TIMOB-28207,12,"""iOS: Packaging fails when Xcode path contains a space""","""""""h5.Description    When packaging an iOS app if the Xcode path contains a space then the exportArchive <USER>will fail. The exportArchive <USER>is used when performing any dist-adhoc build or a dist-appstore build with a {{--output-dir}} argument    h5.Steps to reproduce    1. Change your Xcode path to contain a space and update the xcode-select path  2. Package for dist-adhoc or dist-appstore with a {{--output-dir}} argument      h5.Actual    Error like below        h5.Expected    No error, package shoudl work just fine""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Packaging fails when Xcode path contains a space
Description: """"h5.Description When packaging an iOS app if the Xcode path contains a space then the exportArchive <USER>will fail. The exportArchive <USER>is used when performing any dist-adhoc build or a dist-appstore build with a {{--output-dir}} argument h5.Steps to reproduce 1. Change your Xcode path to contain a space and update the xcode-select path 2. Package for dist-adhoc or dist-appstore with a {{--output-dir}} argument h5.Actual Error like below h5.Expected No error, package shoudl work just fine""""",title+description
