TIMOB-28161,12,"""Android: Modules built with 9.1.0 and using deprecated getter/setter property methods will crash on 9.0.x apps""","""""""*Steps to reproduce:*  # Download the [ti.map|https://github.com/<USER>modules/ti.map] module.  # CD to folder: {{./ti.map/android}}  # Do an {{appc ti sdk select 9.1.0}} or higher Titanium version.  # Build via: {{appc run -p android --build-only}}  # Set up an app with Titanium 9.0.3.GA and built """"""""ti.map"""""""" module.  # Build and run on Android.  # Notice the app crashes on startup with a linker error.    *Cause:*  If a module's Java method is assigned both a {{Kroll.method}} annotation and {{Kroll.getProperty}}/{{Kroll.setProperty}} annotation, then the code generation will inject a C++ {{logDeprecation()}} function whose signature has changed as of 9.1.0 (we've added a 3rd argument).  https://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/pull/11049/files    *Work-Around:*  If you are using both {{Kroll.getProperty}} and {{Kroll.method}} annotations on the same Java method, then remove the {{Kroll.method}} since support for this is deprecated. You must also do the same for setters.    """"""",Bug,"Title: Android: Modules built with 9.1.0 and using deprecated getter/setter property methods will crash on 9.0.x apps
Description: """"*Steps to reproduce:* # Download the [ti.map|https://github.com/<USER>modules/ti.map] module. # CD to folder: {{./ti.map/android}} # Do an {{appc ti sdk select 9.1.0}} or higher Titanium version. # Build via: {{appc run -p android --build-only}} # Set up an app with Titanium 9.0.3.GA and built """"""""ti.map"""""""" module. # Build and run on Android. # Notice the app crashes on startup with a linker error. *Cause:* If a module's Java method is assigned both a {{Kroll.method}} annotation and {{Kroll.getProperty}}/{{Kroll.setProperty}} annotation, then the code generation will inject a C++ {{logDeprecation()}} function whose signature has changed as of 9.1.0 (we've added a 3rd argument). https://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/pull/11049/files *Work-Around:* If you are using both {{Kroll.getProperty}} and {{Kroll.method}} annotations on the same Java method, then remove the {{Kroll.method}} since support for this is deprecated. You must also do the same for setters. """"",title+description
TIMOB-28160,12,"""iOS: """"unrecognized selector sent to instance"""" logged for errors from native side""","""""""An additional error {{-[__NSCFString count]: unrecognized selector sent to instance}} gets logged for errors that originate on the native side.    *Steps to reproduce the behavior*        *Expected behavior*    Only one error is logged: {{invalid method (createFoobar) passed to UIModule}}    *Actual behavior*    A second error is logged: {{-[__NSCFString count]: unrecognized selector sent to instance}}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: """"unrecognized selector sent to instance"""" logged for errors from native side
