TIMOB-28034,12,"""Android: Hyperloop-Examples app, Media player test does not play audio file""","""""""When running the media player test no audio is played, it looks like no audio file is being able to be read at: https://github.com/<USER>hyperloop-examples/commit/d983520db7f10d2ad5209fce09b9f560621aa1f3#diff-1d51eeb19fffa018711f22184199d4eaR11         *Test Steps:*  # Download Hyperloop-examples app (https://github.com/<USER>hyperloop-examples/)  # Launch app   # Go to Media Player test    *Expected:*  Audio file should play.    *Actual result:*  Audio file does not play.""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Hyperloop-Examples app, Media player test does not play audio file
