TIMOB-27915,12,"""Android: Hyperloop generated code can cause """"Cannot redefine property"""" error""","""""""When using the Android Stripe SDK and when I require CardInputWidget (no other code):                I get this error:          In the com.stripe.android.view.CardMultilineWidget.js file that get's generated there are two:    Object.defineProperty(CardMultilineWidget, 'Companion', {    Properties that I think need a:    configurable: true    set after the """"""""enumerable: true,"""""""" perhaps?    """"""",Bug,"Title: Android: Hyperloop generated code can cause """"Cannot redefine property"""" error
