TIMOB-27824,12,"""Hyperloop: iOS - build fails after updating XCode to 11.4""","""""""XCode has been automatically updated to 11.4 and now I can't build for iOS (8.3.1 SDK) I got a weird message when build without liveview after tried building with liveview enabled.    Tried with 8.1.3 & 9.0.0 SDK and Hyperloop different versions      {code:json}  { encoding: '?',    name: 'position',    type: 'unknown type: 176',    value: 'float __attribute__((ext_vector_type(3)))' }  [LiveView] Error: cannot figure out objc return result      at Object.getObjCReturnResult (/Users/<USER>Library/Application Support/Titanium/modules/iphone/hyperloop/4.0.4/hooks/generate/util.js:597:8)      """"""",Bug,"Title: Hyperloop: iOS - build fails after updating XCode to 11.4
Description: """"XCode has been automatically updated to 11.4 and now I can't build for iOS (8.3.1 SDK) I got a weird message when build without liveview after tried building with liveview enabled. Tried with 8.1.3 & 9.0.0 SDK and Hyperloop different versions {code:json} { encoding: '?', name: 'position', type: 'unknown type: 176', value: 'float __attribute__((ext_vector_type(3)))' } [LiveView] Error: cannot figure out objc return result at Object.getObjCReturnResult (/Users/<USER>Library/Application Support/Titanium/modules/iphone/hyperloop/4.0.4/hooks/generate/util.js:597:8) """"",title+description
