TIMOB-27063,12,"""Android: Launch screen is shown twice""","""""""We are experiencing an issue where the launch screen of the app (we use 9 patch) is shown twice. It flickers for half a second and then shows the root window of the app. We are on 8.1.0 (master from ~3 weeks ago, we cannot use current master due to TIMOB-27053) so hopefully this can be fixed soon.""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Launch screen is shown twice
