TIMOB-26990,12,"""Android: Add tabMode (fixed, scrollabl) to TabGroup""","""""""Adding the possibility to change the tabMode of a TabGroup. Currently it will default to a fixed mode (showing all tabs but cutting of labels to do so).     The PR will add a scrollable tabMode (https://developer.android.com/reference/android/support/design/widget/TabLayout#mode_scrollable)      """"""",New Feature,"Title: Android: Add tabMode (fixed, scrollabl) to TabGroup
Description: """"Adding the possibility to change the tabMode of a TabGroup. Currently it will default to a fixed mode (showing all tabs but cutting of labels to do so). The PR will add a scrollable tabMode (https://developer.android.com/reference/android/support/design/widget/TabLayout#mode_scrollable) """"",title+description
