TIMOB-26480,12,"""Android: Titanium.UI.ProgressBar 'color' setting portion of progressBar - should be text only""","""""""Hi,    This seems like this old issue was not fixed correctly: https://jira.<USER>org/browse/TIMOB-20467    The 'color' property of Titanium.UI.ProgressBar sets the color of the portion of progressBar on Android, it should be setting the color of the Text. The correct setting should be 'tintColor' and not 'color'.  There is also no mention of 'trackTintColor'.    When checking the source for the module you can see it only uses color.  https://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/blob/master/android/modules/ui/src/java/ti/modules/titanium/ui/widget/TiUIProgressBar.java#L67    As per the documentation:      https://docs.<USER>com/platform/latest/#!/api/Titanium.UI.ProgressBar-property-color      https://docs.<USER>com/platform/latest/#!/api/Titanium.UI.ProgressBar-property-tintColor    To reproduce simply add the following code to any window and add the progress bar to a view:    """"""",Bug,"Title: Android: Titanium.UI.ProgressBar 'color' setting portion of progressBar - should be text only
