TIMOB-26073,12,"""iOS: Implement support for custom TextField backgroundColor in SearchBar""","""""""The Titanium.UI.SearchBar object does not allow to change the UITextField background.    As for [TIMOB-10368|https://jira.<USER>org/browse/TIMOB-10368] it can be simply done via the same private API.    I'll make a PR that implement this new feature.    PR: https://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/pull/10079""""""",Improvement,"Title: iOS: Implement support for custom TextField backgroundColor in SearchBar
Description: """"The Titanium.UI.SearchBar object does not allow to change the UITextField background. As for [TIMOB-10368|https://jira.<USER>org/browse/TIMOB-10368] it can be simply done via the same private API. I'll make a PR that implement this new feature. PR: https://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/pull/10079""""",title+description
TIMOB-26071,12,"""Deprecate Ti.SafariDialog, move Ti.WebDialog into the core-modules""","""""""We have [ti.safaridialog|https://github.com/<USER>modules/ti.safaridialog] since 5.0.0 to show an embedded web-view natively. Since a while, Android offers the same, so the [ti.webdialog|https://github.com/<USER>modules/titanium-web-dialog] was born.     To signalize parity and have all latest features, especially with iOS 12 and Android P coming, we should move ti.webdialog to the SDK and deprecate ti.safaridialog.""""""",Story,"Title: Deprecate Ti.SafariDialog, move Ti.WebDialog into the core-modules
Description: """"We have [ti.safaridialog|https://github.com/<USER>modules/ti.safaridialog] since 5.0.0 to show an embedded web-view natively. Since a while, Android offers the same, so the [ti.webdialog|https://github.com/<USER>modules/titanium-web-dialog] was born. To signalize parity and have all latest features, especially with iOS 12 and Android P coming, we should move ti.webdialog to the SDK and deprecate ti.safaridialog.""""",title+description
TIMOB-26070,12,"""Create 7.2.0 sample app""","""""""We need a sample app for our 7.2.0 release that demonstrates some GDPR features that we offer, e.g.:  - Opting out of Analytics (simple UI with some buttons to send typical events + a switch to opt out and a console)  - AdMob: Show a consent dialog to define the user consent""""""",Story,"Title: Create 7.2.0 sample app
Description: """"We need a sample app for our 7.2.0 release that demonstrates some GDPR features that we offer, e.g.: - Opting out of Analytics (simple UI with some buttons to send typical events + a switch to opt out and a console) - AdMob: Show a consent dialog to define the user consent""""",title+description
