Description: """"Issue: Can not attach blob file as an attachment to the email dialog on Android v8.x. *Testing Environment:* Ti SDK: 7.1.0.GA, Android v8.X *Test Code:* https://gist.github.com/MotiurRahman/c0bab248003f53e3e98b0ee5ed8d83f9 *Error log:* See the attachment file *Expected Result:* Should be attached the blob file. """"",title+description
