Description: """"In TIMOB-25680 we implemented a workaround for an Apple bug with the DocumentViewer. Once that bug is fixed by Apple, we should remove our workaround. Workaround was implemented in these PRs: PR (master): https://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/pull/9741 PR (7_0_X): https://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/pull/9742 Possible test case for the improvement (Example PDF attached): """"",title+description
