Description: """"In following test case, when we click on """"""""Trigger"""""""" button a window get pushed in navigation window. When we pop that window , there comes a semi transparent view above""""""""Trigger"""""""" button. This problem is not in iOS 10. """"",title+description
TIMOB-25674,12,"""iOS Build: Folders beginning with a platform name are excluded from app""","""""""h5.Description    *This is a regression from 6.3.0.GA*    When building an app where there is a folder that begins with a valid platform then the folder will be excluded from the app, this is incorrect as we should only be excluding folders that match a valid platform    h5.Steps to reproduce    Download the attached app and build for iOS    h5.Actual    Error below is thrown        h5.Expected    App should load, text should say {{it works}}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS Build: Folders beginning with a platform name are excluded from app
Description: """"h5.Description *This is a regression from 6.3.0.GA* When building an app where there is a folder that begins with a valid platform then the folder will be excluded from the app, this is incorrect as we should only be excluding folders that match a valid platform h5.Steps to reproduce Download the attached app and build for iOS h5.Actual Error below is thrown h5.Expected App should load, text should say {{it works}}""""",title+description
TIMOB-25673,12,"""Android: Compile log contains too many XML node warnings""","""""""Compiling an Android app with SDK 7.0.1.GA shows a lot of warnings in the log about XML nodes that are overwritten:        with ti.map it is even more (short snipped):      Since they are not related to my code they should be ignored.     Source:  https://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/blob/d877ab08e2bba1950d294601b3249e6d6ec79f5f/android/cli/lib/base-builder.js#L52""""""",Improvement,"Title: Android: Compile log contains too many XML node warnings
