TIMOB-25573,12,"""CLI: iOS compiler breaks and compiles incorrectly when building to device - 6.3.0""","""""""Hi, I am having some issues with the compiler for iOS on Titanium 6.3.0 - when it compiles to the simulator it works fine but Device compiler breaks things.    I have gotten the error down to standalone code on blank <USER>classic app it build to ios device:    Add this code to the app.js and build      check the build version of app_js        notice that the ```return`` is before the eventlisteners and other values, this causes the code to return out and not function as it should""""""",Bug,"Title: CLI: iOS compiler breaks and compiles incorrectly when building to device - 6.3.0
Description: """"Hi, I am having some issues with the compiler for iOS on Titanium 6.3.0 - when it compiles to the simulator it works fine but Device compiler breaks things. I have gotten the error down to standalone code on blank <USER>classic app it build to ios device: Add this code to the app.js and build check the build version of app_js notice that the ```return`` is before the eventlisteners and other values, this causes the code to return out and not function as it should""""",title+description
