Description: """"Setting the accessibilityLabel on a tab doesn't work. Docs also don't specify the option to add it. """"",title+description
TIMOB-25530,12,"""Android: Debugging from studio 4.10 will not work due to new V8 changes in SDK 7.0.0""","""""""h5.Description:  Debugging in studio 4.10 with SDK 7.0.0 currently says:    The app status & stays on the splash screen for 60 seconds. After 60 seconds the app will start normally without the debugger attached.    *This is probably not a bug as studio 4.10 needs to be updated to support the newer V8 changes for debugger, which is expected in studio 5.0.0.*""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Debugging from studio 4.10 will not work due to new V8 changes in SDK 7.0.0
Description: """"h5.Description: Debugging in studio 4.10 with SDK 7.0.0 currently says: The app status & stays on the splash screen for 60 seconds. After 60 seconds the app will start normally without the debugger attached. *This is probably not a bug as studio 4.10 needs to be updated to support the newer V8 changes for debugger, which is expected in studio 5.0.0.*""""",title+description
