TIMOB-25453,12,"""iOS: console.error.bind is not a function""","""""""*Steps to reproduce the behavior*  1. Create a new app and insert the following code snippet at the end of {{app/controllers/index.js}}:    2. Run the app    *Actual behavior*  The following script error occurs:      *Expected behavior*  The word {{test}} is printed to the error log and no script error appears.    *Additional notes*  This only happens on iOS. Android seems be fine with binding {{console.error}}.""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: console.error.bind is not a function
