Description: """"*Issue description*: When I try to load an array of images in imageView, the following error displayed in the console: Though the images are successfully displayed on device but on the console I get the error. I've tested using set of different images like .jpg and .png but the error occurs every time. It happens both in alloy and classic. *Test case:* Sample code for Alloy: *index.js* *index.xml* Sample code for classic: *Classic code:* *Images*: images are attached as zipped file. *Test Steps*: 1. Create a new project using the test code. 2. Place the images in the /images/anim/ folder. 3. Build on android 7 device. *Actual*: Error showed in the console. *Expected*: No error should be shown in the console. """"",title+description
