TIMOB-24937,12,"""Android: Default module manifest template uses wrong API version""","""""""The Android module {{manifest}} file {{apiversion}} is set to {{3}} instead of {{4}}.""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Default module manifest template uses wrong API version
