Description: """"When doing an ad hoc build using an enterprise ad hoc provisioning profile AND the exporting of the Xcode archive to an IPA fails, it displays the wrong message because it scans """"""""distribution"""""""" and """"""""adhoc"""""""" provisioning profiles only and forgets to scan """"""""enterprise"""""""" ad hoc provisioning profiles. h4. Expected output h4. Actual output """"",title+description
