TIMOB-24775,12,"""iOS 11: Add Xcode 9 macros & utilities""","""""""Enable Xcode 9 development requires two SDK-changes:  # Add {{IS_XCODE_9}} macro to the precompile header  # Add {{isiOS11OrGreater}} utility to {{TiUtils}}    From there, we can implement new features to the existing core-functionality or use it in own modules (like for {{ARKit}} and {{CoreML}}).""""""",Story,"Title: iOS 11: Add Xcode 9 macros & utilities
Description: """"Enable Xcode 9 development requires two SDK-changes: # Add {{IS_XCODE_9}} macro to the precompile header # Add {{isiOS11OrGreater}} utility to {{TiUtils}} From there, we can implement new features to the existing core-functionality or use it in own modules (like for {{ARKit}} and {{CoreML}}).""""",title+description
TIMOB-24773,12,"""iOS 11: Cannot find any iOS 11 simulators""","""""""When building a TItanium app with Xcode 9, the build crashes with the following log:      The project used is open source and can be found [here|https://github.com/hansemannn/studentenfutter-app], ensure to specify {{-I 11.0}} to force running on an iOS 11 simulator.""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS 11: Cannot find any iOS 11 simulators
Description: """"When building a TItanium app with Xcode 9, the build crashes with the following log: The project used is open source and can be found [here|https://github.com/hansemannn/studentenfutter-app], ensure to specify {{-I 11.0}} to force running on an iOS 11 simulator.""""",title+description
TIMOB-24771,12,"""NotificationManagerCompat.areNotificationsEnabled() not available with Hyperloop""","""""""I created a sample project to test if I could use the areNotificationsEnabled() function to determine if push notifications are enabled on Android(https://developer.android.com/reference/android/support/v4/app/NotificationManagerCompat.html#areNotificationsEnabled()). I don't seem to be getting any functions/properties that were added as part of Android SDK 24, even thought SDK 24 is supported. I have attached the index.js and the tiapp.xml from my sample project.""""""",Bug,"Title: NotificationManagerCompat.areNotificationsEnabled() not available with Hyperloop
Description: """"I created a sample project to test if I could use the areNotificationsEnabled() function to determine if push notifications are enabled on Android(https://developer.android.com/reference/android/support/v4/app/NotificationManagerCompat.html#areNotificationsEnabled()). I don't seem to be getting any functions/properties that were added as part of Android SDK 24, even thought SDK 24 is supported. I have attached the index.js and the tiapp.xml from my sample project.""""",title+description
