TIMOB-24686,12,"""Calling getWindow() on a null Activity reference""","""""""I have been eventually getting a crash with this exception:        I checked [proxy.titanium.<USER>org.TiViewProxy's handleMessage method|https://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/blob/a8aceeaeee02ed9c8ea70c835a0e78960e254a55/android/titanium/src/java/org/<USER>titanium/proxy/TiViewProxy.java#L227] and it indeed calls getWindow() on what is returned by TiApplication.getAppCurrentActivity(), on [MSG_GETSIZE|https://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/blob/a8aceeaeee02ed9c8ea70c835a0e78960e254a55/android/titanium/src/java/org/<USER>titanium/proxy/TiViewProxy.java#L296] and on [MSG_GETRECT|https://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/blob/a8aceeaeee02ed9c8ea70c835a0e78960e254a55/android/titanium/src/java/org/<USER>titanium/proxy/TiViewProxy.java#L323]. The [docs|http://docs.<USER>com/module-apidoc/latest/android/org/<USER>titanium/TiApplication.html] state that TiApplication.getAppCurrentActivity() returns ??the current activity if exists. Otherwise, the thread will wait for a valid activity to be visible.??, but [it does in fact return null|https://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/blob/11ce8248edb5d821d18e1c3217bf06b99c96d33f/android/titanium/src/java/org/<USER>titanium/TiApplication.java#L294] if no Activity is present.""""""",Bug,"Title: Calling getWindow() on a null Activity reference
Description: """"I have been eventually getting a crash with this exception: I checked [proxy.titanium.<USER>org.TiViewProxy's handleMessage method|https://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/blob/a8aceeaeee02ed9c8ea70c835a0e78960e254a55/android/titanium/src/java/org/<USER>titanium/proxy/TiViewProxy.java#L227] and it indeed calls getWindow() on what is returned by TiApplication.getAppCurrentActivity(), on [MSG_GETSIZE|https://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/blob/a8aceeaeee02ed9c8ea70c835a0e78960e254a55/android/titanium/src/java/org/<USER>titanium/proxy/TiViewProxy.java#L296] and on [MSG_GETRECT|https://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/blob/a8aceeaeee02ed9c8ea70c835a0e78960e254a55/android/titanium/src/java/org/<USER>titanium/proxy/TiViewProxy.java#L323]. The [docs|http://docs.<USER>com/module-apidoc/latest/android/org/<USER>titanium/TiApplication.html] state that TiApplication.getAppCurrentActivity() returns ??the current activity if exists. Otherwise, the thread will wait for a valid activity to be visible.??, but [it does in fact return null|https://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/blob/11ce8248edb5d821d18e1c3217bf06b99c96d33f/android/titanium/src/java/org/<USER>titanium/TiApplication.java#L294] if no Activity is present.""""",title+description
