TIMOB-24618,12,"""Windows: Replace uglify usage in build process""","""""""h5.Description    Windows build <USER>has some uglify usage  https://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile_windows/blob/a30dec2fa4e6cb84cd4b122a322e0a8376990a09/cli/commands/_build/encrypt.js#L10 and  https://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile_windows/blob/a30dec2fa4e6cb84cd4b122a322e0a8376990a09/cli/commands/_build/copy.js#L11  https://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile_windows/blob/a30dec2fa4e6cb84cd4b122a322e0a8376990a09/cli/commands/_build/copy.js#L526-L575    These should be moved to babili/babel to be inline with the other build processes""""""",Improvement,"Title: Windows: Replace uglify usage in build process
Description: """"h5.Description Windows build <USER>has some uglify usage https://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile_windows/blob/a30dec2fa4e6cb84cd4b122a322e0a8376990a09/cli/commands/_build/encrypt.js#L10 and https://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile_windows/blob/a30dec2fa4e6cb84cd4b122a322e0a8376990a09/cli/commands/_build/copy.js#L11 https://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile_windows/blob/a30dec2fa4e6cb84cd4b122a322e0a8376990a09/cli/commands/_build/copy.js#L526-L575 These should be moved to babili/babel to be inline with the other build processes""""",title+description
