TIMOB-24380,12,"""iOS: Cannot package for iOS iTunes Store; PhaseScriptExecution error""","""""""*Description*  When packaging an app to the iOS Tunes Store using the Ti SDK 6.1.0.v20170206114448, the following error appears in the console log;  [ERROR] :  ** ARCHIVE FAILED **    [ERROR] :  The following build commands failed:    [ERROR] :  PhaseScriptExecution Copy\ Resources\ to\ Archive build/Intermediates/andorra.build/Release-iphoneos/andorra.build/Script-000000000000000000000001.sh    [ERROR] :  (1 failure)    *Steps to reproduce*  1. Create new application  2. Package to iOS Tunes Store    *Expected result*  An alert appears which says that the app has packaged and no errors appear in the console log. However, a ticket has been opened on this matter because the app does NOT package    *Actual Result*  The app does not package and the error stated above appears in the console log.""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Cannot package for iOS iTunes Store; PhaseScriptExecution error
Description: """"*Description* When packaging an app to the iOS Tunes Store using the Ti SDK 6.1.0.v20170206114448, the following error appears in the console log; [ERROR] : ** ARCHIVE FAILED ** [ERROR] : The following build commands failed: [ERROR] : PhaseScriptExecution Copy\ Resources\ to\ Archive build/Intermediates/andorra.build/Release-iphoneos/andorra.build/Script-000000000000000000000001.sh [ERROR] : (1 failure) *Steps to reproduce* 1. Create new application 2. Package to iOS Tunes Store *Expected result* An alert appears which says that the app has packaged and no errors appear in the console log. However, a ticket has been opened on this matter because the app does NOT package *Actual Result* The app does not package and the error stated above appears in the console log.""""",title+description
