TIMOB-24334,12,"""iOS: Multiple Simulators running at the same time""","""""""ioslib attempts to detect if the iOS Simulator is already running by running {{ps -ef}} and searching for a <USER>with {{-CurrentDeviceUDID}}. However if the iOS Simulator is manually launched from Xcode, the <USER>name won't have the {{-CurrentDeviceUDID}} and ioslib will not detect the simulator is currently running.    ioslib needs to find a better way of determining if the iOS Simulator is running. Perhaps use {{simctl}}?""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Multiple Simulators running at the same time
Description: """"ioslib attempts to detect if the iOS Simulator is already running by running {{ps -ef}} and searching for a <USER>with {{-CurrentDeviceUDID}}. However if the iOS Simulator is manually launched from Xcode, the <USER>name won't have the {{-CurrentDeviceUDID}} and ioslib will not detect the simulator is currently running. ioslib needs to find a better way of determining if the iOS Simulator is running. Perhaps use {{simctl}}?""""",title+description
