Description: """"After TIMOB-23423, we need to add pivotX and pivotY https://developer.android.com/reference/android/view/View.html#setPivotX(float) https://developer.android.com/reference/android/view/View.html#setPivotY(float)""""",title+description
TIMOB-24320,12,"""iOS: Removing a TableView with headerView may cause the app to crash""","""""""I have an app with TableView with headerView or footerView specified. When you add this view into ScrollableView and removing it afterwards, it causes the app to crash with SIGABRT. It happens on both simulator and the device.  Here is the crash log:        I guess this happens after the TiUITableView is dealloc'ed and the headerViewProxy is still alive at that time. The app doesn't crash when you call [headerViewProxy setProxyObserver:nil] from -[TiUITableView dealloc].    I have tried to create a simple example to describe this problem, but I have not successfully created one that reproduces the issue.  """"""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Removing a TableView with headerView may cause the app to crash
Description: """"I have an app with TableView with headerView or footerView specified. When you add this view into ScrollableView and removing it afterwards, it causes the app to crash with SIGABRT. It happens on both simulator and the device. Here is the crash log: I guess this happens after the TiUITableView is dealloc'ed and the headerViewProxy is still alive at that time. The app doesn't crash when you call [headerViewProxy setProxyObserver:nil] from -[TiUITableView dealloc]. I have tried to create a simple example to describe this problem, but I have not successfully created one that reproduces the issue. """"",title+description
TIMOB-24315,12,"""Scrolling a ScrollableView inside a ScrollView pushes content offscreen""","""""""A ScrollView contains a ScrollableView with children including a TextArea each.    If the current TextArea is focused and the user scrolls the ScrollableView the content would go off screen    Steps to reproduce:  Focus the text field, try scrolling the scrollable view right or left""""""",Bug,"Title: Scrolling a ScrollableView inside a ScrollView pushes content offscreen
Description: """"A ScrollView contains a ScrollableView with children including a TextArea each. If the current TextArea is focused and the user scrolls the ScrollableView the content would go off screen Steps to reproduce: Focus the text field, try scrolling the scrollable view right or left""""",title+description
