TIMOB-24305,12,"""Android: androidback window, tabgroup event does not fired in SDK 6.0.1.GA, 6.0.0.GA, This works fine for SDK 5.5.1.GA.""","""""""Window's android back event handler is faulty or event not functioning at all. Compare the following code with version 6* of the SDK with version 5.5.1.GA where it works.    Sample code:  var win1 = Titanium.UI.createWindow({   backgroundColor : """"""""white"""""""",  });        // Add to the parent view.  win1.add(aWebView);    win1.addEventListener('androidback', function () {   alert(""""""""Don't go!"""""""");  });    win1.open();    Expected behaviour: When back button clicked in Android, the application should remain open and the alert be shown.     Actual behaviour: Application closes and the alert is never displayed.""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: androidback window, tabgroup event does not fired in SDK 6.0.1.GA, 6.0.0.GA, This works fine for SDK 5.5.1.GA.
Description: """"Window's android back event handler is faulty or event not functioning at all. Compare the following code with version 6* of the SDK with version 5.5.1.GA where it works. Sample code: var win1 = Titanium.UI.createWindow({ backgroundColor : """"""""white"""""""", }); // Add to the parent view. win1.add(aWebView); win1.addEventListener('androidback', function () { alert(""""""""Don't go!""""""""); }); win1.open(); Expected behaviour: When back button clicked in Android, the application should remain open and the alert be shown. Actual behaviour: Application closes and the alert is never displayed.""""",title+description
