TIMOB-24236,12,"""Support language natural direction text alignment""","""""""We want to add new natural text alignment, already supported both iOS and Android, for Android natural is anyRtl.    iOS  https://developer.apple.com/reference/uikit/uilabel/1620541-textalignment    Android  https://developer.android.com/reference/android/view/View.html#attr_android:textDirection    """"""",Improvement,"Title: Support language natural direction text alignment
