TIMOB-24235,12,"""Add new method to overwrite device locale""","""""""Switch locale is a very important feature for all multilingual applications, especially after iOS 9 and Android 4.2 RTL support.    ref  http://stackoverflow.com/questions/1669645/how-to-force-nslocalizedstring-to-use-a-specific-language  http://stackoverflow.com/questions/4985805/set-locale-programatically    Check my RTL guide  https://github.com/HazemKhaled/Titanium_RTL_guide""""""",New Feature,"Title: Add new method to overwrite device locale
Description: """"Switch locale is a very important feature for all multilingual applications, especially after iOS 9 and Android 4.2 RTL support. ref http://stackoverflow.com/questions/1669645/how-to-force-nslocalizedstring-to-use-a-specific-language http://stackoverflow.com/questions/4985805/set-locale-programatically Check my RTL guide https://github.com/HazemKhaled/Titanium_RTL_guide""""",title+description
TIMOB-24233,12,"""Android: tabsBackgroundColor is not working.""","""""""Hello, tabsBackgroundColor for tabGroup is not work in Android, iOS is working as expected. Docs shows it's supported. http://docs.<USER>com/platform/latest/#!/api/Titanium.UI.TabGroup-property-tabsBackgroundColor    {code:js}  var tabGroup = Ti.UI.createTabGroup({      tabsBackgroundColor: 'green'  });  {code}    Tested with latest SDK 6.0.0.GA. Thanks.""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: tabsBackgroundColor is not working.
Description: """"Hello, tabsBackgroundColor for tabGroup is not work in Android, iOS is working as expected. Docs shows it's supported. http://docs.<USER>com/platform/latest/#!/api/Titanium.UI.TabGroup-property-tabsBackgroundColor {code:js} var tabGroup = Ti.UI.createTabGroup({ tabsBackgroundColor: 'green' }); {code} Tested with latest SDK 6.0.0.GA. Thanks.""""",title+description
