TIMOB-24120,12,"""Application hangs on Splash Screen in android""","""""""Hi,    I just created a Hello world app.   1. Launch the app.  2. Press back button  3. App goes into background  4. Again tap on the app icon and launch the app    App hangs on the Splash screen.    Its working fine, if we kill the app and relaunch.  Please update on this ASAP    Thanks  <USER>""""",Bug,"Title: Application hangs on Splash Screen in android
