TIMOB-24119,12,"""Android: Add support for com.google.android.gms.location""","""""""Currently android.location is being used in the SDK. However, as Android has specified in the [documentation|https://developer.android.com/reference/android/location/package-summary.html]:    *This API is not the recommended method for accessing Android location.*    The recommended way is by using [com.google.android.gms.location|https://developers.google.com/android/reference/com/google/android/gms/location/package-summary].    Main reason: higher accuracy   """"""",Improvement,"Title: Android: Add support for com.google.android.gms.location
Description: """"Currently android.location is being used in the SDK. However, as Android has specified in the [documentation|https://developer.android.com/reference/android/location/package-summary.html]: *This API is not the recommended method for accessing Android location.* The recommended way is by using [com.google.android.gms.location|https://developers.google.com/android/reference/com/google/android/gms/location/package-summary]. Main reason: higher accuracy """"",title+description
TIMOB-24118,12,"""Android: java.util.zip.ZipException: duplicate entry: org/appcelerator/titanium/gen/bindings.json when having both ti.admob & ti.map modules in the project""","""""""h5.Steps to reproduce:  1. Make sure you have {{ti.admob}} ver.3.0.1 & {{ti.map}} ver.3.0.1 in your tiapp.xml.  2. Build for android device/emulator.    h5.Actual results:  1. The build fails with:      h5.Expected results:  1. The build should be successful.""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: java.util.zip.ZipException: duplicate entry: org/appcelerator/titanium/gen/bindings.json when having both ti.admob & ti.map modules in the project
