TIMOB-24029,12,"""Hyperloop: iOS - log server port issue when running hyperloop example app on simulator""","""""""When testing the Hyperloop Examples app with Hyperloop Module (2.0.0) an issue was found when running on iOS Simulator:       *This will repeat indefinitely until the app or the simulator is killed.*  *This affects both iOS9/10 Simulators.*  *This does not affect new Hyperloop apps.*    h2. Steps to Reproduce  1. Download the hyperloop-examples app from the 2.0.0-dev branch  2. Install Hyperloop module (2.0.0) from preprod.  3. Import application to Studio.  4. Run the application on iOS Simulator.    h2. Expected Result    Simulator should connect to log server port correctly   *OR*  Should time out after a fixed number of attempts.    h2. Actual Result    server port message repeats indefinitely.""""""",Bug,"Title: Hyperloop: iOS - log server port issue when running hyperloop example app on simulator
Description: """"When testing the Hyperloop Examples app with Hyperloop Module (2.0.0) an issue was found when running on iOS Simulator: *This will repeat indefinitely until the app or the simulator is killed.* *This affects both iOS9/10 Simulators.* *This does not affect new Hyperloop apps.* h2. Steps to Reproduce 1. Download the hyperloop-examples app from the 2.0.0-dev branch 2. Install Hyperloop module (2.0.0) from preprod. 3. Import application to Studio. 4. Run the application on iOS Simulator. h2. Expected Result Simulator should connect to log server port correctly *OR* Should time out after a fixed number of attempts. h2. Actual Result server port message repeats indefinitely.""""",title+description
TIMOB-24026,12,"""TIMOB-14533 app on Media Module displays video capture button when it should display image capture button""","""""""For the TIMOB-14533 app on MediaModule it is supposed to allow the user to Open Camera and then take a photograph. However, the only option is to capture a video and if you capture the video and select that the app shows an alert which states """"""""got the wrong type back=public video"""""""".""""""",Bug,"Title: TIMOB-14533 app on Media Module displays video capture button when it should display image capture button
