Description: """"I am using Titanium SDK 5.2.2.GA for building apps but recently I found my app on which I am working is crashing on iPad mini with iOS 10 when opened for the first time only. This issue has come recently only because before few mins my project was working fine. I have posted logs below if you want to take a look. I can't change SDK to 5.5.0.GA because it will cause few trouble of migrations and at my workplace my app is in final phase of release while it got crashed. Let me know any suggestion to solve the issue. {{Incident Identifier: 77918B0B-7A78-4DED-951E-0BB4AA3BE937 CrashReporter Key: 29aa6910a889f74f44ad93b1ff19d65fbcf594cc Hardware Model: iPad4,4 Process: Danske IR [1350] Path: /private/var/containers/Bundle/Application/8C4E1AD6-9F90-4052-A571-562336926FA6/Danske IR.app/Danske IR Identifier: com.<USER>danskebank Version: 1.0.0 (1.0.0) Code Type: ARM-64 (Native) Role: Foreground Parent Process: launchd [1] Coalition: com.<USER>danskebank [1201] Date/Time: 2016-09-16 16:43:10.4156 +0530 Launch Time: 2016-09-16 16:43:04.6507 +0530 OS Version: iPhone OS 10.0.1 (14A403) Report Version: 104 Exception Type: EXC_BAD_ACCESS (SIGSEGV) Exception Subtype: KERN_INVALID_ADDRESS at 0x0000000dbc44beb8 Triggered by Thread: 5 Filtered syslog: None found Thread 0 name: Dispatch queue: com.apple.main-thread Thread 0: 0 libsystem_kernel.dylib 0x0000000192bd416c mach_msg_trap + 8 1 libsystem_kernel.dylib 0x0000000192bd3fdc mach_msg + 72 2 CoreFoundation 0x0000000193bd1cec __CFRunLoopServiceMachPort + 192 3 CoreFoundation 0x0000000193bcf908 __CFRunLoopRun + 1132 4 CoreFoundation 0x0000000193afe048 CFRunLoopRunSpecific + 444 5 GraphicsServices 0x0000000195581198 GSEventRunModal + 180 6 UIKit 0x0000000199ad0818 -[UIApplication _run] + 684 7 UIKit 0x0000000199acb550 UIApplicationMain + 208 8 Danske IR 0x0000000100066e38 0x100060000 + 28216 9 libdyld.dylib 0x0000000192ae05b8 start + 4 Thread 1: 0 libsystem_kernel.dylib 0x0000000192bf2a88 __workq_kernreturn + 8 1 libsy