TIMOB-23650,12,"""iOS10: Differential build fails on Xcode 8 using --launch-watch-app""","""""""h4. Steps to reproduce  *sudo xcode-select --switch /Applications/Xcode-beta.app*  1. *appc new --classic*  2. enter project  3. *appc new -t applewatch*  4. *appc run -p ios -I 10.0 --launch-watch-app -l trace*  5. change content in app.js  6. Repeat 4.    h4. Expected result  app builds and runs normally    h4. Actual result  """"""",Bug,"Title: iOS10: Differential build fails on Xcode 8 using --launch-watch-app
Description: """"h4. Steps to reproduce *sudo xcode-select --switch /Applications/Xcode-beta.app* 1. *appc new --classic* 2. enter project 3. *appc new -t applewatch* 4. *appc run -p ios -I 10.0 --launch-watch-app -l trace* 5. change content in app.js 6. Repeat 4. h4. Expected result app builds and runs normally h4. Actual result """"",title+description
