TIMOB-23626,12,"""Avoid deprecated methods/libs while generating default android module""","""""""Hi,    width Studio v4.5.0 I have created a new, empty module project. In header I found deprecated classes like  org.<USER>titanium.util.Log and org.<USER>titanium.util.TiConfig.    I think it would be better to use the new stuff from org.<USER>kroll.common.*    Code strong!    Rainer""""""",Improvement,"Title: Avoid deprecated methods/libs while generating default android module
Description: """"Hi, width Studio v4.5.0 I have created a new, empty module project. In header I found deprecated classes like org.<USER>titanium.util.Log and org.<USER>titanium.util.TiConfig. I think it would be better to use the new stuff from org.<USER>kroll.common.* Code strong! Rainer""""",title+description
