TIMOB-23616,12,"""Class not found: Ti.UI.ScrollableView in ListView Template""","""""""h2. Problem  Trying to build for Device (iPhone) and for some reason the app dies and gives me an error about ScrollableView in my ListView template. *It all works as expected in the simulator* and I have also tested multiple versions of CLI, Xcode and Node. I have even reinstalled my Macbook but it didnt solve anything.    _I just downloaded the super-latest 5.3.1 GA SDK, which didnt help either._    ---    h2. Test case  {code:lang=javascript|title=app.js}  Titanium.UI.setBackgroundColor('#000');    var tabGroup = Titanium.UI.createTabGroup();    var win1 = Titanium.UI.createWindow({        title:'Tab 1',      backgroundColor:'#fff'  });  var tab1 = Titanium.UI.createTab({        icon:'KS_nav_views.png',      title:'Tab 1',      window:win1  });    var win2 = Titanium.UI.createWindow({        title:'Tab 2',      backgroundColor:'#fff'  });  var tab2 = Titanium.UI.createTab({        icon:'KS_nav_ui.png',      title:'Tab 2',      window:win2  });    ///////////   var templates = {    """"""""scrollableView"""""""" : {     properties: {      height: 75,      backgroundColor: """"""""transparent"""""""",      selectionStyle: Ti.UI.iPhone.ListViewCellSelectionStyle.NONE     },     childTemplates: [      {       type: 'Ti.UI.ScrollableView',       bindId: 'scrollableView',       properties: { height: 75, showPagingControl: false }      }     ]    }   };     var section = Ti.UI.createListSection({ items: [{ template: 'scrollableView' }]});      var listView = Ti.UI.createListView(   {          templates   : templates,          sections   : [section]     });       win2.add(listView);  ///////////    tabGroup.addTab(tab1);    tabGroup.addTab(tab2);      tabGroup.open();       ---    h2. Q&A   [http://stackoverflow.com/questions/37750914/titanium-cant-build-for-device-com-apple-syslog-relay-error]""""""",Bug,"Title: Class not found: Ti.UI.ScrollableView in ListView Template
Description: """"h2. Problem Trying to build for Device (iPhone) and for some reason the app dies and gives me an error about ScrollableView in my ListView template. *It all works as expected in the simulator* and I have also tested multiple versions of CLI, Xcode and Node. I have even reinstalled my Macbook but it didnt solve anything. _I just downloaded the super-latest 5.3.1 GA SDK, which didnt help either._ --- h2. Test case {code:lang=javascript|title=app.js} Titanium.UI.setBackgroundColor('#000'); var tabGroup = Titanium.UI.createTabGroup(); var win1 = Titanium.UI.createWindow({ title:'Tab 1', backgroundColor:'#fff' }); var tab1 = Titanium.UI.createTab({ icon:'KS_nav_views.png', title:'Tab 1', window:win1 }); var win2 = Titanium.UI.createWindow({ title:'Tab 2', backgroundColor:'#fff' }); var tab2 = Titanium.UI.createTab({ icon:'KS_nav_ui.png', title:'Tab 2', window:win2 }); /////////// var templates = { """"""""scrollableView"""""""" : { properties: { height: 75, backgroundColor: """"""""transparent"""""""", selectionStyle: Ti.UI.iPhone.ListViewCellSelectionStyle.NONE }, childTemplates: [ { type: 'Ti.UI.ScrollableView', bindId: 'scrollableView', properties: { height: 75, showPagingControl: false } } ] } }; var section = Ti.UI.createListSection({ items: [{ template: 'scrollableView' }]}); var listView = Ti.UI.createListView( { templates : templates, sections : [section] }); win2.add(listView); /////////// tabGroup.addTab(tab1); tabGroup.addTab(tab2); tabGroup.open(); --- h2. Q&A [http://stackoverflow.com/questions/37750914/titanium-cant-build-for-device-com-apple-syslog-relay-error]""""",title+description
TIMOB-23613,12,"""CLI: Encryption process fails on Windows with spawn ENAMETOOLONG on a large amount of files""","""""""h5.Description    When building https://github.com/<USER>hyperloop-examples on Windows the build <USER>fails with the following         The build failure is not due to the number of files in the encryption command but rather the length of the command that is being spawned which has a max length of around [32k|https://blogs.msdn.microsoft.com/oldnewthing/20031210-00/?p=41553]    h5.Steps to reproduce    # Download https://github.com/<USER>hyperloop-examples  # Build the project using {{appc run -p android -T device -d <path_to_hyperloop-examples> --build-only}}, see CLI-1038 for why you need to use {{\-\-project-dir}}.    h5.Actual result    The build will fail with the error shown above    h5.Expected result    The build should not fail""""""",Bug,"Title: CLI: Encryption process fails on Windows with spawn ENAMETOOLONG on a large amount of files
Description: """"h5.Description When building https://github.com/<USER>hyperloop-examples on Windows the build <USER>fails with the following The build failure is not due to the number of files in the encryption command but rather the length of the command that is being spawned which has a max length of around [32k|https://blogs.msdn.microsoft.com/oldnewthing/20031210-00/?p=41553] h5.Steps to reproduce # Download https://github.com/<USER>hyperloop-examples # Build the project using {{appc run -p android -T device -d <path_to_hyperloop-examples> --build-only}}, see CLI-1038 for why you need to use {{\-\-project-dir}}. h5.Actual result The build will fail with the error shown above h5.Expected result The build should not fail""""",title+description
