Description: """"Android and iOS both support the textid property on Ti.UI.Label. Could we get the same feature on Windows?""""",title+description
TIMOB-23470,12,"""Android: Saving photos to external directory still causing app data size to grow""","""""""Taking photos and saving them outside of the applicationdatadirectoy is causing the data size of the app to grow even though no data is being saved to the app.    To reproduce, use the following code in app.js:        Run the app and take not if the initial data size on the device.    Repeatedly take photos and verify they are saved outside of the applicationdatadirectory in a folder called 'images'    As photos are taken and saved, the data size of the app will continue to grow, even though the images are not in the app.  """"""",Bug,"Title: Android: Saving photos to external directory still causing app data size to grow
Description: """"Taking photos and saving them outside of the applicationdatadirectoy is causing the data size of the app to grow even though no data is being saved to the app. To reproduce, use the following code in app.js: Run the app and take not if the initial data size on the device. Repeatedly take photos and verify they are saved outside of the applicationdatadirectory in a folder called 'images' As photos are taken and saved, the data size of the app will continue to grow, even though the images are not in the app. """"",title+description
