TIMOB-23153,12,"""Allow platform specific properties to be set via xml attributes""","""""""{quote}As a developer,  I want to set properties for a specific platform from an xml view,  So that I can control how views look on different platforms using only xml view.{quote}        No PR has been created yet.  I will update this ticket after PR containing feature and tests has been submitted.      https://github.com/mobilehero/adamantium/issues/26      """"""",New Feature,"Title: Allow platform specific properties to be set via xml attributes
