Description: """"Hi, Facebook module with latest SDK throwing error in Alloy on android. I tested this using the SDK 5..2.1 , Facbook Module 5.0.0 , alloy 1.8.2 and android 5.0.2. Facebook module working fine in classic project. This is an alloy issue. app/alloy.js: app/views/index.xml: app/controllers/index.js: Error Log : *Environment:* 1. Android Devices: Nexus 7 (android 6.0) ,HTC (android 5.0.2) 2. Facebook 5.0.0 3. Operating System: Mac OS X, Version 10.10.5 4. Node.js Version 0.10.37 5. Titanium SDK Version 5.2.1.GA Thanks""""",title+description
