TIMOB-20528,12,"""Android: App is crashing using Facebook Module in 5.2.0.GA ""","""""""App is crashing using Facebook Module in 5.2.0.GA .    *Test Environment:*    <USER>Studio, build: 4.5.0.201602170821  Operating System Mac OS X -EI Capitan,Versio-10.11.1  <USER>Command-Line Interface, version 5.2.0  SDK Version = 5.2.0.GA   Node.js Version             = 4.2.2  npm Version                 = 2.14.7  Android Devices HTC One_M8 Ey android 5.0.2 (android-21)   Module Version: 5.0.0       *Test Steps to reproduce:*    1.Create a brand new project using 5.2.0.GA   2.Add in only one module e.g. facebook   3.Build to an Android 5.1.1 device e.g. Nexus 7  4.Run project    *Test case:*        *Test Result:* App is crashing. Here is the console log.    """"""",Bug,"Title: Android: App is crashing using Facebook Module in 5.2.0.GA
Description: """"App is crashing using Facebook Module in 5.2.0.GA . *Test Environment:* <USER>Studio, build: 4.5.0.201602170821 Operating System Mac OS X -EI Capitan,Versio-10.11.1 <USER>Command-Line Interface, version 5.2.0 SDK Version = 5.2.0.GA Node.js Version = 4.2.2 npm Version = 2.14.7 Android Devices HTC One_M8 Ey android 5.0.2 (android-21) Module Version: 5.0.0 *Test Steps to reproduce:* 1.Create a brand new project using 5.2.0.GA 2.Add in only one module e.g. facebook 3.Build to an Android 5.1.1 device e.g. Nexus 7 4.Run project *Test case:* *Test Result:* App is crashing. Here is the console log. """"",title+description
