Description: """"h3. How can we check from our app that the Android device is Rooted. So application is not able to start. I had some Google, that it is possibel to check it in android native code, but not possibel through <USER>code. Other alternative is android Module. But i am suggesting to <USER>to add some methods and propery. to make it easy. I know it is vary twisty topic. if it is possible make it work Thanx and Best of luck """"",title+description
TIMOB-20412,12,"""Information - Vendor ID data on the file CLSUserDefaults""","""""""One of customer want to know some info about following id in CLSUserDefaults.plist file.    {quote}  I found on the device/mobile an file named """"""""CLSUserDefaults.plist"""""""" and inside it an information about """"""""vendor_id""""""""     My questions are:     1 - Is that information (vendor_id) receiving or is be sending to the any webserver??? <USER>or Crittercism???     2 - What's the meaning of this information???     3 - This information stays on the device/mobile???  {quote}""""""",Story,"Title: Information - Vendor ID data on the file CLSUserDefaults
Description: """"One of customer want to know some info about following id in CLSUserDefaults.plist file. {quote} I found on the device/mobile an file named """"""""CLSUserDefaults.plist"""""""" and inside it an information about """"""""vendor_id"""""""" My questions are: 1 - Is that information (vendor_id) receiving or is be sending to the any webserver??? <USER>or Crittercism??? 2 - What's the meaning of this information??? 3 - This information stays on the device/mobile??? {quote}""""",title+description
