TIMOB-20269,12,"""Ti.Geolocation.reverseGeocoder returns different information on Android and iOS""","""""""On iOS the reverse geocoder response is passed straight through, but on Android the place objects are built (https://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/blob/bc85170157d3bebc5de1d61a9fe6e34bce84a8c9/android/modules/geolocation/src/java/ti/modules/titanium/geolocation/TiLocation.java#L330).    This means the API response is inconsistent between platforms with missing fields (e.g. """"""""state""""""""):    iOS:      Android:  """"""",Bug,"Title: Ti.Geolocation.reverseGeocoder returns different information on Android and iOS
Description: """"On iOS the reverse geocoder response is passed straight through, but on Android the place objects are built (https://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/blob/bc85170157d3bebc5de1d61a9fe6e34bce84a8c9/android/modules/geolocation/src/java/ti/modules/titanium/geolocation/TiLocation.java#L330). This means the API response is inconsistent between platforms with missing fields (e.g. """"""""state""""""""): iOS: Android: """"",title+description
