TIMOB-20247,12,"""Regression in android HTTPClient""","""""""https://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/blob/master/android/modules/network/src/java/ti/modules/titanium/network/TiHTTPClient.java    Line 160: setReadyState(READY_STATE_HEADERS_RECEIVED) is called before the headers are actually set. Calling getResponseHeader() will result in an attempt to invoke the isEmpty() method on null responseHeaders member.""""""",Bug,"Title: Regression in android HTTPClient
