TIMOB-19888,12,"""iOS 9: 3D touch peek/preview from native gallery causes app to crash""","""""""When the iOS native gallery is accessed from with an app, using 3D touch features peek/preview on an image will cause the app to crash with the following error:       h2. Steps to Reproduce:   1. Create a classic app.  2. Include {{Ti.Media.openPhotoGallery();}} in app.js.  3. Build project to either 6S or 6S + device.  4.Navigate to an image and press with force to initiate 3D touch.    h2. *Actual Result:*   App will crash immediately upon 3D touch.    h2. *Expected Result:*   App should not crash, and open up image preview.      """"""",Bug,"Title: iOS 9: 3D touch peek/preview from native gallery causes app to crash
Description: """"When the iOS native gallery is accessed from with an app, using 3D touch features peek/preview on an image will cause the app to crash with the following error: h2. Steps to Reproduce: 1. Create a classic app. 2. Include {{Ti.Media.openPhotoGallery();}} in app.js. 3. Build project to either 6S or 6S + device. 4.Navigate to an image and press with force to initiate 3D touch. h2. *Actual Result:* App will crash immediately upon 3D touch. h2. *Expected Result:* App should not crash, and open up image preview. """"",title+description
TIMOB-19887,12,"""Android 6.0: Issues with getting contacts info on android 6.0""","""""""h5.Description:  1. There are various issues while you try to get contacts info from android 6.0:    *Case 1*: Run the code below on android 6.0 device which has contacts:    2. Let the app launch.  3. Grant permissions to access contacts.    h5. Actual Result:  1. We get runtime error """"""""Can't read property length of null"""""""".  2. This works fine on android 5.1.1.  3. In logcat I see these logs:    The issue might be that even after granting permissions in reality the permissions are not really granted.    *Case 2*: Run the code below on android 6.0 device which has contacts:    2. Let the app launch.  3. Grant permissions to access contacts.    h5. Actual Result:  1. We get runtime error """"""""Can't read property fullName of null"""""""" & so on for other properties as well.  2. This works fine on android 5.1.1.  3. In logcat I see:    This also shows the permissions granting is sketchy.    h5.Expected Results:  1. We should be able to read contacts & all the properties of contact on android 6.0 """"""",Bug,"Title: Android 6.0: Issues with getting contacts info on android 6.0
Description: """"h5.Description: 1. There are various issues while you try to get contacts info from android 6.0: *Case 1*: Run the code below on android 6.0 device which has contacts: 2. Let the app launch. 3. Grant permissions to access contacts. h5. Actual Result: 1. We get runtime error """"""""Can't read property length of null"""""""". 2. This works fine on android 5.1.1. 3. In logcat I see these logs: The issue might be that even after granting permissions in reality the permissions are not really granted. *Case 2*: Run the code below on android 6.0 device which has contacts: 2. Let the app launch. 3. Grant permissions to access contacts. h5. Actual Result: 1. We get runtime error """"""""Can't read property fullName of null"""""""" & so on for other properties as well. 2. This works fine on android 5.1.1. 3. In logcat I see: This also shows the permissions granting is sketchy. h5.Expected Results: 1. We should be able to read contacts & all the properties of contact on android 6.0 """"",title+description
