TIMOB-19785,12,"""Enable Code Coverage for TIMOB SDK""","""""""Want to use Tio2, TiMocha and Titanium_Mobile_Tests repos to implement code coverage, such that every time a PR is submitted (together with a unit test PR, if any, into Titanium_Mobile_Tests), it runs through the test suites and rejects PR if a certain percentage is not met. Windows Code Coverage should be integrated together as well.""""""",Epic,"Title: Enable Code Coverage for TIMOB SDK
Description: """"Want to use Tio2, TiMocha and Titanium_Mobile_Tests repos to implement code coverage, such that every time a PR is submitted (together with a unit test PR, if any, into Titanium_Mobile_Tests), it runs through the test suites and rejects PR if a certain percentage is not met. Windows Code Coverage should be integrated together as well.""""",title+description
