TIMOB-19781,12,"""Build for ios device with SDK 5.0.2 results in 'app.js not found'""","""""""Hello,    compiliing on a device with SDK 5.0.2 does not work. When the app starts, the app.js file is not found:    [ERROR] Error loading path: file:///private/var/mobile/Containers/Bundle/Application/854E8FE1-6B6F-409B-9B7E-CFE6083EF1A6/sandbox.app/app.js, Error Domain=NSCocoaErrorDomain Code=260 """"""""The operation couldn’t be completed. (Cocoa error 260.)"""""""" UserInfo=0x1700708c0 {NSFilePath=/private/var/mobile/Containers/Bundle/Application/854E8FE1-6B6F-409B-9B7E-CFE6083EF1A6/sandbox.app/app.js, NSUnderlyingError=0x17005c9e0 """"""""The operation couldn’t be completed. No such file or directory""""""""}  [ERROR] Script Error Could not find the file app.js    Steps to reproduce:  - create a new alloy project  - compile for a device connected via usb  - launch application on the phone    Thanks.""""""",Bug,"Title: Build for ios device with SDK 5.0.2 results in 'app.js not found'
Description: """"Hello, compiliing on a device with SDK 5.0.2 does not work. When the app starts, the app.js file is not found: [ERROR] Error loading path: file:///private/var/mobile/Containers/Bundle/Application/854E8FE1-6B6F-409B-9B7E-CFE6083EF1A6/sandbox.app/app.js, Error Domain=NSCocoaErrorDomain Code=260 """"""""The operation couldn’t be completed. (Cocoa error 260.)"""""""" UserInfo=0x1700708c0 {NSFilePath=/private/var/mobile/Containers/Bundle/Application/854E8FE1-6B6F-409B-9B7E-CFE6083EF1A6/sandbox.app/app.js, NSUnderlyingError=0x17005c9e0 """"""""The operation couldn’t be completed. No such file or directory""""""""} [ERROR] Script Error Could not find the file app.js Steps to reproduce: - create a new alloy project - compile for a device connected via usb - launch application on the phone Thanks.""""",title+description
