TIMOB-19613,12,"""Android: Crash when opening Window themed with ActionBar if app is themed without""","""""""If you use a built-in or custom theme that has no action (title) bar or trigger a built-in theme without action bar with {{<navbar-hidden>true</navbar-hidden>}} the app will log errors and finally crash if you open a window and use the {{theme}} property to select a built-in or custom theme *with* action bar.    *Steps*    1. Create a new app  2. Use the code below as {{app.js}}  3. Build to device and confirm it works and shows ActionBar on both screens  4. Change the application theme to one without ActionBar either by setting {{<navbar-hidden>true</navbar-hidden>}} or:         5. Build to device and confirm the app logs errors and finally crashes after tapping the red window.        *Logs*    """"""",Bug,"Title: Android: Crash when opening Window themed with ActionBar if app is themed without
Description: """"If you use a built-in or custom theme that has no action (title) bar or trigger a built-in theme without action bar with {{<navbar-hidden>true</navbar-hidden>}} the app will log errors and finally crash if you open a window and use the {{theme}} property to select a built-in or custom theme *with* action bar. *Steps* 1. Create a new app 2. Use the code below as {{app.js}} 3. Build to device and confirm it works and shows ActionBar on both screens 4. Change the application theme to one without ActionBar either by setting {{<navbar-hidden>true</navbar-hidden>}} or: 5. Build to device and confirm the app logs errors and finally crashes after tapping the red window. *Logs* """"",title+description
