TIMOB-19538,12,"""Error adding text before model attribute in using dataCollection""","""""""h3. Steps to Reproduce To get a model attribute assigned directly to a Label.text we can use something like this <Label text='{title} by {author}' /> this works ok but if the text attribute starts with simple text for example <Label text='by {author}' />  we get an error.  You can use one of the examples presents in http://docs.<USER>com/titanium/3.0/#!/guide/Alloy_Data_Binding  h3. Actual Result This return an error and we can't compile  h3. Expected Result I expected that I can start the text attribute with some text and put the {attribute} wherever I want""""""",Bug,"Title: Error adding text before model attribute in using dataCollection
Description: """"h3. Steps to Reproduce To get a model attribute assigned directly to a Label.text we can use something like this <Label text='{title} by {author}' /> this works ok but if the text attribute starts with simple text for example <Label text='by {author}' /> we get an error. You can use one of the examples presents in http://docs.<USER>com/titanium/3.0/#!/guide/Alloy_Data_Binding h3. Actual Result This return an error and we can't compile h3. Expected Result I expected that I can start the text attribute with some text and put the {attribute} wherever I want""""",title+description
