TIMOB-19247,12,"""iOS: handleLinks for TextArea doesn't work in ListItem templates""","""""""I'm in the <USER>of converting a TableView to a ListView. Everything is ok excluding a textarea…  In the TableView, this TextArea was in the custom TableViewRow view and had the {{handleLinks}} argument set to {{false}}. But when I do that in the ListItem template, I got the following error. If I remove this argument, everything is fine, but I need it.        """"""",Bug,"Title: iOS: handleLinks for TextArea doesn't work in ListItem templates
Description: """"I'm in the <USER>of converting a TableView to a ListView. Everything is ok excluding a textarea… In the TableView, this TextArea was in the custom TableViewRow view and had the {{handleLinks}} argument set to {{false}}. But when I do that in the ListItem template, I got the following error. If I remove this argument, everything is fine, but I need it. """"",title+description
TIMOB-19246,12,"""MobileWeb: can't communicate from Titanium to Webview""","""""""h6.Reproduce   Using our [example code|http://docs.<USER>com/platform/latest/#!/guide/Communication_Between_WebViews_and_Titanium-section-29004919_CommunicationBetweenWebViewsandTitanium-Ti.AppEvents] from document, we can make a communication between WebViews and Titanium. But on IOS and Android bidirectional communication is working fine (from titanium to web view and from web view to titanium). But in mobile web from web view to titanium only working. The reverse is not working(from titanium to web view).     h6.Test Code  See the document.""""""",Bug,"Title: MobileWeb: can't communicate from Titanium to Webview
Description: """"h6.Reproduce Using our [example code|http://docs.<USER>com/platform/latest/#!/guide/Communication_Between_WebViews_and_Titanium-section-29004919_CommunicationBetweenWebViewsandTitanium-Ti.AppEvents] from document, we can make a communication between WebViews and Titanium. But on IOS and Android bidirectional communication is working fine (from titanium to web view and from web view to titanium). But in mobile web from web view to titanium only working. The reverse is not working(from titanium to web view). h6.Test Code See the document.""""",title+description
