TIMOB-19168,12,"""iOS: attributedString does not override text property like documented""","""""""The [documentation says|http://docs.<USER>com/titanium/latest/#!/api/Titanium.UI.Label-property-attributedString] a Label's {{text}} property will be ignored if {{attributedString}}. However, the following test case shows it's not:    h1. Test case  Remove the comments before line #7 and the label will say """"""""Text"""""""".        The same might also be true for the {{value}} property of {{TextArea}} and {{TextField}}.""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: attributedString does not override text property like documented
