Description: """"Google has released a new Map SDK specific to Enterprises that provides extended functionality and monitoring to the GoogleMaps. As this is a new SDK, its currently not supported by our standard Maps Module. Information on GoogleMaps for Work can be found here: https://www.google.com/work/mapsearth/ """"",title+description
