TIMOB-18666,12,"""Geocoder Classic and Todo List Classic projects default to 3.5.0.GA""","""""""The classic sample projects (Geocoder and Todo List) default to use SDK 3.5.0.GA despite 3.5.1.GA being installed.    *Steps to reproduce issue*:  1. Install SDK 3.5.0.GA and 3.5.1.GA  2. Create new sample projects of Geocoder and Todo List, classic  3. Notice that the Titanium SDK is set to 3.5.0.GA for both projects    *Expected results*:  Projects are set to use SDK 3.5.1.GA""""""",Bug,"Title: Geocoder Classic and Todo List Classic projects default to 3.5.0.GA
Description: """"The classic sample projects (Geocoder and Todo List) default to use SDK 3.5.0.GA despite 3.5.1.GA being installed. *Steps to reproduce issue*: 1. Install SDK 3.5.0.GA and 3.5.1.GA 2. Create new sample projects of Geocoder and Todo List, classic 3. Notice that the Titanium SDK is set to 3.5.0.GA for both projects *Expected results*: Projects are set to use SDK 3.5.1.GA""""",title+description
TIMOB-18665,12,"""KitchenSink: When importing the sample via Studio, tiapp.xml is set to 3.5.0.GA""","""""""h5.Description    When importing the KitchenSink sample the SDK in the tiapp.xml is set to 3.5.0.GA. It should be set to 3.5.1.GA    h5.Steps To Reproduce    1. Using the latest Studio import KitchenSink from the samples    h5.Actual Result    The SDK version in the tiapp.xml is set to 3.5.0.GA    h5.Expected Result    The SDK version in the tiapp.xml should be set to 3.5.1.GA  """"""",Bug,"Title: KitchenSink: When importing the sample via Studio, tiapp.xml is set to 3.5.0.GA
Description: """"h5.Description When importing the KitchenSink sample the SDK in the tiapp.xml is set to 3.5.0.GA. It should be set to 3.5.1.GA h5.Steps To Reproduce 1. Using the latest Studio import KitchenSink from the samples h5.Actual Result The SDK version in the tiapp.xml is set to 3.5.0.GA h5.Expected Result The SDK version in the tiapp.xml should be set to 3.5.1.GA """"",title+description
TIMOB-18663,12,"""With 3.5.0.GA, can't open child window more than two times in a row""","""""""In one of my App Templates (https://github.com/ricardoalcocer/AlloyAppTemplate) there's NavigationWindow with a RightNavButton that opens a child window.  When compiled with 3.5.0.GA, that button only opens the child window two times in a row.    To reproduce, <USER>the repo, make sure you set sdk-version to 3.5.0.GA on tiapp.xml.  When the app runs, click on the + button, go back, click again, go back, click again.""""""",Bug,"Title: With 3.5.0.GA, can't open child window more than two times in a row
