TIMOB-18636,12,"""iOS: Rotate documentViewer and back to root Window occurs a glitch on screen""","""""""[Edited]  Steps to reproduce:  1.Create Window  2.Create a TabGroup  3.Create a TableView or ListView  2.Add a click listener  3.Call createDocumentViewer():  4.Rotate the simulator/device to landscape  5.Back to root Win  6.Bug occurs""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Rotate documentViewer and back to root Window occurs a glitch on screen
