TIMOB-18474,12,"""IOS: Unable to make toolbar really transparent/with alpha channel""","""""""h2. Problem    Not possible to make toolbars really transparent or with a specified alpha channel (translucent).     If barColor='transparent' (Test 1), toolbar is translucent (no control over opacity).  If barColor='#2fff' (Test 2), toolbar is completely opaque.    h2. Test case 1    {code:lang=javascript|title=ApplicationWindow.js}    //Application Window Component Constructor  function ApplicationWindow() {   //load component dependencies   var FirstView = require('ui/common/FirstView');     //create component instance   var self = Ti.UI.createWindow({    backgroundColor : '#0cf'   });     //construct UI   var firstView = new FirstView();   self.add(firstView);     var button2 = Titanium.UI.createButton({    title:'test',   });   var toolbar = Titanium.UI.iOS.createToolbar({    items : [button2],    barColor:'transparent',    bottom : 0,    borderTop : true,    borderBottom : true   });   self.add(toolbar);     return self;  }    //make constructor function the public component interface  module.exports = ApplicationWindow;      """"""",Bug,"Title: IOS: Unable to make toolbar really transparent/with alpha channel
Description: """"h2. Problem Not possible to make toolbars really transparent or with a specified alpha channel (translucent). If barColor='transparent' (Test 1), toolbar is translucent (no control over opacity). If barColor='#2fff' (Test 2), toolbar is completely opaque. h2. Test case 1 {code:lang=javascript|title=ApplicationWindow.js} //Application Window Component Constructor function ApplicationWindow() { //load component dependencies var FirstView = require('ui/common/FirstView'); //create component instance var self = Ti.UI.createWindow({ backgroundColor : '#0cf' }); //construct UI var firstView = new FirstView(); self.add(firstView); var button2 = Titanium.UI.createButton({ title:'test', }); var toolbar = Titanium.UI.iOS.createToolbar({ items : [button2], barColor:'transparent', bottom : 0, borderTop : true, borderBottom : true }); self.add(toolbar); return self; } //make constructor function the public component interface module.exports = ApplicationWindow; """"",title+description
TIMOB-18473,12,"""Android: QE automation app crashes and throws out of memory errors when built with sdk 3.6.0.v20150127082526""","""""""h6. This is a regression. The issue is not seen with 3.5.1.GA    Link to download QE Automation app: https://www.dropbox.com/s/gstz67dw6pbs6jj/QE%20Automator.zip?dl=0    h5.Description:  1. Build the QE automation app on an android device( I have tried on android 5.0 & android 4.4.2).  2. Launch the app.  3. Scroll the listview.  4. Click on any test.    h5.Actual result:  1. You will see some of the information & play buttons are missing for some tests.  2. You will see that the app crashes(some tests might launch but finally it will crash).  NOTE: Please refer the attached logs on android 5.0 & android 4.4.2 device for reference. We do not see a crash on android 4.4.2 device but just out of memory errors.    h5.Expected Result:  1. The app should not crash when built with sdk 3.6.0.v20150127082526""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: QE automation app crashes and throws out of memory errors when built with sdk 3.6.0.v20150127082526
Description: """"h6. This is a regression. The issue is not seen with 3.5.1.GA Link to download QE Automation app: https://www.dropbox.com/s/gstz67dw6pbs6jj/QE%20Automator.zip?dl=0 h5.Description: 1. Build the QE automation app on an android device( I have tried on android 5.0 & android 4.4.2). 2. Launch the app. 3. Scroll the listview. 4. Click on any test. h5.Actual result: 1. You will see some of the information & play buttons are missing for some tests. 2. You will see that the app crashes(some tests might launch but finally it will crash). NOTE: Please refer the attached logs on android 5.0 & android 4.4.2 device for reference. We do not see a crash on android 4.4.2 device but just out of memory errors. h5.Expected Result: 1. The app should not crash when built with sdk 3.6.0.v20150127082526""""",title+description
