TIMOB-18455,12,"""iPad: OptionDialog shows not in center of display""","""""""Starting 3.5.0, show an OptionDialog without specifying view property:    1. Dialog not centered  2. Arrow points to the center of the window.    Which looks very weird.    Before 3.5.0, the dialog will be centered without an arrow. That is the preferred behavior.""""""",Bug,"Title: iPad: OptionDialog shows not in center of display
