Description: """"h4. Problem Description I'm not able to set the text color of the picker value. Therefore, I have to use the Android theme files to set it, but this should be exposed in the API as the default `color: '#hex'` We have tested this issue. But Android, iOS have not text color property of pickerView or pickerRow. h4. Steps to Reproduce: 1. Create classic project. 3. Paste this code in app.js file. 3. Run this code with the testing environment. 4. """"",title+description
