Description: """"There seems to be a bug with streaming video using Ti.Media.VideoPlayer on Android 4.4.4. Tested on: Samsung S5 4.4.4: Fail Samsung S5 4.4.2: Pass Nexus 5 4.4.4: Fail Nexus 5 4.4.2: Pass Nexus 4 4.4.4: Fail h3. Expected behavior Full screen player streams m3u8 video h3. Actual behavior Blank screen accompanied with the following logs h3. Code to reproduce index.xml index.js index.tss """"",title+description
