TIMOB-17897,12,"""CLI build prompt doesn't show connected Android device ""","""""""If I run {{ti info}} with my Android device connected, it correctly tells me so:        But when I build for Android, and let the CLI prompt me for the target device, the list doesn't include the connected device (""""""""SGH-M919"""""""" in this case), only emulators:        I would expect the connected devices listed by {{ti info}} to be available as a build target. In Studio, the connected device does show up as an available target, as expected, just not in the CLI.""""""",Bug,"Title: CLI build prompt doesn't show connected Android device
