TIMOB-17893,12,"""Support data binding for TabbedBar""","""""""Allow:    problem discovered when traversing a parent TableView collection and creating multiple TabbedBars, full issue detail with example code / environment details can be found here:    http://developer.<USER>com/question/178619/bug-in-alloy-tabbedbar-when-using-datacollection#answer-283287    N.B. to be able to assign in the view would also be really helpful.""""""",New Feature,"Title: Support data binding for TabbedBar
