TIMOB-17872,12,"""Android: Update to Android build tools ver.21 breaks the build process""","""""""h5. Description:   h5. We are unable to build for android with new tools ver.21.0.0    h5.Steps To Reproduce:  1. Update your android build tools to ver.21.0.0  2. Build any titanium android app from Studio/CLI to a device/emulator.    h5. Actual Result:  1. The build <USER>fails with the errors below:      h5. Expected Result:  1. The build <USER>should not break after the build tools update to ver.21.0.0 & the app should build successfully  """"""",Bug,"Title: Android: Update to Android build tools ver.21 breaks the build process
