TIMOB-17796,12,"""iOS8: KitchenSink control Tabbed Bar 'Set Tab 0 Active'  button failing to set null index for one of the Tabbed bar.""","""""""Description:    Clicking on 'Set Tab 0 Active' button does not set all tabbed bars index to 0.  There seems a problem in the tabbedbar.js code. Title control and custom tabbed bar are having same name. So the index is getting set for the custom tabbed bar only.    STEPS TO REPRODUCE:-  1. Install the KitchenSink on iPhone 6/6+ simulator.  2. Navigate to: Controls => Tabbed Bar   3. Press each button.  4. Press """"""""Set Tab 0 Active""""""""     EXPECTED RESULT:  3. All indexes should be nulled    ACTUAL RESULT:  3. All tabbed bar except Title control tabbed bar index not setting to null.""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS8: KitchenSink control Tabbed Bar 'Set Tab 0 Active' button failing to set null index for one of the Tabbed bar.
Description: """"Description: Clicking on 'Set Tab 0 Active' button does not set all tabbed bars index to 0. There seems a problem in the tabbedbar.js code. Title control and custom tabbed bar are having same name. So the index is getting set for the custom tabbed bar only. STEPS TO REPRODUCE:- 1. Install the KitchenSink on iPhone 6/6+ simulator. 2. Navigate to: Controls => Tabbed Bar 3. Press each button. 4. Press """"""""Set Tab 0 Active"""""""" EXPECTED RESULT: 3. All indexes should be nulled ACTUAL RESULT: 3. All tabbed bar except Title control tabbed bar index not setting to null.""""",title+description
TIMOB-17794,12,"""IOS 8 : Opening an email dialog does not work on IOS 8.0.2""","""""""h6. I cant check if this is a regression as SDK 3.3.0.GA is not compatible with xcode 6.0.1    h5. Description:  1. Replace the contents of app.js with the code below:    2. Build for IOS 8 (this is device independent).    h5. Actual Result:  1. The email dialog does not open in IOS 8.0.2 but opens fine on IOS 7.1.2.    h5. Expected Result:  1. The email dialog should open in IOS 8.0.2.""""""",Bug,"Title: IOS 8 : Opening an email dialog does not work on IOS 8.0.2
