TIMOB-17466,12,"""[iOS] TabGroup Event : Problem with the refresh of Components after a focus of Tab""","""""""h4. Problem Description  The problem is simple: when I try to close a view with the focus of another tab and then back to the main tab , you can see the previous view for a few milliseconds    explanatory video attached    h4. Steps to reproduce  - Create a new mobile project (classic titanium)  - Add the following code (into app.js).   """"""",Bug,"Title: [iOS] TabGroup Event : Problem with the refresh of Components after a focus of Tab
