TIMOB-17428,12,"""BlackBerry: KitchenSink - Phone Vibrate is not implemented ""","""""""h5. Description  http://docs.<USER>com/titanium/latest/#!/api/Titanium.Media-method-vibrate  According to docs vibrate is not implemented for BlackBerry.  h5. To reproduce  1. Import KS and build it for BlackBerry  2. Install it on to device  3. Navigate to KS> Phone> Vibrate  4. Click Vibrate  h5. Actual result  Application Error, referring to ui/common/phone/vibrate.js:25:19  """"""",Bug,"Title: BlackBerry: KitchenSink - Phone Vibrate is not implemented
