TIMOB-17421,12,"""KitchenSink: BlackBerry -Text Field: The Rest - Some properties can not be toggled""","""""""h5. Description  Toggling property Capital (words) is not working, only first word capitalized.  h5. To reproduce  1. Import KS and build for BlackBerry  2. Install on BB device  3. Navigate to KS> Controls> Text Field> The Rest> Capital (words)  4. Start typing words  h5. Actual result  The only first word started with a capital letter  h5. Expected result  All words should begin with capital letters.""""""",Bug,"Title: KitchenSink: BlackBerry -Text Field: The Rest - Some properties can not be toggled
