TIMOB-17387,12,"""Default iPad graphics for new projects are the wrong size""","""""""We supply the wrong size graphics for the iPad splash screen graphics. Our graphics omit the height of the status bar, which apparently is not correct. See https://developer.apple.com/library/ios/documentation/UserExperience/Conceptual/MobileHIG/IconMatrix.html for proper sizes. The correct graphic sizes are also noted in this link to the TiCons project:    https://github.com/FokkeZB/TiCons-CLI/blob/master/lib/specs.js#L160""""""",Bug,"Title: Default iPad graphics for new projects are the wrong size
