TIMOB-17375,12,"""Android: Parsing invalid json hangs the app and crashes debugger""","""""""In debug mode, calling JSON.parse() on a piece of invalid json hangs the application and silently terminates the debugging session.    A sample code snippet is as simple as:        No code seems to be executed after the JSON.parse() call. The debugger <USER>the application as terminated without reporting any error and the app on the device hangs (but does not crash).    In Release mode an exception is properly reported and execution of the app continues as expected.  """"""",Bug,"Title: Android: Parsing invalid json hangs the app and crashes debugger
Description: """"In debug mode, calling JSON.parse() on a piece of invalid json hangs the application and silently terminates the debugging session. A sample code snippet is as simple as: No code seems to be executed after the JSON.parse() call. The debugger <USER>the application as terminated without reporting any error and the app on the device hangs (but does not crash). In Release mode an exception is properly reported and execution of the app continues as expected. """"",title+description
