TIMOB-17255,12,"""Tizen: Text string indicates Tizen is still part of build""","""""""1. navigate to http://builds.<USER>com/index.html#3_3_X  2. look at the titles for the builds    results: Note that the text string has """"""""Tizen"""""""" in it (for example - OS X (iOS, Android, Mobile Web, BlackBerry, Tizen)    expected - we have removed Tizen from the builds, there should not be a reference to it. This is a public facing page.""""""",Bug,"Title: Tizen: Text string indicates Tizen is still part of build
