TIMOB-17240,12,"""Android: TiCacheCleanup running indefinitely when app is in background""","""""""h4. Problem Description  When opening an app and putting it to the background, TiCacheCleanup is still run every 60 seconds. This is probably not ideal for battery life and also not really necessary as long as the app is not being actively used.    h4. Steps to reproduce  1. Create a new Titanium project  2. Run it on an Android device or on Genymotion  3. Put app to background  4. Do DDMS """"""""Method profiling"""""""" for at least 60 seconds on the app  5. You will see that TiResponseCache$TiCacheCleanup.run is executed every 60 seconds.""""""",Improvement,"Title: Android: TiCacheCleanup running indefinitely when app is in background
Description: """"h4. Problem Description When opening an app and putting it to the background, TiCacheCleanup is still run every 60 seconds. This is probably not ideal for battery life and also not really necessary as long as the app is not being actively used. h4. Steps to reproduce 1. Create a new Titanium project 2. Run it on an Android device or on Genymotion 3. Put app to background 4. Do DDMS """"""""Method profiling"""""""" for at least 60 seconds on the app 5. You will see that TiResponseCache$TiCacheCleanup.run is executed every 60 seconds.""""",title+description
TIMOB-17239,12,"""Strip invalid characters from Xcode project targets""","""""""The iOS build script copies an Xcode project into the build dir and performs a bunch of string replacements. This introduces issues with naming things such as the targets. For example, you cannot have a \ [ ] { } ( ) . + or * in the target name. You also cannot have the word """"""""titanium"""""""" in the app name. We simply need to properly escape the app name.    The change needs to take place around https://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/blob/master/iphone/cli/commands/_build.js#L2002-L2014. There may also need to be some changes in project.pbxproj template.""""""",Improvement,"Title: Strip invalid characters from Xcode project targets
Description: """"The iOS build script copies an Xcode project into the build dir and performs a bunch of string replacements. This introduces issues with naming things such as the targets. For example, you cannot have a \ [ ] { } ( ) . + or * in the target name. You also cannot have the word """"""""titanium"""""""" in the app name. We simply need to properly escape the app name. The change needs to take place around https://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/blob/master/iphone/cli/commands/_build.js#L2002-L2014. There may also need to be some changes in project.pbxproj template.""""",title+description
