TIMOB-17188,12,"""CLI: App ID in not validated against a single word ID in CLI""","""""""When a project is created from CLI, It allows the app id value with a *single word*. It doesn't check for reverse domain notation like X.X.X (refer CLI_allow.png).    But Studio does not allow a *single word app id* (refer studio_not_allow.png).     h5. Expected Result  Studio and CLI should behave *identically*.     This is *not a regression* since it occurs in 3.2.3 GA as well""""""",Bug,"Title: CLI: App ID in not validated against a single word ID in CLI
Description: """"When a project is created from CLI, It allows the app id value with a *single word*. It doesn't check for reverse domain notation like X.X.X (refer CLI_allow.png). But Studio does not allow a *single word app id* (refer studio_not_allow.png). h5. Expected Result Studio and CLI should behave *identically*. This is *not a regression* since it occurs in 3.2.3 GA as well""""",title+description
