TIMOB-17034,12,"""iOS: Cannot build for device from Xcode using the build project""","""""""h3.Steps to Reproduce    * Build an using cli  * Open the app in Xcode (build/iphone/<appname>.xcodeproject)  * Try building the project for device.    h4.Actual Result.  Build fails with the following output      h3.Expected Result   The app builds successfully and runs on device.    h3.  Notes.  There seems two problems here.  1. The SDK version in the pre compile command is hard coded.  2. The env variable is not being passed in correctly.  """"""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Cannot build for device from Xcode using the build project
Description: """"h3.Steps to Reproduce * Build an using cli * Open the app in Xcode (build/iphone/<appname>.xcodeproject) * Try building the project for device. h4.Actual Result. Build fails with the following output h3.Expected Result The app builds successfully and runs on device. h3. Notes. There seems two problems here. 1. The SDK version in the pre compile command is hard coded. 2. The env variable is not being passed in correctly. """"",title+description
