TIMOB-17020,12,"""iOS Apps with a period at the end of the name are not able to submit to the store""","""""""h2. Bug    If in {{tiapp.xml}} I have {{<name>Sport Instr.</name>}} then the {{CFBundleURLSchemes}} becomes {{sportinstr_}} which is not valid because Apple doesn't allow it to end with {{_}}.    This needs a little more work at https://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/blob/85b3c33f81c853fd273ee1b025e1d87573997f03/iphone/cli/commands/_build.js#L1710""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS Apps with a period at the end of the name are not able to submit to the store
Description: """"h2. Bug If in {{tiapp.xml}} I have {{<name>Sport Instr.</name>}} then the {{CFBundleURLSchemes}} becomes {{sportinstr_}} which is not valid because Apple doesn't allow it to end with {{_}}. This needs a little more work at https://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/blob/85b3c33f81c853fd273ee1b025e1d87573997f03/iphone/cli/commands/_build.js#L1710""""",title+description
