Description: """"In the final zip file for a BlackBerry module, it includes a Makefile, Makefile.release, and Makefile.debug for both arm and x86 folders. These files should not be there. Exclude them from final zip file.""""",title+description
TIMOB-16984,12,"""TiAPI: Deprecate Ti.include""","""""""The Ti.include method was a solution fit for another time in Titanium's history.  That time has long since gone.  Too many newbies are using Ti.include as if it is the correct pattern to develop their apps against.    The only reason against deprecation is that some older apps still use Ti.include.  However using this as a reason only serves to increase the number of apps this will affect.""""""",Improvement,"Title: TiAPI: Deprecate Ti.include
Description: """"The Ti.include method was a solution fit for another time in Titanium's history. That time has long since gone. Too many newbies are using Ti.include as if it is the correct pattern to develop their apps against. The only reason against deprecation is that some older apps still use Ti.include. However using this as a reason only serves to increase the number of apps this will affect.""""",title+description
