TIMOB-16965,12,"""Blackberry: Wrong BlackBerry folder structure in resources""","""""""h5. This is a regression. Works as expected with 3.2.3.GA    h5.Description:  1. Create a Blackberry app with latest 3.3.0 sdk or the one mentioned above  2. Go to Resources/Blackberry    h5.Actual Result:  1. You would see an additional blackberry folder which consists of appicon & splashscreen etc, under the parent blackberry folder    h5.Expected Result:  1. There should be only one blackberry folder""""""",Bug,"Title: Blackberry: Wrong BlackBerry folder structure in resources
Description: """"h5. This is a regression. Works as expected with 3.2.3.GA h5.Description: 1. Create a Blackberry app with latest 3.3.0 sdk or the one mentioned above 2. Go to Resources/Blackberry h5.Actual Result: 1. You would see an additional blackberry folder which consists of appicon & splashscreen etc, under the parent blackberry folder h5.Expected Result: 1. There should be only one blackberry folder""""",title+description
