TIMOB-16888,12,"""Android: Add Actionbar.setHomeButtonEnabled functionality""","""""""The home button is automatically enabled when the DISPLAY_HOME_AS_UP is enabled (natively by Android). However, the home button cannot be disabled later unless this method is exposed - thus its necessity.""""""",Improvement,"Title: Android: Add Actionbar.setHomeButtonEnabled functionality
Description: """"The home button is automatically enabled when the DISPLAY_HOME_AS_UP is enabled (natively by Android). However, the home button cannot be disabled later unless this method is exposed - thus its necessity.""""",title+description
TIMOB-16887,12,"""TiAPI: Add an event on TabGroup that fires before a Tab is focused""","""""""I would like to have an event that fires when handleWillShowTab is fired. Currently, the focus-event fires when handleDidShowTab has fired. I would like to do some UI-changes while changing tab, and found that firing an event in handleWillShowTab instead makes it a bit quicker (probably because it's fired before the tab content is rendered?)    As a quick fix I created my own event called """"""""willShowTab"""""""", as I'm sure there are different use-cases for events just before and after the tab has changed.""""""",New Feature,"Title: TiAPI: Add an event on TabGroup that fires before a Tab is focused
Description: """"I would like to have an event that fires when handleWillShowTab is fired. Currently, the focus-event fires when handleDidShowTab has fired. I would like to do some UI-changes while changing tab, and found that firing an event in handleWillShowTab instead makes it a bit quicker (probably because it's fired before the tab content is rendered?) As a quick fix I created my own event called """"""""willShowTab"""""""", as I'm sure there are different use-cases for events just before and after the tab has changed.""""",title+description
TIMOB-16886,12,"""Android: SearchView now works for all versions so remove SearchBar""","""""""Accepted PR https://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/pull/5631 added SearchView functionality for all Android versions, so for simplicity we can remote SearchBar for Android, which is now an unnecessary hack.""""""",Improvement,"Title: Android: SearchView now works for all versions so remove SearchBar
Description: """"Accepted PR https://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/pull/5631 added SearchView functionality for all Android versions, so for simplicity we can remote SearchBar for Android, which is now an unnecessary hack.""""",title+description
