TIMOB-16831,12,"""Android: Analytics: Event sequence numbers are not sequential""","""""""NOTE : Not a regression. I could repro it in 3.2.2.GA also.    h5.Description:  1. Run the analytics app from repo mobile_test_internal/FeatureTest on an android device.  2. After the app launches you will see the ti.enroll & ti.start events on the ubuntu server.  3. Now end the app & start it again as well as try some other events.    h5.Actual Results:  1. The sequence numbers of the events are not one after another but sometimes 1 or 2 numbers ahead.  2. My analytics logs:      h5.Expected Results:  1. The sequence numbers of the events should be one after another.""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Analytics: Event sequence numbers are not sequential
