TIMOB-16821,12,"""iOS/Android : Support window.location.search for local files in WebView""","""""""If you load a local file into a webview like this:        The following {{index.html}} results in the attached screenshot, showing the query string is not found in {{window.location.search}}:        This is unfortunate since I'd like to use the query string to pass parameters to the static HTML. I know I can wait for the WebView's {{load}} event and then {{evalJS}}, but my benchmarks show I loose a lot of valuable time this way.""""""",Improvement,"Title: iOS/Android : Support window.location.search for local files in WebView
Description: """"If you load a local file into a webview like this: The following {{index.html}} results in the attached screenshot, showing the query string is not found in {{window.location.search}}: This is unfortunate since I'd like to use the query string to pass parameters to the static HTML. I know I can wait for the WebView's {{load}} event and then {{evalJS}}, but my benchmarks show I loose a lot of valuable time this way.""""",title+description
