TIMOB-16819,12,"""MobileWeb: networkTypeName returns incorrect result""","""""""networkTypeName returns value as """"""""UNKNOWN"""""""" when connected to wifi.    Steps to Reproduce:  1. Package KS and deploy. Open the url in mobile browser.  2. Navigate to Platform>Network    Expected Result:  1. networkTypeName must be """"""""WIFI""""""""    Actual Result:  1. Returns networkTypeName as """"""""UNKNOWN""""""""    """"""",Bug,"Title: MobileWeb: networkTypeName returns incorrect result
