TIMOB-16805,12,"""MobileWeb: Unable to see header for TableSection in TableView""","""""""Unable to see custom header and footer title.  Steps to reproduce:  1.Package KS for mobile web and open the url on device browser.  2.Navigate to BaseUI>Views>Table Views>Table Section Header    Actual Result:  2. No section header are seen.    Expected Result:  2.Each section in the table should have a section header.""""""",Bug,"Title: MobileWeb: Unable to see header for TableSection in TableView
