TIMOB-16804,12,"""MobileWeb: Unable to see custom header and footer title""","""""""Unable to see custom header and footer title.  Steps to reproduce:  1.Package KS for mobile web and open the url on device browser.  2.Navigate to BaseUI>Views>Table Views>Table Custom Row Header    Actual Result:  2. No header and footer are seen as per the data given.    Expected Result:  2.first data in the row would Indicate what the name of the Row header should be.See if the name matches.  """"""",Bug,"Title: MobileWeb: Unable to see custom header and footer title
