TIMOB-16782,12,"""BlackBerry: Ti.UI.Window events not fired""","""""""h6.Issue description  Events open, focus event not woking on Ti.UI.Window for BB10. To replicate just keep clicking Open & Close buttons, back'n forth.     h6.Check code example      h6.Console output  From time to time iOS fires Window events consistently.      BlackBerry isn't firing Window focus events and Master Window Open event is only fired once.  """"""",Bug,"Title: BlackBerry: Ti.UI.Window events not fired
