TIMOB-16781,12,"""BlackBerry: TiUIWebview does not return evalJS data""","""""""h6.Issue  EvalJS does not return data to the app:    h6.Test case  Using a simple Alloy app:  index.xml  {code:xml}  <Alloy>   <Window>   <WebView top=""""""""150"""""""" id=""""""""webContent"""""""" width=""""""""300px"""""""" height=""""""""300px"""""""" borderColor=""""""""red""""""""           borderWidth=""""""""2px"""""""" url=""""""""http://www.google.com""""""""></WebView>   </Window>  </Alloy>  {code}    Controller: index.js    {code:javascript}  function checkState(e) {   var webTitle = $.webContent.evalJS('document.title');   $.webContent.evalJS(""""""""alert(document.title)"""""""");   alert(webTitle);  }  $.webContent.addEventListener('load', checkState);  $.index.open();  {code}    One alert works (As its triggered from within the webview), the second fails as it does not pass back to the controller.""""""",Bug,"Title: BlackBerry: TiUIWebview does not return evalJS data
Description: """"h6.Issue EvalJS does not return data to the app: h6.Test case Using a simple Alloy app: index.xml {code:xml} <Alloy> <Window> <WebView top=""""""""150"""""""" id=""""""""webContent"""""""" width=""""""""300px"""""""" height=""""""""300px"""""""" borderColor=""""""""red"""""""" borderWidth=""""""""2px"""""""" url=""""""""http://www.google.com""""""""></WebView> </Window> </Alloy> {code} Controller: index.js {code:javascript} function checkState(e) { var webTitle = $.webContent.evalJS('document.title'); $.webContent.evalJS(""""""""alert(document.title)""""""""); alert(webTitle); } $.webContent.addEventListener('load', checkState); $.index.open(); {code} One alert works (As its triggered from within the webview), the second fails as it does not pass back to the controller.""""",title+description
