TIMOB-16679,12,"""Android: Links do not work in ListView (e.g. autoLink)""","""""""ListView does not display the links after scrolling out of screen. Both autoLink and html (text) does not work.    Example code below. For the example, the first time the app loads google.com link is clickable, upon scrolling out of screen and scrolling back google.com becomes no longer clickable.    """"""",Bug,"Title: Android: Links do not work in ListView (e.g. autoLink)
