TIMOB-16381,12,"""iOS: ListView crashes on setting accessoryType after filtering on itemclick event""","""""""h5. Problem description     listview crashes on setting accessoryType after filtering on itemclick event. But its working well without filtering data in [ListView |http://docs.<USER>com/titanium/latest/#!/api/Titanium.UI.ListView].       h5. Testing Environment  MAC OS X 10.8.5  Ti SDK 3.2.0.GA   Ti CLI 3.2.0  IOS Simulator 7.0.3      h5. Test Code        h5. Step to reproduces     # Run this code in IOS Simulator   # Filter on list view   # Click on list item   # App will crash    h5. Expected Result   App will not crash        Thanks  """"""",Bug,"Title: iOS: ListView crashes on setting accessoryType after filtering on itemclick event
