Description: """"Sencha Touch apps (using any Sencha SDK version) don't load in the Titanium web view on Android 4.4.2. Earlier Android versions work fine. Code to reproduce: When it fails to load, the log is spammed with the following: I tested in the Android 4.4.2 emulator, but it has been reported as an issue on multiple devices as well. Note that the Sencha Touch apps load perfectly fine in native Android with the Cordova web view.""""",title+description
