Description: """"High Resolution image (dog@2x~iphone.jpg) is not visible on iPad since the format of image is wrong. Steps to reproduce: 1.Install and Run KS>BaseUI>Views>Hi-Res Image 2 Expected Result: 1.High Resolution image of dog must be visible. Actual Result: 1.No image is viewed. Note: Issue is due to wrong format of high resolution image(dog@2x~iphone.jpg) Think it must be <EMAIL>""""",title+description
