Description: """"*Details:* If you create a custom camera overlay with properties, then a RuntimeException is thrown on Android. *This is not a regression and this bug is not reproducible on iOS.* *Steps to reproduce:* 1. Create the default Titanium classic app with this sample code: 2. Install the app to an Android device 3. Press on *camera overlay* button *Actual:* A RuntimeException is thrown (see logcat.txt attachment). *Expected:* A RuntimeException should not be thrown and the specified overlay properties should appear on top of the camera ui.""""",title+description
