TIMOB-16157,12,"""ListView Phase 2 - Templates and Search not working together""","""""""After waiting for the release of SDK 3.2.0 so I can convert my TableViews to ListViews, I was looking to add a layout (2x labels) to each row along with the ability to search. https://jira.<USER>org/browse/TIMOB-666    There's lack of documentation but the searchBar works fine standalone and a template works fine standalone however combining the code together results in there being no search bar at all when a template is used.    Am I missing something or is this a bug?          The above example code shows a template working, comment out the below to see the searchBar work on its own:       Can the both work together or what am I missing?""""""",Bug,"Title: ListView Phase 2 - Templates and Search not working together
