TIMOB-16140,12,"""BlackBerry: Running APK files on BlackBerry devices sends incorrect analytic data.""","""""""h5.Description  BlackBerry 10.2 can run Android APK files. Installing an APK built in Titanium Studio successfully installs. However the analytic data sent from the device is incorrect.    It will send:  OS: Android  Platform: Android  Model: Z10    It has correctly identified the model of the phone, but not the OS and Platform.    h5.Steps To Reproduce  1. Create an Android application  2. Publish the application to an APK file  3. Install the APK onto the BlackBerry device    h5.Expected Result  Analytic data should show a BlackBerry install    h5.Actual Result  Analytic data shows an Android install""""""",Bug,"Title: BlackBerry: Running APK files on BlackBerry devices sends incorrect analytic data.
Description: """"h5.Description BlackBerry 10.2 can run Android APK files. Installing an APK built in Titanium Studio successfully installs. However the analytic data sent from the device is incorrect. It will send: OS: Android Platform: Android Model: Z10 It has correctly identified the model of the phone, but not the OS and Platform. h5.Steps To Reproduce 1. Create an Android application 2. Publish the application to an APK file 3. Install the APK onto the BlackBerry device h5.Expected Result Analytic data should show a BlackBerry install h5.Actual Result Analytic data shows an Android install""""",title+description
