Description: """"I tested this issue with our Ti Default project. When I publish for distribution its Apk size show me 7 MB+. I think this is too big for android. h5. Test Environment: Mac OS X 10.8.5(64 bit) Ti SDK 3.2.0.GA Ti CLI 3.2.0 Node.js v0.10.23 Android 2.3.3 h5. Step to Reproduce: # Create a Default project in Ti Classic # Publish for Android App Store # Check Apk size, its showing 7MB + h5. Expected Result Apk size should be 3-4 MB max h5. Actual Result APK size 7MB + Thanks """"",title+description
