TIMOB-16114,12,"""Android: GeolocationModule not found when referenced from local variable""","""""""h6.Issue description  Whenever the Ti.Geolocation module is referenced to Javascript variable the build <USER>errors with:        h6.Steps to reproduce  Although we were unable to replicate the error, the developer was setting this:    var geo = Ti.Geolocation;    After commenting it out the Ti Project was able to build at device. The simple app is attached.     h6.Devices under test  Error was reproduced on Galaxy S3 w/ 4.1.2  Not reproducible w/ Android 4.0.4 nor Droid razr 2.3.5""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: GeolocationModule not found when referenced from local variable
