TIMOB-16112,12,"""Android - Saving pictures from camera make the application TOO BIG""","""""""Hi guys, I build an app that allow the user to take a camera photo and then save it on file system and then enter the path to the image in my DB. what i notice is that every picture that i take make the application bigger in the same size that the image weight.  I have set the image location folder to /SDcard/ i assume that this will solve the problem but it's not.  An application with few records on DB and 4~5 images now taking 25MB.  How can i solve that ? Thanks !    How can i tell the app not to consider the pictures size as part of app data size ?""""""",Bug,"Title: Android - Saving pictures from camera make the application TOO BIG
Description: """"Hi guys, I build an app that allow the user to take a camera photo and then save it on file system and then enter the path to the image in my DB. what i notice is that every picture that i take make the application bigger in the same size that the image weight. I have set the image location folder to /SDcard/ i assume that this will solve the problem but it's not. An application with few records on DB and 4~5 images now taking 25MB. How can i solve that ? Thanks ! How can i tell the app not to consider the pictures size as part of app data size ?""""",title+description
