TIMOB-16062,12,"""iOS: Installing existing project to device fails""","""""""h6.Issue description  Can't run app on iPhone 4 iOS 7.0.3    h6.Console output  An existing app fails to install.       h6.Steps to reproduce  1) Please select an already existing Project (StoreKit.zip)  2) Attempt to run app (Run As > Select iOS Device)  3) Studio is unable to resume installation.     Message in the top left at Console window: <terminated> Titanium iOS Application Installer - """"""""App name"""""""" Screen shoot: InstallFailed_Studio_3.2.0.jpg""""""""    Not reproducible with """"""""1TestDevice.zip"""""""" (I created it today and was able to run app on iOS device).    h5.New Titanium Project  If you create a brand new Project Studio will build it successfully.  h6.Console output    """"""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Installing existing project to device fails
Description: """"h6.Issue description Can't run app on iPhone 4 iOS 7.0.3 h6.Console output An existing app fails to install. h6.Steps to reproduce 1) Please select an already existing Project (StoreKit.zip) 2) Attempt to run app (Run As > Select iOS Device) 3) Studio is unable to resume installation. Message in the top left at Console window: <terminated> Titanium iOS Application Installer - """"""""App name"""""""" Screen shoot: InstallFailed_Studio_3.2.0.jpg"""""""" Not reproducible with """"""""1TestDevice.zip"""""""" (I created it today and was able to run app on iOS device). h5.New Titanium Project If you create a brand new Project Studio will build it successfully. h6.Console output """"",title+description
