TIMOB-16045,12,"""CLI: iOS: Device builds from Xcode fail unless a developer cert and provisioning profile is selected""","""""""If you create a project and build for iOS, then open the generated Xcode project and build for device, the build fails unless you explicitly select a developer cert and provisioning profile from the build settings tab.    The CLI doesn't actually NEED either of these, so it should be safe to make them not required.""""""",Bug,"Title: CLI: iOS: Device builds from Xcode fail unless a developer cert and provisioning profile is selected
Description: """"If you create a project and build for iOS, then open the generated Xcode project and build for device, the build fails unless you explicitly select a developer cert and provisioning profile from the build settings tab. The CLI doesn't actually NEED either of these, so it should be safe to make them not required.""""",title+description
TIMOB-16044,12,"""Android: Plugins keep playing after closing WebView""","""""""Really love the new HTML5 video support in 3.2.    But when I load the webview in a window it the plugin (webhchrome client) Does not always stop playing. The Android docs say that you have to called the onPause function to clear all plugin activity. As far as I can see I don't see this happening here.    https://github.com/wienke/titanium_mobile/blob/master/android/modules/ui/src/java/ti/modules/titanium/ui/widget/webview/TiWebChromeClient.java  """"""",Bug,"Title: Android: Plugins keep playing after closing WebView
Description: """"Really love the new HTML5 video support in 3.2. But when I load the webview in a window it the plugin (webhchrome client) Does not always stop playing. The Android docs say that you have to called the onPause function to clear all plugin activity. As far as I can see I don't see this happening here. https://github.com/wienke/titanium_mobile/blob/master/android/modules/ui/src/java/ti/modules/titanium/ui/widget/webview/TiWebChromeClient.java """"",title+description
