Description: """"__filename and __dirname are available in android but not on ios.""""",title+description
TIMOB-16003,12,"""Android: Density specific resources do not work""","""""""h3. Steps to Reproduce  1) Launch Kitchen Sink.  2) Open Base UI -> Views -> Image Views -> Android drawable resource.    h3. Actual Result  No images present on the window.    h3. Expected Result  Images should be present on the window.""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Density specific resources do not work
Description: """"h3. Steps to Reproduce 1) Launch Kitchen Sink. 2) Open Base UI -> Views -> Image Views -> Android drawable resource. h3. Actual Result No images present on the window. h3. Expected Result Images should be present on the window.""""",title+description
TIMOB-15999,12,"""Android: Disable scrollToItem animation on ListView ""","""""""h3. Request    In the Android listView allow user to disable animation on the scrollToItem method or set selection to a specific Section and row.    h3. Current Behavior     The listView element is able to disable animation on scrollToItem and set selection only on iOS.    h3. Sample Code        """"""",New Feature,"Title: Android: Disable scrollToItem animation on ListView
Description: """"h3. Request In the Android listView allow user to disable animation on the scrollToItem method or set selection to a specific Section and row. h3. Current Behavior The listView element is able to disable animation on scrollToItem and set selection only on iOS. h3. Sample Code """"",title+description
TIMOB-15997,12,"""Incremental builds while modifying custom android manifest files do not work""","""""""Steps to reproduce:  1. Build an android project with a file named AndroidManifest1.xml inside platform/android  2. Rename the AndroidManifest1.xml to AndroidManifest.xml    Expected:  The manifest inside the build directory should not be symlinked to the one in platform/android    Actual:  It is symlinked to it.    Doing a clean build after renaming the manifest will fix this problem.""""""",Bug,"Title: Incremental builds while modifying custom android manifest files do not work
Description: """"Steps to reproduce: 1. Build an android project with a file named AndroidManifest1.xml inside platform/android 2. Rename the AndroidManifest1.xml to AndroidManifest.xml Expected: The manifest inside the build directory should not be symlinked to the one in platform/android Actual: It is symlinked to it. Doing a clean build after renaming the manifest will fix this problem.""""",title+description
