TIMOB-15977,12,"""Code Processor: mocha is returning failures""","""""""h5. Problem description  Running 'mocha' tests in the titanium-code-processor folder, failures are returned.    1. Install mocha in case is not already present      2. Go to the titanium code processor folder (by default /usr/local/lib/node_modules/titanium-code-processor) and run """"""""mocha""""""""    Result:    6 tests are passing, 7 are failing.       """"""",Bug,"Title: Code Processor: mocha is returning failures
Description: """"h5. Problem description Running 'mocha' tests in the titanium-code-processor folder, failures are returned. 1. Install mocha in case is not already present 2. Go to the titanium code processor folder (by default /usr/local/lib/node_modules/titanium-code-processor) and run """"""""mocha"""""""" Result: 6 tests are passing, 7 are failing. """"",title+description
