TIMOB-15966,12,"""SDK: node-appc - The node-appc version in the RC SDK does not match the version in the CLI""","""""""*Details:* The node-appc version in the RC SDK is not 0.2.0-cr. The node-appc version in the SDK should match the node-appc version in the CLI which is 0.2.0-cr.    *Steps to reproduce:*  1. Go to ~Library/Application Support/Titanium/mobilesdk/osx/3.2.0.v20131210191510/node_modules/node-appc  2. Open package.json    *Actual:* The node-appc version is not 0.2.0-cr (see sdk_package.json)  *Expected:* The node-appc version should be 0.2.0-cr like in the CLI (see cli_package.json)""""""",Bug,"Title: SDK: node-appc - The node-appc version in the RC SDK does not match the version in the CLI
