TIMOB-15959,12,"""BlackBerry: KitchenSink: Controls > Text Field > Keyboard, appropriate keyboard is not invoked""","""""""KitchenSink: Controls > Text Filed > Keyboard, appropriate keyboard is not invoked  It works fine on SDK: 3.1.3.GA    Steps to reproduce:  1.Press each button then focus textfield    Expected:  Appropriate Keyboard should appear.    Actual:  After clicking 'Phone Pad', only number keypad is opened in all cases including when trying to invoke ascii keyboard""""""",Bug,"Title: BlackBerry: KitchenSink: Controls > Text Field > Keyboard, appropriate keyboard is not invoked
