Description: """"Blue line appears under tabs in tabgroup. Steps to reproduce: 1)Create Classic two tabbed application and launch on android device. Actual Result: 1)Blue line appears under tabs. Expected Result: 1)No blue line should appear unless any color defined. This is an observation hence logged the bug since this does not occur in 3.1.3.GA So if this is a bug then its a regression as issue does not occur in 3.1.3.GA""""",title+description
