TIMOB-15919,12,"""Analytics: BlackBerry - app Install is not displayed on the dashboard""","""""""Although the payload shows ti.enroll on app's first launch, the BlackBerry Platform does not occur in Installs on the dashboard.   Since there is no easy way to roll back an environment, we cannot say if it is a regression.  h5. To reproduce  1. Create an application.  2. ssh ubuntu@54.212.133.215  3. Check the daily folder for mobile_events.json  4. tail -f mobile_events.json.txt | grep <app-guid>  5. Make sure your devap  6. Run app as BB device    h5. Actual result  Payload shows ti.start, ti.enroll  NO BB platform appears in the dashboard Installs""""""",Bug,"Title: Analytics: BlackBerry - app Install is not displayed on the dashboard
Description: """"Although the payload shows ti.enroll on app's first launch, the BlackBerry Platform does not occur in Installs on the dashboard. Since there is no easy way to roll back an environment, we cannot say if it is a regression. h5. To reproduce 1. Create an application. 2. ssh ubuntu@54.212.133.215 3. Check the daily folder for mobile_events.json 4. tail -f mobile_events.json.txt | grep <app-guid> 5. Make sure your devap 6. Run app as BB device h5. Actual result Payload shows ti.start, ti.enroll NO BB platform appears in the dashboard Installs""""",title+description
