TIMOB-15912,12,"""iOS: Dynamic ScrollableView has jerky effect when right swiping""","""""""h2. Problem    I designed a dynamic scrollableView with 3 scrollViews. ScrollViews are populated with data when needed (ie after left/right swipe effect). Left swipe effect is OK and smooth. Right swipe effect is jerky (scrollviews sometimes scroll, not null contentOffset,etc.., jerky refresh).     h2. Test case    see archive project attached : iphoneTest.zip (source only)  code : ui/viewArtiste.js, viewScroll2 function (scrollEnd event handler)    h2. Logs    {code:lang=none|title=console}  Insert any output or logs; one per code block. Use the title argument to differentiate between them  {code}    h2. Discussions    it seems to be related to currentPage and setViews actions especially on target. Left swipe ok, right swipe randomly not smooth.      Labels:  """"""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Dynamic ScrollableView has jerky effect when right swiping
Description: """"h2. Problem I designed a dynamic scrollableView with 3 scrollViews. ScrollViews are populated with data when needed (ie after left/right swipe effect). Left swipe effect is OK and smooth. Right swipe effect is jerky (scrollviews sometimes scroll, not null contentOffset,etc.., jerky refresh). h2. Test case see archive project attached : iphoneTest.zip (source only) code : ui/viewArtiste.js, viewScroll2 function (scrollEnd event handler) h2. Logs {code:lang=none|title=console} Insert any output or logs; one per code block. Use the title argument to differentiate between them {code} h2. Discussions it seems to be related to currentPage and setViews actions especially on target. Left swipe ok, right swipe randomly not smooth. Labels: """"",title+description
