TIMOB-15874,12,"""iOS 7: Blinking title image in titleControl when assigning button to leftNavButton or rightNavButton""","""""""Our development team informed that there was a blinking title image in titleControl when putting a Ti.UI.Button to window's leftNavButton property, as you can see in attached video files.  We need to know what the problem is, and how to solve this.    Video1 - ios7_button.mp4  Putting Ti.UI.Button to leftBavButton property, testing in iOS7    Video2 - ios7.mp4  Nothing put to leftBavButton property, testing in iOS7    Video3 - ios6_button.mp4  Putting Ti.UI.Button to leftBavButton property, testing in iOS6    Video4 - ios6.mp4  Nothing put to leftBavButton property, testing in iOS6    Thank you""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS 7: Blinking title image in titleControl when assigning button to leftNavButton or rightNavButton
Description: """"Our development team informed that there was a blinking title image in titleControl when putting a Ti.UI.Button to window's leftNavButton property, as you can see in attached video files. We need to know what the problem is, and how to solve this. Video1 - ios7_button.mp4 Putting Ti.UI.Button to leftBavButton property, testing in iOS7 Video2 - ios7.mp4 Nothing put to leftBavButton property, testing in iOS7 Video3 - ios6_button.mp4 Putting Ti.UI.Button to leftBavButton property, testing in iOS6 Video4 - ios6.mp4 Nothing put to leftBavButton property, testing in iOS6 Thank you""""",title+description
