TIMOB-15845,12,"""iOS: Slider: Slider overlaps the thumbImage when custom image changed on run time""","""""""Slider overlaps the thumbImage when slider properties changed on run time.    This is not a regression.   Since issue occurs on 3.1.3.GA    Steps to reproduce:  1)KS>Controls>Slider>Basic  2)Change Basic Slider.    Expected Result:  Slider height width and thumb image changes and image must be over the slider.Not behind the slider    Actual Result:  Slider height width and thumb image changes but slider overlaps the slider.       """"""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Slider: Slider overlaps the thumbImage when custom image changed on run time
