TIMOB-15828,12,"""iOS: HTML5 Video is not played on the first tap on play button needs a second tap to be played""","""""""HTML5 Video is not played on the first tap on play button needs a second tap to be played.    Not a Regression. Issue occurs in 3.1.3.GA also.    1)KS>BaseUI>Views>WebViews>HTML5 Video    Expected Result:  Clicking on play button and video must be played.    Actual Result:  Clicking on play button twice only video to be played.  """"""",Bug,"Title: iOS: HTML5 Video is not played on the first tap on play button needs a second tap to be played
