TIMOB-15813,12,"""CLI: 'ti config' will duplicate the length of the paths.sdks value""","""""""h5.Description  Running """"""""ti config"""""""" in CLI will display all the variables and their corresponding values. In this case paths.sdks is set to be    Running ti config a second time will make the value      The more I run ti config the longer it gets.    h5.Steps To Reproduce  1. Run ti config to make sure a paths.sdks value is set  2. Set paths.sdks to a location  3. Run ti config a few times  4. Look at paths.sdks value    h5.Expected Result  paths.sdks should still be the same value    h5.Actual Result  paths.sdks adds it's original value onto itself. Increasing in length each time """"""""ti config"""""""" is run""""""",Bug,"Title: CLI: 'ti config' will duplicate the length of the paths.sdks value
Description: """"h5.Description Running """"""""ti config"""""""" in CLI will display all the variables and their corresponding values. In this case paths.sdks is set to be Running ti config a second time will make the value The more I run ti config the longer it gets. h5.Steps To Reproduce 1. Run ti config to make sure a paths.sdks value is set 2. Set paths.sdks to a location 3. Run ti config a few times 4. Look at paths.sdks value h5.Expected Result paths.sdks should still be the same value h5.Actual Result paths.sdks adds it's original value onto itself. Increasing in length each time """"""""ti config"""""""" is run""""",title+description
TIMOB-15811,12,"""iOS: KitchenSink: Animation not working properly on orientation change ""","""""""Animation on TabGroup is not working fine when orientation changed.  Steps to reproduce:    Scenario 1:    1. Install KS.Turn Device to orientation mode.  2. BaseUI>TabGroup>Animate Tab Group.  3. Again Tap on Animate Tab Group    Expected Result:  2. Proper animation must be shown.  3. Tab group window must open with all 6 options in landscape mode.    Actual Result:  2. Tab group animates as it should animate while on portrait mode then it again animates back changing its position as it should animate on landscape mode.  3. Tab group window opens up but in portrait mode and then switch back on landscape mode.    Scenario 2:  1. Install KS.Turn Device to orientation mode.  2. BaseUI>TabGroup>Close/Animate Tab Group.      Expected Result:  2. Proper animation must be shown.    Actual Result:  2. It turns to portrait mode then animate and then change back to landscape mode.    This is not a regression.  Occurs in 3.1.3.GA sdk also.""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: KitchenSink: Animation not working properly on orientation change
Description: """"Animation on TabGroup is not working fine when orientation changed. Steps to reproduce: Scenario 1: 1. Install KS.Turn Device to orientation mode. 2. BaseUI>TabGroup>Animate Tab Group. 3. Again Tap on Animate Tab Group Expected Result: 2. Proper animation must be shown. 3. Tab group window must open with all 6 options in landscape mode. Actual Result: 2. Tab group animates as it should animate while on portrait mode then it again animates back changing its position as it should animate on landscape mode. 3. Tab group window opens up but in portrait mode and then switch back on landscape mode. Scenario 2: 1. Install KS.Turn Device to orientation mode. 2. BaseUI>TabGroup>Close/Animate Tab Group. Expected Result: 2. Proper animation must be shown. Actual Result: 2. It turns to portrait mode then animate and then change back to landscape mode. This is not a regression. Occurs in 3.1.3.GA sdk also.""""",title+description
