TIMOB-15793,12,""" MobileWeb: Kitchensink - Base UI > Views > Events Propagation does not report label clicks""","""""""NOT a regression, occurs in 3.1.3.GA as well    Description:  Base UI>Views>Events Propagation normally reports clicks on the window, the views, and the labels within the views. Clicks on the labels are reported as undefined.    Steps to reproduce:  1) Package KS for mobile web and open on iOS, Android or BB devices  2) Navigate to Base UI>Views>Events Propagation  3) Click on any of the labels (""""""""A"""""""", """"""""B"""""""", """"""""C"""""""", or """"""""D"""""""")    Result:  The label clicks are reported as undefined at the bottom of the screen    """"""",Bug,"Title: MobileWeb: Kitchensink - Base UI > Views > Events Propagation does not report label clicks
Description: """"NOT a regression, occurs in 3.1.3.GA as well Description: Base UI>Views>Events Propagation normally reports clicks on the window, the views, and the labels within the views. Clicks on the labels are reported as undefined. Steps to reproduce: 1) Package KS for mobile web and open on iOS, Android or BB devices 2) Navigate to Base UI>Views>Events Propagation 3) Click on any of the labels (""""""""A"""""""", """"""""B"""""""", """"""""C"""""""", or """"""""D"""""""") Result: The label clicks are reported as undefined at the bottom of the screen """"",title+description
