TIMOB-15735,12,"""CLI: New 'cli:go' hook to manipulate incoming arguments""","""""""Following our discussion at https://github.com/<USER>titanium/issues/71 I'd like to suggest adding a new {{cli:go}} (or whatever we name it) hook that executes before the <USER>arguments are parsed. This will enable hooks to simplify the CLI commands, options and flags like [TiNy](http://github.com/<USER>tn) aims to do.""""""",New Feature,"Title: CLI: New 'cli:go' hook to manipulate incoming arguments
Description: """"Following our discussion at https://github.com/<USER>titanium/issues/71 I'd like to suggest adding a new {{cli:go}} (or whatever we name it) hook that executes before the <USER>arguments are parsed. This will enable hooks to simplify the CLI commands, options and flags like [TiNy](http://github.com/<USER>tn) aims to do.""""",title+description
