TIMOB-15689,12,"""CLI: Move Android and iOS info rendering from CLI to SDK""","""""""As of Titanium SDK 3.2, the Android and iOS detection code is in the SDK. The problem is the rendering of the results is in the CLI. By moving it to the SDK, we decouple the rendering in the """"""""info"""""""" command from the SDK. This also allows future SDKs to change the info that is reported.""""""",Bug,"Title: CLI: Move Android and iOS info rendering from CLI to SDK
Description: """"As of Titanium SDK 3.2, the Android and iOS detection code is in the SDK. The problem is the rendering of the results is in the CLI. By moving it to the SDK, we decouple the rendering in the """"""""info"""""""" command from the SDK. This also allows future SDKs to change the info that is reported.""""",title+description
