TIMOB-15664,12,"""Android: nine-patch splash screen does not work correctly""","""""""Run the attached app. The expected behavior is in the /build/android/res/ directory, there should be a background.9.png in /drawable-nodpi/ and a background.9.png in /drawable-land-hdpi/, and there should be *no* background.png in /drawable/ .""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: nine-patch splash screen does not work correctly
Description: """"Run the attached app. The expected behavior is in the /build/android/res/ directory, there should be a background.9.png in /drawable-nodpi/ and a background.9.png in /drawable-land-hdpi/, and there should be *no* background.png in /drawable/ .""""",title+description
TIMOB-15663,12,"""Android: Cannot require Facebook module inside a CommonJS module""","""""""h2. Problem description  Trying to include the Facebook module inside a CommonJS module fails.    h2. Code to reproduce  app.js      ui/facebook.js      h2. Notes  Moving the content of the function from ui/facebook.js to app.js solves the problem. The module is registered in tiapp.xml, as well as the property ti.facebook.appid.    The module is not defined; this means, the `authorize` method is invalid in the sample above.""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Cannot require Facebook module inside a CommonJS module
Description: """"h2. Problem description Trying to include the Facebook module inside a CommonJS module fails. h2. Code to reproduce app.js ui/facebook.js h2. Notes Moving the content of the function from ui/facebook.js to app.js solves the problem. The module is registered in tiapp.xml, as well as the property ti.facebook.appid. The module is not defined; this means, the `authorize` method is invalid in the sample above.""""",title+description
TIMOB-15662,12,"""CLI: JS Minify - skip-js-minify flag does not minify JS""","""""""*Details:* skip-js-minify flag does not minify JS.    *Steps to reproduce:*  1. <USER>KS from https://github.com/<USER>developer-relations/KitchenSink  2. Install KS to device using the following CLI command:    ti build --skip-js-minify -p ios -P 6C8B12C4-7EC4-43DE-8CEB-B9DC4C3A4F88 -T device -I 7.0.3 -V """"""""QE Department (C64864TF2L)"""""""" -C """"""""Europa""""""""    *Actual:* JS will not be minified (see minify.txt)  *Expected:* JS should be minified when using the skip-js-minify flag""""""",Bug,"Title: CLI: JS Minify - skip-js-minify flag does not minify JS
Description: """"*Details:* skip-js-minify flag does not minify JS. *Steps to reproduce:* 1. <USER>KS from https://github.com/<USER>developer-relations/KitchenSink 2. Install KS to device using the following CLI command: ti build --skip-js-minify -p ios -P 6C8B12C4-7EC4-43DE-8CEB-B9DC4C3A4F88 -T device -I 7.0.3 -V """"""""QE Department (C64864TF2L)"""""""" -C """"""""Europa"""""""" *Actual:* JS will not be minified (see minify.txt) *Expected:* JS should be minified when using the skip-js-minify flag""""",title+description
TIMOB-15661,12,"""iOS: KitchenSink - Cannot launch KS on iOS""","""""""*Details:* Cannot launch KS on iOS    *Steps to reproduce:*  1. <USER>KS from https://github.com/<USER>developer-relations/KitchenSink  2. Install KS to device using the following CLI command:    ti build -p ios -P <PROVISIONING_PROFILE_UUID> -T device -I 7.0.3 -V <DEVELOPER_NAME> -C <DEVICE_NAME>    3. Launch KS on device    *Actual:* A runtime error appears on launch (see ks_runtime.png).    *Expected:* A runtime error should not appear.""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: KitchenSink - Cannot launch KS on iOS
