TIMOB-15659,12,"""iOS7: Table View last row separator line missing when footer title is set as empty""","""""""h6.Issue description  Table view last row separator line is missing when footer title is set as empty. When last row gets clicked appears on-screen.    Developers were setting the footer title as empty to the table as a workaround to solve the empty rows getting displayed in a table (this was working fine on iOS6 with earlier Titanium SDKs. But the same is not working on iOS7 with 3.1.3 SDK).    h6.Runnable sample  Run snippet and select latest row.  """"""",Bug,"Title: iOS7: Table View last row separator line missing when footer title is set as empty
