TIMOB-15637,12,"""Add property to disable text selection on non-editable TextArea...""","""""""It would be great to have the ability to disable text selection in a TextArea that is both non-editable and not enabled (i.e., functioning as a Label), so we can take advantage of autoLink (a feature not available on the Label control for iOS), yet not allow the user to copy text from it.     This would be useful in a messaging system scenario (see image attachment), or when text with varying and mixed link types (emails, urls, phone #'s, dates, etc.) need to be displayed.""""""",New Feature,"Title: Add property to disable text selection on non-editable TextArea...
Description: """"It would be great to have the ability to disable text selection in a TextArea that is both non-editable and not enabled (i.e., functioning as a Label), so we can take advantage of autoLink (a feature not available on the Label control for iOS), yet not allow the user to copy text from it. This would be useful in a messaging system scenario (see image attachment), or when text with varying and mixed link types (emails, urls, phone #'s, dates, etc.) need to be displayed.""""",title+description
