Description: """"h4. Problem Description Camera image of front facing camera is streched when using an overlay. Taking the photo will result in a normal image h4. Steps to reproduce 1. Create a new mobile project 2. Paste this code sample as app.js 3. Switch between front and rear camera. 4.when switching to the front facing camera it is distorted h4. Extra info Android camera had the problem with the backfacing camera: https://jira.<USER>org/browse/TIMOB-8151 and still has an error with overlays: https://jira.<USER>org/browse/TIMOB-14137 not sure if they are related""""",title+description
