TIMOB-15632,12,"""iOS: Status bar missing from iPhone-targeted application run on non-retina iPad""","""""""h2. Description   Running the iPhone app into iPad mini or iPad (non-retina) which is on iOS 7 the status bar is not shown in the device. You should run the iPhone app into iPad (not ipad app).    h4. Steps to reproduce  iPad mini or non-retina ipad (simulator or device) with iOS 7 and titanium sdk 3.1.3 GA  install any simple iphone app (Where deployment target is selected as iPhone only)  Run the app in iphone simulator -> this will launch the iphone simulator.  In iOS simulator menu (top bar) -> select hardware -> device ->iPad  then again launch the app again in iPad simulator.""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Status bar missing from iPhone-targeted application run on non-retina iPad
Description: """"h2. Description Running the iPhone app into iPad mini or iPad (non-retina) which is on iOS 7 the status bar is not shown in the device. You should run the iPhone app into iPad (not ipad app). h4. Steps to reproduce iPad mini or non-retina ipad (simulator or device) with iOS 7 and titanium sdk 3.1.3 GA install any simple iphone app (Where deployment target is selected as iPhone only) Run the app in iphone simulator -> this will launch the iphone simulator. In iOS simulator menu (top bar) -> select hardware -> device ->iPad then again launch the app again in iPad simulator.""""",title+description
