TIMOB-15593,12,"""iOS: A Label in a TableViewRow shifts up and down when text is updated""","""""""h5. Problem Description    Label in the TableViewRow is moving up and down (Approx. 1-2px) after every text update. If I set top attribute value on the label then working well but sometimes (On real device very often) blink after text update.       h5. My testing environment follows:       OS: MAC OX X 10.8.5     Ti SDK: 3.1.3 GA   Ti CLI: 3.2.0  IOS simulator 7.0    h5. My test code            h5. Step to reproduces  1. Create a new project  2. Paste test code in app.js  3. Now run on iOS 7 with simulator 7.0   4. See simulator screen, its moving up and down    h5. Expected result    It should fixed/ not moving up and down.    Thanks  """"""",Bug,"Title: iOS: A Label in a TableViewRow shifts up and down when text is updated
Description: """"h5. Problem Description Label in the TableViewRow is moving up and down (Approx. 1-2px) after every text update. If I set top attribute value on the label then working well but sometimes (On real device very often) blink after text update. h5. My testing environment follows: OS: MAC OX X 10.8.5 Ti SDK: 3.1.3 GA Ti CLI: 3.2.0 IOS simulator 7.0 h5. My test code h5. Step to reproduces 1. Create a new project 2. Paste test code in app.js 3. Now run on iOS 7 with simulator 7.0 4. See simulator screen, its moving up and down h5. Expected result It should fixed/ not moving up and down. Thanks """"",title+description
