  pause  10-21 16:19:33.679: D/TiAPI(1668):  stop  10-21 16:19:34.639: D/TiAPI(1668):  close    SDK 3.1.2 onwards    10-21 16:22:09.479: D/TiAPI(2219):  open  10-21 16:22:16.479: D/TiAPI(2219):  pause  10-21 16:22:17.289: D/TiAPI(2219):  stop  10-21 16:22:17.559: D/TiAPI(2219):  close  10-21 16:22:19.699: D/TiAPI(2219):  open  10-21 16:22:21.899: D/TiAPI(2219):  pause  10-21 16:22:22.859: D/TiAPI(2219):  stop  10-21 16:22:22.859: D/TiAPI(2219):  close  10-21 16:22:24.749: D/TiAPI(2219):  open  10-21 16:22:26.069: D/TiAPI(2219):  pause  10-21 16:22:27.049: D/TiAPI(2219):  stop  10-21 16:22:27.059: D/TiAPI(2219):  close  """"""",Bug,"Title: Android: window activity event not fired
