TIMOB-15491,12,"""iOS7: ScrollableView Scroll very slow""","""""""The problem is the following: Scrollableview with 10 view, 150 objects(the problem occurs even with less loaded objects) for view, the loaded object is always the same and is a commonjs.    The slowdown of the scroll will notice when you scroll, for example, from view 2 to 3, from 3 to 4 view, etc etc ... To see the problem just try to scroll slowly from one view to another, and as soon as you switch to another view you will notice the shot    the problem comes with the following SDK titanium:  3.1.4.v20131008163742  3.1.3GA  3.1.2GA  3.1.1GA      Code to be used for the test (and the attached video shows the problem):    app.js      common_js.js  """"""",Bug,"Title: iOS7: ScrollableView Scroll very slow
Description: """"The problem is the following: Scrollableview with 10 view, 150 objects(the problem occurs even with less loaded objects) for view, the loaded object is always the same and is a commonjs. The slowdown of the scroll will notice when you scroll, for example, from view 2 to 3, from 3 to 4 view, etc etc ... To see the problem just try to scroll slowly from one view to another, and as soon as you switch to another view you will notice the shot the problem comes with the following SDK titanium: 3.1.4.v20131008163742 3.1.3GA 3.1.2GA 3.1.1GA Code to be used for the test (and the attached video shows the problem): app.js common_js.js """"",title+description
TIMOB-15490,12,"""nfc.transceive() crashes app""","""""""I have successfully been able to connect to a DesFire (IsoDep) card and am able to call all the Tag methods associated with it. However every time I call the transceive() method my app crashes with no error. I have wrapped the transceive() call in a try catch but no exception is caught. Here is my code:        It doesn't matter what command I send, the app always crashes when the tech.transceive(command) is called!    """"""",Bug,"Title: nfc.transceive() crashes app
Description: """"I have successfully been able to connect to a DesFire (IsoDep) card and am able to call all the Tag methods associated with it. However every time I call the transceive() method my app crashes with no error. I have wrapped the transceive() call in a try catch but no exception is caught. Here is my code: It doesn't matter what command I send, the app always crashes when the tech.transceive(command) is called! """"",title+description
TIMOB-15488,12,"""Mobile Web: CLI mobile web production builds include *.js.uncompressed.js files in addition to minified versions""","""""""When building for mobile web using the CLI with the following command, the resulting build contains minified JS files in addition to their uncompressed counterpart (*.js.uncompressed.js):         At present, in order to ready a build for distribution, all uncompressed files must be deleted manually or via script.""""""",Bug,"Title: Mobile Web: CLI mobile web production builds include *.js.uncompressed.js files in addition to minified versions
Description: """"When building for mobile web using the CLI with the following command, the resulting build contains minified JS files in addition to their uncompressed counterpart (*.js.uncompressed.js): At present, in order to ready a build for distribution, all uncompressed files must be deleted manually or via script.""""",title+description
