TIMOB-15484,12,"""Android: Make property ti.android.bug2373.finishfalseroot default to true (in order to fix """"restart required"""" bug by default)""","""""""The """"""""restart required"""""""" bug seems to still be affecting people. In my research on this I came across a workaround which worked for us. However, we could have been saved 5-10 man-hours of time discussing the implications of this and doing research on how we might fix it. Details of the work around can be found here: https://jira.<USER>org/browse/TC-3125    Because this cost us so much time, I want to recommend thatti.android.bug2373.finishfalseroot be true by default. Are there any downsides to doing that? What are they?    """"""",New Feature,"Title: Android: Make property ti.android.bug2373.finishfalseroot default to true (in order to fix """"restart required"""" bug by default)
Description: """"The """"""""restart required"""""""" bug seems to still be affecting people. In my research on this I came across a workaround which worked for us. However, we could have been saved 5-10 man-hours of time discussing the implications of this and doing research on how we might fix it. Details of the work around can be found here: https://jira.<USER>org/browse/TC-3125 Because this cost us so much time, I want to recommend thatti.android.bug2373.finishfalseroot be true by default. Are there any downsides to doing that? What are they? """"",title+description
