Description: """"I'm testing a simple titanium app on an android avd obtained from a Xperia Z device definition (similar to samsung s4). The app works but I got a wrong value for Titanium.Platform.displayCaps.dpi The app report a wrong value for Titanium.Platform.displayCaps.dpi = 320 (avd has a dpi of 480). If can help finding a solution the Ti.Platform.displayCaps.platformWidth correctly report 1080. Attached AVD config""""",title+description
