TIMOB-15431,12,"""CLI: When cli.prompt set """"false"""", command """"ti sdk install -b master -d"""" returns error""","""""""h5. Description:  I was unable to install the latest version of master using the CLI and command """"""""ti sdk install -b master -d"""""""". An error was returned:      <USER>investigated the code and discovered that if the config setting """"""""cli.prompt"""""""" is false, then the command will fail as observed.    h5. Steps to reproduce:  1) Ensure cli.prompt is set to false with:  ti config cli.prompt """"""""false""""""""  2) Run command: ti sdk install -b master -d    h5. Result:  Error as described above    h5. Expected Result:  Latest master build installed and set as default SDK""""""",Bug,"Title: CLI: When cli.prompt set """"false"""", command """"ti sdk install -b master -d"""" returns error
