TIMOB-15424,12,"""Allow ScrollableView to set pageIndicatorColor and currentPageIndicatorColor""","""""""Every Ti SDK update, I have to manually edit the files to set my own custom colors for pageIndicatorColor and currentPageIndicatorColor:  - TiUIScrollableView.h  - TiUIScrollableView.m  - TiUIScrollableViewProxy.h  - TiUIScrollableViewProxy.m    Following this GitHub repo: https://github.com/boardmain/TitaniumMods/tree/master/3.0.2.GA    This works well with Ti SDK 3.1.3, though I have to manually update them with each update of Ti SDK (adding *just* the pageIndicatorColor & currentPageIndicatorColor features)""""""",New Feature,"Title: Allow ScrollableView to set pageIndicatorColor and currentPageIndicatorColor
Description: """"Every Ti SDK update, I have to manually edit the files to set my own custom colors for pageIndicatorColor and currentPageIndicatorColor: - TiUIScrollableView.h - TiUIScrollableView.m - TiUIScrollableViewProxy.h - TiUIScrollableViewProxy.m Following this GitHub repo: https://github.com/boardmain/TitaniumMods/tree/master/3.0.2.GA This works well with Ti SDK 3.1.3, though I have to manually update them with each update of Ti SDK (adding *just* the pageIndicatorColor & currentPageIndicatorColor features)""""",title+description
TIMOB-15423,12,"""Time picker show invalid time""","""""""Create picker with Ti.UI.PICKER_TYPE_TIME.  Set time by timePicker.setValue(new Date(0, 0, 0, 12, 45)).  Time on picker will be 11:35AM for +0003.  Get time from picker by getValue(). Return value is '1899-12-31 09:45:00 +0000'.""""""",Bug,"Title: Time picker show invalid time
