TIMOB-15397,12,"""Android: Map V2 module does not provide animation for annotation""","""""""Using Earlier version (1.0) of Ti.Map, there was a feature for annotation animation (http://docs.<USER>com/titanium/latest/#!/api/Titanium.Map.Annotation-property-animate).  In Map version 2, there is no method for animating annotation object.""""""",New Feature,"Title: Android: Map V2 module does not provide animation for annotation
