TIMOB-15342,12,"""Android: Value of Label not getting updated in tableView when Table height is set as Ti.UI.SIZE""","""""""This is not a regression.      Value of Label is not getting updated in tableView when Table's height is set as Ti.UI.SIZE.      Expected Result:  On clicking the """"""""Update Label"""""""" button value of Label """"""""New Label"""""""" must be getting increment(changed) on every click.    Actual Result:  On iOS it works fine.   On Android Value of label does not gets updated.  but if  """"""""height: Ti.UI.SIZE"""""""" of tableview is commented off.   Code works fine. Label's value gets updated.""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Value of Label not getting updated in tableView when Table height is set as Ti.UI.SIZE
