TIMOB-15341,12,"""Please update detect.js to use latest node-appc and make iOS build process work again""","""""""iphone detect.js relies on node-appc function (subprocess.run) which is available in edge node-appc. But Titanium SDK is still uses old node-appc (but new detect.js) which does not have appc.subprocess.run function.""""""",New Feature,"Title: Please update detect.js to use latest node-appc and make iOS build process work again
