TIMOB-15340,12,"""iOS: Update Facebook Module to version 3.8""","""""""We need to update the Facebook SDK Module version.    It's more than 1 year old now as per https://github.com/<USER>titanium_modules/blob/master/facebook/mobile/ios/Classes/FBConnect/version we are currently stuck on version 3.1 of the Facebook SDK... And there were a lot of improvements since them...    The official Changelog from 3.1 to 3.8:  https://developers.facebook.com/docs/ios/change-log-3.x/    There are many features and improvements since them, not to mention that the latest 3.8 version brings the UI enhancements necessary for iOS 7.""""""",New Feature,"Title: iOS: Update Facebook Module to version 3.8
Description: """"We need to update the Facebook SDK Module version. It's more than 1 year old now as per https://github.com/<USER>titanium_modules/blob/master/facebook/mobile/ios/Classes/FBConnect/version we are currently stuck on version 3.1 of the Facebook SDK... And there were a lot of improvements since them... The official Changelog from 3.1 to 3.8: https://developers.facebook.com/docs/ios/change-log-3.x/ There are many features and improvements since them, not to mention that the latest 3.8 version brings the UI enhancements necessary for iOS 7.""""",title+description
