TIMOB-15337,12,"""Splash Screen Shifts to the Left""","""""""h3. Steps to Reproduce  Create a Default project which defaults to landscape only. Then use say the alloy landscape image.    Issume on IPad Build.    Use SDK 3.1.3.GA      h3. Actual Result  Splash screen shifts to the left.    h3. Expected Result  Should not move at all.""""""",Bug,"Title: Splash Screen Shifts to the Left
