TIMOB-15245,12,"""CLI: Killing running app launched in iOS simulator presents unexpected console output including """"project failed to build""""""","""""""h5. Description:  When an app is launched in the iOS simulator and killed via the simulator, the following output appears in the console:      A slightly longer section of the output shows """"""""** BUILD SUCCEEDED **"""""""" prior to the failure, this could cause confusion:      This occurs from Studio or the CLI.    h5. Steps to reproduce:  1) Create a project  2) Launch in CLI or studio on iOS simulator  3) When app running in simulator, simulate home button press (via CMD-SHIFT-H)  4) Simulate Double press on home button (via double CMD-SHIFT-H)  5) For iOS 7, find your running app and swipe upwards to kill  6) Check console    h5. Result:  Error as listed above    h5. Expected Result:  No errors presented""""""",Bug,"Title: CLI: Killing running app launched in iOS simulator presents unexpected console output including """"project failed to build""""
Description: """"h5. Description: When an app is launched in the iOS simulator and killed via the simulator, the following output appears in the console: A slightly longer section of the output shows """"""""** BUILD SUCCEEDED **"""""""" prior to the failure, this could cause confusion: This occurs from Studio or the CLI. h5. Steps to reproduce: 1) Create a project 2) Launch in CLI or studio on iOS simulator 3) When app running in simulator, simulate home button press (via CMD-SHIFT-H) 4) Simulate Double press on home button (via double CMD-SHIFT-H) 5) For iOS 7, find your running app and swipe upwards to kill 6) Check console h5. Result: Error as listed above h5. Expected Result: No errors presented""""",title+description
TIMOB-15244,12,"""Android: Expose cookie management methods for HTTPClient and WebView""","""""""In Android, HttpClient does not share cookies with WebView. Need to expose the cookie management methods so developers can manage their cookies.  Reference: http://developer.android.com/reference/android/webkit/CookieManager.html  http://developer.android.com/reference/org/apache/http/client/CookieStore.html  http://developer.android.com/reference/org/apache/http/impl/cookie/BasicClientCookie.html""""""",New Feature,"Title: Android: Expose cookie management methods for HTTPClient and WebView
Description: """"In Android, HttpClient does not share cookies with WebView. Need to expose the cookie management methods so developers can manage their cookies. Reference: http://developer.android.com/reference/android/webkit/CookieManager.html http://developer.android.com/reference/org/apache/http/client/CookieStore.html http://developer.android.com/reference/org/apache/http/impl/cookie/BasicClientCookie.html""""",title+description
