TIMOB-15201,12,"""iOS: Same variable display different values""","""""""    *OUT PUT*  [INFO] :   TODAY: Fri Sep 13 2013 06:00:00 GMT+0200 (CEST) // RIGHT  [INFO] :   SOME DATE: Tue Feb 01 1876 11:46:00 GMT+<USER>(CET) // RIGHT    [INFO] :   > TODAY: Fri Sep 13 2013 06:00:18 GMT+0200 (CEST) // WRONG  [INFO] :   > SOME DATE: Tue Feb 01 1876 11:45:50 GMT+<USER>(CET) // WRONG""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Same variable display different values
