TIMOB-15200,12,"""Android: ImageView.image from XHR no longer shows new image""","""""""After installing SDK 3.1.3.v20130913160104 to verify the fix for TIMOB-14777    i.e. https://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/pull/4657    I have found that setting the .image property on an ImageView does not show the actual image.    Here's a reduced repro (that can be placed into FirstView.js after creating a new project, for example):        On SDK 3.1.2, the logo shows up.    On SDK 3.1.3.v20130913160104, the logo does not show up.    The XHR.onload event does fire, but it appears setting imageView.image has no effect.    I suspect that it may be related to the fix I mention TIMOB-14777.""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: ImageView.image from XHR no longer shows new image
Description: """"After installing SDK 3.1.3.v20130913160104 to verify the fix for TIMOB-14777 i.e. https://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/pull/4657 I have found that setting the .image property on an ImageView does not show the actual image. Here's a reduced repro (that can be placed into FirstView.js after creating a new project, for example): On SDK 3.1.2, the logo shows up. On SDK 3.1.3.v20130913160104, the logo does not show up. The XHR.onload event does fire, but it appears setting imageView.image has no effect. I suspect that it may be related to the fix I mention TIMOB-14777.""""",title+description
