TIMOB-15197,12,"""iOS7: AlertDialog changes its position on orientation change""","""""""h4. Description     When we open an alert dialog and background the app in portrait mode, if we resume the app in landscape the alert dialog shifts position.    h4. Steps to reproduce    1. Pop up Alert message by Clicking Long title Button in Portrait mode  2. Press the home button once  3. Resume the app in Landscape mode (See screenshot 2 for how it looks at this step)  4. Pop up Alert message by Clicking Long title Button in Landscape mode  5. Press the home button  6. Resume the app in portrait mode (See screenshot 3 for how it looks at this step)    h4. Code          """"""",Bug,"Title: iOS7: AlertDialog changes its position on orientation change
Description: """"h4. Description When we open an alert dialog and background the app in portrait mode, if we resume the app in landscape the alert dialog shifts position. h4. Steps to reproduce 1. Pop up Alert message by Clicking Long title Button in Portrait mode 2. Press the home button once 3. Resume the app in Landscape mode (See screenshot 2 for how it looks at this step) 4. Pop up Alert message by Clicking Long title Button in Landscape mode 5. Press the home button 6. Resume the app in portrait mode (See screenshot 3 for how it looks at this step) h4. Code """"",title+description
