TIMOB-15123,12,"""Android : """"Out of Memory"""" issue in ti.map when getting directions between far places after 2-3 times""","""""""We get """"""""Out of Memory"""""""" issue in ti.map when getting directions between far places after 2-3 times.    Here are the error logs:        *Steps to reproduce* :    1. Import the attached project in Titanium Studio.    2. Run and Launch it in Nexus 7.    3. Two textfields would be shown. Enter 'Danbury' and 'LosAngeles' in those textfields.    4. Click on 'Get Directions' button.A map with the appropriate route would be shown.    5. Repeat step 4 approx 2-3 times. Application crashed due to memory issue.    *Note:* If the same steps followed to get the directions between nearer places, the crash did not happen.""""""",Bug,"Title: Android : """"Out of Memory"""" issue in ti.map when getting directions between far places after 2-3 times
Description: """"We get """"""""Out of Memory"""""""" issue in ti.map when getting directions between far places after 2-3 times. Here are the error logs: *Steps to reproduce* : 1. Import the attached project in Titanium Studio. 2. Run and Launch it in Nexus 7. 3. Two textfields would be shown. Enter 'Danbury' and 'LosAngeles' in those textfields. 4. Click on 'Get Directions' button.A map with the appropriate route would be shown. 5. Repeat step 4 approx 2-3 times. Application crashed due to memory issue. *Note:* If the same steps followed to get the directions between nearer places, the crash did not happen.""""",title+description
