TIMOB-15089,12,"""Tizen: Apps built with tizen 2.2 and 3.1.3 SDK are missing basic functionality""","""""""Cant say if it is a regression as we are testing against tizen 2.2 for the first time.Also can't test tizen 2.2 apps with 3.1.2GA because of the signer utility fix in 3.1.3 specific for tizen 2.2.      h5.Description:  1. Create an app for tizen from the default apps from studio or create an app with the following code in the app.js    2.Build & run for tizen emulator/device.  3.After the app has launched tap on the button 'click me' or tap on tab2    h5.Actual Result:  1.Tapping on 'tab2' in the above code does not open the tab2. Also,tapping on the button does not bring up the alert or the logs in the console.  2.One more observation in the default master detail app is that tapping on the rows of fruit names does not open any view or window with the price of the fruit according to the code which means issue with table view  3. There might be other functionality's broken too.    h5.Expected Result:  1.The apps should not break & work appropriately.""""""",Bug,"Title: Tizen: Apps built with tizen 2.2 and 3.1.3 SDK are missing basic functionality
Description: """"Cant say if it is a regression as we are testing against tizen 2.2 for the first time.Also can't test tizen 2.2 apps with 3.1.2GA because of the signer utility fix in 3.1.3 specific for tizen 2.2. h5.Description: 1. Create an app for tizen from the default apps from studio or create an app with the following code in the app.js 2.Build & run for tizen emulator/device. 3.After the app has launched tap on the button 'click me' or tap on tab2 h5.Actual Result: 1.Tapping on 'tab2' in the above code does not open the tab2. Also,tapping on the button does not bring up the alert or the logs in the console. 2.One more observation in the default master detail app is that tapping on the rows of fruit names does not open any view or window with the price of the fruit according to the code which means issue with table view 3. There might be other functionality's broken too. h5.Expected Result: 1.The apps should not break & work appropriately.""""",title+description
TIMOB-15088,12,"""Geolocation Accuracy sometimes resets from ACCURACY_BEST to ACCURACY_THREE_KILOMETERS""","""""""Given that Ti.Geolocation.ACCURACY_BEST is defined as -1, the following code starting at line 275 in GeolocationModule.m, sometimes changes ACCURACY_BEST to ACCURACY_THREE_KILOMETERS.        If you set the accuracy to ACCURACY_BEST before adding the event listener, then it's changed to ACCURACY_THREE_KILOMETERS.    This issue was brought up by Ondrej Urik in a comment @ https://developer.<USER>com/question/116986""""""",Bug,"Title: Geolocation Accuracy sometimes resets from ACCURACY_BEST to ACCURACY_THREE_KILOMETERS
Description: """"Given that Ti.Geolocation.ACCURACY_BEST is defined as -1, the following code starting at line 275 in GeolocationModule.m, sometimes changes ACCURACY_BEST to ACCURACY_THREE_KILOMETERS. If you set the accuracy to ACCURACY_BEST before adding the event listener, then it's changed to ACCURACY_THREE_KILOMETERS. This issue was brought up by Ondrej Urik in a comment @ https://developer.<USER>com/question/116986""""",title+description
TIMOB-15087,12,"""iOS7: Method Cache Corrupted ""","""""""h4. PROBLEM DESCRIPTION  Upon opening a window which includes a webView the following errors are seen in the console and the app crashes.    h4. LOG   {code:title=Log}  [DEBUG] objc[35284]: Method cache corrupted. This may be a message to an invalid object, or a memory error somewhere else.  [DEBUG] objc[35284]: receiver 0xe592b10, SEL 0x43d3643, isa 0xf2f4a8, cache 0xf2f4b0, buckets 0xe9e74b, mask 0xb, occupied 0x0  [DEBUG] objc[35284]: receiver 32 bytes, buckets 0 bytes  [DEBUG] objc[35284]: selector 'release'  [DEBUG] objc[35284]: isa ''  [DEBUG] objc[35284]: Method cache corrupted.      The above is wrapped inside a module.exports. The calling window grabs the returned win object, and opens it as a child window in the active tab of a Tab Group.""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS7: Method Cache Corrupted
Description: """"h4. PROBLEM DESCRIPTION Upon opening a window which includes a webView the following errors are seen in the console and the app crashes. h4. LOG {code:title=Log} [DEBUG] objc[35284]: Method cache corrupted. This may be a message to an invalid object, or a memory error somewhere else. [DEBUG] objc[35284]: receiver 0xe592b10, SEL 0x43d3643, isa 0xf2f4a8, cache 0xf2f4b0, buckets 0xe9e74b, mask 0xb, occupied 0x0 [DEBUG] objc[35284]: receiver 32 bytes, buckets 0 bytes [DEBUG] objc[35284]: selector 'release' [DEBUG] objc[35284]: isa '' [DEBUG] objc[35284]: Method cache corrupted. The above is wrapped inside a module.exports. The calling window grabs the returned win object, and opens it as a child window in the active tab of a Tab Group.""""",title+description
