TIMOB-15023,12,"""CLI: Missing dependencies prevent building for device""","""""""h5. Description:  While trying to perform a functional review on an SDK pull request for master, we were unable to build. It seems this is caused by missing dependencies. Bryan came over to help resolve, but encountered the same problem on his system.    Missing is:      The result when trying to build is typically:      h5. Steps to reproduce:  1) Install a build of master  2) Update to CLI 1.2.0 using: sudo npm install -g git://github.com/<USER>titanium.git  3) Copy node_appc 0.2.0 into the SDK if it does not exist  4) Attempt to build for iOS device via studio    h5. Result:  Failure to build    h5. Expected Result:  Project builds and installs to iTunes, sync starts""""""",Bug,"Title: CLI: Missing dependencies prevent building for device
Description: """"h5. Description: While trying to perform a functional review on an SDK pull request for master, we were unable to build. It seems this is caused by missing dependencies. Bryan came over to help resolve, but encountered the same problem on his system. Missing is: The result when trying to build is typically: h5. Steps to reproduce: 1) Install a build of master 2) Update to CLI 1.2.0 using: sudo npm install -g git://github.com/<USER>titanium.git 3) Copy node_appc 0.2.0 into the SDK if it does not exist 4) Attempt to build for iOS device via studio h5. Result: Failure to build h5. Expected Result: Project builds and installs to iTunes, sync starts""""",title+description
