TIMOB-15019,12,"""iOS: Tableview crash when calling setData after search""","""""""h4. Description    When calling setData on a table that has been populated with sections and rows, setting the data to just rows causes a crash.    h4. Code to reproduce        h4. Steps to reproduce    1. Tap on search bar and type 'a'.  2. Press search  3. Press cancel  4. Tap on search bar again  5. App should crash    Please see the attached crash log.  The issue does not occur in 2.1.4GA  """"""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Tableview crash when calling setData after search
