TIMOB-14972,12,"""iOS: Grouped TableView - Not able to calculate height""","""""""*Problem*  When using style=GROUPED TableView with height=Ti.UI.SIZE, the height is calculated wrong, this works fine with style=PLAIN. See test case.    *Actual Result*  The height is calculated wrong    *Expected Result*  The height should be calculated right.    *Test case*  """"""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Grouped TableView - Not able to calculate height
