Description: """"When you run """"""""ti info -t os"""""""" on a Red Hat Linux distro (or Fedora or Centos), it displays: Apparently Red Hat distros do not provide a /etc/lsb-release file, but do provide a /etc/system-release which does contain the correct info. Expected output should look like: """"",title+description
