Description: """"h6.Issue Live View works when client setup his app in <USER>Studio but when he try to run the app (Live View icon toggled on) he receives this and nothing else happens: h6.His output: h5.Additional details Forgive me if I'm missing something obvious. When we attempted to reproduce the issue was only possible using """"""""alloy.js"""""""" and """"""""lib/dates.js"""""""" throwing a similar error (logs posted below). h6.Steps to reproduce Use StrippedDownSample.zip assets attached. Required files are inside app folder. h6.alloy.js h6.lib/dates.js h6.Console output """"",title+description
