TIMOB-14769,12,"""Android: When FastDev is enabled, emulators from SDKs 4.1 and greater will crash""","""""""h5. Description:  When fastdev is enabled, emulators for 4.1, 4.2, or 4.3 Android SDK will crash. This is potentially a side effect of a pull request (4474).     h5. Steps to reproduce:  1) Create a new project using a 3.1.2 SDK post pull 4474 (after July 23rd)  2) Launch in 4.1 or later emulator (4.1 - 4.3 currently)    h5. Result:  If on <USER>Studio, your emulator will hang. If on Titanium studio, your emulator will crash    h5. Expected Result:  No crash, the emulator functions as expected.""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: When FastDev is enabled, emulators from SDKs 4.1 and greater will crash
Description: """"h5. Description: When fastdev is enabled, emulators for 4.1, 4.2, or 4.3 Android SDK will crash. This is potentially a side effect of a pull request (4474). h5. Steps to reproduce: 1) Create a new project using a 3.1.2 SDK post pull 4474 (after July 23rd) 2) Launch in 4.1 or later emulator (4.1 - 4.3 currently) h5. Result: If on <USER>Studio, your emulator will hang. If on Titanium studio, your emulator will crash h5. Expected Result: No crash, the emulator functions as expected.""""",title+description
