Description: """"*Steps to Reproduce* 1. Create a new Classic Default Project 2. Drop the attached images into the Resources folder 3. Run the test case 4. Observe the actual result *Test case* {code:javascript} var wnd = Ti.UI.createWindow({ fullscreen : false }); var view = Ti.UI.createView(); wnd.add(view); wnd.backgroundImage = """"""""backWnd.png""""""""; view.backgroundImage = """"""""backView.png""""""""; wnd.open(); {code} *Actual Result* From fastdev console: *Expected Result* Background image must be loaded once.""""",title+description
