TIMOB-14732,12,"""Android: imageView inside a scrollView is not correctly resized""","""""""h5. Problem description    imageViews in a scrollView are not correctly resized on Android devices    h5. Sample code        (apoc.jpg attached to the project).    h5. Steps to reproduce  Run the sample code using the attached image (image is bigger than the screen)  Result: on Android device the 95% value for the width is respected, but the image is cropped instead of being correctly resized (as is correctly displayed on iOS).    If the image is added to a normal view, is displayed correctly.    Same behavior is reproducible on 3.1.1 GA and 3.1.0 GA, so is not a regression.""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: imageView inside a scrollView is not correctly resized
Description: """"h5. Problem description imageViews in a scrollView are not correctly resized on Android devices h5. Sample code (apoc.jpg attached to the project). h5. Steps to reproduce Run the sample code using the attached image (image is bigger than the screen) Result: on Android device the 95% value for the width is respected, but the image is cropped instead of being correctly resized (as is correctly displayed on iOS). If the image is added to a normal view, is displayed correctly. Same behavior is reproducible on 3.1.1 GA and 3.1.0 GA, so is not a regression.""""",title+description
