TIMOB-14730,12,"""Blackberry: Modules - Create a module API""","""""""Both Android and iOS have module APIs, which are similar in naming convention. We need to expose some type of similar API to the modules in BB. This includes a set of utility and helper classes, such as TiUtils, TiProxy, TiViewProxy, TiBase, TiModule, etc...""""""",New Feature,"Title: Blackberry: Modules - Create a module API
Description: """"Both Android and iOS have module APIs, which are similar in naming convention. We need to expose some type of similar API to the modules in BB. This includes a set of utility and helper classes, such as TiUtils, TiProxy, TiViewProxy, TiBase, TiModule, etc...""""",title+description
TIMOB-14729,12,"""Blackberry: Modules - Expose Titanium NON-UI API""","""""""In native modules for blackberry we need to expose the basic Proxy classes for subclasing. Currently we can create simple JavaScript objects with the V8 API, but we need the proxy which contains useful features such as Events.""""""",Sub-task,"Title: Blackberry: Modules - Expose Titanium NON-UI API
Description: """"In native modules for blackberry we need to expose the basic Proxy classes for subclasing. Currently we can create simple JavaScript objects with the V8 API, but we need the proxy which contains useful features such as Events.""""",title+description
TIMOB-14728,12,"""Blackberry: Modules - Expose Titanium UI API""","""""""In modules, we need a way to create more custom views, such as barcode scanning views, etc... Currently there is no way to call the ViewProxy from a module and create views.""""""",Sub-task,"Title: Blackberry: Modules - Expose Titanium UI API
Description: """"In modules, we need a way to create more custom views, such as barcode scanning views, etc... Currently there is no way to call the ViewProxy from a module and create views.""""",title+description
TIMOB-14727,12,"""Blackberry: Modules - Expose internal Titanium API""","""""""Currently the native modules in BB only expose V8 and the BB libraries. We need to also expose the native Titanium API, such as ViewProxy, Proxy, etc...""""""",Sub-task,"Title: Blackberry: Modules - Expose internal Titanium API
Description: """"Currently the native modules in BB only expose V8 and the BB libraries. We need to also expose the native Titanium API, such as ViewProxy, Proxy, etc...""""",title+description
