TIMOB-14722,12,"""Android 4.3 - Image Views - Image is not displayed on Nexus7(2)""","""""""While testing Image Views in Kitchen Sink, I encountered that an image is not displayed. It happens on Nexus7(2)Android version4.3 only.  Test steps:  1. Install and run KitchenSink>Views>Image Views> Basic    Expected result:  The image should be displayed    Actual result:  No image. Clicking an """"""""imaginary"""""""" image returns an alert """"""""You cliked me"""""""". See log, if it helps.""""""",Bug,"Title: Android 4.3 - Image Views - Image is not displayed on Nexus7(2)
