TIMOB-14663,12,"""BlackBerry: ScrollView not scrolling and not showing ScrollIndicators""","""""""h5. Problem description    On BlackBerry, a ScrollView is not scrolling and not showing ScrollIndicators    h5. Steps to reproduce    Sample code (Alloy):    index.js      index.tss      index.xml      1. Run the sample on BlackBerry  Result: the scrollView is displayed, but is not possible to scroll down to the bottom of the View (also not scrolling horizontally).  2. Run the sample on Android or iOS  Result: scrollView can scroll down to the bottom and the orange view is visible.    No scroll indicators are also visible.""""""",Bug,"Title: BlackBerry: ScrollView not scrolling and not showing ScrollIndicators
