TIMOB-14654,12,"""Android: Picker selected row does not highlight multi line text completely""","""""""In Android if we create a picker and set the picker row text some large value that can not be set in a single line. Then picker selectedRow lighter does not highlight complete selected row.    *Sample code to test issue**      Steps:  1: Use the sample code in a Titanium Project and put it on app.js file.  2: Test the sample on any android device(preferred is Samsung S3 and Nexux).  3: Picker selected row highlighter does not highlight complete text.  """"""",Bug,"Title: Android: Picker selected row does not highlight multi line text completely
Description: """"In Android if we create a picker and set the picker row text some large value that can not be set in a single line. Then picker selectedRow lighter does not highlight complete selected row. *Sample code to test issue** Steps: 1: Use the sample code in a Titanium Project and put it on app.js file. 2: Test the sample on any android device(preferred is Samsung S3 and Nexux). 3: Picker selected row highlighter does not highlight complete text. """"",title+description
TIMOB-14653,12,"""iOS: PDF in a webview does not show form fields value""","""""""The PDF loads fine in a webView but the form field's values present in the PDF are not seen.  Here is the test case:      Please find the attached `document.pdf` for testing.""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: PDF in a webview does not show form fields value
