Description: """"Using Ti.Platform.openURL() to try and launch the dialer or sms on blackberry (simulator and device) gives a TypeError: Object [object Object] has no method 'openURL' This functionality works fine on android and iOS however we are also looking at external modules to prevent leaving our app to send SMS. In the meantime, is there any way of sending sms or calling the dialer in Balckberry 10 currently?""""",title+description
