TIMOB-14641,12,"""Blackberry: Not specifying a """"target"""" throws unhelpful error in CLI""","""""""h2. problem    Executing a {{titanium build}} without the --target option throws an error that the 99% of developers will have no idea how to work with, seen here:        It appears it happens because the --target option is not explicitly set.    h2. test case    In any Titanium app, execute the following:    {code:bash}  titanium build -p blackberry  """"""",Bug,"Title: Blackberry: Not specifying a """"target"""" throws unhelpful error in CLI
