TIMOB-14570,12,"""MobileWeb: Ti.UI.create2DMatrix() does not support properties in its constructor object""","""""""h2. problem     Mobileweb does not respect matrix properties ([MatrixCreationDict|http://docs.<USER>com/titanium/latest/#!/api/MatrixCreationDict]) set in the constructor of [Ti.UI.create2DMatrix()|http://docs.<USER>com/titanium/latest/#!/api/Titanium.UI.2DMatrix], despite the documentation at docs.<USER>com indicating that it should. It works on Android and iOS.    h2. expected    Mobileweb, like Android and iOS, should appropriately apply a [MatrixCreationDict|http://docs.<USER>com/titanium/latest/#!/api/MatrixCreationDict] passed into the Ti.UI.create2DMatrix() function.    h2. test case    The label will be tilted 45 degrees on Android and iOS. It will not be on Mobileweb.    """"""",Bug,"Title: MobileWeb: Ti.UI.create2DMatrix() does not support properties in its constructor object
Description: """"h2. problem Mobileweb does not respect matrix properties ([MatrixCreationDict|http://docs.<USER>com/titanium/latest/#!/api/MatrixCreationDict]) set in the constructor of [Ti.UI.create2DMatrix()|http://docs.<USER>com/titanium/latest/#!/api/Titanium.UI.2DMatrix], despite the documentation at docs.<USER>com indicating that it should. It works on Android and iOS. h2. expected Mobileweb, like Android and iOS, should appropriately apply a [MatrixCreationDict|http://docs.<USER>com/titanium/latest/#!/api/MatrixCreationDict] passed into the Ti.UI.create2DMatrix() function. h2. test case The label will be tilted 45 degrees on Android and iOS. It will not be on Mobileweb. """"",title+description
