TIMOB-14560,12,"""iOS: Typo in setActivityType (GeolocationModule.m)""","""""""There is a typo in setActivityType where accuracy is being set instead of activityType""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Typo in setActivityType (GeolocationModule.m)
