Description: """"No controls are displayed while playing the video Steps to reproduce: 1. Go to KS> Phone>Camera> video Record. 2. Click on Start video to record video. 3. Click on Stop video. The recorded video is played after that. Actual: No controls are displayed while the video is being played. Expected: The controls should be displayed """"",title+description
TIMOB-14523,12,"""iOS7: iPad Features - popover crashes to give the runtime error""","""""""Popover crashes to display runtime error.    Steps to reproduce:    1. KS> Phone>iPad Features.  2. Click Main tests>Show list>Popovers  3. Click popover2    Expected:  Popover should be displayed.    Actual:  A runtime error is displayed.     The error displayed in the logs as below:     [ERROR] Script Error {       backtrace = """"""""#0 () at :0"""""""";       line = 1;       message = """"""""*** -[__NSArrayM objectAtIndex:]: index 1 beyond bounds [0 .. 0]"""""""";       sourceId = 47925504;       sourceURL = """"""""file:///var/mobile/Applications/BCC3F229-ECB3-4FD0-9C6D-D5A043328421/KitchenSink.app/ui/tablet/ios/baseui/popover.js"""""""";   }  ␀␀""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS7: iPad Features - popover crashes to give the runtime error
Description: """"Popover crashes to display runtime error. Steps to reproduce: 1. KS> Phone>iPad Features. 2. Click Main tests>Show list>Popovers 3. Click popover2 Expected: Popover should be displayed. Actual: A runtime error is displayed. The error displayed in the logs as below: [ERROR] Script Error { backtrace = """"""""#0 () at :0""""""""; line = 1; message = """"""""*** -[__NSArrayM objectAtIndex:]: index 1 beyond bounds [0 .. 0]""""""""; sourceId = 47925504; sourceURL = """"""""file:///var/mobile/Applications/BCC3F229-ECB3-4FD0-9C6D-D5A043328421/KitchenSink.app/ui/tablet/ios/baseui/popover.js""""""""; } ␀␀""""",title+description
