TIMOB-14511,12,"""Android: activity.actionBar.title crash on some skinned Android versions.""","""""""h1. Summary  On some Android devices, the app crashes after setting the 'title' property of the actionBar.    h1. Test case  Coffeescript:  {quote}  @_tabGroup = Titanium.UI.createTabGroup()  actionBar = @_tabGroup.getActivity().actionBar  actionBar?.title = """"""""Compass""""""""  {quote}  Javascript:  {quote}  this._tabGroup = Titanium.UI.createTabGroup();  var actionBar;  actionBar = _this._tabGroup.getActivity().actionBar;  if (actionBar != null) actionBar.title = """"""""Compass"""""""";  {quote}    The app crashes with the following stack-trace:      According to user-reports, at least the following devices are affected:  * Android devices running HTC Sense  * HP tablet with cyanogenmod  * Aldi Wolfgang AT-AS45IPS    h1. Resolution  I just submitted a [Pull request|https://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/pull/4437] for [TIMOB-14215|https://jira.<USER>org/browse/TIMOB-14215]. These issues are related. I can confirm that the changes in this pull request resolve both issues. """"""",Bug,"Title: Android: activity.actionBar.title crash on some skinned Android versions.
Description: """"h1. Summary On some Android devices, the app crashes after setting the 'title' property of the actionBar. h1. Test case Coffeescript: {quote} @_tabGroup = Titanium.UI.createTabGroup() actionBar = @_tabGroup.getActivity().actionBar actionBar?.title = """"""""Compass"""""""" {quote} Javascript: {quote} this._tabGroup = Titanium.UI.createTabGroup(); var actionBar; actionBar = _this._tabGroup.getActivity().actionBar; if (actionBar != null) actionBar.title = """"""""Compass""""""""; {quote} The app crashes with the following stack-trace: According to user-reports, at least the following devices are affected: * Android devices running HTC Sense * HP tablet with cyanogenmod * Aldi Wolfgang AT-AS45IPS h1. Resolution I just submitted a [Pull request|https://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/pull/4437] for [TIMOB-14215|https://jira.<USER>org/browse/TIMOB-14215]. These issues are related. I can confirm that the changes in this pull request resolve both issues. """"",title+description
