TIMOB-14508,12,"""Android : 9 patch image for splash screen stretches unevenly""","""""""9 patch image for splash screen stretches unevenly.    Steps to Reproduce :     1. Create an alloy project in Titanium studio.    2. Under project folder, paste the attached `platform` folder.     Custom theme is applied for 9 patch image under this folder. Please Find       the 9 patch image under platform/android/res/drawable/splash.9.png.    3. Run the sample and see how the splash screen stretches unevenly.    4. Please find the attached screenshot of the splash screen.""""""",Bug,"Title: Android : 9 patch image for splash screen stretches unevenly
Description: """"9 patch image for splash screen stretches unevenly. Steps to Reproduce : 1. Create an alloy project in Titanium studio. 2. Under project folder, paste the attached `platform` folder. Custom theme is applied for 9 patch image under this folder. Please Find the 9 patch image under platform/android/res/drawable/splash.9.png. 3. Run the sample and see how the splash screen stretches unevenly. 4. Please find the attached screenshot of the splash screen.""""",title+description
