TIMOB-14467,12,"""BlackBerry: Tibbtest project needs to be enhanced to allow the running and debugging of native modules""","""""""Test:    1) Import native module into Momentics.    2) Edit common.mk to have your static module in the search path and named.    3) Edit main.cpp to register the module.     3) Create an app.js file that requires in the module. You should be able to debug the module.""""""",New Feature,"Title: BlackBerry: Tibbtest project needs to be enhanced to allow the running and debugging of native modules
