TIMOB-14463,12,"""BlackBerry: CLI for native module support needs to load shared libraries ""","""""""Test:    1) After building the native modules, put shared library binaries in the modules folder of the project or SDK. The path should be .../modules/blackberry/<MY_NATIVE_MODULE>/<VERSION>/lib/x86/<MY_NATIVE_MODULE>.so and .../modules/blackberry/<MY_NATIVE_MODULE>/<VERSION>lib/arm/<MY_NATIVE_MODULE>.so     2) After running """"""""ti build"""""""" look into the application project folder under <MYPROJECT>/Resources/modules, the MY_NATIVE_MODULE should exist. """"""",New Feature,"Title: BlackBerry: CLI for native module support needs to load shared libraries
Description: """"Test: 1) After building the native modules, put shared library binaries in the modules folder of the project or SDK. The path should be .../modules/blackberry/<MY_NATIVE_MODULE>/<VERSION>/lib/x86/<MY_NATIVE_MODULE>.so and .../modules/blackberry/<MY_NATIVE_MODULE>/<VERSION>lib/arm/<MY_NATIVE_MODULE>.so 2) After running """"""""ti build"""""""" look into the application project folder under <MYPROJECT>/Resources/modules, the MY_NATIVE_MODULE should exist. """"",title+description
TIMOB-14461,12,"""iOS7: Save to File - Filesystem.getFile(filename) method is not working""","""""""While testing camera, I encountered the issue, when image was not saved to file. I tested setting a backgroundImage to the window, and it works.  To reproduce:  1. Install and run KS> Phone> Camera> Save to File  2. Take a picture and press Use    Actual result:  The image is not displayed         Expected:  The image should be displayed""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS7: Save to File - Filesystem.getFile(filename) method is not working
Description: """"While testing camera, I encountered the issue, when image was not saved to file. I tested setting a backgroundImage to the window, and it works. To reproduce: 1. Install and run KS> Phone> Camera> Save to File 2. Take a picture and press Use Actual result: The image is not displayed Expected: The image should be displayed""""",title+description
