TIMOB-14455,12,"""iOS7: Audio Session Mode - delay playing streaming audio after stop""","""""""There is a delay to replay streaming audio after stop.  To reproduce:  1. Install and run KS> Phone> Sound >Audio Session Mode  2. Click Play streaming audio  3. Click Stop  4. Click Play streaming audio     Actual result:  No visual result that the label clicked, audio started playing with significant delay""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS7: Audio Session Mode - delay playing streaming audio after stop
