TIMOB-14401,12,"""iOS7: Slider-Basic - thumbs are located behind the slider highlight""","""""""While running Slider test I encountered the issue, where sliders' thumbs are located behind sliders. In case of Custom Slider the thumb is visible partially and can be moved to the right and left, in case of Basic Slider the thumb is not visible at all.    Test steps:  1. Install and run KS> Controls> Slider> Basic  2. Observe sliders' thumbs    Actual result:  The Custom Slider's thumb is partially visible  The Basic Slider's thumb is not visible    Expected:  Proper  display of sliders""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS7: Slider-Basic - thumbs are located behind the slider highlight
