TIMOB-14400,12,"""iOS7: Slider-Basic - crash navigating between views, using nav bar""","""""""Testing Slider I encountered the app crash after navigating to the previouse view, using nav bar.    Test steps:  1. Install and run KS> Base UI> Slider> Basic  2. Click Slider in the nav bar    Actual result:  Crash    Expected:  No crash""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS7: Slider-Basic - crash navigating between views, using nav bar
