TIMOB-14365,12,"""BlackBerry: We do not see any logs if the app crashes when launched on simulator""","""""""Description:  =============  1. Create an app for BB & make sure you have a mistake in the js code in the app.js.  or run the code below :      2. Build & run on BB simulator  3. The app will crash after launch because of the error in the js  4. Look for the logs    Actual Result:  ===============  1. We do not see any logs if the app crashes    Expected Result:  =================  We should see logs even if the app crashes    Note: Telnetting into the simulator for logs shows us the error log  =====""""""",Bug,"Title: BlackBerry: We do not see any logs if the app crashes when launched on simulator
Description: """"Description: ============= 1. Create an app for BB & make sure you have a mistake in the js code in the app.js. or run the code below : 2. Build & run on BB simulator 3. The app will crash after launch because of the error in the js 4. Look for the logs Actual Result: =============== 1. We do not see any logs if the app crashes Expected Result: ================= We should see logs even if the app crashes Note: Telnetting into the simulator for logs shows us the error log =====""""",title+description
