TIMOB-14293,12,"""iOS7: Image Views - label is not shown or its text is  cut off""","""""""It is a regression, does not occur in iOS6    Test steps:  1. Install and run KitchenSink>Base UI>Image Views>Basic  2. Click on the image    Actual result:  1. Lable """"""""Click me"""""""" is not displayed.  2. Text """"""""Try again. You shouldn't get alert and the image should be different"""""""" is cut off    Expected:  1. Lable """"""""Click me"""""""" should be displayed.  2. The whole text should be visible  """"""",Bug,"Title: iOS7: Image Views - label is not shown or its text is cut off
