TIMOB-14287,12,"""iOS 7: BarColor is now barTintColor and tintColor is now used for coloring Window Theme""","""""""BarColor is now barTintColor and tintColor is now used for coloring the Labels (icons right/leftNav button tints) everywhere on the Window, it's a new iOS7 design pattern where also the Tabs (if exists) also use the focused windows' tintColor.""""""",New Feature,"Title: iOS 7: BarColor is now barTintColor and tintColor is now used for coloring Window Theme
