TIMOB-14282,12,"""LiveView: Alloy: iOS device: if LiveView is enabled, code is no longer recompiled even building manually""","""""""h5. Problem description    Build/Run on iOS device enabling LiveView.  Looking at the logs, LiveView seems to be running correctly.  However, no modification made is being applied, also after manually building/running again the project, as if the Alloy code wasn't recompiled.    It seems to be intermittent and not always reproducible.  Currently using the attached sample code.    Attaching log""""""",Bug,"Title: LiveView: Alloy: iOS device: if LiveView is enabled, code is no longer recompiled even building manually
