TIMOB-14271,12,""" iOS7: Base UI - wrong table view frame""","""""""When open Base UI Table View does not display first row and scroll wont help to make that row visible, it bounces back, what makes it impossible to tap on it.  Tap on  a different row and return to Base UI again will solve this problem.  It is a *regression* compare to iOS 6.X    Test steps:  1. Install and run KitchenSink  2. Tap Base UI    Actual result:  """"""""Tab Groups"""""""" row is not visible     Expeced:  It should be visible  or accessible  """"""",Bug,"Title: iOS7: Base UI - wrong table view frame
