Description: """"We need to implement the apiName constants. Every proxy will need to expose this constant. The spec is listed in TIMOB-13968""""",title+description
TIMOB-14221,12,"""iOS: Calling TextArea.setSelection gives error, hard crash""","""""""Calling setSelection always throws this error - within context of supplied app.js. (and in my app)     void _WebThreadLockFromAnyThread(bool), 0xa8206d0: Obtaining the web lock from a thread other than the main thread or the web thread. UIKit should not be called from a secondary thread.    Please see the app.js as it now consistently reproduces this error.""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Calling TextArea.setSelection gives error, hard crash
Description: """"Calling setSelection always throws this error - within context of supplied app.js. (and in my app) void _WebThreadLockFromAnyThread(bool), 0xa8206d0: Obtaining the web lock from a thread other than the main thread or the web thread. UIKit should not be called from a secondary thread. Please see the app.js as it now consistently reproduces this error.""""",title+description
