TIMOB-14207,12,"""BlackBerry: Local WebView - Ti is undefined""","""""""*Problem*  In a local webview any titanium functionality such as    or more important than that    do not work.    I have also tried placing them in a timeout like mobile web but to no avail: Ti is always undefined.    *index.xml*  {code:xml}  <Window class=""""""""container"""""""" id=""""""""home"""""""" platform=""""""""android,blackberry"""""""">   <WebView id=""""""""mainWebView"""""""" url=""""""""/www/index.html""""""""  disableBounce=""""""""true""""""""/>  </Window>  {code}    *index.js*  {code:javascript}  if (Ti.Platform.name === 'blackberry'){      $.mainWebView.url = 'local:///assets/www/index.html';  }  {code}    *index.html*  {code:html}  <html>  <head>   <meta charset=""""""""utf-8"""""""">   <meta http-equiv=""""""""X-UA-Compatible"""""""" content=""""""""IE=edge,chrome=1"""""""">     <title>SomePage</title>   <meta name=""""""""viewport"""""""" content=""""""""width=device-width,initial-scale=1,minimum-scale=1.0,maximum-scale=1.0,user-scalable=no"""""""">         <link href=""""""""css/stylesheet.css"""""""" rel=""""""""stylesheet"""""""">               <!-- THE OFFENDING CODE SNIPPET -->   <script type=""""""""text/javascript"""""""">       window.onload = function(){        setTimeout(function(){         alert(typeof(Ti));         Ti.API.info('in timeout file');         Ti.API.fireEvent('someEvent');        },2000);        };       </script>   <script data-main=""""""""js/main"""""""" src=""""""""js/libs/require.js""""""""></script>  </head>  <body>  </body>  </html>  {code}""""""",Bug,"Title: BlackBerry: Local WebView - Ti is undefined
Description: """"*Problem* In a local webview any titanium functionality such as or more important than that do not work. I have also tried placing them in a timeout like mobile web but to no avail: Ti is always undefined. *index.xml* {code:xml} <Window class=""""""""container"""""""" id=""""""""home"""""""" platform=""""""""android,blackberry""""""""> <WebView id=""""""""mainWebView"""""""" url=""""""""/www/index.html"""""""" disableBounce=""""""""true""""""""/> </Window> {code} *index.js* {code:javascript} if (Ti.Platform.name === 'blackberry'){ $.mainWebView.url = 'local:///assets/www/index.html'; } {code} *index.html* {code:html} <html> <head> <meta charset=""""""""utf-8""""""""> <meta http-equiv=""""""""X-UA-Compatible"""""""" content=""""""""IE=edge,chrome=1""""""""> <title>SomePage</title> <meta name=""""""""viewport"""""""" content=""""""""width=device-width,initial-scale=1,minimum-scale=1.0,maximum-scale=1.0,user-scalable=no""""""""> <link href=""""""""css/stylesheet.css"""""""" rel=""""""""stylesheet""""""""> <!-- THE OFFENDING CODE SNIPPET --> <script type=""""""""text/javascript""""""""> window.onload = function(){ setTimeout(function(){ alert(typeof(Ti)); Ti.API.info('in timeout file'); Ti.API.fireEvent('someEvent'); },2000); }; </script> <script data-main=""""""""js/main"""""""" src=""""""""js/libs/require.js""""""""></script> </head> <body> </body> </html> {code}""""",title+description
