TIMOB-14189,12,"""Build: Files imported as links are not included in the build""","""""""h2. Problem description  Importing a file as link does not work when building the application. The files are not copied in the build.    h2. Steps to reproduce  1) Create a folder outside the project directory, with a file named 'main.js' that has the following content:        2) Create a new application with this code:        3) Create a directory in Resources, e.g. 'shared'  4) Right click on the folder, and choose 'Import...'  5) Choose General/Filesystem and select the folder created in #1  6) Select the file, and choose the options 'Create links in workspace', 'Create virtual folders' and 'Create link locations relative to PROJECT_LOC'  7) Build the app - the module won't be found    """"""",Bug,"Title: Build: Files imported as links are not included in the build
Description: """"h2. Problem description Importing a file as link does not work when building the application. The files are not copied in the build. h2. Steps to reproduce 1) Create a folder outside the project directory, with a file named 'main.js' that has the following content: 2) Create a new application with this code: 3) Create a directory in Resources, e.g. 'shared' 4) Right click on the folder, and choose 'Import...' 5) Choose General/Filesystem and select the folder created in #1 6) Select the file, and choose the options 'Create links in workspace', 'Create virtual folders' and 'Create link locations relative to PROJECT_LOC' 7) Build the app - the module won't be found """"",title+description
