 CFRunLoopRunInMode + 123  [ERROR] :  14  GraphicsServices                    0x036747e3 GSEventRunModal + 88  [ERROR] :  15  GraphicsServices                    0x03674668 GSEventRun + 104  [ERROR] :  16  UIKit                               0x011aaffc UIApplicationMain + 1211  [ERROR] :  17  ewd                                 0x00004358 main + 456  [ERROR] :  18  ewd                                 0x00002c65 start + 53  [ERROR] :  2013-06-10 09:49:24.010 ewd[42008:1c103] *** Terminating app due to uncaught exception 'NSInternalInconsistencyException', reason: 'request for rect of invalid section (-1)'  [ERROR] :  *** First throw call stack:  [ERROR] :  (0x38ed012 0x33aee7e 0x38ece78 0xe63665 0x13933e3 0x1257144 0xcd16e 0x1f6425 0xdcb5b3 0x38ac376 0x38abe06 0x3893a82 0x3892f44 0x3892e1b 0x36747e3 0x3674668 0x11aaffc 0x4358 0x2c65)  -- End simulator log ---------------------------------------------------------  [INFO] :   Application has exited from iOS Simulator  [INFO] :   Project built successfully in 31s 418ms  {quote}        *WORKAROUND*   {quote}  Just call for every textfield function blur();  {quote}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Delete section that include focused textfield causes app to crash
