TIMOB-14112,12,"""BlackBerry : We do not see analytic events like nav, setting, timed & user for BB""","""""""Description:  1. Create an app & replace the app.js with the app.js for analytics test in feature test repo  2. Follow the instructions for rightscale from this wiki page: https://wiki.<USER>org/display/tp/Analytics+Test+Plan  3. Build & run the app on BB device  4. Now generate nav, setting, timed, user events using the app  5. Check on right scale if you see them    Actual Result:  1. The nav, setting, timed, user events do not show up on right scale    NOTE : I can see the feature event as expected    Expected result:  1. We should see these events""""""",Bug,"Title: BlackBerry : We do not see analytic events like nav, setting, timed & user for BB
