TIMOB-14111,12,"""iOS: Problem with webviews with anchors not scrolling to correct location in local files""","""""""*Problem*  I have a local HTML file that I would like to open in a webview in a window. The file contains HTML anchors and I would like the view to position itself to that anchor when it opens.    *Note*  It works on Android. The file opens in the webview positioned at the myanchorpoint anchor.    *app.js*      *mypage.html*  {code:html}  <html>   <head>    <title>Test</title>   </head>   <body>    <a href=""""""""#myanchorpoint"""""""">Go to my anchor point</a>    <div style=""""""""height: 1600px;""""""""></div>    <a id=""""""""myanchorpoint"""""""">My Anchor Point</a>   </body>  </html>  {code}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Problem with webviews with anchors not scrolling to correct location in local files
Description: """"*Problem* I have a local HTML file that I would like to open in a webview in a window. The file contains HTML anchors and I would like the view to position itself to that anchor when it opens. *Note* It works on Android. The file opens in the webview positioned at the myanchorpoint anchor. *app.js* *mypage.html* {code:html} <html> <head> <title>Test</title> </head> <body> <a href=""""""""#myanchorpoint"""""""">Go to my anchor point</a> <div style=""""""""height: 1600px;""""""""></div> <a id=""""""""myanchorpoint"""""""">My Anchor Point</a> </body> </html> {code}""""",title+description
