TIMOB-14105,12,"""Android: toImage() does not work if applied to ImageView""","""""""h2. Problem description  The method toImage() does not work if applied to an ImageView. This is also true if the ImageView is child of another view.    h2. Steps to reproduce  Use the following code to reproduce the issue:        h2. Additional notes  The same code works with SDK 3.0.0.  If the ImageView is child of another view, and the toImage() is applied to the parent, the ImageView will not be visible as well.""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: toImage() does not work if applied to ImageView
