TIMOB-13967,12,"""BlackBerry : Layout crashes if we touch the views before it finishes laying out the whole layout""","""""""Description:  1. Create an app for BB with the code below:    2. Build & run it on a BB device.  3. Immediately after the app launches & you see the scrollview touch & try to scroll the scroll view. (make sure this happens before all the layout is complete)    Actual results:  1. The layout crashes & the scroll view does not scroll anymore  2. If you wait for the whole layout to complete & then touch the scroll view then everything works fine    Expected Results:  1. The layout should not crash""""""",Bug,"Title: BlackBerry : Layout crashes if we touch the views before it finishes laying out the whole layout
