TIMOB-13952,12,"""Android: analytics timedEvent does not fire""","""""""Android: analytics timedEvent does not fire.  This is not a regression. Issue occurs since 2.1.4.GA  Steps to reproduce: 1. Run the app.  2. Press the timedEvent button  3. Check logs 4. Quit application check logs  Expected: After Step 3: nothing is logged After Step4: """"""""event"""""""":""""""""timedEvent.testButton"""""""",""""""""data"""""""":{""""""""start"""""""":""""""""<start_time>"""""""",""""""""data"""""""":[],""""""""event"""""""":""""""""timedEvent.testButton"""""""",""""""""stop"""""""":""""""""<stop_time>"""""""",""""""""duration"""""""":""""""""<stop_time-start_time>""""""""},""""""""  Actual : no logs appear.  """"""",Bug,"Title: Android: analytics timedEvent does not fire
Description: """"Android: analytics timedEvent does not fire. This is not a regression. Issue occurs since 2.1.4.GA Steps to reproduce: 1. Run the app. 2. Press the timedEvent button 3. Check logs 4. Quit application check logs Expected: After Step 3: nothing is logged After Step4: """"""""event"""""""":""""""""timedEvent.testButton"""""""",""""""""data"""""""":{""""""""start"""""""":""""""""<start_time>"""""""",""""""""data"""""""":[],""""""""event"""""""":""""""""timedEvent.testButton"""""""",""""""""stop"""""""":""""""""<stop_time>"""""""",""""""""duration"""""""":""""""""<stop_time-start_time>""""""""},"""""""" Actual : no logs appear. """"",title+description
