Description: """"Slider becomes visible only, if its handle is moved. Steps to reproduce: 1. Run Kitchen Sink > Controls > Slider > Basic. 2. Move the handle. Actual result: 1. The only visible part of the slider is the handle(screenshot), we can barely see the slider. 2. The slider is partially visible (screenshot) Expected: Slider should be visible""""",title+description
