TIMOB-13902,12,"""BlackBerry : The webview methods like reload, goback, go forward etc do not work""","""""""Description:  1. Create an app with a webview which implements methods like reload, goback, go forward etc  2. Build & run the app for BB simulator or device  3. After the app launch do a reload, goback , go forward etc.    Actual results:  1. These methods do not work in BB , they work fine in android & IOS.    Expected Results:  1. These methods should work in parity with other platforms""""""",Bug,"Title: BlackBerry : The webview methods like reload, goback, go forward etc do not work
