TIMOB-13891,12,"""Android: Accessibility: Accessibility for slider control with hidden attribute to be true, device should not read anything out. ""","""""""Android: Accessibility: Accessibility for slider control with hidden attribute to be true, device should not read anything out.   This is not a regression. Issue occurs since 2.0.2.GA  Steps to reproduce:  1. Run the app Accessibility Acceptance Access_1107  2. Touch fourth progress bar (with accessibility hidden)    Expected:  On touching the progress bar the device does not read aloud anything.    Actual:  Device Reads out the progress bar attributes.""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Accessibility: Accessibility for slider control with hidden attribute to be true, device should not read anything out.
