TIMOB-13887,12,"""iOS: Accessibility - Tabs label are not showing on relaunching the application""","""""""This is not regression. This issue also exist on SDK 3.1.0    Steps:  1) Turned off accessibility services on the device.  2) Run the app on device.  3) Launch the app. Shows two tabs with labels """"""""View Properties"""""""" and """"""""Events"""""""".  4) Now close and kill the app on device.  5) Launch the app again.    Actual Result: Tabs are showing without labels (""""""""View Properties"""""""" and """"""""Events""""""""). See the attached screenshot and log file.    Expected Result: Tabs label (""""""""View Properties"""""""" and """"""""Events"""""""") should show on relaunching the application    """"""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Accessibility - Tabs label are not showing on relaunching the application
