TIMOB-13885,12,"""iOS: I can't send more than one cookie""","""""""*Problem*  Unfortunately with an iOS I can't use/send more than one cookie. With Android it is working without any problems.    *Test case*      *Log*  {code}[ERROR] invalid arguments for setting cookie. value should be in the format 'name=value'. in -[TiNetworkHTTPClientProxy setRequestHeader:] (TiNetworkHTTPClientProxy.m:465) [WARN] Exception in event callback. { line = xxx; message = """"""""invalid arguments for setting cookie. value should be in the format 'name=value'. in -[TiNetworkHTTPClientProxy setRequestHeader:] (TiNetworkHTTPClientProxy.m:465)""""""""; sourceId = 366760928; sourceURL = """"""""file://localhost/Users/xxx/Library/Application%20Support/iPhone%20Simulator/6.0/Applications/1EC7C0B6-34E5-4D96-9D79-0685610566E7/xxx.app/xxx.js""""""""; }{code}      *Workarounds*  http://developer.<USER>com/question/120728/set-cookies-using-setrequestheader--crashed-    {code:javascript}  if (Titanium.Platform.name == 'iPhone OS')    {      xhr.setRequestHeader(""""""""Cookie"""""""", """"""""cookie1=value1"""""""");      xhr.setRequestHeader(""""""""Cookie"""""""", """"""""cookie2=value2"""""""");  }  else  {      var cookieString = """"""""cookie1=value1; cookie2=value2;"""""""";      xhr.setRequestHeader('Cookie', cookieString);  }  {code}  """"""",Bug,"Title: iOS: I can't send more than one cookie
Description: """"*Problem* Unfortunately with an iOS I can't use/send more than one cookie. With Android it is working without any problems. *Test case* *Log* {code}[ERROR] invalid arguments for setting cookie. value should be in the format 'name=value'. in -[TiNetworkHTTPClientProxy setRequestHeader:] (TiNetworkHTTPClientProxy.m:465) [WARN] Exception in event callback. { line = xxx; message = """"""""invalid arguments for setting cookie. value should be in the format 'name=value'. in -[TiNetworkHTTPClientProxy setRequestHeader:] (TiNetworkHTTPClientProxy.m:465)""""""""; sourceId = 366760928; sourceURL = """"""""file://localhost/Users/xxx/Library/Application%20Support/iPhone%20Simulator/6.0/Applications/1EC7C0B6-34E5-4D96-9D79-0685610566E7/xxx.app/xxx.js""""""""; }{code} *Workarounds* http://developer.<USER>com/question/120728/set-cookies-using-setrequestheader--crashed- {code:javascript} if (Titanium.Platform.name == 'iPhone OS') { xhr.setRequestHeader(""""""""Cookie"""""""", """"""""cookie1=value1""""""""); xhr.setRequestHeader(""""""""Cookie"""""""", """"""""cookie2=value2""""""""); } else { var cookieString = """"""""cookie1=value1; cookie2=value2;""""""""; xhr.setRequestHeader('Cookie', cookieString); } {code} """"",title+description
