Description: """"h2. Problem description Opening a window with an animation that changes its opacity fails if the window is not heavyweight. h2. Steps to reproduce Use the following code: The window never shows up - its opacity stays at 0. If you add some property to make the window heavyweight (e.g. navBarHidden=true or fullscreen=true), the animation works fine.""""",title+description
