TIMOB-13743,12,"""Liveview: Liveview does not work with android emulator or android device""","""""""h5. Description:  While testing liveview, I attempted to run on Android emulator and on Android device. Both failed. My first emulator run failed with a red runtime error screen complaining of a timeout. This is similar to the attached image from device.    The second run and subsequent runs of the emulator launched and ran, but changes did not show in the emulator. The console reported the changed files however:      attempting to install on works, but when the app is auto-launched, it fails with the error shown in the attachment    h5. Steps to reproduce:  1) Navigate to the studio install location for liveview and run """"""""./liveview-server stop""""""""  2) Launch a project without crittercism for Android emulator liveview enabled  3) Change the app.js code    part two:  Launch liveview session on android device    h5. Result:  Emulator will not show any changes although the console shows the file listener is functioning    part two: error as shown in attachment    h5. Expected Result:  Code changes appear in the emulator  Device build runs and shows code changes""""""",Bug,"Title: Liveview: Liveview does not work with android emulator or android device
Description: """"h5. Description: While testing liveview, I attempted to run on Android emulator and on Android device. Both failed. My first emulator run failed with a red runtime error screen complaining of a timeout. This is similar to the attached image from device. The second run and subsequent runs of the emulator launched and ran, but changes did not show in the emulator. The console reported the changed files however: attempting to install on works, but when the app is auto-launched, it fails with the error shown in the attachment h5. Steps to reproduce: 1) Navigate to the studio install location for liveview and run """"""""./liveview-server stop"""""""" 2) Launch a project without crittercism for Android emulator liveview enabled 3) Change the app.js code part two: Launch liveview session on android device h5. Result: Emulator will not show any changes although the console shows the file listener is functioning part two: error as shown in attachment h5. Expected Result: Code changes appear in the emulator Device build runs and shows code changes""""",title+description
