TIMOB-13732,12,"""Liveview: Crittercism injected code in project causes liveview launch to fail with parse error and black screen""","""""""h5. Description:  When launching a """"""""<USER>services enabled"""""""" project in the simulator, the launch will fail with a black screen on device and a error in the console:      I was told this was caused by the crittercism injected code.    h5. Steps to reproduce:  1) Create a new project in <USER>studio with services enabled  2) Attempt to launch a liveview simulator session    h5. Result:  Failure with errors in the console and black screen on device    h5. Expected Result:  Successful launch""""""",Bug,"Title: Liveview: Crittercism injected code in project causes liveview launch to fail with parse error and black screen
