TIMOB-13704,12,"""Android: Add setTime() method to allow playback from arbitrary locations in a stream""","""""""In order for an audio stream to be played back from an arbitrary location within the stream, a setTime() method would be beneficial. Usage would be like this:    {code:title=index.js|borderStyle=solid}  function doClick(e) {        audioPlayer.url = """"""""http://domain/to/mp3_file.mp3"""""""";   audioPlayer.setTime(55000); // Playback from the 55th second   audioPlayer.start();  }  {code}  """"""",New Feature,"Title: Android: Add setTime() method to allow playback from arbitrary locations in a stream
