TIMOB-13630,12,"""Mobile Web: analytics.js continues to use iFrame for request despite setting ti-analytics-use-xhr to true""","""""""In index.html it is configured in following way:  var require = {   app: {    analytics: true,  ...   has: {  ...    """"""""ti-analytics-use-xhr"""""""": true,  but analytics.js continue use iframe for request.  and ignoring code in analytics.js  if (has(""""""""analytics-use-xhr"""""""")) {   var xhr = new XmlHttpRequest;    """"""",Bug,"Title: Mobile Web: analytics.js continues to use iFrame for request despite setting ti-analytics-use-xhr to true
