TIMOB-13629,12,"""Mobile Web: XmlHttpRequest typo in analytics.js""","""""""There is error in _/analytics.js that cause:    Uncaught ReferenceError: XmlHttpRequest is not defined     Reason is typo in code:  analytics.js  var xhr = new XmlHttpRequest;    js is case-sensitive and corrent class name is XMLHttpRequest  As result this functionality is completely non working""""""",Bug,"Title: Mobile Web: XmlHttpRequest typo in analytics.js
