TIMOB-13610,12,"""Android: Proposed fix for poor user experience when scrollableView is inside tableview/listview/scrollview""","""""""*Problem description*  If you put a scrollableview inside a tableview/listview/scrollview, it s almost unusable as described in the docs: http://docs.<USER>com/titanium/3.0/#!/api/Titanium.UI.TableView  {quote}  As a table view inherently scrolls, it creates a very poor user experience when one contains other scrolling views, such as a ScrollableView or TextArea. Thus, this layout is strongly discouraged.   {quote}    The following pull request fixes that:    *Pull request*  https://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/pull/4153    *Steps to reproduce*  1. Run the reproduction test case.  2. See that scrolling the scroll view horizontally causes it to sometimes repel swiping.    *Reproduction test case (any SDK)*      *Pull request test case*  """"""",Bug,"Title: Android: Proposed fix for poor user experience when scrollableView is inside tableview/listview/scrollview
Description: """"*Problem description* If you put a scrollableview inside a tableview/listview/scrollview, it s almost unusable as described in the docs: http://docs.<USER>com/titanium/3.0/#!/api/Titanium.UI.TableView {quote} As a table view inherently scrolls, it creates a very poor user experience when one contains other scrolling views, such as a ScrollableView or TextArea. Thus, this layout is strongly discouraged. {quote} The following pull request fixes that: *Pull request* https://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/pull/4153 *Steps to reproduce* 1. Run the reproduction test case. 2. See that scrolling the scroll view horizontally causes it to sometimes repel swiping. *Reproduction test case (any SDK)* *Pull request test case* """"",title+description
