TIMOB-13597,12,"""CLI : Tizen option exists in 'ti create module' command even though its not supported as of now i.e 4/16/13""","""""""Description:  1. In the cli execute 'ti create module'  2. Notice the options you get for the platforms    Actual Results:  1. We see 'Tizen' as a platform option even though modules for tizen are not supported as of now  2. NOTE : going ahead & creating the module for tizen gives us a default two tabbed app    Expected result:  1. There should be no tizen platform option in the 'ti create module' command & it is not supported as of today i.e 4/16/13""""""",Bug,"Title: CLI : Tizen option exists in 'ti create module' command even though its not supported as of now i.e 4/16/13
Description: """"Description: 1. In the cli execute 'ti create module' 2. Notice the options you get for the platforms Actual Results: 1. We see 'Tizen' as a platform option even though modules for tizen are not supported as of now 2. NOTE : going ahead & creating the module for tizen gives us a default two tabbed app Expected result: 1. There should be no tizen platform option in the 'ti create module' command & it is not supported as of today i.e 4/16/13""""",title+description
