TIMOB-13593,12,"""CLI: Allow ti sdk install to specify CI SDK versions""","""""""CLI: allow ti sdk install to specify CI SDK versions.    For example, if I run:    ti sdk install 3.1.0.v20130415184552    I would expect that version to install.    Currently, the result is:    [ERROR] Invalid version """"""""3.1.0.v20130415184552""""""""""""""",New Feature,"Title: CLI: Allow ti sdk install to specify CI SDK versions
