TIMOB-13564,12,"""BlackBerry : We get same index for 'OK' & 'Cancel' button on an alert dialog""","""""""Description:  1. Create an app for BB  2. Replace the code in the app.ja with the following code:    2. Build & run on BB device/simulator  3. The app launches  4. You will get an alert dialog qith a dialog 'click a button'  5. After taping on OK 0r Cancel button on the first alert dialog you will get another alert dialog with the index of the tapped button    Actual Result:  1.Notice that tapping on both OK or Cancel gives us the same index i.e '0'    Expected Result;  1. Both the OK & Cancel buttons should not have same index. """"""",Bug,"Title: BlackBerry : We get same index for 'OK' & 'Cancel' button on an alert dialog
