TIMOB-13546,12,"""Tizen : CLI build options for tizen has two '-K' flags""","""""""Description:  1. In the terminal do ' ti build -h'  2. Look at the build options for tizen    Actual results:  1. Notice that there are 2 options --key-password <value> & --keystore <path> with the same flag '-K'    Expected Results:  1. The two options should have different flags    """"""",Bug,"Title: Tizen : CLI build options for tizen has two '-K' flags
