TIMOB-13511,12,"""CLI: ti build - android - package with no options returns error and not  all missing options are being prompted""","""""""Steps to reproduce:  Please create the project and navigate to it's directory.  1) Try  CLI command (build android package with no options)  """"""""ti build -T dist-playstore""""""""  2) Enter target platform after it is prompted    Result:  [ERROR] Invalid required option """"""""--alias"""""""" in the output    Expected result:  It would be nice to have all missing options  prompted""""""",Bug,"Title: CLI: ti build - android - package with no options returns error and not all missing options are being prompted
