TIMOB-13510,12,"""Registering my App as a Routing App.""","""""""See Registering my App as a Routing App at     http://developer.apple.com/library/ios/#documentation/userexperience/conceptual/LocationAwarenessPG/ProvidingDirections/ProvidingDirections.html     I request that Titanium support MKDirectionsRequest handling soon.""""""",New Feature,"Title: Registering my App as a Routing App.
