TIMOB-13446,12,"""iOS: ListView - ScrollIndicator flickering when background is red""","""""""Test case:  1. Run KitchenSink>Base UI> Views> List View  2. Basic Functions> Background Colors&Scroll Indicator  3. Press Next botton  Actual result:  Background turns red and the latter """"""""e"""""""" flickers under ScrollIndicator=false  Expected result:  No flickering    Note: It is happening only when background turns red""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: ListView - ScrollIndicator flickering when background is red
