TIMOB-13439,12,"""iOS: UI.TableViewRow with UI.TextField which uses a keyboardTool not displaying correctly""","""""""Steps to reproduce:  1. Create following window and open it      2. Click on a textfield (so that virtual keyboard with toolbar shows up)  3. Click on the """"""""return"""""""" button of the keyboard to hide keyboard and toolbar  4. Scroll to the end of the tableview    As you can see at the end of the tableview is a transparent empty block of the height of the keyboard toolbar which looks very """"""""unclean""""""""""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: UI.TableViewRow with UI.TextField which uses a keyboardTool not displaying correctly
