Description: """"Scrollable view unusable Problems: 1. It scrolls very badly, not intuitive 2. Sometimes it flickers displaying scrollableview background 3. Does not always show next page, when I tap on an image it disapper Also ImageView does not honor it size, width, or height properties. They are equal to image size despite that I set them to 100x100 *Test case* """"",title+description
