TIMOB-13320,12,"""Android: Image in table row doesn't change or changes on a wrong row""","""""""*Problem description*  A table with 2 table view sections, each section contains some rows, in each row there's a label and image view. When the user clicks on the image, the image should change to another one, and when the user clicks on the row it should change back. This causes 2 problems on Android only:    1. If user keep click on selection 1 row image and then click on selection 2 same row image, the table will start to to act incorrectly (click on selection1 image row will change selection2 same row image).  2. Sometimes when user click on the row, the image doesn't change back.     *Steps to reproduce*  Just keep tapping on these two section rows or images, you will see the problem.    *Test case*  """"""",Bug,"Title: Android: Image in table row doesn't change or changes on a wrong row
Description: """"*Problem description* A table with 2 table view sections, each section contains some rows, in each row there's a label and image view. When the user clicks on the image, the image should change to another one, and when the user clicks on the row it should change back. This causes 2 problems on Android only: 1. If user keep click on selection 1 row image and then click on selection 2 same row image, the table will start to to act incorrectly (click on selection1 image row will change selection2 same row image). 2. Sometimes when user click on the row, the image doesn't change back. *Steps to reproduce* Just keep tapping on these two section rows or images, you will see the problem. *Test case* """"",title+description
