TIMOB-13308,12,"""Android: KrollProxy not told of eventListener added""","""""""i was working on the correction of that bug  http://jira.<USER>org/browse/TIMOB-10985  My implementation was correct but relied on krollProxy.eventListenerAdded  With my example i found it strange that that method wasnt called  Then i realised that at the time i was calling addEventlistener the KrollObject proxy was not yet set    If you uncomment the commented lines, then krollProxy.eventListenerAdded is called.  Sadly to see the problem you have to add Log in TiViewProxy.eventListenerAdded  and recompile titanium.    I hope this is gonna be fixed soon. We really need it.  Also it creates some other bugs. Like in my example, the labels are not clickable when they should (because TableViewProxy does that in eventListenerAdded)""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: KrollProxy not told of eventListener added
Description: """"i was working on the correction of that bug http://jira.<USER>org/browse/TIMOB-10985 My implementation was correct but relied on krollProxy.eventListenerAdded With my example i found it strange that that method wasnt called Then i realised that at the time i was calling addEventlistener the KrollObject proxy was not yet set If you uncomment the commented lines, then krollProxy.eventListenerAdded is called. Sadly to see the problem you have to add Log in TiViewProxy.eventListenerAdded and recompile titanium. I hope this is gonna be fixed soon. We really need it. Also it creates some other bugs. Like in my example, the labels are not clickable when they should (because TableViewProxy does that in eventListenerAdded)""""",title+description
