TIMOB-13297,12,"""Android: Light weight window close is VERY slow""","""""""h3. Problem  Closing a lightweight window in android is very slow, you can see how the children are being removed one by one creating a bad user experience.     h3. Code    h3. To reproduce:  1. Copy and paste the code into app.js  2. Click on the button that will open the light weight window  3. On lightweight window, click on the first button """"""""Close""""""""  4. You will see how all the other buttons (which do nothing) will dissapear one by one before the window is closed    h3. Workaround:  Hide the window before closing it.""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Light weight window close is VERY slow
Description: """"h3. Problem Closing a lightweight window in android is very slow, you can see how the children are being removed one by one creating a bad user experience. h3. Code h3. To reproduce: 1. Copy and paste the code into app.js 2. Click on the button that will open the light weight window 3. On lightweight window, click on the first button """"""""Close"""""""" 4. You will see how all the other buttons (which do nothing) will dissapear one by one before the window is closed h3. Workaround: Hide the window before closing it.""""",title+description
