TIMOB-13279,12,"""CodeProcessor: Some APIs have underscores prepended to their names that need to be hidden""","""""""Some APIs have names that aren't valid JSON names (for example 2DMatrix) so they get an underscore prepended to their names. These underscores need to be removed from output messages""""""",Bug,"Title: CodeProcessor: Some APIs have underscores prepended to their names that need to be hidden
