TIMOB-13260,12,"""Package """"Core"""" modules as part of Titanium SDK""","""""""Based on the page here:    https://wiki.<USER>org/display/mds/Module+Planning+Page    There is a suite of modules that we wish to ship with the SDK by default. This story encapsulates the idea of setting up the build, test and verification infrastructure to make such a change happen.    Currently, modules shipped with the SDK are packaged as .zip files and checked in. We need  amore flexible approach, likely one that packages a known good version of the module at build time.""""""",Story,"Title: Package """"Core"""" modules as part of Titanium SDK
Description: """"Based on the page here: https://wiki.<USER>org/display/mds/Module+Planning+Page There is a suite of modules that we wish to ship with the SDK by default. This story encapsulates the idea of setting up the build, test and verification infrastructure to make such a change happen. Currently, modules shipped with the SDK are packaged as .zip files and checked in. We need amore flexible approach, likely one that packages a known good version of the module at build time.""""",title+description
