TIMOB-13104,12,"""Android: Postlayout event not fired""","""""""*Problem*  postlayout event not firing on android but works as expected on iOS. Possible Parity.    *Steps to Reproduce*  1. Download image attached (chatbubble.jpeg)  2. Paste this code in app.js        3. Run on device (android)  4. Run on iOS simulator    h2. Android    *Expectation*   you get alert message with text """"""""test"""""""" on android    *Actual*   No alert message    h2. iOS  *Correct Behavior*  2 times alert message""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Postlayout event not fired
Description: """"*Problem* postlayout event not firing on android but works as expected on iOS. Possible Parity. *Steps to Reproduce* 1. Download image attached (chatbubble.jpeg) 2. Paste this code in app.js 3. Run on device (android) 4. Run on iOS simulator h2. Android *Expectation* you get alert message with text """"""""test"""""""" on android *Actual* No alert message h2. iOS *Correct Behavior* 2 times alert message""""",title+description
TIMOB-13103,12,"""CLI: Intermittent iOS Simulator failure ""","""""""While testing TIMOB-12722 I ran into issue where Application has exited from iOS simulator with the following error:  [INFO]  Finished building the application in 25s 824ms  [INFO]  Running application in iOS Simulator  [INFO]  Launching application in iOS Simulator  [INFO]  Focusing the iOS Simulator  [INFO]  Application has exited from iOS Simulator  [INFO]  Project built successfully in 29s 859ms    [ERROR] Failed to focus the iPhone Simulator window  [ERROR] /Users/<USER>Library/Application Support/Titanium/mobilesdk/osx/3.1.0.v20130316201654/iphone/iphone_sim_activate.scpt: execution error: iPhone Simulator got an error: Connection is invalid. (-609)    Test steps:  1. Create the default Alloy project project  2. Run command ti build --platform iphone in command line    Actual result:  The error  Expected result:  App should launch successfully in iOS simulator    Note: Running the same command second time works fine""""""",Bug,"Title: CLI: Intermittent iOS Simulator failure
Description: """"While testing TIMOB-12722 I ran into issue where Application has exited from iOS simulator with the following error: [INFO] Finished building the application in 25s 824ms [INFO] Running application in iOS Simulator [INFO] Launching application in iOS Simulator [INFO] Focusing the iOS Simulator [INFO] Application has exited from iOS Simulator [INFO] Project built successfully in 29s 859ms [ERROR] Failed to focus the iPhone Simulator window [ERROR] /Users/<USER>Library/Application Support/Titanium/mobilesdk/osx/3.1.0.v20130316201654/iphone/iphone_sim_activate.scpt: execution error: iPhone Simulator got an error: Connection is invalid. (-609) Test steps: 1. Create the default Alloy project project 2. Run command ti build --platform iphone in command line Actual result: The error Expected result: App should launch successfully in iOS simulator Note: Running the same command second time works fine""""",title+description
