TIMOB-13093,12,"""iOS: KitchenSink - ListView - Under Append Items, Animation style 'Bottom' and 'Fade' do not work.""","""""""Kitchensink -Listview -Under Append Items, Animation style 'Bottom' and 'Fade' do not work.    Steps to Reproduce:  1. Fetch kitchensink from https://github.com/vishalduggal/KitchenSink.git listview_tests.  2. Go to Kitchensink > Base UI > View >ListView> Append Items.  3. Click on 'Start test' button.  4. Observe the screen. The items in the listview change with the specified animation style.  5. Observe the Animation style - 'Animation Bottom' and 'Animation Fade'.    Actual:  It does not show the bottom up and faded animations.    Expected:  It should show the bottom up and faded animations properly.""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: KitchenSink - ListView - Under Append Items, Animation style 'Bottom' and 'Fade' do not work.
Description: """"Kitchensink -Listview -Under Append Items, Animation style 'Bottom' and 'Fade' do not work. Steps to Reproduce: 1. Fetch kitchensink from https://github.com/vishalduggal/KitchenSink.git listview_tests. 2. Go to Kitchensink > Base UI > View >ListView> Append Items. 3. Click on 'Start test' button. 4. Observe the screen. The items in the listview change with the specified animation style. 5. Observe the Animation style - 'Animation Bottom' and 'Animation Fade'. Actual: It does not show the bottom up and faded animations. Expected: It should show the bottom up and faded animations properly.""""",title+description
