TIMOB-13039,12,"""iOS: TableViewRow title text won't wrap""","""""""h2.Problem  A simple TableViewRow's title will not text wrap.  Instead, it gets elipsized.  In contrast, the same TableViewRow's title will wrap on Android, therefore, this is a parity issue.    h2.Testcase  {panel:title=app.js}    {panel}  """"""",Bug,"Title: iOS: TableViewRow title text won't wrap
Description: """"h2.Problem A simple TableViewRow's title will not text wrap. Instead, it gets elipsized. In contrast, the same TableViewRow's title will wrap on Android, therefore, this is a parity issue. h2.Testcase {panel:title=app.js} {panel} """"",title+description
