TIMOB-13020,12,"""Android: applyProperties should be atomic for UI actions""","""""""Given:      Tapping the button shows the view flickering from top left to bottom right as it should be, BUT sometimes it will show top right and bottom left as the properties in applyProperties are only half-applied before the draw phase. This means wasted draws and possible visual glitches.""""""",New Feature,"Title: Android: applyProperties should be atomic for UI actions
Description: """"Given: Tapping the button shows the view flickering from top left to bottom right as it should be, BUT sometimes it will show top right and bottom left as the properties in applyProperties are only half-applied before the draw phase. This means wasted draws and possible visual glitches.""""",title+description
