ks without problem. The problem ocur only in SDk 3.0.2 h2. Note: Regression In 3.0.0GA if platform is not specified, for example: then the module will load without issue. But the same code will break and result in script error if tried in 3.0.2GA. In 3.0.2GA, the platform must be specified: or a script error will occur. """"",title+description
TIMOB-12893,12,"""iOS: iPad switches to Default.png after the splash screen Default-Portrait.png is displayed before opening a window""","""""""h4. Problem    The issue occurs when running the iPhone app on an iPad. After displaying the splash screen on an ipad (Default-Portrait.png), the screen will flicker and display Default.png for a brief moment (between the period when the splash screen ends and the window is displayed) before opening the window.    Please see the screencast here: http://dl.dropbox.com/u/31008648/IMG_5304.MOV.    Note that in the video the second time that Default-Portrait.png displayed is actually a window with the backgroundImage set to Default-Portrait.png.     h4. Code to reproduce    Here is the code that is being run in the video:          """"""",Bug,"Title: iOS: iPad switches to Default.png after the splash screen Default-Portrait.png is displayed before opening a window
