TIMOB-12877,12,"""Create AST visitor/transformer for """"property-aggregation""""""","""""""var v = Ti.UI.createView();  v.width = Ti.UI.FILL;  v.height = Ti.UI.FILL;  v.backgroundColor = """"""""red"""""""";  w.add(v);    is transformed to    w.add(Ti.UI.createView({width:Ti.UI.FILL,height:Ti.UI.FILL,backgroundColor:""""""""red""""""""}));  """"""",Sub-task,"Title: Create AST visitor/transformer for """"property-aggregation""""
Description: """"var v = Ti.UI.createView(); v.width = Ti.UI.FILL; v.height = Ti.UI.FILL; v.backgroundColor = """"""""red""""""""; w.add(v); is transformed to w.add(Ti.UI.createView({width:Ti.UI.FILL,height:Ti.UI.FILL,backgroundColor:""""""""red""""""""})); """"",title+description
TIMOB-12876,12,"""Create AST visitor/transformer for """"pre-bind-methods-and-arguments""""""","""""""Titanium JavaScript functions with constant arguments will have their  arguments pre-bound on the native side of the bridge. For example,  Ti.API.log('foo') becomes T$2().    The JavaScript constants (e.g. strings, numbers and booleans) that are  passed to these native functions will be marshaled across the bridge  only once and will remain cached for subsequent lookups in a symbol  table. This will avoid repeated type conversions (e.g. JSStringRef <->  NSString, JSValueRef <-> NSNumber, etc.).""""""",Sub-task,"Title: Create AST visitor/transformer for """"pre-bind-methods-and-arguments""""
Description: """"Titanium JavaScript functions with constant arguments will have their arguments pre-bound on the native side of the bridge. For example, Ti.API.log('foo') becomes T$2(). The JavaScript constants (e.g. strings, numbers and booleans) that are passed to these native functions will be marshaled across the bridge only once and will remain cached for subsequent lookups in a symbol table. This will avoid repeated type conversions (e.g. JSStringRef <-> NSString, JSValueRef <-> NSNumber, etc.).""""",title+description
TIMOB-12875,12,"""Create AST visitor/transformer for """"namespace-folding""""""","""""""namespace-folding for native Titanium object (to eliminate  repeated key/value lookups across the bridge):    var message = 'hello'; Ti.API.log(foo) becomes T$1(foo) (as an example)  """"""",Sub-task,"Title: Create AST visitor/transformer for """"namespace-folding""""
Description: """"namespace-folding for native Titanium object (to eliminate repeated key/value lookups across the bridge): var message = 'hello'; Ti.API.log(foo) becomes T$1(foo) (as an example) """"",title+description
