TIMOB-12847,12,"""Android: Graphic assets loaded 4 times (only at emulators)""","""""""h6.Issue  While trying to run app on Android emulator ended up with Out Of memory Error(stack trace below).    h6.Android manifest  tiapp.xml android section:      h6.FastDev <USER>console  Every graphic resource logged, appears to be loaded even 4 times. Based on customer's project can be easily reproducible, at least on my local environment.      h6.Studio Console output      h6.Further info  After disabling fastDev it seems to work as expected. Adding such property:    - <property name=""""""""ti.android.fastdev"""""""" type=""""""""bool"""""""">false</property>""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Graphic assets loaded 4 times (only at emulators)
Description: """"h6.Issue While trying to run app on Android emulator ended up with Out Of memory Error(stack trace below). h6.Android manifest tiapp.xml android section: h6.FastDev <USER>console Every graphic resource logged, appears to be loaded even 4 times. Based on customer's project can be easily reproducible, at least on my local environment. h6.Studio Console output h6.Further info After disabling fastDev it seems to work as expected. Adding such property: - <property name=""""""""ti.android.fastdev"""""""" type=""""""""bool"""""""">false</property>""""",title+description
