TIMOB-12791,12,"""iOS:ipad: TableviewRow gets a double click when used inside a popover""","""""""h4. Problem Description  You will get the event click twice when using a label inside a tableviewrow inside the popoever. It only happens the second time you click the label.     h4. Code example      h4. Steps to reproduce  1. Create a new mobile project  2. Paste this code to app.js  3. Run this into the emulator  4. Go to the top of the screen, click list.  5. Click on the label.  6. Check the Ti Studio output/terminal  7. Click the label again   8. you will see  that the event is fired twice.     """"""",Bug,"Title: iOS:ipad: TableviewRow gets a double click when used inside a popover
