Description: """"Description: 1.In cli run command """"""""ti build -T 'target' -p android -d 'project-dir' -o 'output-dir' --skip-js-minify """""""" (all target types don't work) 2.Observe the output Actual result: 1.we get error as below: 2.Cleaning & building the project does not work either 3.Not putting the '--skip-js-minify' works fine Expected Result: 1.We should be able to build with '--skip-js-minify' """"",title+description
