TIMOB-12747,12,"""Android: setIcon in Ti.UI.Tab is failing to show the updated icon""","""""""h4. Problem Description  In iOS you can add an eventlistener that will update the icon every time you switch between different tabs in a tabgroup. When you run this same code in android, the icon never changes.     h4. Code Example      Add this code to a new project's app.js, run it on iOS. See the change. Now try in android, the icon never updates.    """"""",Bug,"Title: Android: setIcon in Ti.UI.Tab is failing to show the updated icon
