TIMOB-12746,12,"""CodeProcessor: Merge common-globals plugin into ti-api-processor""","""""""The common-globals plugin is rather hacky and doesn't track well with the Titanium API (which defines the common globals). We should merge it in and use the new value override mechanism for implementing support for the contents of common globals""""""",Story,"Title: CodeProcessor: Merge common-globals plugin into ti-api-processor
Description: """"The common-globals plugin is rather hacky and doesn't track well with the Titanium API (which defines the common globals). We should merge it in and use the new value override mechanism for implementing support for the contents of common globals""""",title+description
