TIMOB-12743,12,"""Animations reset when switching between heavyweight windows""","""""""When switching between heavyweight windows any animations that have occured are reset. The animation is not reset on later iOS versions but occurs on all android versions.    See attached app.js for an example, Click both coloured boxes, then switch between the 2 windows, one of the boxes will have reset, while the other which has had its size changed will stay.    Platform:  iOS 4.1  Android 2.3 - 4.2""""""",Bug,"Title: Animations reset when switching between heavyweight windows
Description: """"When switching between heavyweight windows any animations that have occured are reset. The animation is not reset on later iOS versions but occurs on all android versions. See attached app.js for an example, Click both coloured boxes, then switch between the 2 windows, one of the boxes will have reset, while the other which has had its size changed will stay. Platform: iOS 4.1 Android 2.3 - 4.2""""",title+description
