TIMOB-12674,12,"""iOS:Request to support iPad specific images (-ipad suffix) in the resources other than the splash screen""","""""""Its not a regression.It happens in 3.0.0.GA as well.    Steps to reproduce:  1. Use the code below in the app.js  file    2. Download the attached images zip file, unzip it and paste it under the 'Resources' folder of the project.  3. Run the app on retina ipad.    Expected result:  3. It should display the image with suffix '@2x~ipad.png'.    Actual result:  3. It displays the image with suffix '@2x.png'""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS:Request to support iPad specific images (-ipad suffix) in the resources other than the splash screen
