Description: """"** Perform much needed update for anvil server. ** Bringing all anvil test machines up to date """"",title+description
TIMOB-12589,12,"""Android: Blob has wrong Content-Type & file extension name when send via HTTPClient""","""""""  h6.Repro sequence  {code: JavaScript}  Ti.Media.openPhotoGallery({      success : function(event) {       var alertText = '';    var image = event.media;        alertText += image.mimeType + '\n';    alertText += image.imageAsThumbnail(200).mimeType + '\n';        var imageView = Ti.UI.createImageView({     image : image    });    alertText += imageView.toBlob().mimeType + '\n';    alert(alertText);        //exam request multipart 'image' property. It has a txt.filename (tixhr-xxxxxx.txt), why txt?;    var xhr = Ti.Network.createHTTPClient();    xhr.open(""""""""POST"""""""", 'http://www.google.com');    xhr.setRequestHeader(""""""""enctype"""""""", """"""""multipart/form-data;"""""""");    xhr.send({     image : imageView.toBlob()    });   },   mediaTypes : [Ti.Media.MEDIA_TYPE_PHOTO]  });    image/jpeg  image/jpeg  image/jpeg    image/jpeg  image/bitmap  image/bitmap  {code}    h6.Additional info  Attached request multipart screenshots""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Blob has wrong Content-Type & file extension name when send via HTTPClient
Description: """" h6.Repro sequence {code: JavaScript} Ti.Media.openPhotoGallery({ success : function(event) { var alertText = ''; var image = event.media; alertText += image.mimeType + '\n'; alertText += image.imageAsThumbnail(200).mimeType + '\n'; var imageView = Ti.UI.createImageView({ image : image }); alertText += imageView.toBlob().mimeType + '\n'; alert(alertText); //exam request multipart 'image' property. It has a txt.filename (tixhr-xxxxxx.txt), why txt?; var xhr = Ti.Network.createHTTPClient(); xhr.open(""""""""POST"""""""", 'http://www.google.com'); xhr.setRequestHeader(""""""""enctype"""""""", """"""""multipart/form-data;""""""""); xhr.send({ image : imageView.toBlob() }); }, mediaTypes : [Ti.Media.MEDIA_TYPE_PHOTO] }); image/jpeg image/jpeg image/jpeg image/jpeg image/bitmap image/bitmap {code} h6.Additional info Attached request multipart screenshots""""",title+description
TIMOB-12588,12,"""Android: Change image property of imageView doesn't work in tableviewRow""","""""""h6.Problem   When imageView in TableViewRow and Android, setImage doesn't work (just work 1st time).    h6.Tested on  iOS 6 simulator  Razr Droid OS 2.3.5    h6.To reproduce  run below example, click row multiple times.    h6.Snippet code      h6.Additional info    - When imageView in window, setImage work every time.        """"""",Bug,"Title: Android: Change image property of imageView doesn't work in tableviewRow
