TIMOB-12539,12,"""Android: Add calendarViewShown to picker ""","""""""h1.Feature Request  As of API Level 11 there is a picker property called calendarViewShown which will show a calendar as a part of the date picker view as shown in the attached screen shot.    h3.Original Community Request  when using the date picker i get a picker with three columns (day, month and year) but ALSO i am getting a calendar like box on the right containing the number of days. how can i remove the calendar box and keep the picker columns?? i am compiling against android 3.2 SDK        my code:        posted problem on the forum but didn't get any suggestions yet http://developer.<USER>com/question/147296/date-picker-with-box-calendar-like-days-on-the-right """"""",New Feature,"Title: Android: Add calendarViewShown to picker
