TIMOB-12538,12,"""BlackBerry : Event listeners are not working on BlackBerry ""","""""""Description:  1.Make a new project & select master/detail application template  2.Build & run the application on the BB simulator or device  3.You will see a table view with apples,grapes,oranges etc  4.Tap on any table row    Actual Result:  1.Tapping on table row does not open anything as the eventlistner is not working    Expected results:  1.The eventlistner should work & we should be able to get inside the table row after tapping on it """"""",Bug,"Title: BlackBerry : Event listeners are not working on BlackBerry
Description: """"Description: 1.Make a new project & select master/detail application template 2.Build & run the application on the BB simulator or device 3.You will see a table view with apples,grapes,oranges etc 4.Tap on any table row Actual Result: 1.Tapping on table row does not open anything as the eventlistner is not working Expected results: 1.The eventlistner should work & we should be able to get inside the table row after tapping on it """"",title+description
TIMOB-12537,12,"""BlackBerry: Define Ti.UI.SIZE and Ti.UI.FILL constants""","""""""The SIZE and FILL constants need to be defined on the UI module.  The layout engine expects the current values:      - SIZE -> """"""""UI.SIZE""""""""      - FILL -> """"""""UI.FILL""""""""    h3. Acceptance Test      1. The FILL and SIZE constant values should be printed to the log.     Verify they contain the correct value ('UI.SIZE', 'UI.FILL').  2. A blue view should be visible that fills the window horizontally     and sizes vertically to fit it's child view (red).  3. A red view should be visibile that fills vertically and is 200 dp horizontally.  """"""",New Feature,"Title: BlackBerry: Define Ti.UI.SIZE and Ti.UI.FILL constants
Description: """"The SIZE and FILL constants need to be defined on the UI module. The layout engine expects the current values: - SIZE -> """"""""UI.SIZE"""""""" - FILL -> """"""""UI.FILL"""""""" h3. Acceptance Test 1. The FILL and SIZE constant values should be printed to the log. Verify they contain the correct value ('UI.SIZE', 'UI.FILL'). 2. A blue view should be visible that fills the window horizontally and sizes vertically to fit it's child view (red). 3. A red view should be visibile that fills vertically and is 200 dp horizontally. """"",title+description
