TIMOB-12526,12,"""BlackBerry: Update documentation with latest supported features""","""""""Update the """"""""master"""""""" branch of titanium_mobile with features currently supported  in BlackBerry as of today plus include any other documentation developers will  need to know.    If there is any quirks developers need to know about, feel free to mention it, but  double check there's a bug ticket open to address it in the future with note to  update documentation to remove such a notice.    Note: There may be some changes in the Mac. fork we can re-use.""""""",Story,"Title: BlackBerry: Update documentation with latest supported features
Description: """"Update the """"""""master"""""""" branch of titanium_mobile with features currently supported in BlackBerry as of today plus include any other documentation developers will need to know. If there is any quirks developers need to know about, feel free to mention it, but double check there's a bug ticket open to address it in the future with note to update documentation to remove such a notice. Note: There may be some changes in the Mac. fork we can re-use.""""",title+description
TIMOB-12525,12,"""KitchenSink : Controls are not visible on navbar & toolbar in BlackBerry""","""""""Description:  1.Build & run KS for BB on simulator or device.  2.Goto controls tab.  3.Goto slider -> basic.  4.Might be you can try other tests with controls on navbar & toolbar.    Actual Results:  1.We do not see any controls on navbar & toolbar.    Expected Results:  1.We should see the expected controls on navbar & toolbar.    Controls that should appear on navbar & toolbar:  * Slider  * Progress Bar  """"""",Bug,"Title: KitchenSink : Controls are not visible on navbar & toolbar in BlackBerry
Description: """"Description: 1.Build & run KS for BB on simulator or device. 2.Goto controls tab. 3.Goto slider -> basic. 4.Might be you can try other tests with controls on navbar & toolbar. Actual Results: 1.We do not see any controls on navbar & toolbar. Expected Results: 1.We should see the expected controls on navbar & toolbar. Controls that should appear on navbar & toolbar: * Slider * Progress Bar """"",title+description
