TIMOB-12517,12,"""IOS: TabbedBar - In Kitchensink,  tabbar disappears with different animations in different devices.""","""""""Tabbar disappears with different animations in different devices.  This is not regression since the issue occurs on 3.0.0 GA as well.    Steps to reproduce:  1. Install Kitchensink on iPhone3GS(v5.0.1) and iPhone5(v 6.0)  2. Go to BaseUI > Window(standalone) > Open tab w/o animation.    Actual:   When click on open tab w/o animation on iPhone3GS, the tab bar disappears with bottom up animation whereas on iPhone5, tab bar disappears with slide animation.    Expected:  Same behavior should be observed on both devices.""""""",Bug,"Title: IOS: TabbedBar - In Kitchensink, tabbar disappears with different animations in different devices.
Description: """"Tabbar disappears with different animations in different devices. This is not regression since the issue occurs on 3.0.0 GA as well. Steps to reproduce: 1. Install Kitchensink on iPhone3GS(v5.0.1) and iPhone5(v 6.0) 2. Go to BaseUI > Window(standalone) > Open tab w/o animation. Actual: When click on open tab w/o animation on iPhone3GS, the tab bar disappears with bottom up animation whereas on iPhone5, tab bar disappears with slide animation. Expected: Same behavior should be observed on both devices.""""",title+description
