TIMOB-12513,12,"""BlackBerry: Look into enabling """"pre-compiling"""" of Cascade libraries.""","""""""BlackBerry 10 supports """"""""pre-compiling"""""""" libraries to help improve start-up speed.  We should investigate enabling this in our builds and identify an issues.    https://developer.blackberry.com/cascades/documentation/getting_started/tools/compiling.html  http://devblog.blackberry.com/2012/12/cascades-project-zygote/""""""",Story,"Title: BlackBerry: Look into enabling """"pre-compiling"""" of Cascade libraries.
Description: """"BlackBerry 10 supports """"""""pre-compiling"""""""" libraries to help improve start-up speed. We should investigate enabling this in our builds and identify an issues. https://developer.blackberry.com/cascades/documentation/getting_started/tools/compiling.html http://devblog.blackberry.com/2012/12/cascades-project-zygote/""""",title+description
