Description: """"h3. Problem User might encounter issues when having to specify a project folder Url with spaces, during the project creation h3. Steps to reproduce . Delete the default app.workspace (ti config -r app.workspace) . Run 'ti create' When the user is prompted to enter the project folder, the following error happens depending on the input (assuming the target folder is /Users/<USER>development/project test/ Also using those Urls it fails: Project is created in the right folder when manually typing (no \ and no quotes): """"",title+description
