TIMOB-12307,12,"""Android: Refactor MenuItemProxy""","""""""Starting from API 11, menuItem methods must be run from the main thread, otherwise a Java exception will occur. MenuItemProxy needs to be refactor to address this issue.    Testing code:       1. Run app.js  2. Click on menu/optionMenu button: you should see Item 2 in tab1 and Item 1 in tab2. You should also see """"""""is checked"""""""" and """"""""is enabled"""""""" in logcat.""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Refactor MenuItemProxy
