TIMOB-12166,12,"""CodeProcessor: Create scoring system stub""","""""""A tool should be created that uses the code processor to evaluate programs and give a """"""""score"""""""" detailing the quality of code. This tool will direct devs on how to improve their programs.    There should be scores given for various categories (how cross-platform it is, how many errors, etc), and then a composite, overall score should be calculated from these scores""""""",Sub-task,"Title: CodeProcessor: Create scoring system stub
Description: """"A tool should be created that uses the code processor to evaluate programs and give a """"""""score"""""""" detailing the quality of code. This tool will direct devs on how to improve their programs. There should be scores given for various categories (how cross-platform it is, how many errors, etc), and then a composite, overall score should be calculated from these scores""""",title+description
