Description: """"h3. Problem description Titanium.App.getVersion() returns the bundle version on device, not the version defined in TiAPP.xml Not reproducible using 2.1.4 GA h3. Steps to reproduce Set the version number in TiAPP.xml (for example 1.25) The Titanium.App.getVersion() works fine on simulator. (returns 1.25) But same code on device returns the bundle version (returns for example 1.25.565432543) """"",title+description
