Description: """"In the legacy handler for iOS builds only, it only supports action """"""""run"""""""" which launches the simulator. You cannot do device builds or package 2.X projects with 3.0.""""",title+description
TIMOB-12122,12,"""Prioritize events""","""""""We need the ability to prioritize events in the event queue.  I've ran in to numerous occasions where the event queue would block critical user actions because of other events running that were less important.  For instance, I'd like to always make sure the orientation event is priority over any other event in the queue.""""""",New Feature,"Title: Prioritize events
Description: """"We need the ability to prioritize events in the event queue. I've ran in to numerous occasions where the event queue would block critical user actions because of other events running that were less important. For instance, I'd like to always make sure the orientation event is priority over any other event in the queue.""""",title+description
TIMOB-12121,12,"""Android: Add overScrollMode property""","""""""Should be good to add the overScrollMode proptery to scrollView and tableView.    http://developer.android.com/reference/android/widget/ScrollView.html#setOverScrollMode(int)    At the moment there is no option to disable or edit the overScrollMode.""""""",New Feature,"Title: Android: Add overScrollMode property
Description: """"Should be good to add the overScrollMode proptery to scrollView and tableView. http://developer.android.com/reference/android/widget/ScrollView.html#setOverScrollMode(int) At the moment there is no option to disable or edit the overScrollMode.""""",title+description
