TIMOB-12118,12,"""Implement unique BB10 features (see description)""","""""""UI components:     divider & header, toast, drop-down lists, built in styles (colors, icons)    Active frames (application covers, aka """"""""live tiles"""""""")    Action bars, title bars with buttons/controls   App/Navigation patterns:     action menus, context menus, application menus; sheets (are these just Windows?)    Bezel gestures   Cards (similar to Android activities?)    Sharing/invocation (similar to Android intents?)   Which if any of the platform services listed at https://developer.blackberry.com/devzone/develop/platform_services/index.html    Enterprise features, such as Push, Secure Transport, and Ent. app deployment, BB Messenger""""""",Story,"Title: Implement unique BB10 features (see description)
