TIMOB-12104,12,"""Android: view with borderRadius inside a ScrollableView crashes the App""","""""""h3. Problem description  When including a view that contains the property """"""""borderRadius"""""""" in a ScrollableView, the app crashes.    h3. Steps to reproduce  Create a scrollableView with a view containing the borderRadius property.  App crashes when opening and scrolling through views.          Using TiSDK 2.1.4 GA the crash is immediate when launching the app.  Using TiSDK latest 3.1 CI, the app starts but it crashes with the same exception message after scrolling through views a few times.  """"""",Bug,"Title: Android: view with borderRadius inside a ScrollableView crashes the App
Description: """"h3. Problem description When including a view that contains the property """"""""borderRadius"""""""" in a ScrollableView, the app crashes. h3. Steps to reproduce Create a scrollableView with a view containing the borderRadius property. App crashes when opening and scrolling through views. Using TiSDK 2.1.4 GA the crash is immediate when launching the app. Using TiSDK latest 3.1 CI, the app starts but it crashes with the same exception message after scrolling through views a few times. """"",title+description
TIMOB-12103,12,"""iOS: Simulator 6.0: Sessiocould not be started crash on launch on some machines""","""""""Simulator crashes on launch for newly created project.    Resetting simulator fixes problem. iOS Simulator > Reset Content and Settings...    Does not occur in SDK 2.1.4.GA, or iOS Simulator 5.1.    Error:        Steps to Reproduce:    1. Create New Titanium Project.  2. Run in iPhone Simulator 6.0.    Actual Result:    Crash.    Expected Result:    Run.""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Simulator 6.0: Sessiocould not be started crash on launch on some machines
Description: """"Simulator crashes on launch for newly created project. Resetting simulator fixes problem. iOS Simulator > Reset Content and Settings... Does not occur in SDK 2.1.4.GA, or iOS Simulator 5.1. Error: Steps to Reproduce: 1. Create New Titanium Project. 2. Run in iPhone Simulator 6.0. Actual Result: Crash. Expected Result: Run.""""",title+description
TIMOB-12102,12,"""iOS: UI.iPhone.NavigationGroup animation broken when using barImage""","""""""h3. Problem description  When using a custom barImage, the navigation bar contents of the new window do not animate in.    h3. Steps to reproduce  Create a NavGroup with two windows and set the 'barImage' for at least the first displayed window.  Result: when opening Window 2, the top title bar is not actually animating in. Instead it just appears with no animation.          Videos showing the two different behaviors:  Without barImage: http://cl.ly/2e002Y2C040M  Using barImage: http://cl.ly/012p2x320R1K  """"""",Bug,"Title: iOS: UI.iPhone.NavigationGroup animation broken when using barImage
Description: """"h3. Problem description When using a custom barImage, the navigation bar contents of the new window do not animate in. h3. Steps to reproduce Create a NavGroup with two windows and set the 'barImage' for at least the first displayed window. Result: when opening Window 2, the top title bar is not actually animating in. Instead it just appears with no animation. Videos showing the two different behaviors: Without barImage: http://cl.ly/2e002Y2C040M Using barImage: http://cl.ly/012p2x320R1K """"",title+description
