TIMOB-12024,12,"""iOS: \n (""""backslash en"""") is ignored in strings.xml""","""""""*Problem description*  In strings.xml if there is a value with \n (""""""""backslash"""""""") is ignored. In 2.1.4. it works fine.    *strings.xml*      *app.js*  """"""",Bug,"Title: iOS: \n (""""backslash en"""") is ignored in strings.xml
