TIMOB-12002,12,"""CLI: Remove iphone and ipad platform options""","""""""Since """"""""iphone"""""""", """"""""ipad"""""""", and """"""""ios"""""""" all do the same thing, it's best to remove """"""""iphone"""""""" and """"""""ipad"""""""" to remove confusion. Use the device targets in the tiapp.xml or --device-family option to specify """"""""iphone"""""""", """"""""ipad"""""""", or """"""""universal"""""""".""""""",Bug,"Title: CLI: Remove iphone and ipad platform options
