Description: """"Allen found this. Here's a short test program he provided: var detailWindow = Titanium.UI.createWindow({ backgroundColor : '#fff' }); var imageView = Ti.UI.createImageView({ image : """"""""https://s3.amazonaws.com/static.tumblr.com/6t3upxl/Aawm08w0l/khout-kitten-458882.jpeg"""""""", top : '10dp' }); detailWindow.add(imageView); detailWindow.open(); Expected result: Image of kitten is displayed. Actual result: Screen is blank, then on device rotation image is displayed. """"",title+description
