TIMOB-11942,12,"""Module: Creating a module with numeric name or name starts with number throws """"could not move: ..."""" error""","""""""Steps To Reproduce:  1. Create a Titanium Module Project with name """"""""1"""""""" or """"""""123abc"""""""" (numeric followed by string)  2. select any deployment targets: ios, android or Mobile web  3. click next>finish    Actual: Error occurs.  """"""""Internal error: Could not move: /tmp/module_temp8620768414586470843.tmp/112.  Could not move: /tmp/module_temp8620768414586470843.tmp/112.  java.lang.reflect.InvocationTargetException""""""""     Expected:  No error must appear. Module must get created successfully like other alloy, html based and node.ACS projects.""""""",Bug,"Title: Module: Creating a module with numeric name or name starts with number throws """"could not move: ..."""" error
Description: """"Steps To Reproduce: 1. Create a Titanium Module Project with name """"""""1"""""""" or """"""""123abc"""""""" (numeric followed by string) 2. select any deployment targets: ios, android or Mobile web 3. click next>finish Actual: Error occurs. """"""""Internal error: Could not move: /tmp/module_temp8620768414586470843.tmp/112. Could not move: /tmp/module_temp8620768414586470843.tmp/112. java.lang.reflect.InvocationTargetException"""""""" Expected: No error must appear. Module must get created successfully like other alloy, html based and node.ACS projects.""""",title+description
TIMOB-11941,12,"""iOS: When showing a view, we should first relayout""","""""""*Problem description*  If you run the testcase, when pushing the button, the red view will appear and you will see it of width 50 before going quickly to 200. Actually you expect it to be directly 200 when you show it as you set the property before calling """"""""show."""""""" So the view should force itself to relayout before becoming visible. It comes from the method willShow of TiViewProxy.    *Pull request*  See comment.    *Test case*  """"""",Bug,"Title: iOS: When showing a view, we should first relayout
Description: """"*Problem description* If you run the testcase, when pushing the button, the red view will appear and you will see it of width 50 before going quickly to 200. Actually you expect it to be directly 200 when you show it as you set the property before calling """"""""show."""""""" So the view should force itself to relayout before becoming visible. It comes from the method willShow of TiViewProxy. *Pull request* See comment. *Test case* """"",title+description
