TIMOB-11918,12,"""Android: TableView - Textfields covered by keyboard when invoked second time.""","""""""Textfields covered by keyboard when invoked second time.   This is not regression since the issue occurs as far as 2.1.2 as well.    Steps to reproduce:  1. Create an app using the code below.  2. launch the app and tap on password field to bring up the soft keyboard.  3. click done or hardware back button to bring down the keyboard.  4. Again tap on the password field.    Expected:  The keyboard should pop up but textfields(Username and Password) should not be covered by the keyboard.    Actual:  The keyboard covers both text fields when invoked second time clicking on password field.    """"""",Bug,"Title: Android: TableView - Textfields covered by keyboard when invoked second time.
Description: """"Textfields covered by keyboard when invoked second time. This is not regression since the issue occurs as far as 2.1.2 as well. Steps to reproduce: 1. Create an app using the code below. 2. launch the app and tap on password field to bring up the soft keyboard. 3. click done or hardware back button to bring down the keyboard. 4. Again tap on the password field. Expected: The keyboard should pop up but textfields(Username and Password) should not be covered by the keyboard. Actual: The keyboard covers both text fields when invoked second time clicking on password field. """"",title+description
