TIMOB-11838,12,"""iOS: Device Debugger: show network in UI to help user with troubleshooting""","""""""During iOS device debugging, if the app launches and the session fails to connect to Studio, there is no immediate error message, only """"""""Waiting for debugger to connect..."""""""" with a possible time-out. A suggested improvement, in conjunction with TIMOB-11838, is to display the network name in the waiting menu. Then the user will know which network they are on.    This issue is the alternative to fixing TIMOB-11230.    Max's Comment from TIMOB-11230:    @Dustin, if you want WiFi networks displayed in iOS and TiStudio UIs, please create corresponding Feature requests.    Steps to Reproduce:    1. Debug on iOS Device.  2. Install app to device.  3. Cancel debug <USER>from Studio.  4. Launch app from device (knowing it should fail).    Actual Result:    """"""""Waiting for debugger to connect..."""""""" and possible time-out.    Expected Result:    """"""""Waiting for debugger to connect on network <USER> Inc...""""""""""""""",New Feature,"Title: iOS: Device Debugger: show network in UI to help user with troubleshooting
Description: """"During iOS device debugging, if the app launches and the session fails to connect to Studio, there is no immediate error message, only """"""""Waiting for debugger to connect..."""""""" with a possible time-out. A suggested improvement, in conjunction with TIMOB-11838, is to display the network name in the waiting menu. Then the user will know which network they are on. This issue is the alternative to fixing TIMOB-11230. Max's Comment from TIMOB-11230: @Dustin, if you want WiFi networks displayed in iOS and TiStudio UIs, please create corresponding Feature requests. Steps to Reproduce: 1. Debug on iOS Device. 2. Install app to device. 3. Cancel debug <USER>from Studio. 4. Launch app from device (knowing it should fail). Actual Result: """"""""Waiting for debugger to connect..."""""""" and possible time-out. Expected Result: """"""""Waiting for debugger to connect on network <USER> Inc...""""""""""""",title+description
TIMOB-11836,12,"""BlackBerry: Internal error while creating a BlackBerry project in Studio on win 8 & win 7.""","""""""Description:  1.Add the path for blackberry titanium sdk to studio.  2.Go to create new titanium project.  3.Select default app template.  4.Click next.  5.Fill in the project name etc.  6.Click finish.  7.You will see that you get the error : internal error : URI not absolute.  8.You will also see that though you get this error the project gets created in studio.    Expected Result:  1.We should not get any errors while creating a BB project.    Note: attached is the screenshot for the error.    Actual Result:  1.Getting a error while creating a BB project in studio.  """"""",Bug,"Title: BlackBerry: Internal error while creating a BlackBerry project in Studio on win 8 & win 7.
Description: """"Description: 1.Add the path for blackberry titanium sdk to studio. 2.Go to create new titanium project. 3.Select default app template. 4.Click next. 5.Fill in the project name etc. 6.Click finish. 7.You will see that you get the error : internal error : URI not absolute. 8.You will also see that though you get this error the project gets created in studio. Expected Result: 1.We should not get any errors while creating a BB project. Note: attached is the screenshot for the error. Actual Result: 1.Getting a error while creating a BB project in studio. """"",title+description
TIMOB-11835,12,"""Blackberry : Titanium studio does not detect blackberry titanum sdk when we add path in studio for win 8""","""""""Description:  1.Download the latest Blackberry titanium sdk.  2.Set the titanium sdk path to the blackberry titanium sdk downloaded.  3.You will see that the studio dos not detect the blackberry titanium sdk.    Expected Results:  1. Studio should detect the titanium blackberry sdk.    Actual results:  1.Studio does not detect the titanium blackberry sdk.""""""",Bug,"Title: Blackberry : Titanium studio does not detect blackberry titanum sdk when we add path in studio for win 8
