TIMOB-11794,12,"""MobileWeb: New Feature: Add RTL as a property in Labels to display Arabic text properly""","""""""h3. Feature Description  In order to correctly display Arabic text we need to implement the property RTL, which will align the the text to the right.     h4. More info  In CSS this is done using direction:rtl     h4. Extra comment   If you are passing a string in arabic, it should already have the proper orientation (as any i18n string).       """"""",New Feature,"Title: MobileWeb: New Feature: Add RTL as a property in Labels to display Arabic text properly
