TIMOB-11789,12,"""Android: Ti.Facebook.authorize() causes app crash when a textfield added to the same parent view is accessed.""","""""""When a textField and a button with Ti.Facebook.authorize() event are added to a window or view, the Ti.Facebook.authorize() causes an app crash if the textfield is typed in. It works fine on iOS.  h4.Steps to Reproduce:  1. Load the below app.js  2. Click on the 'open FB' button(it opens fine)  3. Now tap on the textField and then type some letters.  4. Click on 'open FB' button. The app crashes.    h4.app.js  """"""",Bug,"Title: Android: Ti.Facebook.authorize() causes app crash when a textfield added to the same parent view is accessed.
Description: """"When a textField and a button with Ti.Facebook.authorize() event are added to a window or view, the Ti.Facebook.authorize() causes an app crash if the textfield is typed in. It works fine on iOS. h4.Steps to Reproduce: 1. Load the below app.js 2. Click on the 'open FB' button(it opens fine) 3. Now tap on the textField and then type some letters. 4. Click on 'open FB' button. The app crashes. h4.app.js """"",title+description
