TIMOB-11779,12,"""iOS: iPad - """"DONE"""" button not working in Fullscreen video""","""""""h6.Issue  App is not able to get fullscreen video to close properly on an iPad device/simulator.     Also, _complete_ event listener gets fired twice        h6.Expected results  Get window closed when """"""""DONE"""""""" button get clicked    h6.Tested on  iOS 5.1.5 iPad Simulator  On iOS 6 is not reproducible    h6.Steps to reproduce  1. Grab and paste app.js below  2. Run in iPad simulator  3. Hold till video get played  4. Click """"""""DONE"""""""" button, notice how the Fullscreen video can't be get closed  5. Repeat steps 1 to 4 on iOS 6 - the DONE button might work in such Ti SDK    h6.Repro sequence      h6.Workaround  Remove """"""""mediaControlStyle"""""""" property of Ti.Media.VideoPlayer object.""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: iPad - """"DONE"""" button not working in Fullscreen video
Description: """"h6.Issue App is not able to get fullscreen video to close properly on an iPad device/simulator. Also, _complete_ event listener gets fired twice h6.Expected results Get window closed when """"""""DONE"""""""" button get clicked h6.Tested on iOS 5.1.5 iPad Simulator On iOS 6 is not reproducible h6.Steps to reproduce 1. Grab and paste app.js below 2. Run in iPad simulator 3. Hold till video get played 4. Click """"""""DONE"""""""" button, notice how the Fullscreen video can't be get closed 5. Repeat steps 1 to 4 on iOS 6 - the DONE button might work in such Ti SDK h6.Repro sequence h6.Workaround Remove """"""""mediaControlStyle"""""""" property of Ti.Media.VideoPlayer object.""""",title+description
