TIMOB-11718,12,"""CodeProcessor: Create end-user debugging tools""","""""""We should create a mechanism for debugging apps being run in the code processor in a similar vein to how V8 has a debugger. It would (probably) be a client-server architecture like V8 and would allow some sort of GUI debugger (in studio?) to connect. This would allow end user's to debug their code in a general manner without having to deploy to a specific device (or even platform). It could also allow us to do things like interactive code analysis, execution analysis, and other really cool things.""""""",New Feature,"Title: CodeProcessor: Create end-user debugging tools
Description: """"We should create a mechanism for debugging apps being run in the code processor in a similar vein to how V8 has a debugger. It would (probably) be a client-server architecture like V8 and would allow some sort of GUI debugger (in studio?) to connect. This would allow end user's to debug their code in a general manner without having to deploy to a specific device (or even platform). It could also allow us to do things like interactive code analysis, execution analysis, and other really cool things.""""",title+description
TIMOB-11717,12,"""CodeProcessor: Create some documentation""","""""""We should create some documentation describing what the code processor is, how it works, and how to use it.""""""",Sub-task,"Title: CodeProcessor: Create some documentation
Description: """"We should create some documentation describing what the code processor is, how it works, and how to use it.""""",title+description
TIMOB-11716,12,"""CodeProcessor: Implement error recovery mechanism""","""""""We should implement an error recovery mechanism so that (valid) exceptions don't stop the code processor in it's tracks.""""""",Sub-task,"Title: CodeProcessor: Implement error recovery mechanism
Description: """"We should implement an error recovery mechanism so that (valid) exceptions don't stop the code processor in it's tracks.""""",title+description
TIMOB-11715,12,"""iOS: Animation -  Animations are missing while adding and removing view.""","""""""Animations are missing while adding and removing view.  This is regression since the issue does not occur in 2.1.4 and 2.1.3 GA.    Steps to reproduce:  1. Create an app using the code below.  2. Launch the app and Click on yellow button.  3. Click on green button.    Expected result  2. A blue view should appear with drop down animation with no delay.  3. Blue view should disappear with bottom up animation.     Actual:  There is no drop down or bottom up animation while appearing and disappearing the view.    """"""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Animation - Animations are missing while adding and removing view.
Description: """"Animations are missing while adding and removing view. This is regression since the issue does not occur in 2.1.4 and 2.1.3 GA. Steps to reproduce: 1. Create an app using the code below. 2. Launch the app and Click on yellow button. 3. Click on green button. Expected result 2. A blue view should appear with drop down animation with no delay. 3. Blue view should disappear with bottom up animation. Actual: There is no drop down or bottom up animation while appearing and disappearing the view. """"",title+description
