Description: """"When the date is a random string rather than a function(Date()) then String.formatTime causes app crash. It just gives a null output on iOS and does not crash. h4.Steps to reproduce: 1. Load the below app.js 2. Test it on both iOS and Android. Expected Result: On Android, the output should be null or should throw an exception. Actual Result: The App crashes on Android. """"",title+description
