TIMOB-11642,12,"""Android: Enable click event listeners for app icon/app logo in action bar""","""""""We need to be able to add click event listeners to the app icon button inside the action bar.  According the action docs, we would need to handle it in the onOptionsItemSelected() method.    http://developer.android.com/guide/topics/ui/actionbar.html#ActionItems""""""",Sub-task,"Title: Android: Enable click event listeners for app icon/app logo in action bar
