TIMOB-11574,12,"""MobileWeb: activityindicator blocks alert event.""","""""""When activity indicator is added to a window along with an other view, It does not fire the view's event even though the Activity Indicator is hidden. It works perfectly fine on iOS and Android.    h4.Steps to reproduce:  1. Load the below app.js  2. Run it on MobileWeb Browser.    Expected Result: The alert message should pop up    Actual result: There is no alert message being displayed because the event is not getting fired.    h4.app.js      """"""",Bug,"Title: MobileWeb: activityindicator blocks alert event.
