Description: """"SplitWindow """"""""visible"""""""" event is lost and you cannot remove the leftNavButton after changing the orientation to landscape. h4. Repo Steps 1. Run the below code in your app.js 2. Click """"""""Launch SplitView"""""""" button. 3. It opens the splitWindow, click """"""""Launch SplitView"""""""". 4. Now change the orientation of the simulator or device to landscape. 5. Click the """"""""back"""""""" button. 6. You'll see """"""""Master"""""""" leftNavButton. """"",title+description
TIMOB-11537,12,"""iOS: API.timestamp results in runtime error TiUtils exceptionMessage unrecognized selector sent to class 0x4f4848""","""""""Ti.API.timestamp, an ios-specific console logging function that includes the time, no longer works.    This is a regression. This does not occur in SDK 2.1.3.GA.    Steps to Reproduce:    1. Run iOS Titanium app with code:        Actual Result:    Runtime error.    Expected Result:    Console logging message with the time included.""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: API.timestamp results in runtime error TiUtils exceptionMessage unrecognized selector sent to class 0x4f4848
