TIMOB-11465,12,"""Android: Accessibility: Slider: Accessibility does not work for Slider on Android HoneyComb""","""""""Accessibility does not work for Slider on android HoneyComb.    Steps To reproduce:    1. Install and launch the app on device with talk Back enabled.  2. Click on second slider.    Expected Result:  The device reads aloud LVH(This is slider2 label , This is slider2 value , This is slider2 hint) followed by 'seek control'.    Actual Result:  The device does not read aloud anything    app.js      """"""",Bug,"Title: Android: Accessibility: Slider: Accessibility does not work for Slider on Android HoneyComb
