TIMOB-11464,12,"""Android: Accessibility: TableViewSection: Accessibility does not work on TableViewSection""","""""""Accessibility does not work on TableViewSection    Steps To Reproduce:    1. Install and launch the application with Talk back enabled.  2. Touch the Header2 or Footer2    Expected result:  The Label Value and Hint should be spoken by the device    Actual result:  The default text is spoken but not the Label, Value and Hint defined.    app.js      """"""",Bug,"Title: Android: Accessibility: TableViewSection: Accessibility does not work on TableViewSection
