TIMOB-11455,12,"""iOS: Accessibility: TableViewRow: Accessibility Value and Hint not spoken for TableViewRow, also Accessibility Hidden does not work""","""""""Only Accessibility Label spoken for TableViewRow. The Accessibility Value and Hint are not voiced over. Also Accessibility Hidden does not work on TableViewRow    Steps To Reproduce:  1. Open the application below with voice over ON  2. Touch the second row, Row2  3. Touch the fifth row, Row5    Actual Result:  After Step 2: Only Accessibility label (""""""""Second Option"""""""") is voiced over. The Accessibility Value and Hint are not voiced Over  After Step 3: The AccessibilityHidden does not work as the Accessibility label (""""""""Fifth Row"""""""") is voiced over.    """"""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Accessibility: TableViewRow: Accessibility Value and Hint not spoken for TableViewRow, also Accessibility Hidden does not work
