TIMOB-11410,12,"""Android: Runtime error is thrown for evalJS""","""""""This is a regression .It works fine with 2.1.3 GA.    Steps to reproduce:  1. Use the code below in app.js      2. Add below modules to the tiapp.xml of the project       <modules>          <module version=""""""""0.1"""""""">ti.harness</module>          <module platform=""""""""android"""""""" version=""""""""2.0"""""""">ti.omniture</module>          <module>com.arcaner.testModule2</module>      </modules>    3. Download the attached modules zip file, unzip it and add it to the project at root level.  4. Run the project.    Expected result:  No runtime error should be shown.   The console should show the following:   D/TiAPI ( 738): Hello World   D/Testmodule2Module( 738): (KrollRuntimeThread) [2199,5043] Result = 101   D/TiAPI ( 738): Hello from TiContext   D/Testmodule2Module( 738): (KrollRuntimeThread) [8,5152] TiContext Result = 101.1   D/TiAPI ( 738): Hello world from a file   D/Testmodule2Module( 738): (KrollRuntimeThread) [11,5163] TiContext File Result = 102    Actual reult:  Runtime error is thrown. Error log attached with bug.""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Runtime error is thrown for evalJS
Description: """"This is a regression .It works fine with 2.1.3 GA. Steps to reproduce: 1. Use the code below in app.js 2. Add below modules to the tiapp.xml of the project <modules> <module version=""""""""0.1"""""""">ti.harness</module> <module platform=""""""""android"""""""" version=""""""""2.0"""""""">ti.omniture</module> <module>com.arcaner.testModule2</module> </modules> 3. Download the attached modules zip file, unzip it and add it to the project at root level. 4. Run the project. Expected result: No runtime error should be shown. The console should show the following: D/TiAPI ( 738): Hello World D/Testmodule2Module( 738): (KrollRuntimeThread) [2199,5043] Result = 101 D/TiAPI ( 738): Hello from TiContext D/Testmodule2Module( 738): (KrollRuntimeThread) [8,5152] TiContext Result = 101.1 D/TiAPI ( 738): Hello world from a file D/Testmodule2Module( 738): (KrollRuntimeThread) [11,5163] TiContext File Result = 102 Actual reult: Runtime error is thrown. Error log attached with bug.""""",title+description
