TIMOB-11323,12,"""CLI: Cannot build for iOS, it is always looking for build 3.0.0 instead of the default SDK""","""""""Steps To Reproduce:  1. cd to the location of the project  2. titanium build --platform ios    Actual Result:  [ERROR] ** BUILD FAILED **  [ERROR] The following build commands failed:  [ERROR]         PhaseScriptExecution Pre-Compile build/<USER>build/Debug-iphonesimulator/<USER>universal.build/Script-DABB369F12E8CB280026A6EA.sh    Expected Result:  Should build without failures""""""",Bug,"Title: CLI: Cannot build for iOS, it is always looking for build 3.0.0 instead of the default SDK
