TIMOB-11319,12,"""Studio : Apk file size varies in 2.1.3 and in 3.0 build of SDK""","""""""This is a Regression issue. Size in SDK 2.1.3 is 5.9MB  Steps To Reproduce:  1. create a default app.  2. Distribute app on Android device.  3. Verify its apk size.    Actual: In 3.0 SDK build, size is 6.1MB for V8 whereas in 2.1.3 its 5.9MB  Expected: Size must be similar in respective builds.  """"""",Bug,"Title: Studio : Apk file size varies in 2.1.3 and in 3.0 build of SDK
Description: """"This is a Regression issue. Size in SDK 2.1.3 is 5.9MB Steps To Reproduce: 1. create a default app. 2. Distribute app on Android device. 3. Verify its apk size. Actual: In 3.0 SDK build, size is 6.1MB for V8 whereas in 2.1.3 its 5.9MB Expected: Size must be similar in respective builds. """"",title+description
