TIMOB-11317,12,"""Mobileweb not executing Alloy plugin/hook""","""""""Mobileweb does not appear to be executing the alloy plugin and/or hook when a build is executed through TiStudio. It either throws errors like this:    https://img.skitch.com/20121009-xp6pcedyuse1e5g6pqk115nunr.jpg    or just shows the last compiled app when executed, but it doesn't recompile as it should.""""""",Bug,"Title: Mobileweb not executing Alloy plugin/hook
