TIMOB-11307,12,"""Android Debugger: Breakpoints not recognized on files that are added to app.js using URL""","""""""This is a regression issue. It does not occur in 2.1.3.GA  Steps To Reproduce:  1. create app with code below.  2. Put a breakpoint on any line in newWin.js file.  3. Run the app using SDK 3.0 in debug mode(Emulator or Device).  4. Click Test button.    Actual: Breakpoint is not recognized in newWin File. Variables tab appear blank. Console output shows nothing.  Expected: Breakpoint must get hit. Console and Variables tab must work as expected.    app.js      newWin.js    """"""",Bug,"Title: Android Debugger: Breakpoints not recognized on files that are added to app.js using URL
