TIMOB-11306,12,"""iOS: Subversion directories and files present in .IPA""","""""""h6.Problem  Titanium does not exclude subversion directories and files when generating .IPA file.     h6.Actual result  This increased the file size already from 77MB to 127MB, even more increase at every new build.    h6.Screenshot  Shows an IPA file generated. Above with 2.0.2.GA, below with 2.1.3.GA.    _Is noticeable after publishing a project with Studio, a .svn subdirectory is being created with 2.1.3.GA release only._    h6.Steps to reproduce  1. Set 2.0.2.GA SDK into tiapp.xml  2. Right click on Studio Project, """"""""Publish""""""""  3. Select distribution method, """"""""Distribute - Ad Hoc/Enterprise"""""""" for instance  4. Perform steps 1, 2 and 3 with 2.1.3.GA.   5. Unzip, compare IPA generated files upon distribution.    _Results may vary according the project files size_""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Subversion directories and files present in .IPA
Description: """"h6.Problem Titanium does not exclude subversion directories and files when generating .IPA file. h6.Actual result This increased the file size already from 77MB to 127MB, even more increase at every new build. h6.Screenshot Shows an IPA file generated. Above with 2.0.2.GA, below with 2.1.3.GA. _Is noticeable after publishing a project with Studio, a .svn subdirectory is being created with 2.1.3.GA release only._ h6.Steps to reproduce 1. Set 2.0.2.GA SDK into tiapp.xml 2. Right click on Studio Project, """"""""Publish"""""""" 3. Select distribution method, """"""""Distribute - Ad Hoc/Enterprise"""""""" for instance 4. Perform steps 1, 2 and 3 with 2.1.3.GA. 5. Unzip, compare IPA generated files upon distribution. _Results may vary according the project files size_""""",title+description
