TIMOB-11294,12,"""Android: console: log functions fail in commonjs require""","""""""[ERROR][TiJSError(  744)] (main) [0,1111] - Message: Uncaught ReferenceError: console is not defined  [ERROR][TiJSError(  744)] (main) [0,1111] - Source:console.debug(""""""""drawAnnotation"""""""");    Another Log:        seems like console works fine on IOS but throws errors on Android.    Any console object calls in a commonjs module will fail on android, they work from app.js though.    This is not a regression.    Docs: http://docs.<USER>com/titanium/2.1/index.html#!/api/Global.console    Steps to Reproduce:    1. Run code:    require.js      app.js    Actual Result:    Runtime error.    Expected Result:    Console message logged.""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: console: log functions fail in commonjs require
Description: """"[ERROR][TiJSError( 744)] (main) [0,1111] - Message: Uncaught ReferenceError: console is not defined [ERROR][TiJSError( 744)] (main) [0,1111] - Source:console.debug(""""""""drawAnnotation""""""""); Another Log: seems like console works fine on IOS but throws errors on Android. Any console object calls in a commonjs module will fail on android, they work from app.js though. This is not a regression. Docs: http://docs.<USER>com/titanium/2.1/index.html#!/api/Global.console Steps to Reproduce: 1. Run code: require.js app.js Actual Result: Runtime error. Expected Result: Console message logged.""""",title+description
TIMOB-11293,12,"""Android: Investigate reducing the installed size of Titanium Mobile applications""","""""""For a bare-bones app, investigate what takes up each slice of footprint size, and then suggests possible ways in which this can be reduced. We will create follow-on tickets to work on size reductions where possible. A goal is something in the 7-8 MB range.  """"""",Story,"Title: Android: Investigate reducing the installed size of Titanium Mobile applications
Description: """"For a bare-bones app, investigate what takes up each slice of footprint size, and then suggests possible ways in which this can be reduced. We will create follow-on tickets to work on size reductions where possible. A goal is something in the 7-8 MB range. """"",title+description
TIMOB-11292,12,"""Android: Investigate reducing the heap size of Titanium Mobile applications""","""""""From a customer, they feel the app is taking up way too memory (RAM) on device.    For a bare-bones app, investigate what takes up each slice of memory size, and then suggests possible ways in which this can be reduced. We will create follow-on tickets to work on size reductions where possible.  """"""",Epic,"Title: Android: Investigate reducing the heap size of Titanium Mobile applications
Description: """"From a customer, they feel the app is taking up way too memory (RAM) on device. For a bare-bones app, investigate what takes up each slice of memory size, and then suggests possible ways in which this can be reduced. We will create follow-on tickets to work on size reductions where possible. """"",title+description
