Description: """"h3. The problem This issue only appears if there is a view in the rows. If there is no view in the rows, then the table functions as expected. h3. Repro steps 1. Press down on a table row causing it to highlight. 2. Drag the table row without releasing to view later rows. 3. Release the drag and click on a different row. 4. The row that was selected previously will be the row that receives the click event. h3. The code: """"",title+description
