TIMOB-11234,12,"""iOS: Device Debugger: Titanium SDK log messages print out of order""","""""""During iOS device debugging, Titanium SDK log messages do not print in order.    Steps to Reproduce:    1. Launch app in iOS device debug with code (insert breakpoint at last line to initiate debugger):        Actual Result:    Messages print to Studio console out of order. See attached log.    Expected Result:    Messages print in order.""""""",Sub-task,"Title: iOS: Device Debugger: Titanium SDK log messages print out of order
