TIMOB-11233,12,"""iOS: Device Debugger: Titanium SDK log messages do not print to Xcode console""","""""""During iOS device debugging, Titanium SDK log messages do not print to Xcode console, but they do print to Studio console.    Steps to Reproduce:    1. Launch app in iOS device debug with code (insert breakpoint at last line to initiate debugger):        Actual Result:    Messages print to Studio console, but not Xcode console.    Expected Result:    Messages print to Studio console AND Xcode console.""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Device Debugger: Titanium SDK log messages do not print to Xcode console
