TIMOB-11230,12,"""iOS: Device Debugger: no error message if connection fails""","""""""During iOS device debugging, if the app launches and the session fails to connect to Studio, there is no immediate error message, only """"""""Waiting for debugger to connect..."""""""" with a possible time-out.    Steps to Reproduce:    1. Debug on iOS Device.  2. Install app to device.  3. Cancel debug <USER>from Studio.  4. Launch app from device (knowing it should fail).    Actual Result:    """"""""Waiting for debugger to connect..."""""""" and possible time-out.    Expected Result:    Immediate error (within 0 - 10 seconds, or whatever appropriate) indicating problem.""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Device Debugger: no error message if connection fails
Description: """"During iOS device debugging, if the app launches and the session fails to connect to Studio, there is no immediate error message, only """"""""Waiting for debugger to connect..."""""""" with a possible time-out. Steps to Reproduce: 1. Debug on iOS Device. 2. Install app to device. 3. Cancel debug <USER>from Studio. 4. Launch app from device (knowing it should fail). Actual Result: """"""""Waiting for debugger to connect..."""""""" and possible time-out. Expected Result: Immediate error (within 0 - 10 seconds, or whatever appropriate) indicating problem.""""",title+description
TIMOB-11229,12,"""CLI: Build I18N library that support multiple locale directories""","""""""We need a small i18n lib that exposes __() and __n() functions, uses sprint() syntax, and supports multiple locale directories.    Should be modifying the appc fork of https://github.com/<USER>i18n-node.    Things we need:  * determine system locale  ** Linux  *** """"""""locale""""""""  ** Mac OS X  *** defaults read .GlobalPreferences AppleLanguages | tr -d [:space:] | cut -c2-3  ** Windows???  * Default locale in config.json  * Multiple locale directories per project  ** titanium/locales  ** node-appc/locales  ** titanium_mobile/android/cli/locales  ** titanium_mobile/iphone/cli/locales  ** titanium_mobile/mobileweb/cli/locales  ** titanium_mobile/support/cli/locales  ** titanium_mobile/support/node_modules/titanium-sdk/locales  * i18n tool to find all __() and __n() functions  ** determine missing string or strings that are no longer needed  ** needs to take multiple locale directories into account""""""",Sub-task,"Title: CLI: Build I18N library that support multiple locale directories
Description: """"We need a small i18n lib that exposes __() and __n() functions, uses sprint() syntax, and supports multiple locale directories. Should be modifying the appc fork of https://github.com/<USER>i18n-node. Things we need: * determine system locale ** Linux *** """"""""locale"""""""" ** Mac OS X *** defaults read .GlobalPreferences AppleLanguages | tr -d [:space:] | cut -c2-3 ** Windows??? * Default locale in config.json * Multiple locale directories per project ** titanium/locales ** node-appc/locales ** titanium_mobile/android/cli/locales ** titanium_mobile/iphone/cli/locales ** titanium_mobile/mobileweb/cli/locales ** titanium_mobile/support/cli/locales ** titanium_mobile/support/node_modules/titanium-sdk/locales * i18n tool to find all __() and __n() functions ** determine missing string or strings that are no longer needed ** needs to take multiple locale directories into account""""",title+description
