Description: """"View on window with vertical layout first drawn from left top then to the center(top). This is a regression.It does not occurs on 2.1.2.GA Steps to Reproduce: 1. Install and launch the app on device. 2. Click on the button """"""""click"""""""" Actual Result: After Step2: The red view initially appears left top of the screen for a moment and then moves to the center(top) as if it is animated. Expected Result: It should appear in center (top). app.js """"",title+description
TIMOB-11202,12,"""iOS: Ti.Locale.getCurrencySymbol('SGD') is returning wrong symbol for Singapore Dollar ""","""""""Ti.Locale.getCurrencySymbol('SGD') doesn't return right symbol for Singapore Dollar. It is returning """"""""SGD"""""""" instead of """"""""$"""""""". The currency symbols are working fine for other currencies like USD, GBP, CAD, INR, etc. Please find the screenshot and app.js attached.    h4. Repo Steps  1. Run the attached app.js in your project.  2. Click the """"""""Show"""""""" button.  3. It'll show the currency symbols.  """"""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Ti.Locale.getCurrencySymbol('SGD') is returning wrong symbol for Singapore Dollar
