TIMOB-11201,12,"""iOS: """"XHR to Filesystem"""" loads non mobile Google page. ""","""""""Description:  """"""""XHR to Filesystem"""""""" loads non mobile Google page. After reloading the page Google page is displayed correctly (mobile mode).    Steps:  1. Launch KitchenSink.  2. Go to BaseUI> Views> Web views> XHR to Filesystem.    Expected results:  Google webpage is displayed correctly in the middle of the screen.    Actual results:  Google webpage is hardly visible (positioned to far right).    """"""",Bug,"Title: iOS: """"XHR to Filesystem"""" loads non mobile Google page.
