TIMOB-11181,12,"""iOS: View sublayer animations are not in sync""","""""""When running the sample below you can see when clicking on the view that the gradient layer is not animating smoothly with the view itself.    I discovered that when making that pull request  https://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/pull/2996    I put the backgroundImage in a sublayer and i have the same behavior as with the gradient layer    it might also be related to a fix i made:  https://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/pull/2995  I mean when fixing this i realised that the gradient sublayer had its own animation (instead of being resize upon each view animation step)  """"""",Bug,"Title: iOS: View sublayer animations are not in sync
Description: """"When running the sample below you can see when clicking on the view that the gradient layer is not animating smoothly with the view itself. I discovered that when making that pull request https://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/pull/2996 I put the backgroundImage in a sublayer and i have the same behavior as with the gradient layer it might also be related to a fix i made: https://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/pull/2995 I mean when fixing this i realised that the gradient sublayer had its own animation (instead of being resize upon each view animation step) """"",title+description
