TIMOB-11151,12,"""iOS 6 Only: Window - opening a modal window with UPSIDE_PORTRAIT orientation only crashes""","""""""Steps to reproduce:  Run the following code:    2. Click on any of the row    Expected:  Open a red window with text hello    Actual:  Crash with following log:  Sep 25 16:02:11 Titan WindowModule[2716] <Error>: *** Terminating app due to uncaught exception 'UIApplicationInvalidInterfaceOrientation', reason: 'Supported orientations has no common orientation with the application, and shouldAutorotate is returning YES'""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS 6 Only: Window - opening a modal window with UPSIDE_PORTRAIT orientation only crashes
