TIMOB-11108,12,"""Win8: """"Charges"""" table rows are displayed in reverse order from manager view""","""""""Steps to reproduce:    1. submit a report with at least 2 charges in it  2. switch to manager view  3. open the report and check the order of rows in """"""""Charges"""""""" table    Expected result: the rows should be displayed in the same order as in employee view    Actual result: the rows are displayed in reverse order    see the attached screenshots""""""",Bug,"Title: Win8: """"Charges"""" table rows are displayed in reverse order from manager view
