TIMOB-11088,12,"""Android: Autolink tap area automatically takes the whole line space.""","""""""When using long text for auto link, some of the text wraps in to a second line leaving a white area in the first line. Tapping on this white area opens the email client or the phone app. (The auto link behavior).    h4.Steps to Reproduce:  1. Load a new project with the below app.js.  2. Click anywhere on the white space next to the link.     Expected Behavior: The e-mail client or the Phone Dial pad should only open when the link is clicked.    Actual Behavior: They open even when the blank space next to the link is tapped.    """"""",Bug,"Title: Android: Autolink tap area automatically takes the whole line space.
Description: """"When using long text for auto link, some of the text wraps in to a second line leaving a white area in the first line. Tapping on this white area opens the email client or the phone app. (The auto link behavior). h4.Steps to Reproduce: 1. Load a new project with the below app.js. 2. Click anywhere on the white space next to the link. Expected Behavior: The e-mail client or the Phone Dial pad should only open when the link is clicked. Actual Behavior: They open even when the blank space next to the link is tapped. """"",title+description
