TIMOB-11060,12,"""iOS6 only - tool bar bar no longer animates the same way as ios5 does when opening a new window""","""""""1.publish KS (https://github.com/<USER>developer-relations/KitchenSink) using the noted config  2.install onto an iphone running ios6  3.nav to BaseUI > Window (standalone)  4.tap either of the buttons on the tool bar (""""""""open tab animation"""""""" or """"""""open tab w/o animation"""""""") and watch the tool bar itself during the animation. Compare to ios5.    results:on ios5, the tool bar animates down and off the screen during the transition. On ios6 the bar slides off the side.""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS6 only - tool bar bar no longer animates the same way as ios5 does when opening a new window
Description: """"1.publish KS (https://github.com/<USER>developer-relations/KitchenSink) using the noted config 2.install onto an iphone running ios6 3.nav to BaseUI > Window (standalone) 4.tap either of the buttons on the tool bar (""""""""open tab animation"""""""" or """"""""open tab w/o animation"""""""") and watch the tool bar itself during the animation. Compare to ios5. results:on ios5, the tool bar animates down and off the screen during the transition. On ios6 the bar slides off the side.""""",title+description
