Description: """"Application crashes when Kitchen Sink : Camera: Video Record opened. Attached is the crash logs. This is not a regression.It even occurs on 2.1.2.GA Steps to reproduce: 1. Launch new instance of Kitchen Sink 2. Tap on Phone>Camera>Video Record Actual Result: App crashes Expected Result: App should not crash""""",title+description
