TIMOB-10976,12,"""iOS: KitchenSink :Picker :Countdown Picker - Part of the label is hidden under the Start button""","""""""Part of the label is hidden under the Start button.    This is not a regression.This even occurs on 2.1.0.GA    Steps to Reproduce:    1. Run the Kitchen Sink application  2. Tap on Controls>Picker>Countdown Picker  3. Choose hours and minutes by scrolling up and down.    Actual Result:  The part of label is hidden under the button    Expected Result:  The label should display completely.  """"""",Bug,"Title: iOS: KitchenSink :Picker :Countdown Picker - Part of the label is hidden under the Start button
