TIMOB-10933,12,"""iOS: Kitchen Sink - Pressing tab while holding the phone in landscape mode opens the window in landscape mode temporarily""","""""""Pressing tab while holding the iphone in landscape mode opens the window in Landscape mode first and then after some time returns to portrait mode automatically.    This is not a regression.This even occurs on 2.1.2.GA    Steps To reproduce:    1. Run the Kitchen Sink application  2. Rotate the device in Landscape mode  3. Tap on Platform Tab.(Wait for few seconds)    Actual Result:  The window opens in lanscape mode for some time and then returns to portrait mode automatically.    Expected Result:  The window should remain in Lanscape mode.  """"""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Kitchen Sink - Pressing tab while holding the phone in landscape mode opens the window in landscape mode temporarily
