Description: """"h2. Problem description Setting a database file so that it is not backed up remotely leads to memory leaks in the app. h2. Steps to reproduce - Create an app.js with the following code: - Run the app using XCode profiling, and open the Instruments tool to check leaks - Wait ~1 minute and the following leaks are shown: - Comment the remoteBackup line and leaks won't show up. """"",title+description
