TIMOB-10795,12,"""Android: Ti.UI.SIZE on a view does not work with layout property set""","""""""h3. Issue    When a view has its width set to Ti.UI.SIZE, along with a layout of horizontal, the width does not wrap to the size of its child containers, instead filling out the parent that it is placed into (on Android). On iOS, the width wraps around fine.    h3. Sample Code        This issue did not exist in Release 2.1.0.GA. Attached is the screenshot of how it looks like in Android.""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Ti.UI.SIZE on a view does not work with layout property set
