TIMOB-10793,12,"""Android: Cannot remove child view from inside TableViewRow""","""""""Bug: Cannot remove child view from inside TableViewRow  2 cases  A: .remove() View inside TableViewRow - Crash ( http://pastie.org/4572849 )  B: .remove() View nested in View inside TableViewRow - No Crash, but no effect    The same works fine on iOS.""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Cannot remove child view from inside TableViewRow
