Description: """"h6.Parity Problem When you add the button directly to the row, the event doesn't fire when you click on the left side of the row (actual behavior). h6.Expected behavior The click event fired when clicking on a row h6.Tested on iOS 5.1 simulator Droid Razr 2.3.5 h6.Repro sequence """"",title+description
TIMOB-10750,12,"""iPhone Simulator: bad path crash""","""""""{html}<div><p>Just thought I'd let you know that in Titanium Developer 1.2.2 I  am now getting the following errors when I launch an app in the iOS  4.2 simulator:</p>  <pre>  <code>[INFO] One moment, building ...  [INFO] Detected third-party module: jp.masuidrive.ti.admob/0.1  [INFO] Titanium SDK version: 1.5.1  [INFO] iPhone Device family: iphone  [INFO] iPhone SDK version: 4.2  [ERROR] Error: Traceback (most recent call last):  File """"""""/Library/Application Support/Titanium/mobilesdk/osx/1.5.1/iphone/builder.py"""""""", line 1040, in main  cleanup_app_logfiles()  File """"""""/Library/Application Support/Titanium/mobilesdk/osx/1.5.1/iphone/builder.py"""""""", line 1038, in cleanup_app_logfiles  os.remove(i)  OSError: [Errno 2] No such file or directory: 'bad path 2F119901-0000-0000-0000-006B00000000'</code>  </pre>  <p>If I click Launch again it works fine. Seems to be that every  other 'launch' works.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iPhone Simulator: bad path crash
Description: """"{html}<div><p>Just thought I'd let you know that in Titanium Developer 1.2.2 I am now getting the following errors when I launch an app in the iOS 4.2 simulator:</p> <pre> <code>[INFO] One moment, building ... [INFO] Detected third-party module: jp.masuidrive.ti.admob/0.1 [INFO] Titanium SDK version: 1.5.1 [INFO] iPhone Device family: iphone [INFO] iPhone SDK version: 4.2 [ERROR] Error: Traceback (most recent call last): File """"""""/Library/Application Support/Titanium/mobilesdk/osx/1.5.1/iphone/builder.py"""""""", line 1040, in main cleanup_app_logfiles() File """"""""/Library/Application Support/Titanium/mobilesdk/osx/1.5.1/iphone/builder.py"""""""", line 1038, in cleanup_app_logfiles os.remove(i) OSError: [Errno 2] No such file or directory: 'bad path 2F119901-0000-0000-0000-006B00000000'</code> </pre> <p>If I click Launch again it works fine. Seems to be that every other 'launch' works.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
