TIMOB-10738,12,"""Android: using vertical layout, multiple views cannot be added if one has the 'bottom' property set, but no 'height'""","""""""h2. Problem description  When using the 'vertical' layout in Android, setting the property 'bottom' for a view, without setting its height, does not allow to add additional views, because of the fix to this bug: https://jira.<USER>org/browse/TIMOB-10175 (the second view is always outside the screen).     h2. Additional information  Use the following code to see the behavior: test on 2.1.1 and 2.1.2 to verify how this has changed.        h2. Additional note  See also https://jira.<USER>org/browse/TIMOB-10175""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: using vertical layout, multiple views cannot be added if one has the 'bottom' property set, but no 'height'
