Description: """"When packaging android modules on Linux, there is a build error. Console: This is not a regression. This worked on Ubuntu 10.04 using ant 1.8, but reinstalling 1.8 caused the same problem. Steps to Reproduce: 1. Create an Android Module. 2. Package Android Module using ant, either from Studio or command line. Actual Result: Error. Expected Result: Android Module Packages.""""",title+description
