TIMOB-10694,12,"""Android: Setting 'url' or 'html' of a webview results in a crash on Android 2.3.3 emulator""","""""""Run the attached app.js ( build it with Ti SDK 2.1.1GA)  The app crashes on the webview launch.   It happens only on 2.3.3 emulator. App works fine on all other emulators and devices.  Note: The app does not crash on 2.3.3 emulator if its built with Ti SDK 2.0.1 GA2, 2.0.2 GA2 and 2.1.0 GA!!    Might be related to this issue: http://code.google.com/p/android/issues/detail?id=12987""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Setting 'url' or 'html' of a webview results in a crash on Android 2.3.3 emulator
Description: """"Run the attached app.js ( build it with Ti SDK 2.1.1GA) The app crashes on the webview launch. It happens only on 2.3.3 emulator. App works fine on all other emulators and devices. Note: The app does not crash on 2.3.3 emulator if its built with Ti SDK 2.0.1 GA2, 2.0.2 GA2 and 2.1.0 GA!! Might be related to this issue: http://code.google.com/p/android/issues/detail?id=12987""""",title+description
TIMOB-10693,12,"""iOS: Application crashes when trying to open """"Record"""" (iOS 6 Beta 4).""","""""""Description:  """"""""Record"""""""" crashes when trying to open the application. Crash only occurs on iPhone with beta version 6.   This is not a regression. Behavior also occurs on 2.1.1.    Seps:  KS>Phone>Sound>Press """"""""Record"""""""".    Expected results:  Should be able to open page with """"""""Start recording"""""""" button.    Actual results:  Application crashes.""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Application crashes when trying to open """"Record"""" (iOS 6 Beta 4).
