Description: """"We need to write a plugin that will throw a warning when doing an assignment inside of an if statement to prevent the following coding mistake: Doing assignments inside of an if statement is sometimes valid though, so it needs to be a warning only.""""",title+description
TIMOB-10639,12,"""MobileWeb: Textfield hides hintText when value is set to empty""","""""""h4. Mobileweb Textfield hides hintText if value is set to an empty string  When creating a textfield with no value and hintText of 'required', setting the value to '' will cause the value to be shown instead of the hintText in mobileweb even though the value is empty.  This works correctly in iOS as a comparison.    h4. Steps to reroduce:  1. Copy the code below into a new project  2. Run using MobileWeb  3. Note the textfield has no text    4. Run using iOS  5. Note the textfield says 'Required'    h4. CODE:  """"""",Bug,"Title: MobileWeb: Textfield hides hintText when value is set to empty
