TIMOB-10636,12,"""KitchenSink: Sockets - Error while closing Sockets > Listening socket through hardware back button""","""""""Error while hard return from Sockets> Listening socket.  This is not regression since error occurs in 2.1.0 build as well but error does not occur in 2.0.1 build.    Steps to reproduce:  1) Build KS with 2.1.2.  2) Navigate to Platform>Sockets>Listening socket  3) Click """"""""socket state""""""""  4) Click """"""""Listen on 40404""""""""  5) Telnet to the Android with command """"""""telnet <Android's IP> 40404"""""""" from system on same network  6) Click """"""""close""""""""  7) Click """"""""socket state""""""""  8) Tap """"""""back"""""""" button to leave test    Result:  Socket error is displayed.    Expected:  Normal resumption of tests  """"""",Bug,"Title: KitchenSink: Sockets - Error while closing Sockets > Listening socket through hardware back button
Description: """"Error while hard return from Sockets> Listening socket. This is not regression since error occurs in 2.1.0 build as well but error does not occur in 2.0.1 build. Steps to reproduce: 1) Build KS with 2.1.2. 2) Navigate to Platform>Sockets>Listening socket 3) Click """"""""socket state"""""""" 4) Click """"""""Listen on 40404"""""""" 5) Telnet to the Android with command """"""""telnet <Android's IP> 40404"""""""" from system on same network 6) Click """"""""close"""""""" 7) Click """"""""socket state"""""""" 8) Tap """"""""back"""""""" button to leave test Result: Socket error is displayed. Expected: Normal resumption of tests """"",title+description
TIMOB-10635,12,"""iOS: App has been rejected 3 Times by Apple""","""""""The developer version of this build of our app works, however on all these SDKs, when we create the distribution build iOS app is rejected as """"""""Splash screen on the app is freezing"""""""" On iPhone 4S, 5.1.1    According to this ticket: http://jira.<USER>org/browse/TC-498  The issue was resolved in 1.9.0cb, however I cannot find this build on the download site in the master branch as suggested.    The app is freezing in the ad-hoc build method (suggested by Apple to test before sending in Distribution build).    We don't have much time here as this needs to get to market and we've lost 2-3 weeks between iterations.    I've also set the appcel metrics to """"""""False"""""""" as per some of the forum notes.  This didn't help with the rejection freeze either.    On 2.1.1 the ad-hoc build freezes on BOTH 3GS/itouch and 4-S,  1.7.5/1.8.2 at least don't freeze on 3GS""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: App has been rejected 3 Times by Apple
Description: """"The developer version of this build of our app works, however on all these SDKs, when we create the distribution build iOS app is rejected as """"""""Splash screen on the app is freezing"""""""" On iPhone 4S, 5.1.1 According to this ticket: http://jira.<USER>org/browse/TC-498 The issue was resolved in 1.9.0cb, however I cannot find this build on the download site in the master branch as suggested. The app is freezing in the ad-hoc build method (suggested by Apple to test before sending in Distribution build). We don't have much time here as this needs to get to market and we've lost 2-3 weeks between iterations. I've also set the appcel metrics to """"""""False"""""""" as per some of the forum notes. This didn't help with the rejection freeze either. On 2.1.1 the ad-hoc build freezes on BOTH 3GS/itouch and 4-S, 1.7.5/1.8.2 at least don't freeze on 3GS""""",title+description
