TIMOB-10568,12,"""iOS : Label - Vertical alignment on label is not set properly""","""""""Vertical alignment on label is not set properly.    This is not a Regression.It happens as far as 2.0.1.    Steps To reproduce:    1. install and launch the app on to the device.  2. Click on Top or Bottom button    Expected Result:    After Step 2: the text on the label should be vertically aligned as per the button click.    Actual Result:    After Step 2: The text doesn't get vertically aligned    app.js  """"""",Bug,"Title: iOS : Label - Vertical alignment on label is not set properly
