TIMOB-10532,12,"""KitchenSink: Image changes location during device rotation""","""""""Description:  On Base UI> Views> Scroll Views> """"""""Scrolling Zoom+Pinch"""""""" image changes location during device rotation. It moves from center to left top corner.    This is not a regression. The behavior occurs on 2.1.1 as well.    Steps:  1.Open """"""""Scrolling Zoom+Pinch"""""""" in portrait mode.  2.Minimize the image which is located in the center of the screen.  3.Rotate device in to landscape mode.    Expected results:  Image remains in the center of the page.      Actual results:  Image jumps in to left top conner of the page.""""""",Bug,"Title: KitchenSink: Image changes location during device rotation
