TIMOB-10503,12,"""Android: Only send ti.geo analytics event once when user sets a ti.geolocation callback""","""""""Currently, when user sets ti.geolocation, ti.geo analytics events are sent for every callback. We only care about one lat/long pair, and it's wasteful to send all ti.geo info.    Testing steps:   1. Launch a simple app with this code in production (Package in iOS/Android App store)    2. Drive around a little bit to trigger location change (home -> work. etc.)  3. Put app's name and GUID in this ticket so we can look up analytics events that was fired.""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Only send ti.geo analytics event once when user sets a ti.geolocation callback
Description: """"Currently, when user sets ti.geolocation, ti.geo analytics events are sent for every callback. We only care about one lat/long pair, and it's wasteful to send all ti.geo info. Testing steps: 1. Launch a simple app with this code in production (Package in iOS/Android App store) 2. Drive around a little bit to trigger location change (home -> work. etc.) 3. Put app's name and GUID in this ticket so we can look up analytics events that was fired.""""",title+description
TIMOB-10502,12,"""TiAPI: Analytics timestamps sent with localized characters instead of western numerals""","""""""For example, ts is set to """"""""۲۰۱۲-۰۷-۲۹T۰۸:۳۱:۰۱.۶۸۵+0000""""""""    Timestamps should follow ISO-8601. Sometimes they are sent in unicode as eastern arabic or perso-arabic. They should always sent as western glyphs regardless of localization settings of device.    http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eastern_Arabic_numerals      """"""",Bug,"Title: TiAPI: Analytics timestamps sent with localized characters instead of western numerals
Description: """"For example, ts is set to """"""""۲۰۱۲-۰۷-۲۹T۰۸:۳۱:۰۱.۶۸۵+0000"""""""" Timestamps should follow ISO-8601. Sometimes they are sent in unicode as eastern arabic or perso-arabic. They should always sent as western glyphs regardless of localization settings of device. http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eastern_Arabic_numerals """"",title+description
TIMOB-10501,12,"""iOS: No error logging on non-exported CommonJS code""","""""""h6.Problem  Error console does not log errors that occur within CommonJS modules outside of the Exported code.    h6.Expected results  module.js should error on line 13 as foobar() is not a valid method of UI.view.    h6.Actual result  No error is raised until line 10 of app.js, when the empty object is added to the window.    h6.Tested on  iOS simulator    h6.app.js      h6.module.js      h6.Console output      h6.Customer's output  """"""",Bug,"Title: iOS: No error logging on non-exported CommonJS code
Description: """"h6.Problem Error console does not log errors that occur within CommonJS modules outside of the Exported code. h6.Expected results module.js should error on line 13 as foobar() is not a valid method of UI.view. h6.Actual result No error is raised until line 10 of app.js, when the empty object is added to the window. h6.Tested on iOS simulator h6.app.js h6.module.js h6.Console output h6.Customer's output """"",title+description
