TIMOB-10478,12,"""Tooling: Module packaging does not maintain upper-case letters in the module name""","""""""# In the studio, create a Mobile Module project and set the module id to ti.MyModule  # Clicked the module project and selected the package option.  # Selected another project in the workspace as deployment target.    Expected:  The directory structure should maintain the upper-case letters defined in the module's name.    Actual:  The tiapp.xml was updated with the right name: ti.MyModule   The directory structure under the modules directory is all with lower-case letter, which trigger an error in the tiapp editor.""""""",Bug,"Title: Tooling: Module packaging does not maintain upper-case letters in the module name
Description: """"# In the studio, create a Mobile Module project and set the module id to ti.MyModule # Clicked the module project and selected the package option. # Selected another project in the workspace as deployment target. Expected: The directory structure should maintain the upper-case letters defined in the module's name. Actual: The tiapp.xml was updated with the right name: ti.MyModule The directory structure under the modules directory is all with lower-case letter, which trigger an error in the tiapp editor.""""",title+description
