TIMOB-10450,12,"""iOS: Feature: Expose setZoomScale:animated: method""","""""""h6.Feature  Enable setZoomScale:animated: so scrollView can be animated.    h6.setZoomScale:animated:  A floating-point value that specifies the current zoom scale.    - (void)setZoomScale:(float)scale animated:(BOOL)animated    h6.Apple release docs  http://developer.apple.com/library/ios/#documentation/uikit/reference/UIScrollView_Class/Reference/UIScrollView.html    h6.The case: zoomScale property cannot be animated on scrollview  """"""",New Feature,"Title: iOS: Feature: Expose setZoomScale:animated: method
Description: """"h6.Feature Enable setZoomScale:animated: so scrollView can be animated. h6.setZoomScale:animated: A floating-point value that specifies the current zoom scale. - (void)setZoomScale:(float)scale animated:(BOOL)animated h6.Apple release docs http://developer.apple.com/library/ios/#documentation/uikit/reference/UIScrollView_Class/Reference/UIScrollView.html h6.The case: zoomScale property cannot be animated on scrollview """"",title+description
