TIMOB-10363,12,"""Android: Picker """"add"""" method is dead slow""","""""""h2. The problem    Picker's """"""""add"""""""" method is very slow, when creating picker with 30 rows on tablet with Tegra2 processor, picker """"""""add"""""""" method takes about 1.5 seconds to execute.      This greatly impacts Titanium's performance when there are more pickers with more that just a few options.      h2. Test case            30 rows is really not big number, especially on powerful hardware. 1.5 seconds is a way too much. JS execution time (creation of array of picker's rows) is 14ms. Execution of """"""""add"""""""" method should be similar to that value.""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Picker """"add"""" method is dead slow
Description: """"h2. The problem Picker's """"""""add"""""""" method is very slow, when creating picker with 30 rows on tablet with Tegra2 processor, picker """"""""add"""""""" method takes about 1.5 seconds to execute. This greatly impacts Titanium's performance when there are more pickers with more that just a few options. h2. Test case 30 rows is really not big number, especially on powerful hardware. 1.5 seconds is a way too much. JS execution time (creation of array of picker's rows) is 14ms. Execution of """"""""add"""""""" method should be similar to that value.""""",title+description
