TIMOB-10338,12,"""Android: Opening a new tab group after closing a tab group crashes the application""","""""""h3. Problem    When closing a tab group followed by creating and opening a new tab group, the application crashes.    h3. Steps to reproduce    1. The app starts and the first tab group is opened  2. Click on the button to close the first tab group and create and open another tab group  3. Application crashes    h3. Code to reproduce        h3. Expected behavior     First tab group is closed and new tab group is opened.    h3. Actual behavior    Application crashes           Please find attached the crash log.""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Opening a new tab group after closing a tab group crashes the application
