Description: """"Description: Text tables are not correctly displayed in Android """"""""userSpinner""""""""-text. This bug also occurs on """"""""userSpinner""""""""-text 2. Steps: 1. Run Refactored KitchenSink 2. In """"""""Controls"""""""" module press on """"""""Picker"""""""". 3. Clickon Android """"""""userSpiner""""""""-text and/or """"""""userSpiner""""""""-text 2. Expected results: Should see one table with three columns(for""""""""userSpinner""""""""-text) and three tables with 3 columns each and header should be """"""""SOME LAYOUT EXAMPLES""""""""( for """"""""userSpinner""""""""- text 2.). Actual results: For """"""""userSpinner""""""""-text only two columns in the table visible. For """"""""userSpinner""""""""- text 2 two tables have only two columns. """"",title+description
