TIMOB-10263,12,"""KitchenSink: Phone > Contacts: on iPhone in landscape mode part of contact list is hidden under status bar when manage contacts via picker""","""""""Description:  On iPhone when manage contacts via picker landscape mode leads to hiding part of contacts list.    This is not a regression it occurs on SDK 2.1.0.GA    Steps to reproduce:  1) Launch refactored Kitchen Sink (Kevin Winnerey/Developer relations version) > Phone > Contacts  2)  Tap on 'Contacts picker' > 'Show picker' rotate the device to landscape mode.  3) From step 1 tap on 'Remove contact' > 'Delete via picker' rotate the device to landscape mode.  4) From step 1 tap on 'Contact images' > 'Get image from picker' or 'Remove image via picker' or 'Set image via picker' and rotate the device to landscape mode.  5) From step 1 tap on 'Groups' > 'Add person' or 'Remove person' and rotate the device to landscape mode.     Actual result:  Part of contact list is hidden under status bar.    Expected result:  Part of contact list isn't hidden.       """"""",Bug,"Title: KitchenSink: Phone > Contacts: on iPhone in landscape mode part of contact list is hidden under status bar when manage contacts via picker
Description: """"Description: On iPhone when manage contacts via picker landscape mode leads to hiding part of contacts list. This is not a regression it occurs on SDK 2.1.0.GA Steps to reproduce: 1) Launch refactored Kitchen Sink (Kevin Winnerey/Developer relations version) > Phone > Contacts 2) Tap on 'Contacts picker' > 'Show picker' rotate the device to landscape mode. 3) From step 1 tap on 'Remove contact' > 'Delete via picker' rotate the device to landscape mode. 4) From step 1 tap on 'Contact images' > 'Get image from picker' or 'Remove image via picker' or 'Set image via picker' and rotate the device to landscape mode. 5) From step 1 tap on 'Groups' > 'Add person' or 'Remove person' and rotate the device to landscape mode. Actual result: Part of contact list is hidden under status bar. Expected result: Part of contact list isn't hidden. """"",title+description
