TIMOB-10205,12,"""Android: Window Properties - Click on toggle height width button gives flickering effect.""","""""""Window Properties - Click on toggle height width button gives flickering effect.  This is not regression. It occurs on 2.0.1GA as well.    Steps to Reproduce:  1. Go to Kitchensink> BaseUI> WindowProperties.  2. Click on Toggle Height/Width. The window changes its height width to become smaller.  3. Click again on toggle height width.    Actual:  The window flickers at top left corner of the screen before getting to the original size.    Expected:  Resizing of window should be smooth without any flicker.      """"""",Bug,"Title: Android: Window Properties - Click on toggle height width button gives flickering effect.
