TIMOB-10097,12,"""iOS: ButtonBar - text field focus skips several text field's  rows after buttons """"Next"""" or  """"Previous"""" are pressed""","""""""Description:  While testing ButtonBar I noticed that after buttons """"""""Next"""""""" or """"""""Previous"""""""" are pressed several times on a ButtonBar, focus of a text field """"""""jumps"""""""" over several rows of text fields .     NOTE: this behavior does not occur on iPad or iPad Simulator    This is not a regression, occurs in 2.1.0    Steps to reproduce:  1. Install the attachment  2. Run TIMOB-6463  3. Press on a first text field  4. Press """"""""Next"""""""" several time    Actual result:  The text field focus seems to skip several text fields  Expected result:  the next text field should be focused after button """"""""Next"""""""" is pressed""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: ButtonBar - text field focus skips several text field's rows after buttons """"Next"""" or """"Previous"""" are pressed
Description: """"Description: While testing ButtonBar I noticed that after buttons """"""""Next"""""""" or """"""""Previous"""""""" are pressed several times on a ButtonBar, focus of a text field """"""""jumps"""""""" over several rows of text fields . NOTE: this behavior does not occur on iPad or iPad Simulator This is not a regression, occurs in 2.1.0 Steps to reproduce: 1. Install the attachment 2. Run TIMOB-6463 3. Press on a first text field 4. Press """"""""Next"""""""" several time Actual result: The text field focus seems to skip several text fields Expected result: the next text field should be focused after button """"""""Next"""""""" is pressed""""",title+description
