TIMOB-10094,12,"""iOS: ButtonBar - ButtonBar on a keyboard animates every time  buttons """"Next"""" or  """"Previous"""" pressed""","""""""Description:  While testing ButtonBar I noticed that it animates every time  buttons """"""""Next"""""""" or """"""""Previous"""""""" pressed.   This is not a regression, occurs in 2.1.0    Steps to reproduce:  1. Install the attachment  2. Run TIMOB-6463  3. Press on a first text field  4. Press """"""""Next""""""""or """"""""Previous""""""""button     Actual result:  ButtonBar always animates after pressing buttons    Expected result:  NO animation    """"""",Bug,"Title: iOS: ButtonBar - ButtonBar on a keyboard animates every time buttons """"Next"""" or """"Previous"""" pressed
