TIMOB-10086,12,"""Android: Window: Honeycomb - BackgroundColor of new window not shown when new window opened in a tab""","""""""The BackgroundColor of new window not shown when new window opened in a tab. This happens only on Android Honeycomb and works fine when tested on Froyo, Gingerbread and ICS.    This is not a regression. The issue occurs atleast since 2.0.2    Steps to Reproduce:  1. Create an application with code below  2. Launch the application  3. Under Tab1, Click on 'Open Win3' button    Actual: The win3 opens up under tab1 and has no background color    Expected: The window win3 should open up with blue background color    """"""",Bug,"Title: Android: Window: Honeycomb - BackgroundColor of new window not shown when new window opened in a tab
