TIMOB-9977,12,"""Android: Anvil: ui/ui/webview* tests fail""","""""""Four tests in ui/ui suite fail with 2_1_X branch.  1. webviewEvalJSLockup (only failed on 2.2 emulator): Error: should be: '', was: 'null'  2. webviewBindingAvailable (only failed on 2.2 emulator): Error: should be: 'object', was: 'null'  3. webviewBindingAvailableAfterSetHtml (only failed on 2.2 emulator): Error: should be: 'object', was: 'null'  4. webviewBindingUnavailable (failed on 2.2 emulator, 3.x device, 4.x device): Error: should be: '', was: 'null'""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Anvil: ui/ui/webview* tests fail
Description: """"Four tests in ui/ui suite fail with 2_1_X branch. 1. webviewEvalJSLockup (only failed on 2.2 emulator): Error: should be: '', was: 'null' 2. webviewBindingAvailable (only failed on 2.2 emulator): Error: should be: 'object', was: 'null' 3. webviewBindingAvailableAfterSetHtml (only failed on 2.2 emulator): Error: should be: 'object', was: 'null' 4. webviewBindingUnavailable (failed on 2.2 emulator, 3.x device, 4.x device): Error: should be: '', was: 'null'""""",title+description
TIMOB-9976,12,"""MobileWeb: HttpClient in the MobileWeb drops responseText when error happens""","""""""1. Client make ajax request using HttpClient  2. Server return HTTP error code 4xx (for example 400) with  detail error in the response body    There is no way to get response body because HttpClient perform abort after receiving error.    Here is method abort for HttpClient      So before performing abort on xhr, the responseText should be saved.    """"""",Bug,"Title: MobileWeb: HttpClient in the MobileWeb drops responseText when error happens
Description: """"1. Client make ajax request using HttpClient 2. Server return HTTP error code 4xx (for example 400) with detail error in the response body There is no way to get response body because HttpClient perform abort after receiving error. Here is method abort for HttpClient So before performing abort on xhr, the responseText should be saved. """"",title+description
