TIMOB-9963,12,"""iOS: ImageView not centered inside a ScrollView until you zoom in/out""","""""""h2. Problem description  When putting an ImageView inside a ScrollView, the image is not centered in the ScrollView. When the view is zoomed in/out, the image gets centered.    h2. Steps to reproduce  - Create an app with the code here: http://pastebin.com/ijZGCzPH  - Run the app: the image will be as large as the screen, on top  - Zoom in and zoom out: the image gets centered    h2. Expected behavior  The image is always centered""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: ImageView not centered inside a ScrollView until you zoom in/out
Description: """"h2. Problem description When putting an ImageView inside a ScrollView, the image is not centered in the ScrollView. When the view is zoomed in/out, the image gets centered. h2. Steps to reproduce - Create an app with the code here: http://pastebin.com/ijZGCzPH - Run the app: the image will be as large as the screen, on top - Zoom in and zoom out: the image gets centered h2. Expected behavior The image is always centered""""",title+description
TIMOB-9962,12,"""Android: Tab icon property change not updating icon image shown in tab""","""""""h3. Problem  If you change the icon property of a tab on Android, the icon should change, but it doesn't. This works on iOS but not on Android.    h3. Sample Code  (attached)    h3. Steps to reproduce bug  1. Download and add """"""""smileyicon.png"""""""" (attached) to your resources folder  2. Launch app on android emulator (or on device)  3. navigate to window 1  4. click """"""""toggle tab icon"""""""" button in window 1  5. observe that icon does not change  6. repeat steps on iOS to observe correct behaviour""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Tab icon property change not updating icon image shown in tab
Description: """"h3. Problem If you change the icon property of a tab on Android, the icon should change, but it doesn't. This works on iOS but not on Android. h3. Sample Code (attached) h3. Steps to reproduce bug 1. Download and add """"""""smileyicon.png"""""""" (attached) to your resources folder 2. Launch app on android emulator (or on device) 3. navigate to window 1 4. click """"""""toggle tab icon"""""""" button in window 1 5. observe that icon does not change 6. repeat steps on iOS to observe correct behaviour""""",title+description
