TIMOB-9934,12,"""MobileWeb: Catalog themeable UI elements for graphics designer""","""""""Need to create snapshots of all UI elements that need designing and document some guidelines for each.    The UI elements include:    * Ti.UI.MapView (Annotation only)  * Ti.UI.ActivityIndicator  * Ti.UI.AlertDialog  * Ti.UI.Button  * Ti.UI.MobileWeb.NavigationGroup  * Ti.UI.OptionDialog  * Ti.UI.Picker  * Ti.UI.PickerColumn  * Ti.UI.PickerRow  * Ti.UI.ProgressBar  * Ti.UI.ScrollableView  * Ti.UI.SearchBar  * Ti.UI.Slider  * Ti.UI.Switch  * Ti.UI.Tab  * Ti.UI.TableViewSection  * Ti.UI.Textarea  * Ti.UI.TextField    Optionally there are scrollbars.  """"""",Story,"Title: MobileWeb: Catalog themeable UI elements for graphics designer
Description: """"Need to create snapshots of all UI elements that need designing and document some guidelines for each. The UI elements include: * Ti.UI.MapView (Annotation only) * Ti.UI.ActivityIndicator * Ti.UI.AlertDialog * Ti.UI.Button * Ti.UI.MobileWeb.NavigationGroup * Ti.UI.OptionDialog * Ti.UI.Picker * Ti.UI.PickerColumn * Ti.UI.PickerRow * Ti.UI.ProgressBar * Ti.UI.ScrollableView * Ti.UI.SearchBar * Ti.UI.Slider * Ti.UI.Switch * Ti.UI.Tab * Ti.UI.TableViewSection * Ti.UI.Textarea * Ti.UI.TextField Optionally there are scrollbars. """"",title+description
TIMOB-9932,12,"""iOS: Building an Ipad only project should not produce Arm v6 code""","""""""Since all Ipad devices are based on Arm V7 architecture, there is no reason to produce armv6 and Arm V7 code for 'Ipad only' projects.     advantages :  - we build faster  - we produce way smaller code for Ipad    test :  - build kitchen sink for Ipad or iphone/ipad.  - open KitchenSink-iPad.xcodeproj in xcode  - select KitchenSink-iPad-iPad target , 'Build settings' and check architectures : we have armv6 armv7 (should be armv7 $(ARCHS_STANDARD_32_BIT) only)    """"""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Building an Ipad only project should not produce Arm v6 code
Description: """"Since all Ipad devices are based on Arm V7 architecture, there is no reason to produce armv6 and Arm V7 code for 'Ipad only' projects. advantages : - we build faster - we produce way smaller code for Ipad test : - build kitchen sink for Ipad or iphone/ipad. - open KitchenSink-iPad.xcodeproj in xcode - select KitchenSink-iPad-iPad target , 'Build settings' and check architectures : we have armv6 armv7 (should be armv7 $(ARCHS_STANDARD_32_BIT) only) """"",title+description
