TIMOB-9895,12,"""Android: Slider within table crash on 2.1.0 GA""","""""""h2. Problem description  When a Slider is put inside a TableView, the app crashes with the exception:    [ERROR][TiApplication( 317)] (main) [514,514] Sending event: exception on thread: main msg:java.lang.NumberFormatException: Unable to convert java.lang.Float; Titanium 2.1.0,2012/06/28 12:16,6e3cab6 [ERROR][TiApplication( 317)] java.lang.NumberFormatException: Unable to convert java.lang.Float      h2. Steps to reproduce  1. Create an app with the following code:        2. Run the app using SDK 2.1.0 (both on Emulator or device): the app crashes.      h2. Expected result  The app works without issues    h2. Additional information  The same app works just fine if you run it using SDK 2.0.2 GA. Regression.    h2. Customer ticket  http://support.<USER>com/tickets/APP-266717""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Slider within table crash on 2.1.0 GA
Description: """"h2. Problem description When a Slider is put inside a TableView, the app crashes with the exception: [ERROR][TiApplication( 317)] (main) [514,514] Sending event: exception on thread: main msg:java.lang.NumberFormatException: Unable to convert java.lang.Float; Titanium 2.1.0,2012/06/28 12:16,6e3cab6 [ERROR][TiApplication( 317)] java.lang.NumberFormatException: Unable to convert java.lang.Float h2. Steps to reproduce 1. Create an app with the following code: 2. Run the app using SDK 2.1.0 (both on Emulator or device): the app crashes. h2. Expected result The app works without issues h2. Additional information The same app works just fine if you run it using SDK 2.0.2 GA. Regression. h2. Customer ticket http://support.<USER>com/tickets/APP-266717""""",title+description
