Description: """"Modify build files to ensure GCC_DYNAMIC_NO_PIC=NO and USE_DYNAMIC_NO_PIC=NO""""",title+description
TIMOB-9887,12,"""iOS: Support hintText in Text Area (as Documented)""","""""""h1. Feature  On iOS, there is a documented hintText property for Text Areas. But there is no actual property to back it up.    h2. Reproduction  {code:title=app.js}  var win = Ti.UI.createWindow({ backgroundColor: 'white' });  win.add(Ti.UI.createTextArea({      hintText: 'I Am HINT TEXT! *clang-clang-clang*',      top: 2, right: 2, bottom: 2, left: 2,       textAlign: 'left',      width: 230, height: Ti.UI.SIZE,      color: '#000', backgroundColor: 'transparent',      font: { fontFamily: 'HelveticaNeue-Light', fontSize: 16 },      borderWidth: 3, borderColor: 'transparent'  });  win.open();  {code}    h2. Pull Request  Never mind.""""""",New Feature,"Title: iOS: Support hintText in Text Area (as Documented)
Description: """"h1. Feature On iOS, there is a documented hintText property for Text Areas. But there is no actual property to back it up. h2. Reproduction {code:title=app.js} var win = Ti.UI.createWindow({ backgroundColor: 'white' }); win.add(Ti.UI.createTextArea({ hintText: 'I Am HINT TEXT! *clang-clang-clang*', top: 2, right: 2, bottom: 2, left: 2, textAlign: 'left', width: 230, height: Ti.UI.SIZE, color: '#000', backgroundColor: 'transparent', font: { fontFamily: 'HelveticaNeue-Light', fontSize: 16 }, borderWidth: 3, borderColor: 'transparent' }); win.open(); {code} h2. Pull Request Never mind.""""",title+description
