TIMOB-9861,12,"""Android 2.3.3/2.3.4: Ti.App.fireEvent() and Ti.App.addEventListener() in webView crashes the App""","""""""h3. Problem  When calling Ti.App.fireEvent() or Ti.App.addEventListener() from a webview, it crashes the app.    h3. Sample Code to Reproduce Error:  app.js      global.js      h3. Steps to Reproduce Error  1. Add the code above into respective js files  2. Run on android emulator 2.3.3 or 2.3.4 and any Titanium sdk  3. Watch for crash  """"""",Bug,"Title: Android 2.3.3/2.3.4: Ti.App.fireEvent() and Ti.App.addEventListener() in webView crashes the App
