TIMOB-9855,12,"""MobileWeb: Add MobileWeb.NavigationGroup.hide function (parity issue)""","""""""h4. Feature Description  The customer wants to be able to hide a navigation bar as can do it in android or ios.     Right now, they are using this:    http://docs.<USER>com/titanium/2.0/index.html#!/api/Titanium.UI.MobileWeb.NavigationGroup""""""",New Feature,"Title: MobileWeb: Add MobileWeb.NavigationGroup.hide function (parity issue)
