TIMOB-9854,12,"""MobileWeb: Javascript execution timeout error on Mobileweb""","""""""h4. Problem Description  We are getting this error at times which says 'Javascript execution exceeded timeout' while testing on blackberry device.   The same works fine on the browser in the desktop.     h4. Actual Results  Error on bb's browser saying 'Javascript execution exceeded timeout'    h4. Expected Results  The bb version working fine.    h4. Test Case.  1. Use a BB 9860.  2. Open the browser and type the url included in private comment.   3. Use login/pass from the private comment.   4. Once you launch the app using the url, login using the credentials, sometimes this error occurs while launching the app itself.   5. once logged in, if you are prompted with the security questions, type 'quincy' for all the questions.  6. now click continue  7. you can see the home page with a plan.  8. click on the plan (that is when we are seeing this error all the time, we are not able to go beyond this window )      h4. Extra info   We are testing on Blackberry 9860 (v7.0 Bundle 1950). Also, we are testing with wifi,with remote server.    """"""",Bug,"Title: MobileWeb: Javascript execution timeout error on Mobileweb
Description: """"h4. Problem Description We are getting this error at times which says 'Javascript execution exceeded timeout' while testing on blackberry device. The same works fine on the browser in the desktop. h4. Actual Results Error on bb's browser saying 'Javascript execution exceeded timeout' h4. Expected Results The bb version working fine. h4. Test Case. 1. Use a BB 9860. 2. Open the browser and type the url included in private comment. 3. Use login/pass from the private comment. 4. Once you launch the app using the url, login using the credentials, sometimes this error occurs while launching the app itself. 5. once logged in, if you are prompted with the security questions, type 'quincy' for all the questions. 6. now click continue 7. you can see the home page with a plan. 8. click on the plan (that is when we are seeing this error all the time, we are not able to go beyond this window ) h4. Extra info We are testing on Blackberry 9860 (v7.0 Bundle 1950). Also, we are testing with wifi,with remote server. """"",title+description
TIMOB-9853,12,"""Android: hintText doesn't show in a TextField when textAlign is 'right'""","""""""h4.Problem description  The hintText property of TextField doesn't display the hint text at all if the textAlign property is set to 'right'.    - Broken on Android v2.3.3  - Works on Android ICS  - Works on Android if the textAlign property is not specified or set to 'left'.    h4. Steps to reproduce  In the following example, the left TextField shows the hintText properly.  The right TextField should also show hintText of """"""""Hinted"""""""", but does not.  {panel:title=app.js}{panel}  """"""",Bug,"Title: Android: hintText doesn't show in a TextField when textAlign is 'right'
Description: """"h4.Problem description The hintText property of TextField doesn't display the hint text at all if the textAlign property is set to 'right'. - Broken on Android v2.3.3 - Works on Android ICS - Works on Android if the textAlign property is not specified or set to 'left'. h4. Steps to reproduce In the following example, the left TextField shows the hintText properly. The right TextField should also show hintText of """"""""Hinted"""""""", but does not. {panel:title=app.js}{panel} """"",title+description
