TIMOB-9825,12,"""Android: Animations don't work with 'dp' values""","""""""h3. Problem  When trying to run an animation such as this on Android:    var openAnimation = Ti.UI.createAnimation({left :'35dp',duration : 350});    An error is thrown:  Uncaught Error: unable to parse '35dp' as integer      h3. Steps to Reproduce    Please run the sample code below to reproduce the issue:        Please see the attached screenshot of the error too.""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Animations don't work with 'dp' values
