TIMOB-9744,12,"""TiAPI: Review all the deprecated methods and properties and remove them in 2.2.0 release""",,Story,Title: TiAPI: Review all the deprecated methods and properties and remove them in 2.2.0 release,title-only
TIMOB-9741,12,"""Titanium Studio: Help > Install Specific Titanium SDK: 2.0.1.GA is included in the list, but it was not a valid release""","""""""Install Specific Titanium SDK menu lists 2.0.1.GA, but it is an invalid release.    Steps to Reproduce:    1. Help > Install Specific Titanium SDK...  2. Select 2.0.1.GA.    Actual Result:    2.0.1.GA is on the list.    Expected Result:    Only 2.0.1.GA2 should be on the list, as the other release did not include the required modules.""""""",Bug,"Title: Titanium Studio: Help > Install Specific Titanium SDK: 2.0.1.GA is included in the list, but it was not a valid release
Description: """"Install Specific Titanium SDK menu lists 2.0.1.GA, but it is an invalid release. Steps to Reproduce: 1. Help > Install Specific Titanium SDK... 2. Select 2.0.1.GA. Actual Result: 2.0.1.GA is on the list. Expected Result: Only 2.0.1.GA2 should be on the list, as the other release did not include the required modules.""""",title+description
TIMOB-9740,12,"""iOS: Snow Leopard: build to device fails""","""""""Build to device fails on Snow Leopard with SDK 2.1.    Steps to Reproduce:    1. Create a new Titanium project.  2. Run > iOS Device to build to device.    Actual Result:    Fail with console log.    Expected Result:    App should build.""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Snow Leopard: build to device fails
Description: """"Build to device fails on Snow Leopard with SDK 2.1. Steps to Reproduce: 1. Create a new Titanium project. 2. Run > iOS Device to build to device. Actual Result: Fail with console log. Expected Result: App should build.""""",title+description
TIMOB-9739,12,"""Android: Animation stops working on Android after switching off/on """"Reverse"""" function.""","""""""Description:  Animation stops working on Android after switching off/on """"""""Reverse"""""""" function.    Steps to reproduce:  1. Run the following code on Android:    2. Press """"""""Animate"""""""" button  3. Switch """"""""Reverse"""""""" off and press """"""""Animate""""""""  4. Switch """"""""Reverse"""""""" on and press """"""""Animate""""""""    Actual result:  Animation does not work    Expected result:  Animation should work""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Animation stops working on Android after switching off/on """"Reverse"""" function.
