TIMOB-9731,12,"""Android: setAnnotation and setRegion functions are not working in Android""","""""""setAnnotation and setRegion methods are not working on Android Mapview. Its working fine on iOS.  Run the attached app.js to test the functionality.    Steps to reproduce:  1. Copy the app.js to a sample project.  2. Run it on a Google API's SDK.  3. Click on 'ann1a' and 'ann2a' buttons. Annotations wont get added to the map. ( setAnnotations() are used here).  4. Click on 'ann1b' and 'ann2b' buttons. Annotations get added to the map view. ( addAnnotations() is used here)  5. Same behavior is seen for setRegion and setLocation. ( setLocation works but setRegion does not)    **Added updated test case that also tests the 'userLocation' and 'regionFit' properties.**""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: setAnnotation and setRegion functions are not working in Android
Description: """"setAnnotation and setRegion methods are not working on Android Mapview. Its working fine on iOS. Run the attached app.js to test the functionality. Steps to reproduce: 1. Copy the app.js to a sample project. 2. Run it on a Google API's SDK. 3. Click on 'ann1a' and 'ann2a' buttons. Annotations wont get added to the map. ( setAnnotations() are used here). 4. Click on 'ann1b' and 'ann2b' buttons. Annotations get added to the map view. ( addAnnotations() is used here) 5. Same behavior is seen for setRegion and setLocation. ( setLocation works but setRegion does not) **Added updated test case that also tests the 'userLocation' and 'regionFit' properties.**""""",title+description
