TIMOB-9708,12,"""MobileWeb: BaseUI-->Views-->TableViews-->Table View Scroll Indicators:Tapping on table view scroll indicators does not give us any page with table &  refresh button.""","""""""Tapping on table view scroll indicators does not give us any page with table & refresh button.    Steps to reproduce:    Iphone:  1.Build kitchen sink for mobile web in titanium studio.  2.Type the ip address of your laptop into the mobile device's web browser.(safari for iphone & IE for Windows Phone mango).   3.Hit go or enter.  4.Kitchen sink will fire up in the browser.  5.Tap on Base UI tab.  6.Tap on the Views table row.  7.Tap on the Table Views table row.  8.Tap on the table view scroll indicators table row.    Windows Phone Mango:  1.Unable to execute the test case as we can't scroll down to unhide the table view scroll indicators table row.    Actual result:  1.Tapping on table view scroll indicators does not give us any page with table & refresh button.    Expected result:  1:Tap on the refresh button on the right.scroll down or up.  2:Should see a vertical scroll bar on the right.""""""",Bug,"Title: MobileWeb: BaseUI-->Views-->TableViews-->Table View Scroll Indicators:Tapping on table view scroll indicators does not give us any page with table & refresh button.
Description: """"Tapping on table view scroll indicators does not give us any page with table & refresh button. Steps to reproduce: Iphone: 1.Build kitchen sink for mobile web in titanium studio. 2.Type the ip address of your laptop into the mobile device's web browser.(safari for iphone & IE for Windows Phone mango). 3.Hit go or enter. 4.Kitchen sink will fire up in the browser. 5.Tap on Base UI tab. 6.Tap on the Views table row. 7.Tap on the Table Views table row. 8.Tap on the table view scroll indicators table row. Windows Phone Mango: 1.Unable to execute the test case as we can't scroll down to unhide the table view scroll indicators table row. Actual result: 1.Tapping on table view scroll indicators does not give us any page with table & refresh button. Expected result: 1:Tap on the refresh button on the right.scroll down or up. 2:Should see a vertical scroll bar on the right.""""",title+description
TIMOB-9707,12,"""Anvil: testSocketIO test in network_socket_tcp test suite is incorrect""","""""""Per documentation:   - Read/WriteStreamCallbackArgs.errorState is either 0 or 1.   - Read/WriteStreamCallbackArgs.errorDescription is empty string when no error.   - CreateBufferArgs has value, not data    Correct validation:  """"""",Bug,"Title: Anvil: testSocketIO test in network_socket_tcp test suite is incorrect
Description: """"Per documentation: - Read/WriteStreamCallbackArgs.errorState is either 0 or 1. - Read/WriteStreamCallbackArgs.errorDescription is empty string when no error. - CreateBufferArgs has value, not data Correct validation: """"",title+description
TIMOB-9706,12,"""MobileWeb: BaseUI-->Views-->TableViews-->Refresh Table View:The table takes long time to refresh(7-8 sec) after tapping on refresh button.""","""""""The table takes long time to refresh(7-8 sec) after tapping on refresh button.    Not a Regression, occurs with 2.0.2GA    Steps to reproduce:    Iphone & Android:  1.Build kitchen sink for mobile web in titanium studio.  2.Type the ip address of your laptop into the mobile device's web browser.(safari for iphone & IE for Windows Phone mango).   3.Hit go or enter.  4.Kitchen sink will fire up in the browser.  5.Tap on Base UI tab.  6.Tap on the Views table row.  7.Tap on the Table Views table row.  8.Tap on the refresh table view table row.  9.You will get a page with a table & a refresh button.  10.Tap on the refresh button.  11.Notice that the table disappears for 7-8 sec & then appears again.    Windows Phone Mango:  1.unable to execute the test case as we can't scroll down to unhide the set row data table row.    Actual result:  1.The table takes long time to refresh(7-8 sec) after tapping on refresh button.    Expected result:  1.Tap on the refresh button on the right.  2.The Table view should disappear for a second and appear with the exact view as before.""""""",Bug,"Title: MobileWeb: BaseUI-->Views-->TableViews-->Refresh Table View:The table takes long time to refresh(7-8 sec) after tapping on refresh button.
Description: """"The table takes long time to refresh(7-8 sec) after tapping on refresh button. Not a Regression, occurs with 2.0.2GA Steps to reproduce: Iphone & Android: 1.Build kitchen sink for mobile web in titanium studio. 2.Type the ip address of your laptop into the mobile device's web browser.(safari for iphone & IE for Windows Phone mango). 3.Hit go or enter. 4.Kitchen sink will fire up in the browser. 5.Tap on Base UI tab. 6.Tap on the Views table row. 7.Tap on the Table Views table row. 8.Tap on the refresh table view table row. 9.You will get a page with a table & a refresh button. 10.Tap on the refresh button. 11.Notice that the table disappears for 7-8 sec & then appears again. Windows Phone Mango: 1.unable to execute the test case as we can't scroll down to unhide the set row data table row. Actual result: 1.The table takes long time to refresh(7-8 sec) after tapping on refresh button. Expected result: 1.Tap on the refresh button on the right. 2.The Table view should disappear for a second and appear with the exact view as before.""""",title+description
