TIMOB-9684,12,"""iOS: Video Player -  For VIDEO_SCALING_MODE_FILL scaling mode, video does not scale to complete height until the device is rotated.""","""""""For VIDEO_SCALING_MODE_FILL scaling mode, video does not scale to complete height until the device is rotated.  This is not regression. This issue occurs since 1.8.2    Steps to Reproduce:  1. Create an app using the code below.  2. Launch application and wait till media controls disappear after a few seconds.    Actual:   The video does not scale the complete height of the screen. You can see the background of the screen on the top. But when you rotate the device, that space is occupied by the playing video.    Expected:  The video should scale to the complete height when launched. The behavior should be same on device rotation.    """"""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Video Player - For VIDEO_SCALING_MODE_FILL scaling mode, video does not scale to complete height until the device is rotated.
Description: """"For VIDEO_SCALING_MODE_FILL scaling mode, video does not scale to complete height until the device is rotated. This is not regression. This issue occurs since 1.8.2 Steps to Reproduce: 1. Create an app using the code below. 2. Launch application and wait till media controls disappear after a few seconds. Actual: The video does not scale the complete height of the screen. You can see the background of the screen on the top. But when you rotate the device, that space is occupied by the playing video. Expected: The video should scale to the complete height when launched. The behavior should be same on device rotation. """"",title+description
TIMOB-9683,12,"""Android: Picker: The plain picker is hidden on orientation change on Android Tab""","""""""The picker of type plain is hidden when device changes orientation. The issue occurs on Android Tab    Not a Regression. The issue occurs as far as 1.8.2    Steps to Reproduce:  1. Create an application with code below and launch the application  2. Click on the picker control. The picker options are shown  3. Change the orientation of device    Actual: The picker options are hidden    Expected: The picker should continue to show    """"""",Bug,"Title: Android: Picker: The plain picker is hidden on orientation change on Android Tab
