TIMOB-9681,12,"""MobileWeb: Apps break in IE9 when page is reloaded via address bar""","""""""When an app is reloaded in IE9, there is a JavaScript error because page reloads skip to the DOM ready state which causes the Titanium app to load before the outermost container is created, thus resulting in an error.""""""",Bug,"Title: MobileWeb: Apps break in IE9 when page is reloaded via address bar
Description: """"When an app is reloaded in IE9, there is a JavaScript error because page reloads skip to the DOM ready state which causes the Titanium app to load before the outermost container is created, thus resulting in an error.""""",title+description
TIMOB-9680,12,"""Android: Textfield: The focus on textfield does not happen through textfield focus method""","""""""The focus method on the textfield does not get focus on the textfield.    Not a regression. This also occurs on 2.0.2    Steps to Reproduce:  1. Open Kitchen Application  2. Go to Control -> Textfield -> Events  3. Click on blur button  4. Click on Focus button    Actual: The focus on the text field does not happen    Expected: The text field should get focus on click of focus button""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Textfield: The focus on textfield does not happen through textfield focus method
