TIMOB-9678,12,"""MobileWeb: BaseUI-->Views-->event interaction:Clicking on the label does not give us """" you were able to click label.Good!"""" message.""","""""""Clicking on the label does not give us """""""" you were able to click label.Good!"""""""" message.    Not a Regression, occurs with 2.0.2GA    Steps to reproduce:  1.Build kitchen sink for mobile web in titanium studio.  2.Type the ip address of your laptop into the mobile device's web browser.(safari for iphone & IE for Windows Phone mango).   3.Hit go or enter.  4.Kitchen sink will fire up in the browser.  5.Tap on Base UI tab.  6.Tap on the Views table row.  7.Tap on the Event Interactions table row.  8.Tap on the Click on me label in the box.    Actual result:  1.Clicking on the label does not give us """""""" you were able to click label.Good!"""""""" message.    Expected result:  1.Tapping on 'click on me'should give me the message """"""""you were able to click label.Good!"""""""" message.""""""",Bug,"Title: MobileWeb: BaseUI-->Views-->event interaction:Clicking on the label does not give us """" you were able to click label.Good!"""" message.
