TIMOB-9664,12,"""KitchenSink: Views - Buttons """"Add"""", """"Change"""" and """"Jump"""" are missing from a toolbar on Kindle Fire""","""""""Description:  Buttons """"""""Add"""""""", """"""""Change"""""""" and """"""""Jump"""""""" are missing from a toolbar on Kindle Fire.  This is a regression, does not occur on 2.0.2.    Steps to reproduce:  1. Run KitchenSink-Nook  2. Go to Base UI - Views - Scroll Views - Scrollable View    Actual result:  Should see the toolbar with """"""""Change"""""""",""""""""Add"""""""",""""""""Jump"""""""" buttons    Expected result:  Buttons are missing from the toolbar""""""",Bug,"Title: KitchenSink: Views - Buttons """"Add"""", """"Change"""" and """"Jump"""" are missing from a toolbar on Kindle Fire
