TIMOB-9646,12,"""MobileWeb: Phone-->Contacts-->Contacts Picker:The different proporties buttons are cutoff at the bottom edge.""","""""""The different proporties buttons are cutoff at the bottom edge.    Not a Regression, occurs with 2.0.2GA    Steps to reproduce:    Iphone:  1.Build kitchen sink for mobile web in titanium studio.  2.Type the ip address of your laptop into the mobile device's web browser.(safari for iphone & IE for Windows Phone mango).   3.Hit go or enter.  4.Kitchen sink will fire up in the browser.  5.Tap on phone tab.  6.Tap on the contacts table row.  7.Tap on the contact picker table row.  8.Notice that the buttons for animated,address only,stop on person,stop on proporties are cutoff at the bottom edge.    Windows Phone Mango:  1.Unable to scroll the page down thus cant unhide the contacts table row.Thus,further execution of the test case is blocked.    Actual result:  1.The buttons for animated,address only,stop on person,stop on proporties are cutoff at the bottom edge.    Expected result:  1.The buttons should not be cutoff at the bottom edge.""""""",Bug,"Title: MobileWeb: Phone-->Contacts-->Contacts Picker:The different proporties buttons are cutoff at the bottom edge.
Description: """"The different proporties buttons are cutoff at the bottom edge. Not a Regression, occurs with 2.0.2GA Steps to reproduce: Iphone: 1.Build kitchen sink for mobile web in titanium studio. 2.Type the ip address of your laptop into the mobile device's web browser.(safari for iphone & IE for Windows Phone mango). 3.Hit go or enter. 4.Kitchen sink will fire up in the browser. 5.Tap on phone tab. 6.Tap on the contacts table row. 7.Tap on the contact picker table row. 8.Notice that the buttons for animated,address only,stop on person,stop on proporties are cutoff at the bottom edge. Windows Phone Mango: 1.Unable to scroll the page down thus cant unhide the contacts table row.Thus,further execution of the test case is blocked. Actual result: 1.The buttons for animated,address only,stop on person,stop on proporties are cutoff at the bottom edge. Expected result: 1.The buttons should not be cutoff at the bottom edge.""""",title+description
