TIMOB-9642,12,"""MobileWeb: Phone-->Contacts-->Contacts Picker:Selecting respective proporties & tapping on show picker does not give us any list to select people from.""","""""""Selecting respective proporties & tapping on show picker does not give us any list to select people from.    Not a Regression, occurs with 2.0.2GA    Steps to reproduce:    Iphone:  1.Build kitchen sink for mobile web in titanium studio.  2.Type the ip address of your laptop into the mobile device's web browser.(safari for iphone & IE for Windows Phone mango).   3.Hit go or enter.  4.Kitchen sink will fire up in the browser.  5.Tap on phone tab.  6.Tap on the contacts table row.  7.Tap on the contact picker table row.  8.Select the appropriate proporties using the buttons(make sure stop on person is ON).  9.Tap on show picker.  10.Notice that we do not get any list to select contacts from.    Windows Phone Mango:  1.Unable to scroll the page down thus cant unhide the contacts table row.Thus,further execution of the test case is blocked.    Actual result:  1.Selecting respective proporties & tapping on show picker does not show us any list to select contacts from.    Expected result:  1.Tapping on show picker should give us a list to select people from.  2.Tap on any contact.  3.You should see the selected name on the screen.  4.Tap on stop on property.  5.Tap on show picker & select a contact from the list.  6.You should get info of the selected contact on the screen.""""""",Bug,"Title: MobileWeb: Phone-->Contacts-->Contacts Picker:Selecting respective proporties & tapping on show picker does not give us any list to select people from.
Description: """"Selecting respective proporties & tapping on show picker does not give us any list to select people from. Not a Regression, occurs with 2.0.2GA Steps to reproduce: Iphone: 1.Build kitchen sink for mobile web in titanium studio. 2.Type the ip address of your laptop into the mobile device's web browser.(safari for iphone & IE for Windows Phone mango). 3.Hit go or enter. 4.Kitchen sink will fire up in the browser. 5.Tap on phone tab. 6.Tap on the contacts table row. 7.Tap on the contact picker table row. 8.Select the appropriate proporties using the buttons(make sure stop on person is ON). 9.Tap on show picker. 10.Notice that we do not get any list to select contacts from. Windows Phone Mango: 1.Unable to scroll the page down thus cant unhide the contacts table row.Thus,further execution of the test case is blocked. Actual result: 1.Selecting respective proporties & tapping on show picker does not show us any list to select contacts from. Expected result: 1.Tapping on show picker should give us a list to select people from. 2.Tap on any contact. 3.You should see the selected name on the screen. 4.Tap on stop on property. 5.Tap on show picker & select a contact from the list. 6.You should get info of the selected contact on the screen.""""",title+description
TIMOB-9641,12,"""MobileWeb: Phone-->PhotoGallery:Tapping on photo gallery table row does not open up anything.""","""""""Tapping on photo gallery does not open up anything.    Not a Regression, occurs with 2.0.2GA    Steps to reproduce:  1.Build kitchen sink for mobile web in titanium studio.  2.Type the ip address of your laptop into the mobile device's web browser.(safari for iphone).   3.Hit go or enter.  4.Kitchen sink will fire up in the browser.  5.Tap on phone tab.  6.Tap on the Photo Gallery table row.  7.You will see that nothing happens & we do not get any page further.    Actual result:  1.Tapping on photo gallery does not open up anything.    Expected result:  1.Tapping on Photo Gallery should open up a page with a prompt to select a photo.  2.You should see the photo in the window view.  3.Move & scale down the photo & then tap on Use.  4.You should get in the console message like [INFO] PHOTO GALLERY SUCCESS cropRect.x cropRect.y cropRect.height cropRect.width.  """"""",Bug,"Title: MobileWeb: Phone-->PhotoGallery:Tapping on photo gallery table row does not open up anything.
Description: """"Tapping on photo gallery does not open up anything. Not a Regression, occurs with 2.0.2GA Steps to reproduce: 1.Build kitchen sink for mobile web in titanium studio. 2.Type the ip address of your laptop into the mobile device's web browser.(safari for iphone). 3.Hit go or enter. 4.Kitchen sink will fire up in the browser. 5.Tap on phone tab. 6.Tap on the Photo Gallery table row. 7.You will see that nothing happens & we do not get any page further. Actual result: 1.Tapping on photo gallery does not open up anything. Expected result: 1.Tapping on Photo Gallery should open up a page with a prompt to select a photo. 2.You should see the photo in the window view. 3.Move & scale down the photo & then tap on Use. 4.You should get in the console message like [INFO] PHOTO GALLERY SUCCESS cropRect.x cropRect.y cropRect.height cropRect.width. """"",title+description
