TIMOB-9638,12,"""MobileWeb: Phone-->Sound-->Remote Streaming:Tapping on 'Remote Streaming' table row gives us application error page on Windows Phone(Mango).""","""""""Tapping on 'Remote Streaming' table row gives us application error page on Windows Phone(Mango).    Not a Regression, occurs with 2.0.2GA    Steps to reproduce:  1.Build kitchen sink for mobile web in titanium studio.  2.Type the ip address of your laptop into the mobile device's web browser.(IE for windows phone).   3.Hit go or enter.  4.Kitchen sink will fire up in the browser.  5.Tap on phone tab.  6.Tap on the sound table row.  7.Now tap on the 'remote streaming' table row.  7.You will see that nothing happens & we do not get any child pages,but an application error page.    Actual result:  1.Tapping on 'Remote Streaming' table row gives us application error page on Windows Phone(Mango).    Expected result:  1.Tapping on sound table row should give us a child page with buttons""""""""Start streaming"""""""",""""""""Pause Streaming"""""""",""""""""Unpause Streaming"""""""",""""""""Stop Stream"""""""",""""""""Small buffer"""""""", """"""""Default buffer"""""""" and """"""""Large buffer"""""""" on it.""""""",Bug,"Title: MobileWeb: Phone-->Sound-->Remote Streaming:Tapping on 'Remote Streaming' table row gives us application error page on Windows Phone(Mango).
Description: """"Tapping on 'Remote Streaming' table row gives us application error page on Windows Phone(Mango). Not a Regression, occurs with 2.0.2GA Steps to reproduce: 1.Build kitchen sink for mobile web in titanium studio. 2.Type the ip address of your laptop into the mobile device's web browser.(IE for windows phone). 3.Hit go or enter. 4.Kitchen sink will fire up in the browser. 5.Tap on phone tab. 6.Tap on the sound table row. 7.Now tap on the 'remote streaming' table row. 7.You will see that nothing happens & we do not get any child pages,but an application error page. Actual result: 1.Tapping on 'Remote Streaming' table row gives us application error page on Windows Phone(Mango). Expected result: 1.Tapping on sound table row should give us a child page with buttons""""""""Start streaming"""""""",""""""""Pause Streaming"""""""",""""""""Unpause Streaming"""""""",""""""""Stop Stream"""""""",""""""""Small buffer"""""""", """"""""Default buffer"""""""" and """"""""Large buffer"""""""" on it.""""",title+description
TIMOB-9637,12,"""MobileWeb:Phone-->Sound-->Remote Streaming:Tapping on Sound table row does not give us any child pages on Iphone 4.3.5""","""""""Tapping on Sound table row does not give us any child pages on Iphone 4.3.5 thus cant proceed with the test case.    Not a Regression, occurs with 2.0.2GA    Steps to reproduce:  1.Build kitchen sink for mobile web in titanium studio.  2.Type the ip address of your laptop into the mobile device's web browser.(safari for iphone).   3.Hit go or enter.  4.Kitchen sink will fire up in the browser.  5.Tap on phone tab.  6.Tap on the sound table row.  7.You will see that nothing happens & we do not get any child pages.    Actual result:  1.Tapping on sound table row does not give us any child pages.    Expected result:  1.Tapping on sound table row should give us the child pages like local,local with file,local with file URL,remote URL & Remote Streaming.""""""",Bug,"Title: MobileWeb:Phone-->Sound-->Remote Streaming:Tapping on Sound table row does not give us any child pages on Iphone 4.3.5
Description: """"Tapping on Sound table row does not give us any child pages on Iphone 4.3.5 thus cant proceed with the test case. Not a Regression, occurs with 2.0.2GA Steps to reproduce: 1.Build kitchen sink for mobile web in titanium studio. 2.Type the ip address of your laptop into the mobile device's web browser.(safari for iphone). 3.Hit go or enter. 4.Kitchen sink will fire up in the browser. 5.Tap on phone tab. 6.Tap on the sound table row. 7.You will see that nothing happens & we do not get any child pages. Actual result: 1.Tapping on sound table row does not give us any child pages. Expected result: 1.Tapping on sound table row should give us the child pages like local,local with file,local with file URL,remote URL & Remote Streaming.""""",title+description
