TIMOB-9625,12,"""Mobile Web:Phone-->Play Movie-->Remote Streaming:The movie completes , the screen remains blank & we do not get an alert for 'Movie complete'.""","""""""The movie completes,the screen remains blank & we do not get an alert for 'Movie complete'.    Not a Regression, occurs with 2.0.2GA    Steps to reproduce:  1.Build kitchen sink for mobile web in titanium studio.  2.Type the ip address of your laptop into the mobile device's web browser.(safari for iphone & IE for windows phone).   3.Hit go or enter.  4.Kitchen sink will fire up in the browser.  5.Tap on phone tab.  6.Tap on the Play Movie table row.  7.Tap on the remote streaming table row.  8.You will see that the movie starts playing.  9.Let the movie complete.  10.After the movie completes,the screen remains blank & we do not get an alert for movie complete.    Actual result:  1.After the movie completes,the screen remains blank & we do not get an alert for 'Movie complete'.    Expected result:  1.We should get an alert 'movie complete'.""""""",Bug,"Title: Mobile Web:Phone-->Play Movie-->Remote Streaming:The movie completes , the screen remains blank & we do not get an alert for 'Movie complete'.
Description: """"The movie completes,the screen remains blank & we do not get an alert for 'Movie complete'. Not a Regression, occurs with 2.0.2GA Steps to reproduce: 1.Build kitchen sink for mobile web in titanium studio. 2.Type the ip address of your laptop into the mobile device's web browser.(safari for iphone & IE for windows phone). 3.Hit go or enter. 4.Kitchen sink will fire up in the browser. 5.Tap on phone tab. 6.Tap on the Play Movie table row. 7.Tap on the remote streaming table row. 8.You will see that the movie starts playing. 9.Let the movie complete. 10.After the movie completes,the screen remains blank & we do not get an alert for movie complete. Actual result: 1.After the movie completes,the screen remains blank & we do not get an alert for 'Movie complete'. Expected result: 1.We should get an alert 'movie complete'.""""",title+description
TIMOB-9624,12,"""MobileWeb:Platform-->XML RSS:Tapping on 'XML RSS' does not give us any web content in RSS format.""","""""""Tapping on 'XML RSS' does not give us any web content in RSS format.    Not a Regression, occurs with 2.0.2GA    Steps to reproduce:    Iphone 4.3.5:  1.Build kitchen sink for mobile web in titanium studio.  2.Type the ip address of your laptop into the mobile device's web browser.(safari for iphone & IE for windows phone).   3.Hit go or enter.  4.Kitchen sink will fire up in the browser.  5.Tap on platform tab.  6.Tap on the XML RSS table row.    Windows Phone Mango:  1.We cant unhide the XML RSS table row as we cant scroll down the page.Thus cant execute the test case.    Actual result:  1.Tapping on 'XML RSS' does not give us any web content in RSS format.    Expected result:  1.Should get a web content in RSS format.""""""",Bug,"Title: MobileWeb:Platform-->XML RSS:Tapping on 'XML RSS' does not give us any web content in RSS format.
Description: """"Tapping on 'XML RSS' does not give us any web content in RSS format. Not a Regression, occurs with 2.0.2GA Steps to reproduce: Iphone 4.3.5: 1.Build kitchen sink for mobile web in titanium studio. 2.Type the ip address of your laptop into the mobile device's web browser.(safari for iphone & IE for windows phone). 3.Hit go or enter. 4.Kitchen sink will fire up in the browser. 5.Tap on platform tab. 6.Tap on the XML RSS table row. Windows Phone Mango: 1.We cant unhide the XML RSS table row as we cant scroll down the page.Thus cant execute the test case. Actual result: 1.Tapping on 'XML RSS' does not give us any web content in RSS format. Expected result: 1.Should get a web content in RSS format.""""",title+description
TIMOB-9623,12,"""Tooling: add post-project-creation ipad support to projects""","""""""If a project is created without iOS as a deployment target, then iPad (without iPhone) is added as a target via the TiApp Overview, the project will not build to iPad.    Console Log:        Studio Debug Log:        Steps to Reproduce:    1. Create a Titanium Mobile project with only MobileWeb support.  2. Select iPad in the TiApp Editor Overview and save tiapp.xml.  3. Deploy to iPad Simulator.    Result:    iPad project fails to build.    Expected Result:    iPad project should build.""""""",Bug,"Title: Tooling: add post-project-creation ipad support to projects
Description: """"If a project is created without iOS as a deployment target, then iPad (without iPhone) is added as a target via the TiApp Overview, the project will not build to iPad. Console Log: Studio Debug Log: Steps to Reproduce: 1. Create a Titanium Mobile project with only MobileWeb support. 2. Select iPad in the TiApp Editor Overview and save tiapp.xml. 3. Deploy to iPad Simulator. Result: iPad project fails to build. Expected Result: iPad project should build.""""",title+description
