TIMOB-9609,12,"""MobileWeb:Platform-->XHR-->XHR proporties:Tapping on the XML proporties table row does not do give us any xml proporties.""","""""""Tapping on the XML proporties table row does not do give us any xml proporties.    Not a Regression, occurs with 2.0.2GA    Steps to reproduce:  1.Build kitchen sink for mobile web in titanium studio.  2.Type the ip address of your laptop into the mobile device's web browser.(safari for iphone & IE for windows phone).   3.Hit go or enter.  4.Kitchen sink will fire up in the browser.  5.Tap on platform tab.  6.Tap on the XHR table row.  7.Tap on the XML proporties table row.  8.Notice that we do not get any page or screen with XML proporties on it.    Actual result:  1.We do not get any screen or page with XML proporties on it on tapping the XML proporties table row.    Expected result:  1.Tapping on the XML proporties table row gives us a screen with XML data on it & the """"""""response text"""""""" and """"""""response XML"""""""" should be """"""""null"""""""".""""""",Bug,"Title: MobileWeb:Platform-->XHR-->XHR proporties:Tapping on the XML proporties table row does not do give us any xml proporties.
Description: """"Tapping on the XML proporties table row does not do give us any xml proporties. Not a Regression, occurs with 2.0.2GA Steps to reproduce: 1.Build kitchen sink for mobile web in titanium studio. 2.Type the ip address of your laptop into the mobile device's web browser.(safari for iphone & IE for windows phone). 3.Hit go or enter. 4.Kitchen sink will fire up in the browser. 5.Tap on platform tab. 6.Tap on the XHR table row. 7.Tap on the XML proporties table row. 8.Notice that we do not get any page or screen with XML proporties on it. Actual result: 1.We do not get any screen or page with XML proporties on it on tapping the XML proporties table row. Expected result: 1.Tapping on the XML proporties table row gives us a screen with XML data on it & the """"""""response text"""""""" and """"""""response XML"""""""" should be """"""""null"""""""".""""",title+description
TIMOB-9608,12,"""MobileWeb: Ti.Network.HTTPClient aborts when making async request""","""""""When making an asynchronous HTTP request, the request aborts immediately after the 'send' call. The reason is that the setTimeout call is not setting a timeout value due to incorrect parenthesis. At line 115 in HTTPClient.js, the following code:    should be    [Notice the change in the closing parentheses]  """"""",Bug,"Title: MobileWeb: Ti.Network.HTTPClient aborts when making async request
Description: """"When making an asynchronous HTTP request, the request aborts immediately after the 'send' call. The reason is that the setTimeout call is not setting a timeout value due to incorrect parenthesis. At line 115 in HTTPClient.js, the following code: should be [Notice the change in the closing parentheses] """"",title+description
TIMOB-9607,12,"""iOS:Sound:Executing stop,pause and then stop method crashes app.""","""""""This is not a regression.It exists since 2.0.1.  Steps to reproduce  1)Navigate to KitchenSink: Phone:Sound-Local  2)Press stop  3)Press pause   4)Again press stop    Expected result:  Nothing should happen and user should stay in the app.    Actual result:  The app crashes.""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS:Sound:Executing stop,pause and then stop method crashes app.
Description: """"This is not a regression.It exists since 2.0.1. Steps to reproduce 1)Navigate to KitchenSink: Phone:Sound-Local 2)Press stop 3)Press pause 4)Again press stop Expected result: Nothing should happen and user should stay in the app. Actual result: The app crashes.""""",title+description
