Description: """"Labels appended in horizontal layout disappear in landscape mode. This is not regression. This issue occurs since 1.8.X. Steps to reproduce: 1. Got to Kitchensink > BaseUI >Horizontal layout. It displays three labels appended horizontally. 2. Change orientation of the device to landscape. Actual: Labels disappear from the screen. Expected: Labels should be visible in landscape mode also. """"",title+description
