TIMOB-9592,12,"""Android: Webview: The load event of webview is called twice for invalid url""","""""""The load event for a webview is fired twice for invalid url.    This is not a regression. This occurs as far as 1.8.2    The issue does not occur on Android 2.2, 2.3 but occurs on 3.2 and 4.0.2    Steps to reproduce:  1. Create app with the code belo  2. Launch app on android device    Actual: The alert for Loaded is shown twice    Expected: The alert should be shown only once i.e. load event should fire only once for invalid url    """"""",Bug,"Title: Android: Webview: The load event of webview is called twice for invalid url
