Description: """"Description: Set orientation resets by itself in 1-2 seconds. This is regression, does not occur in 2.0.2. Steps to reproduce: 1. Run KitchenSink 2. Go to Phone - Orientation 3. If you are running app in portrait mode press """"""""SetLandscape"""""""", if in landscape - press """"""""SetPortrait"""""""" Expected result: Orientation should be set and not reset by itself Actual result: Orientation is set, but in 1-2 seconds resets by itself""""",title+description
