TIMOB-9496,12,"""Android:Click on different tabs in KS shows """"Appcelerator Titanium 2.1.0"""" label ""","""""""Clicking on different tabs in KS shows """"""""<USER>Titanium 2.1.0"""""""" label     Regression,does not occur on 2.0.2    Steps to Reproduce:    1. Run KitchenSink  2. Click on different tabs (example: Base UI,Controls)    Actual result:  On opening any TAB  for the first time, it shows a label """"""""<USER>Titanium 2.1.0""""""""    Expected result:  Should not see the label """"""""<USER>Titanium 2.1.0"""""""" on every TAB,it should just be shown when the KitchenSink is launched for the first tIME""""""",Bug,"Title: Android:Click on different tabs in KS shows """"Appcelerator Titanium 2.1.0"""" label
