Description: """"h2. Problem description Adding a listener for the 'close' event inside an 'open' event is not working. Other events (e.g. 'click' works fine) h2. Steps to reproduce 1. create an app with the code below 2. open the app and click on the button: a new window opens 3. click the back button: the close event is not fired h2. Additional Notes Note that the event is not added at all: calling a different function inside the 'open' event works just find; also, replacing 'close' with 'click' works fine. Customer ticket: http://support.<USER>com/tickets/APP-646612 """"",title+description
