TIMOB-9280,12,"""Android: Scrollview+Textfields is not working properly (The textfield/view hides behind the keyboard, instead of scroll to be on top of the keyboard).""","""""""h4. Problem Description  When customer uses scrollview to show several textfields, the textfields at the bottom won't be seen when clicked, since they hide under the softkeyboard.     h4. Actual Results  The textfield in the scrollview is hidden under the keyboard.    h4. Expected Results  The textfield scrolling properly, so you can see the textfield on top of the keyboard.    h4. TestCase  1. Create mobile project.  2. Paste this app.js:    3. Run it in a device (See extra info to see where is not working).  4. Click on the bottom textfield.  5. See that you can type, but you can't see what you typing    h4. Extra info  We tested this case, and it's working in some cases, in others don't:    Working fine:   Android emulator - Works fine.  Acer Iconia A500 - OS 3.2 - Working Fine  Motorola Droid 1, running 2.2.3 - Working fine  Motorola Droid 3 with Android 2.3.4 - Working fine.    Failing:   htc sprint slider device - PG06100, OS ver 2.2 - Does not work fine  samsung galaxy Nexus - OS ver 4.0.2 - Does not work fine  Motorola MB860 - OS ver 2.3.4 - Does not work fine  htc spring non slider device PC36100 - OS ver 2.2 - Does not work fine    """"""",Bug,"Title: Android: Scrollview+Textfields is not working properly (The textfield/view hides behind the keyboard, instead of scroll to be on top of the keyboard).
Description: """"h4. Problem Description When customer uses scrollview to show several textfields, the textfields at the bottom won't be seen when clicked, since they hide under the softkeyboard. h4. Actual Results The textfield in the scrollview is hidden under the keyboard. h4. Expected Results The textfield scrolling properly, so you can see the textfield on top of the keyboard. h4. TestCase 1. Create mobile project. 2. Paste this app.js: 3. Run it in a device (See extra info to see where is not working). 4. Click on the bottom textfield. 5. See that you can type, but you can't see what you typing h4. Extra info We tested this case, and it's working in some cases, in others don't: Working fine: Android emulator - Works fine. Acer Iconia A500 - OS 3.2 - Working Fine Motorola Droid 1, running 2.2.3 - Working fine Motorola Droid 3 with Android 2.3.4 - Working fine. Failing: htc sprint slider device - PG06100, OS ver 2.2 - Does not work fine samsung galaxy Nexus - OS ver 4.0.2 - Does not work fine Motorola MB860 - OS ver 2.3.4 - Does not work fine htc spring non slider device PC36100 - OS ver 2.2 - Does not work fine """"",title+description
