TIMOB-9260,12,"""iOS: Image positions to the top/left corner after zooming/pinching""","""""""h3. Problem    When zoom/pinching the image on editing part after taking picture, the image position itself to the upper left corner part of the scrollable view.    h3. Sample Code    Please run the attached sample project.    The image does not position to the center when zooming in.     h3. Steps to reproduce    1. Run the app on device    2. Choose the option to select photo from library.    3. Select any image and try to pinch it.    4. The image always shifts towards top left on every pinch/zoom    This video also shows how to reproduce the issue: http://youtu.be/_EOC6Amp3fQ""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Image positions to the top/left corner after zooming/pinching
Description: """"h3. Problem When zoom/pinching the image on editing part after taking picture, the image position itself to the upper left corner part of the scrollable view. h3. Sample Code Please run the attached sample project. The image does not position to the center when zooming in. h3. Steps to reproduce 1. Run the app on device 2. Choose the option to select photo from library. 3. Select any image and try to pinch it. 4. The image always shifts towards top left on every pinch/zoom This video also shows how to reproduce the issue: http://youtu.be/_EOC6Amp3fQ""""",title+description
TIMOB-9229,12,"""Android: Certain devices aren't able to survive on activity relaunch - splash screen hangs""","""""""h6.Issue  Once an app has been put into the background after going back it hangs in splash screen.    h6.Tested on  LG ally 2.2 (stack trace below) > it shows a black screen then app gets restarted  Razr 2.3.5 (stack trace below) > it returns to the latest window working as expected     h6.Steps to reproduce  1. Build & Run an app  2. Hit the Home key   3. Expect more-less 30 minutes   4. Go back to the Titanium app    h6.tiapp.xml        h3.Stack Trace - LG ally 2.2      h3.Stack trace - Razr 2.3.5          h2.Device where splash screen is hanging  LG Optimus running 2.2.2, it was stuck on the splash screen after trying to relaunch the app after half an hour.     h4.Here are the logs for this test:      """"""",Bug,"Title: Android: Certain devices aren't able to survive on activity relaunch - splash screen hangs
Description: """"h6.Issue Once an app has been put into the background after going back it hangs in splash screen. h6.Tested on LG ally 2.2 (stack trace below) > it shows a black screen then app gets restarted Razr 2.3.5 (stack trace below) > it returns to the latest window working as expected h6.Steps to reproduce 1. Build & Run an app 2. Hit the Home key 3. Expect more-less 30 minutes 4. Go back to the Titanium app h6.tiapp.xml h3.Stack Trace - LG ally 2.2 h3.Stack trace - Razr 2.3.5 h2.Device where splash screen is hanging LG Optimus running 2.2.2, it was stuck on the splash screen after trying to relaunch the app after half an hour. h4.Here are the logs for this test: """"",title+description
