TIMOB-9195,12,"""Android: imageView Rotation always starts over from 0 degrees""","""""""h2. Problem description  Animating an imageView on Android with a rotation. Each time the imageView animation is triggered, it starts over from 0 instead of going on from the last position.    On iOS it works continually as expected.    h2. Sample code (imageView file in attachment)        h2. Customer ticket  http://support-admin.<USER>com/display/APP-563796""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: imageView Rotation always starts over from 0 degrees
