TIMOB-9152,12,"""Android: Deployment: Android Emulator intermittently fails with error type 2""","""""""When an app is deployed to emulator, the deployment intermittently fails with error.    Error type 2  android.util.AndroidException: Can't connect to activity manager; is the system running?   at com.android.commands.am.Am.run(Am.java:97)   at com.android.commands.am.Am.main(Am.java:78)   at com.android.internal.os.RuntimeInit.finishInit(Native Method)   at com.android.internal.os.RuntimeInit.main(RuntimeInit.java:238)   at dalvik.system.NativeStart.main(Native Method)    Steps to Reproduce:    1. Run default app on Android emulator.    Expected Result:    App runs.    Actual Result:    Deployment intermittently fails with error.""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Deployment: Android Emulator intermittently fails with error type 2
