TIMOB-9150,12,"""Tooling: Titanium Studio can not make android module ""","""""""h4. Problem Description  I create Titanium Mobile Module project using studio. And try to make it. Got an error.    h4. Actual Results  The default module is not building just out of the box    h4. Expected Results  The default module compiling without any issues.    h4. Test Case  1. Create a new mobile module for Android.  2. Set NDK  3. Build    h4. Extra info    When compiling the module, you got this:            h4. Workaround  1. After creating your module, if you don't rename your Workspace to something without spaces, you will need to move your project to a directory without spaces.   2. Once you moved it, just type: ant and will automatically build. Right now, with Ti Studio, I created a new module, edit the build.properties to add the ndk:    """"""",Bug,"Title: Tooling: Titanium Studio can not make android module
Description: """"h4. Problem Description I create Titanium Mobile Module project using studio. And try to make it. Got an error. h4. Actual Results The default module is not building just out of the box h4. Expected Results The default module compiling without any issues. h4. Test Case 1. Create a new mobile module for Android. 2. Set NDK 3. Build h4. Extra info When compiling the module, you got this: h4. Workaround 1. After creating your module, if you don't rename your Workspace to something without spaces, you will need to move your project to a directory without spaces. 2. Once you moved it, just type: ant and will automatically build. Right now, with Ti Studio, I created a new module, edit the build.properties to add the ndk: """"",title+description
TIMOB-9149,12,"""iOS: Osascript - Cannot find executable for CFBundle""","""""""Hi,  I've downloaded a new Version of Titanium Studio (2.0.1.201204132053) on OS X Lion 10.7.3, I've installed Xcode 4.3.1 But i have problems running a simple Test Application on the iPhone Simulator, I always get this error message:    [INFO] One moment, building ...  [INFO] Titanium SDK version: 2.0.1 (04/12/12 16:33 999c68a)  [INFO] iPhone Device family: universal  [INFO] iPhone SDK version: 5.1  [INFO] iPhone simulated device: iphone  [INFO] Compiling localization files  [INFO] Launching application in Simulator  2012-05-07 00:28:50.925 osascript[20854:f07] Cannot find executable for CFBundle 0x7f9e5b432b30 </Library/ScriptingAdditions/SIMBL.osax> (not loaded)  osascript: OpenScripting.framework - scripting addition """"""""/Library/ScriptingAdditions/SIMBL.osax"""""""" declares no loadable handlers.  [INFO] Launched application in Simulator (5.31 seconds)  [INFO] Application started  [INFO] test1/1.0 (2.0.1.GA2.999c68a)  [INFO] Application has exited from Simulator    What's goin on? I couldn't find any solutions through Google :(      Best regards,  <USER>""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Osascript - Cannot find executable for CFBundle
Description: """"Hi, I've downloaded a new Version of Titanium Studio (2.0.1.201204132053) on OS X Lion 10.7.3, I've installed Xcode 4.3.1 But i have problems running a simple Test Application on the iPhone Simulator, I always get this error message: [INFO] One moment, building ... [INFO] Titanium SDK version: 2.0.1 (04/12/12 16:33 999c68a) [INFO] iPhone Device family: universal [INFO] iPhone SDK version: 5.1 [INFO] iPhone simulated device: iphone [INFO] Compiling localization files [INFO] Launching application in Simulator 2012-05-07 00:28:50.925 osascript[20854:f07] Cannot find executable for CFBundle 0x7f9e5b432b30 </Library/ScriptingAdditions/SIMBL.osax> (not loaded) osascript: OpenScripting.framework - scripting addition """"""""/Library/ScriptingAdditions/SIMBL.osax"""""""" declares no loadable handlers. [INFO] Launched application in Simulator (5.31 seconds) [INFO] Application started [INFO] test1/1.0 (2.0.1.GA2.999c68a) [INFO] Application has exited from Simulator What's goin on? I couldn't find any solutions through Google :( Best regards, <USER>""",title+description
