TIMOB-9117,12,"""iOS: Titanium.Window - The normal window appears in incorrect mode""","""""""Description:  The normal window appears in incorrect mode if device orientation is landscape.  This issue occurs on 2.0.1 as well.    Steps to reproduce:    1. Run the following code:    2. Press """"""""Open modal""""""""  3. Rotate device to the landscape mode  4. Press """"""""Open win"""""""" button    Expected result:  The normal window should appear in correct mode    Actual result:  The normal window appears in incorrect mode (see attachment)""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Titanium.Window - The normal window appears in incorrect mode
