TIMOB-9059,12,"""iOS: Facebook Login - If you login to Facebook, the default language is set to Indonesian""","""""""Details: While testing a feature for ACS, I noticed when you login to Facebook, the default language will be set to Indonesian. You can get around this by switching to English at the bottom of the login screen.    Steps to reproduce:  1. Get and launch KS from 2_0_X branch  2. Go to Mashups > Login/Logout  3. Press Login with Facebook    Actual: Login window will appear in Indonesian. See attachments.  Expected: Login window should appear in English or the default language set by developer.    Note: This is *not* a regression. Appears in 1.8.2 and 2.0.1.GA2.""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Facebook Login - If you login to Facebook, the default language is set to Indonesian
Description: """"Details: While testing a feature for ACS, I noticed when you login to Facebook, the default language will be set to Indonesian. You can get around this by switching to English at the bottom of the login screen. Steps to reproduce: 1. Get and launch KS from 2_0_X branch 2. Go to Mashups > Login/Logout 3. Press Login with Facebook Actual: Login window will appear in Indonesian. See attachments. Expected: Login window should appear in English or the default language set by developer. Note: This is *not* a regression. Appears in 1.8.2 and 2.0.1.GA2.""""",title+description
