TIMOB-9056,12,"""Android: Textfields in a TableViewRow are losing focus in sliding android phones (physical keyboard)""","""""""h4. Problem Description  Customer has been putting a bunch of textfields in rows inside a table. This is working nice in general, except when the device has an external keyboard (slider models, like HTC PG06100). We are looking for a possible fix in the platform or workaround in order to get the focus properly in each textfield.    h4. Actual results  The textfield is not getting the focus in the bottom of the tableview.    h4. Expected results   All textfields getting focus across all the textfields.    h4. Test Case  1. Create a mobile project  2. Paste this code:      h4. Extra info  Needs to be reproduced with a slider phone""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Textfields in a TableViewRow are losing focus in sliding android phones (physical keyboard)
