Description: """"h4. Problem description When you add an event to the TableViewRow, you don't get the source of which tableviewrow was pressed. The customer wants to select/deselect a checkbox in a row, just with clicking on the row. h4. Actual Results The event is not getting the source of the event. h4. Expected Results The event behave the same as with 1.7.6 h4. Test Case 1. Create a new mobile Project 2. Paste this: h4. Extra info This used to work properly in 1.7.6, but now in 2.1CI it's not working as before. """"",title+description
