TIMOB-8992,12,"""Ti API: Create consistent volume properties for all player types.""","""""""Right now only the Sound API has the ability to set volume. There have been numerous requests to provide the same functionality for AudioPlayer, VideoPlayer and Recording.    h3. Media Player Volume Test Case        1. Create an application with the above source code.  2. Be sure to place media files in your Resources folder (ex: music.mp4, sound.wav)  3. Go through each tab which includes a test for each media player type.  4. Start the media by clicking the button. Try adjusting the volume. It should change as you move the slider.  5. Repeat for the next tab and so forth.""""""",New Feature,"Title: Ti API: Create consistent volume properties for all player types.
Description: """"Right now only the Sound API has the ability to set volume. There have been numerous requests to provide the same functionality for AudioPlayer, VideoPlayer and Recording. h3. Media Player Volume Test Case 1. Create an application with the above source code. 2. Be sure to place media files in your Resources folder (ex: music.mp4, sound.wav) 3. Go through each tab which includes a test for each media player type. 4. Start the media by clicking the button. Try adjusting the volume. It should change as you move the slider. 5. Repeat for the next tab and so forth.""""",title+description
TIMOB-8991,12,"""MobileWeb: Add config option to force a minimum duration the splash screen is displayed""","""""""In many cases, the splash screen displays for too short of a time. There needs to be a tiapp.xml config param to force the splash screen to display for X number of milliseconds. Defaults to go as fast as possible.""""""",New Feature,"Title: MobileWeb: Add config option to force a minimum duration the splash screen is displayed
Description: """"In many cases, the splash screen displays for too short of a time. There needs to be a tiapp.xml config param to force the splash screen to display for X number of milliseconds. Defaults to go as fast as possible.""""",title+description
