TIMOB-8967,12,"""iOS: Compiler/Titanium needs to warn if <ios> section of tiapp.xml is malformed""","""""""h4. Problem Description  If the <ios> section of tiapp.xml is malformed, compiling completely fails... as in, build.log doesn't even get reset from the previous build, and the Ti Studio log shows nothing. The console outputs this:  {code}  [INFO] One moment, building ...  Traceback (most recent call last):  {code}    h4. Test case  Here's a sample of malformed code:  {code:xml}      <ios>       <plist>     <key>CFBundleDisplayName</key>     <string>New Eng Inn</string>     <key>UISupportedInterfaceOrientations</key>     <array>      <string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortrait</string>      <string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortraitUpsideDown</string>     </array>       </plist>      </ios>  {code}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Compiler/Titanium needs to warn if <ios> section of tiapp.xml is malformed
Description: """"h4. Problem Description If the <ios> section of tiapp.xml is malformed, compiling completely fails... as in, build.log doesn't even get reset from the previous build, and the Ti Studio log shows nothing. The console outputs this: {code} [INFO] One moment, building ... Traceback (most recent call last): {code} h4. Test case Here's a sample of malformed code: {code:xml} <ios> <plist> <key>CFBundleDisplayName</key> <string>New Eng Inn</string> <key>UISupportedInterfaceOrientations</key> <array> <string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortrait</string> <string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortraitUpsideDown</string> </array> </plist> </ios> {code}""""",title+description
