TIMOB-8912,12,"""Android: Device rotation while device is locked causes the app to disengage from the filesystem""","""""""PROBLEM  If a device is rotated in while in the locked mode, the app disengages from the filesystem.    TEST STEPS  APK can be found here:  https://<USER>teamworkpm.net/files/95446  1) Open up the app, login to load tickets.  2) While the app is opened up (anywhere in it is fine, but I was leaving it on the ticket summary), put the device to sleep  3) Now wake up the device and while the device is on the lock screen, rotate it!    EXPECTED RESULTS  The app would resume and rotate without losing data.    ACTUAL RESULTS  Data is removed from the app resulting in parts of the screen (columns of data) to disappear.  Please see attached log file at 13:25:25  """"""",Bug,"Title: Android: Device rotation while device is locked causes the app to disengage from the filesystem
Description: """"PROBLEM If a device is rotated in while in the locked mode, the app disengages from the filesystem. TEST STEPS APK can be found here: https://<USER>teamworkpm.net/files/95446 1) Open up the app, login to load tickets. 2) While the app is opened up (anywhere in it is fine, but I was leaving it on the ticket summary), put the device to sleep 3) Now wake up the device and while the device is on the lock screen, rotate it! EXPECTED RESULTS The app would resume and rotate without losing data. ACTUAL RESULTS Data is removed from the app resulting in parts of the screen (columns of data) to disappear. Please see attached log file at 13:25:25 """"",title+description
