TIMOB-8687,12,"""Android: KS TextField > The Rest: Input field does not show clear button""","""""""On KS>Controls>TextField>The Rest - clear button is not displayed on the input field when 'Clear Button','Clear Button(A)','Clear Button(F)','Clear Button(B)'button is pressed.    Steps to Reproduce:  1:enter text in input field  1:tap on 'Clear Button'  2:tap on 'Clear Button(A)  3:tap on 'Clear Button(N),tap on the input field to focus.  4:tap on 'Clear Button(F)  5:tap on 'Clear Button(B)    Actual Result  : clear button don't get displayed on the input field when required  Expected Result: tap on 'Clear Button' Should make visible the button on the input field.                   tap on 'Clear Button(A)' should make the button invisible on the input field.                   tap on 'Clear Button(N)' should make visible the button on the input field, on focus                   tap on 'Clear Button(F)' should make button visible on the input field,on Blur                   tap on 'Clear Button(B)' should make button visible on the input field                                      """"""",Bug,"Title: Android: KS TextField > The Rest: Input field does not show clear button
Description: """"On KS>Controls>TextField>The Rest - clear button is not displayed on the input field when 'Clear Button','Clear Button(A)','Clear Button(F)','Clear Button(B)'button is pressed. Steps to Reproduce: 1:enter text in input field 1:tap on 'Clear Button' 2:tap on 'Clear Button(A) 3:tap on 'Clear Button(N),tap on the input field to focus. 4:tap on 'Clear Button(F) 5:tap on 'Clear Button(B) Actual Result : clear button don't get displayed on the input field when required Expected Result: tap on 'Clear Button' Should make visible the button on the input field. tap on 'Clear Button(A)' should make the button invisible on the input field. tap on 'Clear Button(N)' should make visible the button on the input field, on focus tap on 'Clear Button(F)' should make button visible on the input field,on Blur tap on 'Clear Button(B)' should make button visible on the input field """"",title+description
TIMOB-8686,12,"""Android: Tab: ICS Tabs display extra overlay""","""""""Steps to reproduce:  1. Create a TiMobile project  2. Launch project to emulator/device running 4.0    Actual: An overlay appears underneath the tab. Not noticeable on device but, very noticeable on emulators. See emu_4_0.png.  Expected: An overlay should not appear. See emu_2_2.png    Note:  * Tested only with v8  * Cosmetic bug appears in 1.8.2, 2.0.0.GA, and 2.0.1.v20120410103239 builds  * Cosmetic bug does not appear in emulators/devices running sdk 2.2, 2.3, and 3.0""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Tab: ICS Tabs display extra overlay
Description: """"Steps to reproduce: 1. Create a TiMobile project 2. Launch project to emulator/device running 4.0 Actual: An overlay appears underneath the tab. Not noticeable on device but, very noticeable on emulators. See emu_4_0.png. Expected: An overlay should not appear. See emu_2_2.png Note: * Tested only with v8 * Cosmetic bug appears in 1.8.2, 2.0.0.GA, and 2.0.1.v20120410103239 builds * Cosmetic bug does not appear in emulators/devices running sdk 2.2, 2.3, and 3.0""""",title+description
