Description: """"h3. Problem Setting top=null on the view causes bottom to not be recognized h3. Steps to Reproduce Run the sample code below: On 1.8.2 the """"""""green"""""""" view fills up the entire window(screenshot1) but on the 2.0 CI, with top=null and bottom as 0, the view still is at the top instead of anchoring in the bottom (screenshot2)""""",title+description
