TIMOB-8642,12,"""iOS: hide and show view with vertical layout will redraw the view with layout absolute""","""""""h6.Issue  When we hide an show view with vertical layout it redraw the view with layout absolute.    h6.Steps to reproduce  1. Click the window (yellow area)  2. Watch out the view    h6.Expected behavior  View being shown as per it's layout settings    h6.Repro sequence  - app.js  """"""",Bug,"Title: iOS: hide and show view with vertical layout will redraw the view with layout absolute
