TIMOB-8616,12,"""iOS: Swipe event's direction returns 'unknown' when it was 'left' or 'right'""","""""""h3. Problem    The swipe event listener is returning a direction with a value of 'unknown' instead of the 'left' or 'right'. This is with build: Apr 5 2012 15:35 rd56dc6a6 of the 1.8.3 SDK.    The last build of the 1.8.3 that worked was Apr 2 2012 16:18 rb763622c.    h3. Steps to Reproduce    1. Run the code sample below:        2. Click in red view and swipe. On simulator, 'unknown' is printed out to the console.""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Swipe event's direction returns 'unknown' when it was 'left' or 'right'
