TIMOB-8552,12,"""iOS: Add functionality to provisioner.py to support just parsing a .mobileprovision file""","""""""To improve Studio performance when loading/reloading provisioning profile information, it would make sense to only extract information from a provisioning profile without installing the profile. Currently the provisioner.py does the following:    1. Extracts information from the profile  2. Starts Xcode and installs the profile  3. Sleeps 1.5 seconds before shutting down Xcode    Studio performance would improve if there is a mechanism to just perform step 1""""""",New Feature,"Title: iOS: Add functionality to provisioner.py to support just parsing a .mobileprovision file
Description: """"To improve Studio performance when loading/reloading provisioning profile information, it would make sense to only extract information from a provisioning profile without installing the profile. Currently the provisioner.py does the following: 1. Extracts information from the profile 2. Starts Xcode and installs the profile 3. Sleeps 1.5 seconds before shutting down Xcode Studio performance would improve if there is a mechanism to just perform step 1""""",title+description
