TIMOB-8507,12,"""Android: density specific resolution images for launcher icon are not used""","""""""h2. Problem description  Density specific launcher icons are not used. Icons included in platform/res/drawable-<res>/ folders are not used.    h2. Steps to reproduce  As described in https://wiki.<USER>org/display/guides/Using+density-specific+resources+on+Android#Usingdensity-specificresourcesonAndroid-Theappicon  , folders for specific icons resolutions are created.     Different versions of myAppicon.png file is put inside each folder, however only the file icon specified in TiAPP.xml (<icon>/path-to-icon/myAppicon.png</icon>) is actually used. Other versions (set with the same name) inside res/drawable folder are ignored.    Same result if using the default appicon.png filename    h2. Additional notes  Customer ticket link: http://support-admin.<USER>com/display/APP-536715""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: density specific resolution images for launcher icon are not used
Description: """"h2. Problem description Density specific launcher icons are not used. Icons included in platform/res/drawable-<res>/ folders are not used. h2. Steps to reproduce As described in https://wiki.<USER>org/display/guides/Using+density-specific+resources+on+Android#Usingdensity-specificresourcesonAndroid-Theappicon , folders for specific icons resolutions are created. Different versions of myAppicon.png file is put inside each folder, however only the file icon specified in TiAPP.xml (<icon>/path-to-icon/myAppicon.png</icon>) is actually used. Other versions (set with the same name) inside res/drawable folder are ignored. Same result if using the default appicon.png filename h2. Additional notes Customer ticket link: http://support-admin.<USER>com/display/APP-536715""""",title+description
