TIMOB-8426,12,"""Android: add a click event listener for plain Pickers""","""""""h2. Request description    Customer requirement is to have an additional event on 'Ti.UI.PICKER_TYPE_PLAIN' Pickers.    The new event should indicate that the user clicked on the picker (when it's in its combo-box-looking state). This would fire before the list-of-choices appears, triggering a function following a 'click' event.      h2. Additional notes  Customer ticket: http://support-admin.<USER>com/display/APP-433276  iOS parity ticket: http://jira.<USER>org/browse/TIMOB-8427    Testing steps:  1. Run this code:     2. Click on Picker, you should see log indicating click event was fired.""""""",New Feature,"Title: Android: add a click event listener for plain Pickers
