TIMOB-8421,12,"""MobileWeb: Sizes in millimeters interpreted incorrectly""","""""""When adding a view with a size specified in points (mm), the view is sized in centimeters, instead.    In the following code sample, the blue and red boxes should be the same size, as on iOS. See attached screenshots.    """"""",Bug,"Title: MobileWeb: Sizes in millimeters interpreted incorrectly
