TIMOB-8412,12,"""iOS: Gallery - Unable to save to Gallery from XHR on iPod 3rd gen with 4.0.2""","""""""Description:  Unable to save to Gallery a Titanium logo on iPod 3rd gen with 4.0.2.  Also occurs on this device on 1.8.2.    Steps:  1. Run KitchenSink  2. Go to Phone-Save to Gallery-From XHR    Expected result:  Should get an alert """"""""Check your photo gallery for a titanium logo"""""""" and should find the titanium logo in Photo Gallery.    Actual result:  No alert, no titanium logo in Gallery""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Gallery - Unable to save to Gallery from XHR on iPod 3rd gen with 4.0.2
