TIMOB-8385,12,"""Android:Orientation -v8: Splash Screen is not appearing On Device when in Landscape mode""","""""""Splash Screen is not appearing On Device in landscape mode    Steps To Reproduce:    1. Launch app in landscape mode    app.js      Expected Result:Splash screen should appear in portrait mode, but the app.js screen should appear in landscape mode    Actual Result: 1. Splash screen is not appearing in landscape mode, but appeared in potrait mode.  2. On Android tab, the splash screen shows up in both the modes""""""",Bug,"Title: Android:Orientation -v8: Splash Screen is not appearing On Device when in Landscape mode
