TIMOB-8352,12,"""MobileWeb: Templates: In the Master Detail view, clicking on the empty space at the bottom will display the previous selected item ""","""""""Steps to reproduce:  1. Create a new project with Master Detail Template  2. Run as """"""""Mobile Web Preview in Browser"""""""" or """"""""Mobile Web Preview in Emulator""""""""  3. Click on an item then press Back  4. Click the large white space at the bottom of the list    Actual: Previously selected item appears.  Expected: No selected item should appear.""""""",Bug,"Title: MobileWeb: Templates: In the Master Detail view, clicking on the empty space at the bottom will display the previous selected item
