TIMOB-8350,12,"""iOS: OptionsDialog - Hide function does not work ""","""""""Description:  While testing OptionsDialog, I noticed, that after click on """"""""Show w/hide, animated"""""""" and """"""""Show w/hide, nonanimated"""""""" buttons, options dialog shown, but not hidden.   Also tested on 1.8.2 iPod 4.3.5 and found the same issue.    Steps:  1. Run KitchenSink  2. Go to Base UI-Views-Options Dialog  3. Click on """"""""Show w/hide, animated""""""""  4. Click on """"""""Show w/hide, nonanimated""""""""    Expected result:  Options dialog should be shown and hidden in 2 seconds.    Actual result:  Options dialog shown, but not hidden.""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: OptionsDialog - Hide function does not work
Description: """"Description: While testing OptionsDialog, I noticed, that after click on """"""""Show w/hide, animated"""""""" and """"""""Show w/hide, nonanimated"""""""" buttons, options dialog shown, but not hidden. Also tested on 1.8.2 iPod 4.3.5 and found the same issue. Steps: 1. Run KitchenSink 2. Go to Base UI-Views-Options Dialog 3. Click on """"""""Show w/hide, animated"""""""" 4. Click on """"""""Show w/hide, nonanimated"""""""" Expected result: Options dialog should be shown and hidden in 2 seconds. Actual result: Options dialog shown, but not hidden.""""",title+description
