TIMOB-8328,12,"""Mobileweb: Ti.UI.Label doesn't handle string values for `fontSize`""","""""""h2. Problem    Mobileweb does not translate string values for {{fontSize}} into the appropriate integer values. Android and iOS do this automatically. This likely impacts other properties, but this is how it surfaced for me.    h2. Test Case         The result on Android and iOS will be a label with a font size of 32. On mobileweb, I'm guessing it doesn't recognize the string value and then just uses the default font size to display the label. Changing {{'32'}} to simply {{32}} allows mobileweb to resize correctly. """"""",Bug,"Title: Mobileweb: Ti.UI.Label doesn't handle string values for `fontSize`
Description: """"h2. Problem Mobileweb does not translate string values for {{fontSize}} into the appropriate integer values. Android and iOS do this automatically. This likely impacts other properties, but this is how it surfaced for me. h2. Test Case The result on Android and iOS will be a label with a font size of 32. On mobileweb, I'm guessing it doesn't recognize the string value and then just uses the default font size to display the label. Changing {{'32'}} to simply {{32}} allows mobileweb to resize correctly. """"",title+description
