TIMOB-8277,12,"""MobileWeb: TextField: When """"Editable"""" is set to off, adding or deleting a character adds and then delete instead of doing nothing""","""""""Steps to Reproduce:  1. Launch KS to device  2. Run Controls > Text Area > Basic   3. Click on Toggle """"""""editable""""""""  4. Click on the text field to invoke keyboard  5. Add or delete characters    Actual:  See that the characters are getting displayed and then deleted or deleted and then added back    Expected:  Should do nothing    Note:  Does not occur on iPad 3 (5.1)""""""",Bug,"Title: MobileWeb: TextField: When """"Editable"""" is set to off, adding or deleting a character adds and then delete instead of doing nothing
