TIMOB-8267,12,"""Android: App crashes when reusing a WebView instance on an Activity window""","""""""Application crashes on reopening a web view button (Titanium.UI.WebView Acceptance TIMOB-4357)    Steps To Reproduce:    1. Launch app on Android device or emulator  2. Navigate to acceptance tab and run timob_4357  3. Press the open WebView button  4. Press the back hardware button  5. Press the open WebView button again.    Expected Result:  After Step 5: App should not crash    Actual Result:  After Step 5, the app crashes.    app.js    """"""",Bug,"Title: Android: App crashes when reusing a WebView instance on an Activity window
