TIMOB-8266,12,"""MobileWeb: Copy default splash assets into Resouces/mobileweb during new project creation""","""""""When a new mobile web project is created, it needs to copy the default splash screen assets into the Resources/mobileweb directory.    During the compile <USER> needs to try to read in the files in that directory before resorting back to the default splash dir.""""""",Bug,"Title: MobileWeb: Copy default splash assets into Resouces/mobileweb during new project creation
Description: """"When a new mobile web project is created, it needs to copy the default splash screen assets into the Resources/mobileweb directory. During the compile <USER> needs to try to read in the files in that directory before resorting back to the default splash dir.""""",title+description
