TIMOB-8239,12,"""Investigate refactor of Gesture module""","""""""Investigate refactor of Gesture module.  The functionality of the Gesture module is arguably lacking and some features that might belong in this module live in other places.  We need to define what role the Gesture module should play and what specific features belong in it.  Keep in mind what features can be cross platform and which may need to be namespace to be platform specific.  How much deprecation and moving of existing features will this involve?    Define requirements list first.""""""",Story,"Title: Investigate refactor of Gesture module
Description: """"Investigate refactor of Gesture module. The functionality of the Gesture module is arguably lacking and some features that might belong in this module live in other places. We need to define what role the Gesture module should play and what specific features belong in it. Keep in mind what features can be cross platform and which may need to be namespace to be platform specific. How much deprecation and moving of existing features will this involve? Define requirements list first.""""",title+description
TIMOB-8238,12,"""Titanium Mobile Template: Template.HTML: cover image is missing on Mobile Web""",,Bug,Title: Titanium Mobile Template: Template.HTML: cover image is missing on Mobile Web,title-only
TIMOB-8237,12,"""Investigate new unit test harness""","""""""Investigate a ground up reboot of the unit test harness mechanism for titanium.  This is a drillbit replacement and should work across platforms and be able to tie into appropriate simulators or devices as needed.  Keep in mind how tests are added, managed, etc.  Can this be automated?  With other research tasks, defining requirements list is the first step.""""""",Story,"Title: Investigate new unit test harness
Description: """"Investigate a ground up reboot of the unit test harness mechanism for titanium. This is a drillbit replacement and should work across platforms and be able to tie into appropriate simulators or devices as needed. Keep in mind how tests are added, managed, etc. Can this be automated? With other research tasks, defining requirements list is the first step.""""",title+description
TIMOB-8236,12,"""Investigate tooling reboot""","""""""We need to take a ground up look at our tooling framework.  1)  Define requirements list for new build mechanism (developer interface should ideally be consistent across platform)  2)  Research technical limitations or hurdles associated with new feature set  3)  estimate effort and impact / integration""""""",Story,"Title: Investigate tooling reboot
Description: """"We need to take a ground up look at our tooling framework. 1) Define requirements list for new build mechanism (developer interface should ideally be consistent across platform) 2) Research technical limitations or hurdles associated with new feature set 3) estimate effort and impact / integration""""",title+description
TIMOB-8235,12,"""Mobileweb: Implement Ti.UI.EmailDialog.addAttachment()""","""""""Implement {{Ti.UI.EmailDialog.addAttachment()}} for mobileweb for parity with Android and iOS""""""",New Feature,"Title: Mobileweb: Implement Ti.UI.EmailDialog.addAttachment()
Description: """"Implement {{Ti.UI.EmailDialog.addAttachment()}} for mobileweb for parity with Android and iOS""""",title+description
TIMOB-8234,12,"""Investigate HTTP refactor""","""""""With 2.3 Android, a new HTTP mechanism was introduced that gives us much greater power and flexibility.  We should investigate a full HTTP client refactor to address existing problems and re-evaluate the exposed API in order to provider a better interface for developers, increase maintainability and improve stability / performance.  This should first involve a overall parity and feature set discussion with iOS and other platform to settle on what the API should be (not simply a discussion of what's currently there).  Once the feature set is defined, we can evaluate how this can be incorporated into the existing API or if it should live alongside.""""""",Story,"Title: Investigate HTTP refactor
Description: """"With 2.3 Android, a new HTTP mechanism was introduced that gives us much greater power and flexibility. We should investigate a full HTTP client refactor to address existing problems and re-evaluate the exposed API in order to provider a better interface for developers, increase maintainability and improve stability / performance. This should first involve a overall parity and feature set discussion with iOS and other platform to settle on what the API should be (not simply a discussion of what's currently there). Once the feature set is defined, we can evaluate how this can be incorporated into the existing API or if it should live alongside.""""",title+description
TIMOB-8233,12,"""MobileWeb: Remove outdated mobile web specific kitchen sink.""","""""""Need to remove the old KitchenSink-MobileWeb. It is out of date and unsupported.""""""",New Feature,"Title: MobileWeb: Remove outdated mobile web specific kitchen sink.
Description: """"Need to remove the old KitchenSink-MobileWeb. It is out of date and unsupported.""""",title+description
TIMOB-8232,12,"""TiAPI:  investigate supporting UI fragments""","""""""Investigate the addition of UI fragments introduced by Android.  Could this be a cross platform feature?  What is the impact on the existing UI system.  What are new use cases for this feature?""""""",Story,"Title: TiAPI: investigate supporting UI fragments
Description: """"Investigate the addition of UI fragments introduced by Android. Could this be a cross platform feature? What is the impact on the existing UI system. What are new use cases for this feature?""""",title+description
TIMOB-8230,12,"""Implement a cross-platform common C binding layer for JavaScript""","""""""Investigate the technical feasibility and usefulness of a cross platform C binding layer.  Keep in mind existing in use runtimes for titanium, other runtimes in existence and what come down the pipeline the future if we try and incorporate a new runtime later (IE:  think about lowest common denominator to a degree).    At least two subtasks:    # Spec out common layer  # Provide initial common layer implementation""""""",New Feature,"Title: Implement a cross-platform common C binding layer for JavaScript
Description: """"Investigate the technical feasibility and usefulness of a cross platform C binding layer. Keep in mind existing in use runtimes for titanium, other runtimes in existence and what come down the pipeline the future if we try and incorporate a new runtime later (IE: think about lowest common denominator to a degree). At least two subtasks: # Spec out common layer # Provide initial common layer implementation""""",title+description
TIMOB-8229,12,"""Define line between core and modules""","""""""We need to define where a cross platform line should be draw between what is core functionality (will be present in every titanium application regardless of module inclusion) across all platforms (present and future).""""""",Story,"Title: Define line between core and modules
Description: """"We need to define where a cross platform line should be draw between what is core functionality (will be present in every titanium application regardless of module inclusion) across all platforms (present and future).""""",title+description
