TIMOB-8216,12,"""Android: Can't force orientation mode in the AndroidManifest anymore""","""""""h4. Problem Description  When following the instructions from https://wiki.<USER>org/display/guides/Orientation#Orientation-LockingorientationonAndroid and adding the Portrait only mode to the window, the app doesn't force the user to be in that mode.     h4. Actual results  The screen changes orientation.    h4. Expected results  The screen be fixed in one orientation.    h4. Extra info.  This used to work just fine in 1.7.x""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Can't force orientation mode in the AndroidManifest anymore
Description: """"h4. Problem Description When following the instructions from https://wiki.<USER>org/display/guides/Orientation#Orientation-LockingorientationonAndroid and adding the Portrait only mode to the window, the app doesn't force the user to be in that mode. h4. Actual results The screen changes orientation. h4. Expected results The screen be fixed in one orientation. h4. Extra info. This used to work just fine in 1.7.x""""",title+description
