TIMOB-8201,12,"""Android Titanium.Utils - v8 :Runtime error on running the Application.""","""""""Application throws runtime error on being run.    Steps to reproduce:  1. Run app.    Acceptance.js      App.js        Expected results:  A white screen should be displayed and the app should not crash.    Actual:  Application throws runtime error(Please find the screenshots attached for v8(device-2012-03-22-164623.png) and rhino(3630_rhino.png)).""""""",Bug,"Title: Android Titanium.Utils - v8 :Runtime error on running the Application.
