TIMOB-8188,12,"""Android: The produced APK includes the source code of the app in clear""","""""""h4. Problem Description  After you compile your program to a device, you will get an apk. If you unzip if, you will be able to find the Resources directory, with the source code in clear.    h4. Actual Results  The source code is included in the apk. If you copy that to a new project, you will be able to <USER>it.    h4. Expected results  When distributing, the source code should be either bytecompiled or scrambled.    h4. Test case  1. Create a new mobile project.  2. Compile it.  3. unzip the apk.    """"""",Bug,"Title: Android: The produced APK includes the source code of the app in clear
Description: """"h4. Problem Description After you compile your program to a device, you will get an apk. If you unzip if, you will be able to find the Resources directory, with the source code in clear. h4. Actual Results The source code is included in the apk. If you copy that to a new project, you will be able to <USER>it. h4. Expected results When distributing, the source code should be either bytecompiled or scrambled. h4. Test case 1. Create a new mobile project. 2. Compile it. 3. unzip the apk. """"",title+description
TIMOB-8187,12,"""iOS: Facebook - Attempts to publish status and wall post with GRAPH API on Facebook failed""","""""""Description:  Attempts to publish status with GRAPH API and to publish post with GRAPH API on Facebook failed.   Getting an alert: """"""""FAIL; The operation couldn't be completed. (facebookErrDomain error 10000.)""""""""  Also occurs on 1.8.2    Steps:  1. Run KitchenSink  2. Go to Mashups-Facebook-Publish Stream  3. Login to Facebook with <USER>username and password  4. Write something in FB status field and press """"""""Publish status with GRAPH API""""""""  5. Press """"""""Publish wall post with GRAPH API""""""""    Expected result:  Should get alert with Success message    Actual result:  Getting an alert with Fail message""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Facebook - Attempts to publish status and wall post with GRAPH API on Facebook failed
Description: """"Description: Attempts to publish status with GRAPH API and to publish post with GRAPH API on Facebook failed. Getting an alert: """"""""FAIL; The operation couldn't be completed. (facebookErrDomain error 10000.)"""""""" Also occurs on 1.8.2 Steps: 1. Run KitchenSink 2. Go to Mashups-Facebook-Publish Stream 3. Login to Facebook with <USER>username and password 4. Write something in FB status field and press """"""""Publish status with GRAPH API"""""""" 5. Press """"""""Publish wall post with GRAPH API"""""""" Expected result: Should get alert with Success message Actual result: Getting an alert with Fail message""""",title+description
