Description: """"To reproduce: run the Todo List sample on mobile web""""",title+description
TIMOB-8175,12,"""Titanium Mobile Sample: Sample.RSS: needs a back button on the new opened window on Mobile Web""","""""""Steps to reproduce:  1. run the RSS sample on mobile web  2. Thumbnail images are not shown in the main table view. (Expected result: the images should show)  3. After clicking one table row, it will open a new webpage but there is no way to go back to the main table view. (Expected result: should have a button to go back)""""""",Bug,"Title: Titanium Mobile Sample: Sample.RSS: needs a back button on the new opened window on Mobile Web
