TIMOB-8161,12,"""Templates/Samples: Review and fix templates and samples from Android / iOS / MobileWeb platforms""","""""""h4.Three Templates:  ||device\template||Master/Detail Application||Tabbed Application||Single Window Application||HTML-based Application||  |Android 2.3 device|{color:green}pass{color} (v8 & rhino)|{color:green}pass{color} (v8 & rhino)|{color:green}pass{color} (v8 & rhino)|{color:green}pass{color} (v8 & rhino)|  |iphone 4s device|{color:green}pass{color}|{color:green}pass{color}|{color:green}pass{color}|{color:green}pass{color}|  |Mobile Web (preview in browser)|After clicking one table row, it will open a new webpage but there is no way to go back to the main table view. (TIMOB-8170)|When the app launches, it pops up an alert """"""""Mobile web is not yet supported by this template"""""""". The template runs fine in the browser. (TIMOB-8169) {color:red}Crash on Studio build 2.0.1.201203260123.{color} (TIMOB-8307)|{color:green}pass on Studio build 2.0.1.201203202049{color}. {color:red}Crash on Studio build 2.0.1.201203260123.{color} (TIMOB-8307)|The cover image does not show in the browser. (TIMOB-8238)|      h4.Three Samples:  ||device\sample||Geocoder||RSS Reader||Todo List||  |Android 2.3 device|map annotation is not a red pin but a red dot (v8 & rhino)|{color:green}pass{color} (v8 & rhino)|{color:green}pass{color} (v8 & rhino)|  |iphone 4s device|{color:green}pass{color}|{color:green}pass{color}|{color:green}pass{color}|  |Mobile Web (preview in browser)|Not working in the browser. (TIMOB-8189)|Mobile web loads a local xml file. Thumbnail images are not shown in the main table view. After clicking one table row, it will open a new webpage but there is no way to go back to the main table view. (TIMOB-8175)|When the app launches, it pops up an alert """"""""Mobile web is not yet supported by this template"""""""". The sample does not run in the browser. (TIMOB-8177)|""""""",Story,"Title: Templates/Samples: Review and fix templates and samples from Android / iOS / MobileWeb platforms
Description: """"h4.Three Templates: ||device\template||Master/Detail Application||Tabbed Application||Single Window Application||HTML-based Application|| |Android 2.3 device|{color:green}pass{color} (v8 & rhino)|{color:green}pass{color} (v8 & rhino)|{color:green}pass{color} (v8 & rhino)|{color:green}pass{color} (v8 & rhino)| |iphone 4s device|{color:green}pass{color}|{color:green}pass{color}|{color:green}pass{color}|{color:green}pass{color}| |Mobile Web (preview in browser)|After clicking one table row, it will open a new webpage but there is no way to go back to the main table view. (TIMOB-8170)|When the app launches, it pops up an alert """"""""Mobile web is not yet supported by this template"""""""". The template runs fine in the browser. (TIMOB-8169) {color:red}Crash on Studio build 2.0.1.201203260123.{color} (TIMOB-8307)|{color:green}pass on Studio build 2.0.1.201203202049{color}. {color:red}Crash on Studio build 2.0.1.201203260123.{color} (TIMOB-8307)|The cover image does not show in the browser. (TIMOB-8238)| h4.Three Samples: ||device\sample||Geocoder||RSS Reader||Todo List|| |Android 2.3 device|map annotation is not a red pin but a red dot (v8 & rhino)|{color:green}pass{color} (v8 & rhino)|{color:green}pass{color} (v8 & rhino)| |iphone 4s device|{color:green}pass{color}|{color:green}pass{color}|{color:green}pass{color}| |Mobile Web (preview in browser)|Not working in the browser. (TIMOB-8189)|Mobile web loads a local xml file. Thumbnail images are not shown in the main table view. After clicking one table row, it will open a new webpage but there is no way to go back to the main table view. (TIMOB-8175)|When the app launches, it pops up an alert """"""""Mobile web is not yet supported by this template"""""""". The sample does not run in the browser. (TIMOB-8177)|""""",title+description
TIMOB-8160,12,"""MobileWeb: Convert internal use of View.add() calls to Element._add()""","""""""Any call to View.add() needs to be replaced with a call to Element._add(). Eventually, the Widget class will be changed from inheriting from View to inheriting directly from Element. Any control that needs to add something to itself internally will break. Before we do this, we need to convert these calls to the universal _add().""""""",New Feature,"Title: MobileWeb: Convert internal use of View.add() calls to Element._add()
Description: """"Any call to View.add() needs to be replaced with a call to Element._add(). Eventually, the Widget class will be changed from inheriting from View to inheriting directly from Element. Any control that needs to add something to itself internally will break. Before we do this, we need to convert these calls to the universal _add().""""",title+description
TIMOB-8159,12,"""Android:Views - View.updateLayout -crashes KitchenSink""","""""""In views/View updateLayout when 'change Size' button is tapped it crashes Kitchen Sink . An Alert is displayed in the view 'Unfortunately, KitchenSink has stopped.'    Error messages are also displayed in the log file        steps to reproduce:    1:tap on Views>View updateLayout  2:tap on Change Size    Actual Result: Stops Kitchen Sink  Expected Result:the square size should change to 150x150      """"""",Bug,"Title: Android:Views - View.updateLayout -crashes KitchenSink
Description: """"In views/View updateLayout when 'change Size' button is tapped it crashes Kitchen Sink . An Alert is displayed in the view 'Unfortunately, KitchenSink has stopped.' Error messages are also displayed in the log file steps to reproduce: 1:tap on Views>View updateLayout 2:tap on Change Size Actual Result: Stops Kitchen Sink Expected Result:the square size should change to 150x150 """"",title+description
