TIMOB-8156,12,"""iOS: Ti.UI.iPad.DocumentViewer.hide() doesn't seem to work""","""""""*Code*  The code has been taken from the documentation. I have added a timer of 5 seconds to call the hide() method on the document viewer:  http://pastebin.com/64TX2wUN    *Expected behavior*  The document viewer should hide once the timer has invoked the method.    *Actual behavior*   The document viewer actually 'freezes' and it doesn't respond to any touch inputs anymore.    *Notes*  -Make sure you press the 'launch' button in the top right hand corner, within the first 5 seconds (or change the timer to increase the delay).  -Please also make sure you have a random PDF file inside your resources folder, called 'Example.pdf'.  -Only tested on the simulator.  -HD ticket: http://support-admin.<USER>com/display/APP-658343""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Ti.UI.iPad.DocumentViewer.hide() doesn't seem to work
Description: """"*Code* The code has been taken from the documentation. I have added a timer of 5 seconds to call the hide() method on the document viewer: http://pastebin.com/64TX2wUN *Expected behavior* The document viewer should hide once the timer has invoked the method. *Actual behavior* The document viewer actually 'freezes' and it doesn't respond to any touch inputs anymore. *Notes* -Make sure you press the 'launch' button in the top right hand corner, within the first 5 seconds (or change the timer to increase the delay). -Please also make sure you have a random PDF file inside your resources folder, called 'Example.pdf'. -Only tested on the simulator. -HD ticket: http://support-admin.<USER>com/display/APP-658343""""",title+description
TIMOB-8155,12,"""Tooling: docgen.py doesn't correctly resolve links to inherited members""","""""""For example, Ti.UI.Tab inherits the backgroundColor property from Ti.UI.View. However, a link to <Titanium.UI.Tab.backgroundColor> fails, even though doc is generated for the inherited member.""""""",Bug,"Title: Tooling: docgen.py doesn't correctly resolve links to inherited members
Description: """"For example, Ti.UI.Tab inherits the backgroundColor property from Ti.UI.View. However, a link to <Titanium.UI.Tab.backgroundColor> fails, even though doc is generated for the inherited member.""""",title+description
