TIMOB-8137,12,"""No.8 - Orientation 1006 Standalone""","""""""h3. Description  Test upside down orientation.  h3. Steps to reproduce issue  On Android:  1) Launch OrientationModes/upsideDownOnly app   On iOS:  1) Hold device in portrait mode and launch OrientationModes/upsideDownOnly app  2) Hold device with top pointing left  3) Hold device upside down  4) Hold device with top pointing right  h3. Expected result  Android Results: App appears upside down portrait.  iOS Results: After Step 1) Image appears in upside down portrait mode  After Step 2) Image appears in upside down portrait mode  After Step 3) Image appears in upside down portrait mode  After Step 4) Image appears in upside down portrait mode  h3. Actual result  upsideDownOnly app crashes on launching it to iphone.  Test run: http://<USER>testlodge.com/projects/1317/test_runs/8386#executed_case_162285""""""",Bug,"Title: No.8 - Orientation 1006 Standalone
Description: """"h3. Description Test upside down orientation. h3. Steps to reproduce issue On Android: 1) Launch OrientationModes/upsideDownOnly app On iOS: 1) Hold device in portrait mode and launch OrientationModes/upsideDownOnly app 2) Hold device with top pointing left 3) Hold device upside down 4) Hold device with top pointing right h3. Expected result Android Results: App appears upside down portrait. iOS Results: After Step 1) Image appears in upside down portrait mode After Step 2) Image appears in upside down portrait mode After Step 3) Image appears in upside down portrait mode After Step 4) Image appears in upside down portrait mode h3. Actual result upsideDownOnly app crashes on launching it to iphone. Test run: http://<USER>testlodge.com/projects/1317/test_runs/8386#executed_case_162285""""",title+description
