TIMOB-8089,12,"""Webview doesn't maintain proper location after rotation""","""""""1. Compile and run the attached project  2. Open the application and scroll down to a recognizable part of the webview. I recommend a title header farther down in the document.  3. Rotate the device  EXPECTED RESULT: The title header should remain at the same point of the view.  ACTUAL RESULT: The title header scrolls off the screen""""""",Bug,"Title: Webview doesn't maintain proper location after rotation
