Description: """"When properties or animations are set to the window as follows: (See the comments in the code below) *ACTUAL BEHAVIOR* The open gets fired twice (can be confirmed by the alert statement). If the properties are set just once (either inside the open function or separately), the open event gets fired just once. *EXPECTED BEHAVIOR* Open should be fired just once. """"",title+description
