TIMOB-7957,12,"""TiAPI:  add support for TCP socket timeout options""","""""""We need to support different timeout values for connect versus read operations.  Originally those timeout values were combined into a single timeout property on the socket.    Perhaps add connectTimeout, readTimeout and deprecate the existing timeout property.  Further discussion is required regarding parity and desired behavior.""""""",New Feature,"Title: TiAPI: add support for TCP socket timeout options
Description: """"We need to support different timeout values for connect versus read operations. Originally those timeout values were combined into a single timeout property on the socket. Perhaps add connectTimeout, readTimeout and deprecate the existing timeout property. Further discussion is required regarding parity and desired behavior.""""",title+description
TIMOB-7956,12,"""iOS: ImageView in ScrollView behaves differently in 1.8.2 and CI""","""""""ImageView in ScrollView behaves differently in 1.8.2 and 2.0.x CI build. In 2.0.x CI builds the image is initially zoomed in. Zoom in and zoom out also have different behaviors.  h4. Repro Steps  1. Run the below code in both Ti SDK 1.8.2 and 2.0.x CI builds.  2. You can see the image is zoomed in 1.8.2 when the app starts and zoom in and zoom out have different behaviors.    """"""",Bug,"Title: iOS: ImageView in ScrollView behaves differently in 1.8.2 and CI
Description: """"ImageView in ScrollView behaves differently in 1.8.2 and 2.0.x CI build. In 2.0.x CI builds the image is initially zoomed in. Zoom in and zoom out also have different behaviors. h4. Repro Steps 1. Run the below code in both Ti SDK 1.8.2 and 2.0.x CI builds. 2. You can see the image is zoomed in 1.8.2 when the app starts and zoom in and zoom out have different behaviors. """"",title+description
TIMOB-7955,12,"""iOS: Add scrollsToTop and disableBound to WebView and ScrollView""","""""""[Pull Request #93|https://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/pull/93] adds the following iOS-specific features to Titanium Mobile:    - Adds the {{disableBounce}} (known from ScrollViews) property to WebViews  - Adds a {{scrollsToTop}} property to ScrollView and WebView, that allows to control which visible scrollable view scrolls to top when the status bar is tapped.    Attached is a simple demo project that demonstrates the added feature. Compile with the patch applied.""""""",New Feature,"Title: iOS: Add scrollsToTop and disableBound to WebView and ScrollView
Description: """"[Pull Request #93|https://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/pull/93] adds the following iOS-specific features to Titanium Mobile: - Adds the {{disableBounce}} (known from ScrollViews) property to WebViews - Adds a {{scrollsToTop}} property to ScrollView and WebView, that allows to control which visible scrollable view scrolls to top when the status bar is tapped. Attached is a simple demo project that demonstrates the added feature. Compile with the patch applied.""""",title+description
