Description: """"Application performance on mobile devices is very slow compared to desktop browsers.""""",title+description
TIMOB-7944,12,"""MobileWeb: Add support for startup images""","""""""Need to show the Titanium startup splash screen while the app loads. It needs to be defined by a html and css file. There needs to be tiapp.xml options to disable screen. At compile time, the compiler will need to check if the app has a startup screen to override the default Titanium startup screen.""""""",Bug,"Title: MobileWeb: Add support for startup images
Description: """"Need to show the Titanium startup splash screen while the app loads. It needs to be defined by a html and css file. There needs to be tiapp.xml options to disable screen. At compile time, the compiler will need to check if the app has a startup screen to override the default Titanium startup screen.""""",title+description
TIMOB-7943,12,"""MobileWeb: New back button mechanisms prevents breakpoints from being set""","""""""The new back button mechanism uses url hashes to manage itself. Unfortunately these hashes make it impossible to set a breakpoint cross window openings. To fix this, the back mechanism needs to be embedded in an iFrame.""""""",Bug,"Title: MobileWeb: New back button mechanisms prevents breakpoints from being set
Description: """"The new back button mechanism uses url hashes to manage itself. Unfortunately these hashes make it impossible to set a breakpoint cross window openings. To fix this, the back mechanism needs to be embedded in an iFrame.""""",title+description
TIMOB-7942,12,"""Android: Add the ability to supply Android Tab Styles""","""""""h6.Feature Request  Add the ability to supply Android Tab Styles likewise Tab Bar to the bottom.    h6.Currently if we create a folder named """"""""platform"""""""" in the root project folder, Titanium is able to apply a Layout.    - """"""""Project/platform/android/res/layout/titanium_tabgroup.xml""""""""     {code:title=titanium_tabgroup.xml}  <?xml version=""""""""1.0"""""""" encoding=""""""""utf-8""""""""?>  <TabHost xmlns:android=""""""""http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android""""""""      android:id=""""""""@android:id/tabhost""""""""      android:layout_width=""""""""fill_parent""""""""      android:layout_height=""""""""fill_parent"""""""">        <LinearLayout          android:orientation=""""""""vertical""""""""          android:layout_width=""""""""fill_parent""""""""          android:layout_height=""""""""fill_parent""""""""          android:padding=""""""""5dp"""""""">            <FrameLayout              android:id=""""""""@android:id/tabcontent""""""""              android:layout_width=""""""""fill_parent""""""""              android:layout_height=""""""""wrap_content""""""""              android:padding=""""""""5dp""""""""              android:layout_weight=""""""""1""""""""/>            <TabWidget              android:id=""""""""@android:id/tabs""""""""              android:layout_width=""""""""fill_parent""""""""              android:layout_height=""""""""wrap_content""""""""              android:layout_weight=""""""""0""""""""/>        </LinearLayout>    </TabHost>      h6.Android Styles & Themes  http://developer.android.com/guide/topics/ui/themes.html""""""",New Feature,"Title: Android: Add the ability to supply Android Tab Styles
Description: """"h6.Feature Request Add the ability to supply Android Tab Styles likewise Tab Bar to the bottom. h6.Currently if we create a folder named """"""""platform"""""""" in the root project folder, Titanium is able to apply a Layout. - """"""""Project/platform/android/res/layout/titanium_tabgroup.xml"""""""" {code:title=titanium_tabgroup.xml} <?xml version=""""""""1.0"""""""" encoding=""""""""utf-8""""""""?> <TabHost xmlns:android=""""""""http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"""""""" android:id=""""""""@android:id/tabhost"""""""" android:layout_width=""""""""fill_parent"""""""" android:layout_height=""""""""fill_parent""""""""> <LinearLayout android:orientation=""""""""vertical"""""""" android:layout_width=""""""""fill_parent"""""""" android:layout_height=""""""""fill_parent"""""""" android:padding=""""""""5dp""""""""> <FrameLayout android:id=""""""""@android:id/tabcontent"""""""" android:layout_width=""""""""fill_parent"""""""" android:layout_height=""""""""wrap_content"""""""" android:padding=""""""""5dp"""""""" android:layout_weight=""""""""1""""""""/> <TabWidget android:id=""""""""@android:id/tabs"""""""" android:layout_width=""""""""fill_parent"""""""" android:layout_height=""""""""wrap_content"""""""" android:layout_weight=""""""""0""""""""/> </LinearLayout> </TabHost> h6.Android Styles & Themes http://developer.android.com/guide/topics/ui/themes.html""""",title+description
TIMOB-7941,12,"""Mobile Web: web clip icons: generated appicon meta tags include a typo""","""""""  Note the extraneous """"""""n"""""""" at the end of the 114x114 appicon link tag; it shouldn't be there. This code copied from the index.html of a default Ti project built for Mobile Web using the 2.0.0.v20120308103238 CI build    {code:lang=html}  <link rel=""""""""apple-touch-icon-precomposed"""""""" sizes=""""""""114x114"""""""" href=""""""""apple-touch-icon-114x114-precomposedn.png"""""""">  <link rel=""""""""apple-touch-icon-precomposed"""""""" sizes=""""""""72x72"""""""" href=""""""""apple-touch-icon-72x72-precomposed.png"""""""">  <link rel=""""""""apple-touch-icon-precomposed"""""""" href=""""""""apple-touch-icon-precomposed.png"""""""">    <link rel=""""""""apple-touch-startup-image"""""""" href=""""""""mobileweb/Default-Landscape.jpg"""""""" media=""""""""screen and (min-device-width: 481px) and (max-device-width: 1024px) and (orientation:landscape)"""""""">  <link rel=""""""""apple-touch-startup-image"""""""" href=""""""""mobileweb/Default-Portrait.jpg"""""""" media=""""""""screen and (min-device-width: 481px) and (max-device-width: 1024px) and (orientation:portrait)"""""""">  <link rel=""""""""apple-touch-startup-image"""""""" href=""""""""mobileweb/Default.jpg"""""""" media=""""""""screen and (max-device-width: 320px)"""""""">  {code}  """"""",Bug,"Title: Mobile Web: web clip icons: generated appicon meta tags include a typo
Description: """" Note the extraneous """"""""n"""""""" at the end of the 114x114 appicon link tag; it shouldn't be there. This code copied from the index.html of a default Ti project built for Mobile Web using the 2.0.0.v20120308103238 CI build {code:lang=html} <link rel=""""""""apple-touch-icon-precomposed"""""""" sizes=""""""""114x114"""""""" href=""""""""apple-touch-icon-114x114-precomposedn.png""""""""> <link rel=""""""""apple-touch-icon-precomposed"""""""" sizes=""""""""72x72"""""""" href=""""""""apple-touch-icon-72x72-precomposed.png""""""""> <link rel=""""""""apple-touch-icon-precomposed"""""""" href=""""""""apple-touch-icon-precomposed.png""""""""> <link rel=""""""""apple-touch-startup-image"""""""" href=""""""""mobileweb/Default-Landscape.jpg"""""""" media=""""""""screen and (min-device-width: 481px) and (max-device-width: 1024px) and (orientation:landscape)""""""""> <link rel=""""""""apple-touch-startup-image"""""""" href=""""""""mobileweb/Default-Portrait.jpg"""""""" media=""""""""screen and (min-device-width: 481px) and (max-device-width: 1024px) and (orientation:portrait)""""""""> <link rel=""""""""apple-touch-startup-image"""""""" href=""""""""mobileweb/Default.jpg"""""""" media=""""""""screen and (max-device-width: 320px)""""""""> {code} """"",title+description
