TIMOB-7813,12,"""Android: Interval - v8 only - When running through the platform tab in KS, set interval becomes very slow and jumpy""","""""""Steps to Reproduce:  1. Launch KS > Platform > Set Interval (timer)  2. Let the test run up to 1000, back and restart  3. Repeat step 2 until the test because slow and jumpy (~10-15 times)    Actual:  The set interval is slow and jumpy    Expected:  The set interval should be fast and not jumpy    Note:  Restarting KS and just going to Set Interval test you do not encounter the issue.""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Interval - v8 only - When running through the platform tab in KS, set interval becomes very slow and jumpy
Description: """"Steps to Reproduce: 1. Launch KS > Platform > Set Interval (timer) 2. Let the test run up to 1000, back and restart 3. Repeat step 2 until the test because slow and jumpy (~10-15 times) Actual: The set interval is slow and jumpy Expected: The set interval should be fast and not jumpy Note: Restarting KS and just going to Set Interval test you do not encounter the issue.""""",title+description
