TIMOB-7799,12,"""MobileWeb: Remove dependency on FlexBox""","""""""Mobile Web uses flex box to lay out a number of controls but it is not supported on IE9, and is not supported correctly on FF9 and older. We need to replace it with the new (undocumented, Mobile Web only) layouts """"""""centeredHorizontal"""""""" and the like.""""""",Story,"Title: MobileWeb: Remove dependency on FlexBox
Description: """"Mobile Web uses flex box to lay out a number of controls but it is not supported on IE9, and is not supported correctly on FF9 and older. We need to replace it with the new (undocumented, Mobile Web only) layouts """"""""centeredHorizontal"""""""" and the like.""""",title+description
