TIMOB-7791,12,"""iOS : TabGroups - Tab group icon and content disappear after running KS > Tab Groups > Close/Animate Tab Group""","""""""*Note this behavior does not occur in 1.8.1*    Steps to reproduce:  1. Launch KS and navigate to Tab Groups > Close/Animate Tab Group    Actual result:  *See attached screencap*  The second tab """"""""controls"""""""" icon is missing and the content from the tab is no longer there.    Expected result:  The tab icon is visible as well as the tabs content""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS : TabGroups - Tab group icon and content disappear after running KS > Tab Groups > Close/Animate Tab Group
