TIMOB-7734,12,"""iOS: Animation - While animation is running, animation becomes elongated after rotating device""","""""""Steps to reproduce:  1. Run KS from 1_8_X branch  2. Go to Base UI > Animation > 2D Transform  3. Press Animate  4. While clouds are moving, rotate device    Actual: Clouds can become elongated. See attachment  Expected: Clouds should not be elongated.""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Animation - While animation is running, animation becomes elongated after rotating device
