Description: """"The window2 does not seem to be opened after the first try. Steps to Reproduce. 1. Run on Device or Simulator 2. Touch on window1 to navigate to window2 3. Navigate back to window1 4. Try touching on window one again. h4.Actual Result Gets stuck on window 1 h4.Expected Result Should be able to navigate back and forth between windows. """"",title+description
