TIMOB-7658,12,"""iOS: KS - In Table View (Layout 3), pressing the add and remove icons interchangeably will not display the other icon""","""""""Steps to reproduce:  1. Install and launch KS from master branch  2. Go to Base UI > Table Views > Table view (Layout 3)  3. Press between the add and remove icons on a row for a couple minutes    Actual: The other icon will not appear. Other icon will appear if you press the current icon again.  Expected: The other icon should appear immediately.    *Note:* Pressing the icons interchangeably works fine in 1.8.0.1""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: KS - In Table View (Layout 3), pressing the add and remove icons interchangeably will not display the other icon
Description: """"Steps to reproduce: 1. Install and launch KS from master branch 2. Go to Base UI > Table Views > Table view (Layout 3) 3. Press between the add and remove icons on a row for a couple minutes Actual: The other icon will not appear. Other icon will appear if you press the current icon again. Expected: The other icon should appear immediately. *Note:* Pressing the icons interchangeably works fine in 1.8.0.1""""",title+description
