Description: """"Steps to Reproduce: 1. Launch KS from 1_8_X branch 2. Go to Base UI > Views > Table Views > Insert row; then press """"""""Insert Row Above - Header -2"""""""" Actual: Console displays the following error message: [ERROR] Adding an event listener to a proxy that isn't already in the context Expected: Console should not display any error message during this operation. """"",title+description
