TIMOB-7358,12,"""Tooling: titanium.py create does not support mobileweb""","""""""When 'titanium.py create' is run from the command line:        mobileweb is not a valid platform.    Steps to Reproduce:    1. Run titanium.py from the command line using the arguments above.    Expected Result:    A new project should be created, with MobileTest/build/mobileweb and MobileTest/Resources/mobileweb folders.    Actual Result:    Invalid platform error.    Note: As of now, no tiapp.xml platform tags are creating using the titanium.py create script. They are added on import into studio based on the presence of a platform Resources sub-folder.""""""",Bug,"Title: Tooling: titanium.py create does not support mobileweb
Description: """"When 'titanium.py create' is run from the command line: mobileweb is not a valid platform. Steps to Reproduce: 1. Run titanium.py from the command line using the arguments above. Expected Result: A new project should be created, with MobileTest/build/mobileweb and MobileTest/Resources/mobileweb folders. Actual Result: Invalid platform error. Note: As of now, no tiapp.xml platform tags are creating using the titanium.py create script. They are added on import into studio based on the presence of a platform Resources sub-folder.""""",title+description
