TIMOB-7339,12,"""iOS:  Ti.UI.ScrollableView showPagingControl sould be false by default""","""""""Steps To Reproduce:  1. Get the app.js from Android bug  2. Run the application     Actual:  showPagingControl displays undefined for default    Expected:  showPagingControl should be false by default    Note:  Also occured in 1.8.0.1""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Ti.UI.ScrollableView showPagingControl sould be false by default
