V8Runtime.java:66)  E/AndroidRuntime( 3450):   at org.<USER>kroll.KrollRuntime.doInit(KrollRuntime.java:146)  E/AndroidRuntime( 3450):   at org.<USER>kroll.KrollRuntime$KrollRuntimeThread.run(KrollRuntime.java:99)  W/ActivityManager(  115):   Force finishing activity com.<USER>android.uatest2/.UrbanairshipActivity  W/ActivityManager(  115): Activity pause timeout for HistoryRecord{405576f0 com.<USER>android.uatest2/.UrbanairshipActivity}  V/RenderScript_jni(  211): surfaceCreated  V/RenderScript_jni(  211): surfaceChanged    Expected: To launch application with no problem    Note: Works if you recompile the module with 1.9.0""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Module: UrbanAirship module built with 1.8.0.1 does not work when application is compiled against 1.9.0
