TIMOB-7305,12,"""Android: TableView - In KS Table Views>Performance test, scrolling down to middle of the table causes out of memory error ""","""""""Steps to reproduce:  1. Launch KS  2. Go to Base UI > Views > Table Views > Performance  3. Scroll to the bottom of the table    Actual: After about 250 rows, out of memory error is printed out to logcat. See attachment.  Expected: Should not get an out of memory error.""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: TableView - In KS Table Views>Performance test, scrolling down to middle of the table causes out of memory error
