TIMOB-7304,12,"""MobileWeb: Ti.UI.TextField parity""","""""""The following are things that are not supported and should be able to support with some work.    Properties:  * clearButtonMode [stage]  * leftButton  * leftButtonMode  * leftButtonPadding  * paddingLeft  * paddingRight  * passwordMask  * rightButton  * rightButtonMode  * rightButtonPadding  * verticalAlign - probably can't support - TEXT_VERTICAL_ALIGNMENT_[BOTTOM|CENTER|TOP]""""""",Bug,"Title: MobileWeb: Ti.UI.TextField parity
