TIMOB-7285,12,"""Debugger not connecting to the Android Emulator""","""""""h3.Problem  Debugger not connecting to the Android Emulator.    h3.Steps to reproduce  1. Create a new Titanium Mobile Project for Android  2. Build the app for Android  3. Click the Debug    h3.Additional Information  The Android Emulator gets opened but the debugger cannot connect to the Emulator. Eventually we get the ERROR message: Session initialization failed Connection refused""""""",Bug,"Title: Debugger not connecting to the Android Emulator
