Description: """"h3. Problem Android:back event once removed cannot be reattached in 1.8.0.1 Titanium SDK. h3. Reproducible steps: 1. Run the code below with 1.8.0.1 Titanium SDK. Please see the 1.8.0.1 Titanium SDK--Bad Behavior video. 2. Run the attached code with 1.7.5 Titanium SDK. Please see the 1.7.5 Titanium SDK--Good Behavior video. Notice that in 1.7.5 Titanium SDK. You can close the red window, and go back to the first window, but in 1.8.0.1 it is not possible. h3. Expected behavior: Customer wants to have the same behavior in 1.8.0.1 Titanium SDK like the 1.7.5 Titanium SDK--Good Behavior video. h3. Tested with the next specs: Simulator Android version : 2.3.3 Titanium Studio, build: 1.0.8.201201161938 Titanium SDK: 1.8.0.1 & 1.7.5 Samsung Fit Android version of the device: 2.2.1 h3. Code: h3.Console Logs: {code:title=1.7.5 Titanium SDK--Good Behavior} [INFO] [2012-01-17 11:46:33,092] connected: 192.168.0.129:62950 [INFO] [2012-01-17 11:46:33,093] handshake: 73200e17-264c-4eb6-88bc-e4b990becb83 [INFO] [2012-01-17 11:46:33,093] request: status [INFO] [2012-01-17 11:46:33,093] disconnected: 192.168.0.129:62950 [INFO] [2012-01-17 11:47:51,534] connected: 127.0.0.1:62997 [INFO] [2012-01-17 11:47:51,542] handshake: 73200e17-264c-4eb6-88bc-e4b990becb83 [INFO] [2012-01-17 11:47:51,585] get app.js: /Users/tony/Documents/Titanium Studio Workspace/BackbuttonAndroid/Resources/app.js [INFO] [2012-01-17 11:50:06,793] disconnected: 127.0.0.1:62997 ecome available.. [INFO] Compiling Android Resources... This could take some time [INFO] Installing application on device [INFO] Launching application ... BackbuttonAndroid [INFO] Deployed BackbuttonAndroid ... Application should be running. paused 43ms I/Zygote ( 33): Preloading resources... D/dalvikvm( 33): GC_EXTERNAL_ALLOC freed <1K, 52% free 2462K/5123K, external 0K/0K, paused 44ms W/Zygote ( 33): Preloaded drawable resource #0x1080093 (res/drawable-mdpi/sym_def_app_icon.png) that varies with configuration!! W/Zygote ( 3