TIMOB-7107,12,"""MobileWeb: Complete Ti.Database.ResultSet implementation""","""""""Finish the Ti.Database.ResultSet implementation.    Extends Evented.    Remove second duplicate close() method.""""""",Bug,"Title: MobileWeb: Complete Ti.Database.ResultSet implementation
