TIMOB-7064,12,"""MobileWeb: Device specific appcache optimizations""","""""""When generating the appcache list, also track the file size of the resources and for device specific builds, we need to determine whether or not to use appcache. For example, if the project is larger than 5MB, then don't use appcache on older Android devices.""""""",Bug,"Title: MobileWeb: Device specific appcache optimizations
Description: """"When generating the appcache list, also track the file size of the resources and for device specific builds, we need to determine whether or not to use appcache. For example, if the project is larger than 5MB, then don't use appcache on older Android devices.""""",title+description
TIMOB-7063,12,"""MobileWeb: Add offline support using appcache""","""""""During the build <USER> need to scan the project's resource folder and build a list of resources to be included in the appcache.    Some links:  * https://developers.facebook.com/html5/blog/post/2012/07/16/mastering-the-application-cache-manifest-for-offline-web-apps-and-performance  * http://blip.tv/jsconf/jsconf2012-jake-archibald-appcache-douchebag-6143723  * http://lanyrd.com/2012/jsconf-us/sqxcz/  """"""",Bug,"Title: MobileWeb: Add offline support using appcache
Description: """"During the build <USER> need to scan the project's resource folder and build a list of resources to be included in the appcache. Some links: * https://developers.facebook.com/html5/blog/post/2012/07/16/mastering-the-application-cache-manifest-for-offline-web-apps-and-performance * http://blip.tv/jsconf/jsconf2012-jake-archibald-appcache-douchebag-6143723 * http://lanyrd.com/2012/jsconf-us/sqxcz/ """"",title+description
TIMOB-7062,12,"""Android: Debugger - V8 - The arguments variable contains unexpected variables in the argtest""","""""""Details:  After step 7 in test case 1021 in the [Debugger Test Plan|http://wiki.<USER>org/display/tp/Debugger+Test+Plan], unexpected variables appear. However, when running the argtest on Rhino, extra variables do not appear after expanding it.    Steps to reproduce:  1. Create a new project in studio called debug_test  2. Move the js files form the debug test project in titanium_mobile_tests_internal  3. Refer to the test plan at http://wiki.<USER>org/display/tp/Debugger+Test+Plan  4. Execute test case 1021 on V8    Actual: On V8, after expanding the arguments variable, extra variables appear. See attachment.  Expected: On Rhino, after expanding the arguments variable, no extra variable appears.  """"""",Bug,"Title: Android: Debugger - V8 - The arguments variable contains unexpected variables in the argtest
Description: """"Details: After step 7 in test case 1021 in the [Debugger Test Plan|http://wiki.<USER>org/display/tp/Debugger+Test+Plan], unexpected variables appear. However, when running the argtest on Rhino, extra variables do not appear after expanding it. Steps to reproduce: 1. Create a new project in studio called debug_test 2. Move the js files form the debug test project in titanium_mobile_tests_internal 3. Refer to the test plan at http://wiki.<USER>org/display/tp/Debugger+Test+Plan 4. Execute test case 1021 on V8 Actual: On V8, after expanding the arguments variable, extra variables appear. See attachment. Expected: On Rhino, after expanding the arguments variable, no extra variable appears. """"",title+description
TIMOB-7061,12,"""Android: Don't use deprecated BitmapDrawable( String filePath) constructor""","""""""We are using a deprecated constructor for BitmapDrawable.      http://developer.android.com/reference/android/graphics/drawable/BitmapDrawable.html#BitmapDrawable(java.lang.String)    We should be using the """"""""BitmapDrawable (Resources res, String filepath)"""""""" constructor instead.""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Don't use deprecated BitmapDrawable( String filePath) constructor
Description: """"We are using a deprecated constructor for BitmapDrawable. http://developer.android.com/reference/android/graphics/drawable/BitmapDrawable.html#BitmapDrawable(java.lang.String) We should be using the """"""""BitmapDrawable (Resources res, String filepath)"""""""" constructor instead.""""",title+description
