TIMOB-6975,12,"""iOS: Allow toolbars in nav bar (currently always width 0)""","""""""We need to be able to support adding a toolbar as the left/right nav buttons in order to support multiple system-styled buttons in the nav bar:        See TIMOB-1164 for a discussion about why this feature is necessary.    *NOTE:* This ticket may be invalid based on the existence/functionality of `Ti.UI.Window.toolbar`. Need to check the source/tests to see what that property actually does and whether or not it's comprable.""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Allow toolbars in nav bar (currently always width 0)
Description: """"We need to be able to support adding a toolbar as the left/right nav buttons in order to support multiple system-styled buttons in the nav bar: See TIMOB-1164 for a discussion about why this feature is necessary. *NOTE:* This ticket may be invalid based on the existence/functionality of `Ti.UI.Window.toolbar`. Need to check the source/tests to see what that property actually does and whether or not it's comprable.""""",title+description
TIMOB-6973,12,"""Android: HTTPClient - Sending blobs as form data fails in 1.8.0.1""","""""""h3. Problem  Whenever you attempt to include a blob as post data in an {{HTTPClient}} call on Android using 1.8.0.1, the call will fail with the following exception, also in the attached image:    h5. Message:  {{Uncaught Error: org.apache.http.entity.mime.content.StringBody}}  h5. Source:  {{xhr.send({}}    This exception does not occur when testing against 1.7.5. Also, the exception does not occur in iOS when using 1.8.0.1.  [TIMOB-6411|http://jira.<USER>org/browse/TIMOB-6411] is similar, but does not address the issue with this exception.    h3. Code to reproduce    """"""",Bug,"Title: Android: HTTPClient - Sending blobs as form data fails in 1.8.0.1
Description: """"h3. Problem Whenever you attempt to include a blob as post data in an {{HTTPClient}} call on Android using 1.8.0.1, the call will fail with the following exception, also in the attached image: h5. Message: {{Uncaught Error: org.apache.http.entity.mime.content.StringBody}} h5. Source: {{xhr.send({}} This exception does not occur when testing against 1.7.5. Also, the exception does not occur in iOS when using 1.8.0.1. [TIMOB-6411|http://jira.<USER>org/browse/TIMOB-6411] is similar, but does not address the issue with this exception. h3. Code to reproduce """"",title+description
