TIMOB-6891,12,"""Android: Tab's window property is null if set via creation arguments""","""""""h3. Fail case / Test case    This app.js will show a """"""""cannot call method 'addEventListener' of null"""""""" error in the fail case. If you can load this without the error, then it's fixed:    {code:title=app.js}  Ti.UI.createTab({window: Ti.UI.createWindow()}).    window.addEventListener(""""""""focus"""""""", function(){});  {code}    This happens because {{tab1.window}} is null, and it shouldn't be.""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Tab's window property is null if set via creation arguments
Description: """"h3. Fail case / Test case This app.js will show a """"""""cannot call method 'addEventListener' of null"""""""" error in the fail case. If you can load this without the error, then it's fixed: {code:title=app.js} Ti.UI.createTab({window: Ti.UI.createWindow()}). window.addEventListener(""""""""focus"""""""", function(){}); {code} This happens because {{tab1.window}} is null, and it shouldn't be.""""",title+description
