TIMOB-6718,12,"""MobileWeb: Ti.Network.HTTPClient doesn't properly implement readyState, timeouts, and error handling""","""""""Ti.Network.HTTPClient does not define the proper constants for readyState, nor returns the correct constants when readyState is invoked.    Timeouts are completely incorrectly implemented. The way it was implemented would only work in IE8 which isn't even a supported platform.    Error handling is only tied into connection errors and not 4XX or 5XX response statuses.""""""",Bug,"Title: MobileWeb: Ti.Network.HTTPClient doesn't properly implement readyState, timeouts, and error handling
Description: """"Ti.Network.HTTPClient does not define the proper constants for readyState, nor returns the correct constants when readyState is invoked. Timeouts are completely incorrectly implemented. The way it was implemented would only work in IE8 which isn't even a supported platform. Error handling is only tied into connection errors and not 4XX or 5XX response statuses.""""",title+description
