TIMOB-6707,12,"""1.8.0.1 RC1 Android creating KrollProxy instances at runtime fails""","""""""I have a Proxy called SessionProxy on a native Android module. I also have another Proxy called ClientProxy on the same module.    Somewhere in the code inside SessionProxy, I need to return an instance of the ClientProxy. So normally I write (Java code):        ClientProxy c = new ClientProxy();    The code compiles, but in runtime, it crashes:    E/ProxyFactory( 1592): Failed to find class for com.Ox82.ClientProxy  E/ProxyFactory( 1592): Unable to find class while creating V8 Proxy.I/DEBUG   (   28): *** *** *** *** *** *** *** *** *** *** *** *** *** *** *** ***I/DEBUG   (   28): Build fingerprint: 'generic/sdk/generic/:2.1-update1/ECLAIR/35983:eng/test-keys'  I/DEBUG   (   28): pid: 1592, tid: 1600  >>> com.Ox82.dropbox <<<  I/DEBUG   (   28): signal 11 (SIGSEGV), fault addr 00000000  I/DEBUG   (   28):  r0 570209dd  r1 570209e9  r2 00000000  r3 00000000  I/DEBUG   (   28):  r4 00307afc  r5 00000000  r6 00307b00  r7 00308af0  I/DEBUG   (   28):  r8 00000000  r9 00307b00  10 00307b04  fp 00000000  I/DEBUG   (   28):  ip 00000000  sp 45a40bb8  lr 81287e18  pc 8117f804  cpsr 80000010  I/DEBUG   (   28):          #00  pc 0017f804  /data/data/com.Ox82.dropbox/lib/libkroll-v8.soI/DEBUG   (   28):          #01  lr 81287e18  /data/data/com.Ox82.dropbox/lib/libkroll-v8.so    That didn't happened on < 1.8 SDK.""""""",Bug,"Title: 1.8.0.1 RC1 Android creating KrollProxy instances at runtime fails
Description: """"I have a Proxy called SessionProxy on a native Android module. I also have another Proxy called ClientProxy on the same module. Somewhere in the code inside SessionProxy, I need to return an instance of the ClientProxy. So normally I write (Java code): ClientProxy c = new ClientProxy(); The code compiles, but in runtime, it crashes: E/ProxyFactory( 1592): Failed to find class for com.Ox82.ClientProxy E/ProxyFactory( 1592): Unable to find class while creating V8 Proxy.I/DEBUG ( 28): *** *** *** *** *** *** *** *** *** *** *** *** *** *** *** ***I/DEBUG ( 28): Build fingerprint: 'generic/sdk/generic/:2.1-update1/ECLAIR/35983:eng/test-keys' I/DEBUG ( 28): pid: 1592, tid: 1600 >>> com.Ox82.dropbox <<< I/DEBUG ( 28): signal 11 (SIGSEGV), fault addr 00000000 I/DEBUG ( 28): r0 570209dd r1 570209e9 r2 00000000 r3 00000000 I/DEBUG ( 28): r4 00307afc r5 00000000 r6 00307b00 r7 00308af0 I/DEBUG ( 28): r8 00000000 r9 00307b00 10 00307b04 fp 00000000 I/DEBUG ( 28): ip 00000000 sp 45a40bb8 lr 81287e18 pc 8117f804 cpsr 80000010 I/DEBUG ( 28): #00 pc 0017f804 /data/data/com.Ox82.dropbox/lib/libkroll-v8.soI/DEBUG ( 28): #01 lr 81287e18 /data/data/com.Ox82.dropbox/lib/libkroll-v8.so That didn't happened on < 1.8 SDK.""""",title+description
TIMOB-6706,12,"""Android : Debugger - v8 debugger hitting breakpoint of debugger test early""","""""""Steps to reproduce:    1. Follow this page https://wiki.<USER>org/display/tp/Debugger+Test+Plan to setup the project and run step 1023    Expected result:  Should hit breakpoint at app.js:90    Actual result:  Hits breakpoint at app.js:91""""""",Bug,"Title: Android : Debugger - v8 debugger hitting breakpoint of debugger test early
