TIMOB-6704,12,"""iOS: Button Styling for TabbedBar""","""""""h5. PROBLEM DESCRIPTION  The customer wants to be able to do styling on the buttons in a tabbed bar, just like the tabbed bar in the twitter app for iphone has a nice gradient (attached image).     h5. MORE INFO  They want to be able to style the tabbedbar buttons, meaning clicked vs unclicked colors, changing the gradient and the automatic glow that is on the buttons.   - It would be ideal for them if they could use background images.  They would like to be able to set a background image on toolbars.      """"""",New Feature,"Title: iOS: Button Styling for TabbedBar
Description: """"h5. PROBLEM DESCRIPTION The customer wants to be able to do styling on the buttons in a tabbed bar, just like the tabbed bar in the twitter app for iphone has a nice gradient (attached image). h5. MORE INFO They want to be able to style the tabbedbar buttons, meaning clicked vs unclicked colors, changing the gradient and the automatic glow that is on the buttons. - It would be ideal for them if they could use background images. They would like to be able to set a background image on toolbars. """"",title+description
