12):  at com.android.internal.os.ZygoteInit.main(ZygoteInit.java:599)  E/WindowManager(  812):  at dalvik.system.NativeStart.main(Native Method)  D/dalvikvm(  222): GC_EXPLICIT freed 7K, 5% free 20303K/21191K, paused 7ms+2ms      Steps to reproduce:  1) Install KS with SDK 1.8.0.1  2) Navigate to Phone>Play Movie>Local  3) Press the back button while examining the console    Result:  Console logs error    Expected:  No error in console    Note:  Does not occur on 175 SDK with KS 175""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: TiActivity - v8/rhino - Console reports activity has leaked window
