TIMOB-6678,12,"""MobileWeb: TableView left and right image are inefficient and can access null DOM nodes""","""""""leftImage and rightImage adds an image DOM node, then checks if it really should have added it, then if it doesn't need it, it will delete it, but it's possible for the image DOM node to not have been added to the page yet, thus resulting in a DOM error.""""""",Bug,"Title: MobileWeb: TableView left and right image are inefficient and can access null DOM nodes
Description: """"leftImage and rightImage adds an image DOM node, then checks if it really should have added it, then if it doesn't need it, it will delete it, but it's possible for the image DOM node to not have been added to the page yet, thus resulting in a DOM error.""""",title+description
