TIMOB-6675,12,"""Parity: Variables: Variables lists contain more information in Android V8 vs Rhino and iOS""","""""""Steps To Reproduce:  1. Run TC 1021 from http://wiki.<USER>org/display/tp/Debugger+Test+Plan    Expected Result:  After step 7 nothing is listed for Rhino and iOS    Actual Result:  After step 7 these variables are displayed: callee, length, proto and constructor""""""",Bug,"Title: Parity: Variables: Variables lists contain more information in Android V8 vs Rhino and iOS
