TIMOB-6667,12,"""iOS: Downloaded video from remote server, is not saved into photo gallery""","""""""h4. Expected Behavior  Download a video from a remote server, and save it to the Photo gallery, then exit the app and open the Photo Gallery, the video should be there.    h4. Actual Behavior  Download a video from a remote server, pass the this.response to a """"""""save to Photo Gallery"""""""" statement, there no errors on the <USER> apparently the video has been saved to the photo gallery, exit the app, open the photo gallery, there are no video.    h4. Test Case      h5. Notes  If i use a jpeg, instead a video, the jpeg file it's saved and appears into the photo gallery  I use different remote videos to test.""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Downloaded video from remote server, is not saved into photo gallery
Description: """"h4. Expected Behavior Download a video from a remote server, and save it to the Photo gallery, then exit the app and open the Photo Gallery, the video should be there. h4. Actual Behavior Download a video from a remote server, pass the this.response to a """"""""save to Photo Gallery"""""""" statement, there no errors on the <USER> apparently the video has been saved to the photo gallery, exit the app, open the photo gallery, there are no video. h4. Test Case h5. Notes If i use a jpeg, instead a video, the jpeg file it's saved and appears into the photo gallery I use different remote videos to test.""""",title+description
