Description: """"Description: In KS, on the Base UI>Views>Table Views>Update Row test, clicking any row prompts console logging as so: Dec 12 14:19:29 unknown UIKitApplication:com.<USER>titanium[0x742a][11311] <Notice>: [ERROR] Adding an event listener to a proxy that isn't already in the context Steps to reproduce: 1) Install KS built with SDK 1.8.0.1 2) Navigate to Base UI>Views>Table Views>Update Row 3) Click any row labeled """"""""update"""""""" while watching console output Result: Console logs error Expected: No errors logged Note: Does not occur with 1.7.5 KS and SDK""""",title+description
