TIMOB-6578,12,"""iOS: Local HTML - Clicking on the google link in KS's Local HTML test crashes KS app""","""""""Steps to reproduce:  1. Install and launch KitchenSink  2. Navigate to: Base UI>Views>Web Views>Local HTML  3. Click Ok and click on the google link  4. While alert is loading, click on Web Views in the left hand corner several times    Actual: KitchenSink will crash and exit to the home screen. See attachment for console log.   Expected: KitchenSink should not crash and exit.    Note:   * Difficult to reproduce bug, so will need to repeat the above steps a couple of times  * Bug persists in 1.7.5, but also difficult to reproduce  * Crash log was not generated. See console log for error.""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Local HTML - Clicking on the google link in KS's Local HTML test crashes KS app
Description: """"Steps to reproduce: 1. Install and launch KitchenSink 2. Navigate to: Base UI>Views>Web Views>Local HTML 3. Click Ok and click on the google link 4. While alert is loading, click on Web Views in the left hand corner several times Actual: KitchenSink will crash and exit to the home screen. See attachment for console log. Expected: KitchenSink should not crash and exit. Note: * Difficult to reproduce bug, so will need to repeat the above steps a couple of times * Bug persists in 1.7.5, but also difficult to reproduce * Crash log was not generated. See console log for error.""""",title+description
