TIMOB-6546,12,"""Android: Debugger - v8 - Args test case contains many unexpected variables""","""""""While running the Args test, after step 6, many unexpected global and local variables appear in the variables pane. See attached image.    Steps to reproduce:  1) Create a new project in studio called debug_test  2) Move the js files form the debug test project in titanium_mobile_tests_internal  3) refer to the test plan at http://wiki.<USER>org/display/tp/Debugger+Test+Plan  4) Execute test case 1021    Result:  Many unexpected variables    Expected:  'local' variables (a, b, c, i, arguments)  'global' variables (array, button, exception, encode, win, argtest, evt, x)   """"""",Bug,"Title: Android: Debugger - v8 - Args test case contains many unexpected variables
