TIMOB-6540,12,"""Android: Debugger - v8 - Basic breakpoint test case contains undefined global variable with undefined value""","""""""While running Basic breakpoint test, after step 9, a global variable """"""""undefined"""""""" with value """"""""undefined"""""""" was present in the variable pane.    Steps to reproduce:  1) Create a new project in studio called debug_test  2) Move the js files form the debug test project in titanium_mobile_tests_internal  3) refer to the test plan at http://wiki.<USER>org/display/tp/Debugger+Test+Plan  4) Execute test case 1013    Result:  After step 9, global variable """"""""undefined"""""""" with value """"""""undefined""""""""    Expected:  No undefined variables""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Debugger - v8 - Basic breakpoint test case contains undefined global variable with undefined value
