TIMOB-6501,12,"""ImageView memory leak""","""""""In KS, Base_UI -> Views -> ImageViews -> ImageRapidUpdate, click on the image while its animating and you will notice the slowness of animation. This is due to threads not terminated properly upon stopping the animation """"""",Bug,"Title: ImageView memory leak
