qlite returned: error code = 14, msg = os_unix.c: open() at line 27712 - """""""""""""""" errno=2 path=/CachedGeoposition.db, db=/data/data/com.<USER>titanium/databases/Titanium      Steps to reproduce:  1) Install KS with 1.8.0.1  2) Navigate to the areas listed above  3) Monitor the console    Result:  SQLite errors logged    Expected:  No SQLite errors    Note:  Did not occur with 1.7.5 GA""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: SQLite - v8 - SQLite errors reported in console on Galaxy 10.1
