TIMOB-6378,12,"""Ti API: Default background color for views is inconsistent""","""""""The following code produces different effects on Android and iOS:        On iOS, this produces a transparent box with a red border. On Android, it produces a solid red box.    The workaround is simple enough--specify a background color. But the result is puzzling to customers, who   are more likely to expect the iOS behavior. Reported in Stack Overflow:    http://stackoverflow.com/questions/8222159/titanium-android-bordercolor-behaving-like-backgroundcolor  """"""",Bug,"Title: Ti API: Default background color for views is inconsistent
Description: """"The following code produces different effects on Android and iOS: On iOS, this produces a transparent box with a red border. On Android, it produces a solid red box. The workaround is simple enough--specify a background color. But the result is puzzling to customers, who are more likely to expect the iOS behavior. Reported in Stack Overflow: http://stackoverflow.com/questions/8222159/titanium-android-bordercolor-behaving-like-backgroundcolor """"",title+description
