TIMOB-6319,12,"""Android: Animation - NullPointerException is thrown when exiting Animation example in KitchenSink""","""""""Steps to reproduce:  1. Import KitchenSink to TiStudio  2. Navigate to Base UI>Views>Image Views>Animated   3. Set duration to 0 or 10 ms  4. Run animation for a couple seconds  5. Press Back button    Result: NullPointerException is thrown. See attachment.  Expected: A NullPointerException should not be thrown when pressing the Back button.    Note: Bug appears in both Rhino and V8""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Animation - NullPointerException is thrown when exiting Animation example in KitchenSink
