TIMOB-6239,12,"""Android: Database.ResultSet.next() returns undefined""","""""""The Docs says that Database.ResultSet.next() returns false if no more results are available.  http://developer.<USER>com/apidoc/mobile/latest/Titanium.Database.ResultSet.next-method.html    It is always undefined for android.  On iOS it returns true and false.    Step 1: run the code below  Step 2: click the blue window  Step 3: notice the return value output in the console is always undefined.        h4. Workaround  Use while( rows.isValidRow() ){rows.next()}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Database.ResultSet.next() returns undefined
Description: """"The Docs says that Database.ResultSet.next() returns false if no more results are available. http://developer.<USER>com/apidoc/mobile/latest/Titanium.Database.ResultSet.next-method.html It is always undefined for android. On iOS it returns true and false. Step 1: run the code below Step 2: click the blue window Step 3: notice the return value output in the console is always undefined. h4. Workaround Use while( rows.isValidRow() ){rows.next()}""""",title+description
