TIMOB-6135,12,"""Android: Scons/ant: build fails because google apis not found with newer android platform tools (r14/r15)""","""""""Build fails because google apis (maps, etc.) cannot be found.  It appears that google has changed the location of them from add-ons/addon_google_apis_google_inc_8 to add-ons/addon-google_apis-google_inc_-8.""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Scons/ant: build fails because google apis not found with newer android platform tools (r14/r15)
Description: """"Build fails because google apis (maps, etc.) cannot be found. It appears that google has changed the location of them from add-ons/addon_google_apis_google_inc_8 to add-ons/addon-google_apis-google_inc_-8.""""",title+description
TIMOB-6134,12,"""iOS: jittery labels when re-setting tableview data""","""""""h3.Problem  While re-setting the table content with setData() method the labels that are inside the rows start jittering.    h3.REGRESSION - works fine with SDK 1.7.5    h3.Reproducible Steps  1. Run the sample code  2. Press the """"""""Tap this row"""""""" row    h3.Sample Code      h3.Associated HelpDesk Ticket  http://appc.me/c/APP-954826""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: jittery labels when re-setting tableview data
Description: """"h3.Problem While re-setting the table content with setData() method the labels that are inside the rows start jittering. h3.REGRESSION - works fine with SDK 1.7.5 h3.Reproducible Steps 1. Run the sample code 2. Press the """"""""Tap this row"""""""" row h3.Sample Code h3.Associated HelpDesk Ticket http://appc.me/c/APP-954826""""",title+description
