TIMOB-6089,12,"""iOS: Tweet Sheets support""","""""""h3.Feature Request    Please add the support for Tweet Sheets.    iOS 5 includes several ways to interact with Twitter. The simplest, and possibly the one you will most likely implement, is the TWTweetComposeViewController. That name is quite a handful so we will affectionately call it """"""""Tweet Sheet"""""""" just as Apple does.    More details: http://www.raywenderlich.com/5519/beginning-twitter-in-ios-5""""""",New Feature,"Title: iOS: Tweet Sheets support
Description: """"h3.Feature Request Please add the support for Tweet Sheets. iOS 5 includes several ways to interact with Twitter. The simplest, and possibly the one you will most likely implement, is the TWTweetComposeViewController. That name is quite a handful so we will affectionately call it """"""""Tweet Sheet"""""""" just as Apple does. More details: http://www.raywenderlich.com/5519/beginning-twitter-in-ios-5""""",title+description
TIMOB-6088,12,"""Android: Orientation - v8 only, Nook only, setting orientation does not work""","""""""Navigating to Miscellaneous, Orientation and then pressing any orientation button doesn't cause any orientation changes    Steps to Reproduce:  1. Launch KS  2. Navigate to Miscellaneous  3. Press Orientation table view row  4. Press Set Landscape button    Actual Result:  Orientation doesn't change    Expected result:  Orientation should change to landscape""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Orientation - v8 only, Nook only, setting orientation does not work
