TIMOB-6025,12,"""MobileWeb: Make drillbit mobile web compatible""","""""""Need to make Drillbit work with testing the mobile web platform. This might need to be run from a browser environment.    May want to integrate features from DOH (Dojo Objective Harness), Foounit (http://foounit.com/), and Buster.JS (http://busterjs.org/). More here: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_unit_testing_frameworks#JavaScript""""""",Story,"Title: MobileWeb: Make drillbit mobile web compatible
Description: """"Need to make Drillbit work with testing the mobile web platform. This might need to be run from a browser environment. May want to integrate features from DOH (Dojo Objective Harness), Foounit (http://foounit.com/), and Buster.JS (http://busterjs.org/). More here: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_unit_testing_frameworks#JavaScript""""",title+description
TIMOB-6024,12,"""MobileWeb: Create site to detect mobile browser capabilities and record results""","""""""Need a web page that will run a bunch of tests, the records the results to a database.  Start with getting the data captured by has.js and Modernizer, then extend with more specific tests.""""""",Story,"Title: MobileWeb: Create site to detect mobile browser capabilities and record results
