TIMOB-6007,12,"""TiAPI: Add new method Ti.Platform.runtime""","""""""There is a need to identify the runtime engine being used on the different platforms. Expose a read-only property {{runtime}} on Titanium.Platform to report the engine. Returned value should be lowercased.""""""",New Feature,"Title: TiAPI: Add new method Ti.Platform.runtime
