TIMOB-5993,12,"""iOS: KS Phone>Sound>Record, iPhone audio line type (Ti.Media.audioLineType) reports """"headset"""" when no headset plugged in""","""""""Description:  While testing KS, KS Phone>Sound>Record, I noted that both test devices had the audio line type set as """"""""headset"""""""". While I somewhat expected this for the iPad, I was not expecting this for the iPhone. Using SDK 1.7.5, Ti.Media.audioLineType reports """"""""unknown"""""""" on the iPad 2 and reports """"""""receiver/mic"""""""" on the iPhone 4s.    Steps to reproduce:  1) Install KS 1.8.0 on device  2) Navigate to Phone>Sound>Record  3) note the """"""""audio line type"""""""" data    Result:  Audio line type shows """"""""headset"""""""" for both devices tested    Expected:  Audio line type varies based on device capabilities    Note:  This does not occur on SDK 1.7.5 with KS 1_7_X  """"""",Bug,"Title: iOS: KS Phone>Sound>Record, iPhone audio line type (Ti.Media.audioLineType) reports """"headset"""" when no headset plugged in
Description: """"Description: While testing KS, KS Phone>Sound>Record, I noted that both test devices had the audio line type set as """"""""headset"""""""". While I somewhat expected this for the iPad, I was not expecting this for the iPhone. Using SDK 1.7.5, Ti.Media.audioLineType reports """"""""unknown"""""""" on the iPad 2 and reports """"""""receiver/mic"""""""" on the iPhone 4s. Steps to reproduce: 1) Install KS 1.8.0 on device 2) Navigate to Phone>Sound>Record 3) note the """"""""audio line type"""""""" data Result: Audio line type shows """"""""headset"""""""" for both devices tested Expected: Audio line type varies based on device capabilities Note: This does not occur on SDK 1.7.5 with KS 1_7_X """"",title+description
TIMOB-5992,12,"""iOS: Upgrade ios-sim to newest version with Retina support""","""""""The current build scripts do not allow the user to specify a retina-display density during the simulator launch. Once this is implemented, we'll need to add an additional configuration option to Studio.""""""",New Feature,"Title: iOS: Upgrade ios-sim to newest version with Retina support
