TIMOB-5933,12,"""iOS: Error of authentication using TiNetworkHTTPClientProxy.m in http client under iOS 5""","""""""h3. Problem     Error of authentication using TiNetworkHTTPClientProxy.m in http client under iOS 5     h3. Reproducible steps:     1.     Locate the TiNetworkHTTPClientProxy.m  file in the next path:     / Users/your_username/Library/Application Support/Titanium/mobilesdk/osx/ 1.8.0.v20111028154620/iphone/Classes/    2. Locate, and update the code of the file.  -(void)open:(id)args method implementation and add right after request initialization string (1) authorization strings (2 and 3), see below:           request = [[ASIFormDataRequest  requestWithURL:url] retain]; (1)  [request setUsername:@""""""""xxxxxx""""""""]; (2)  [request setPassword:@""""""""xxxxxx""""""""]; (3)    Please go to the ticket(APP-915216) to see the setUsername, and setPassword.     3. Run the code below.     h3. Expected behavior:  Customer wants to keep the same behavior of iOS 4.3 in the 5  iOS SDK version.  h3. Sample code:         h3.Additional info:  The application does not create any logs in the next path:  Library/Logs/CrashReporter/  h3. Associated HD Ticket:  APP-915216""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Error of authentication using TiNetworkHTTPClientProxy.m in http client under iOS 5
Description: """"h3. Problem Error of authentication using TiNetworkHTTPClientProxy.m in http client under iOS 5 h3. Reproducible steps: 1. Locate the TiNetworkHTTPClientProxy.m file in the next path: / Users/your_username/Library/Application Support/Titanium/mobilesdk/osx/ 1.8.0.v20111028154620/iphone/Classes/ 2. Locate, and update the code of the file. -(void)open:(id)args method implementation and add right after request initialization string (1) authorization strings (2 and 3), see below: request = [[ASIFormDataRequest requestWithURL:url] retain]; (1) [request setUsername:@""""""""xxxxxx""""""""]; (2) [request setPassword:@""""""""xxxxxx""""""""]; (3) Please go to the ticket(APP-915216) to see the setUsername, and setPassword. 3. Run the code below. h3. Expected behavior: Customer wants to keep the same behavior of iOS 4.3 in the 5 iOS SDK version. h3. Sample code: h3.Additional info: The application does not create any logs in the next path: Library/Logs/CrashReporter/ h3. Associated HD Ticket: APP-915216""""",title+description
