TIMOB-5878,12,"""Android: Titanium.UI.TextArea does not decode UTF8 character correctly. ""","""""""TextArea does not decode UTF8 character correctly.    h4. Repro Steps  Step 1: Open Kitchen Sink on Android   Step 2: Go to Platform - XHR - UTF-8 + GET/POST    Expected result: The string """"""""€漢字"""""""" should be shown in the textarea.  Actual result: Some garbage characters was shown.    h4. Workaround  In Javascript code, call the following decode function to decode what returns from HttpClient's responseText.      h4. Associated Helpdesk Ticket  http://appc.me/c/APP-589719     """"""",Bug,"Title: Android: Titanium.UI.TextArea does not decode UTF8 character correctly.
