Description: """"Setting the 'hasCheck' property on the row's click event causes the child elements of the row to disappear. This appears to happen with the newer CI builds. Also, the elements do not disappear at the time of click event. When another row is clicked, the elements on the previously clicked row disappear. When checked with the CI build 1.8.0.v20111008193843, the problem does not appear. Sample Code: """"",title+description
TIMOB-5788,12,"""iOS: Show backgroundImage in the toolbar while the toolbar is opaque ""","""""""The backgroundimage property of Titanium.UI.Toolbar is not shown when the Toolbar is set to opaque.      h4. Repro Steps    1.put the attached png files into the images folder  2.run the example code below.    {code:title=app.js}  win = Ti.UI.createWindow({   backgroundColor : '#fff',   backgroundImage : 'images/background.png'    });  verticalOff = 0;    var mkToolBar = function(title) {   var bar = Titanium.UI.createToolbar({    items : [Ti.UI.createButton({     title : 'test '+ title,     width : 50,     style: Ti.UI.iPhone.SystemButtonStyle.BORDERED    })],    top : verticalOff   });      verticalOff += bar.height + 2;   return bar;  }    tb = mkToolBar('bg');  tb.backgroundImage = 'images/bar_bg.png'  win.add(tb);  win.open();  {code}    h4. Associated Helpdesk Ticket  http://appc.me/c/APP-658713""""""",New Feature,"Title: iOS: Show backgroundImage in the toolbar while the toolbar is opaque
Description: """"The backgroundimage property of Titanium.UI.Toolbar is not shown when the Toolbar is set to opaque. h4. Repro Steps 1.put the attached png files into the images folder 2.run the example code below. {code:title=app.js} win = Ti.UI.createWindow({ backgroundColor : '#fff', backgroundImage : 'images/background.png' }); verticalOff = 0; var mkToolBar = function(title) { var bar = Titanium.UI.createToolbar({ items : [Ti.UI.createButton({ title : 'test '+ title, width : 50, style: Ti.UI.iPhone.SystemButtonStyle.BORDERED })], top : verticalOff }); verticalOff += bar.height + 2; return bar; } tb = mkToolBar('bg'); tb.backgroundImage = 'images/bar_bg.png' win.add(tb); win.open(); {code} h4. Associated Helpdesk Ticket http://appc.me/c/APP-658713""""",title+description
