TIMOB-5777,12,"""ScrollView scroll behavior is not reflecting a scrollType property change ""","""""""Steps to reproduce:    1. Create a ScrollView and set the scrollType property (for example to horizontal)  2. Change the scrollType property (from horizontal to vertical)  3. Also removing and adding back again the ScrollView to the window, the ScrollView does not scroll in the intended direction, even if the property is actually correctly changed.      See the snip code: http://pastie.org/2714251""""""",Bug,"Title: ScrollView scroll behavior is not reflecting a scrollType property change
Description: """"Steps to reproduce: 1. Create a ScrollView and set the scrollType property (for example to horizontal) 2. Change the scrollType property (from horizontal to vertical) 3. Also removing and adding back again the ScrollView to the window, the ScrollView does not scroll in the intended direction, even if the property is actually correctly changed. See the snip code: http://pastie.org/2714251""""",title+description
