TIMOB-5756,12,"""Android: TableView deleteRow with invalid index crashes the application instead of warning""","""""""1) Create a new project and use the following app.js        2) Launch app    Results: Application crashing.  Android log shows: java.lang.IllegalStateException: Index out of range.  Non-existant row at 0.    Expected results:  The same application won't crash on an iOS device and the log output displays: [WARN] no rows found in table, ignoring delete    """"""",Bug,"Title: Android: TableView deleteRow with invalid index crashes the application instead of warning
Description: """"1) Create a new project and use the following app.js 2) Launch app Results: Application crashing. Android log shows: java.lang.IllegalStateException: Index out of range. Non-existant row at 0. Expected results: The same application won't crash on an iOS device and the log output displays: [WARN] no rows found in table, ignoring delete """"",title+description
TIMOB-5755,12,"""iOS: xcode 4.1+ cannot compile to armv6, application crashes on launch""","""""""Steps to Reproduce:  1. Compile a iOS application with xCode 4.1+  2. Sync the application to an iPhone3g 3.1.2  3. Launch the application    Actual:  Application crash on launch    Expected:  Need a way to deploy or stop support on this""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: xcode 4.1+ cannot compile to armv6, application crashes on launch
Description: """"Steps to Reproduce: 1. Compile a iOS application with xCode 4.1+ 2. Sync the application to an iPhone3g 3.1.2 3. Launch the application Actual: Application crash on launch Expected: Need a way to deploy or stop support on this""""",title+description
TIMOB-5754,12,"""iOS: KS bug on sound_record, background does not stop the recording and iOS shows that it is still recording""","""""""Steps to Reproduce:  1. Launch KS > Phone > Sound > Record  2. Press Start Record  3. Press Home  4. Launch KS, press Sound  5. Press Home    Actual:  Indicates that the recording is still in progress (red flashing bar)    Expected:  Should stop the recording""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: KS bug on sound_record, background does not stop the recording and iOS shows that it is still recording
Description: """"Steps to Reproduce: 1. Launch KS > Phone > Sound > Record 2. Press Start Record 3. Press Home 4. Launch KS, press Sound 5. Press Home Actual: Indicates that the recording is still in progress (red flashing bar) Expected: Should stop the recording""""",title+description
