TIMOB-5605,12,"""MobileWeb: WebView works incorrectly when app is deployed not in server web root""","""""""Steps:  # deploy Kitchensink in subdirectory on a webserver  # open """"""""Web view"""""""" demo  # Click """"""""remote url""""""""  Actual result: absent page is displayed because of missing subdir path  Expected result: subdirectory should be included.  Hint: use Ti._5.getAbsolutePath function""""""",Bug,"Title: MobileWeb: WebView works incorrectly when app is deployed not in server web root
