Description: """"Description: When attempting to build using SDK 1.7.3.v20111012103817 on iOS, the following console output appears: [INFO] Performing clean build [ERROR] /Users/<USER>Documents/Titanium Studio Workspace 3/deviceID1/build/iphone/Classes/TiUtils.m:1597:23: error: use of undeclared identifier 'CC_MD5_DIGEST_LENGTH' [3] [ERROR] [ERROR] Error: Traceback (most recent call last): File """"""""/Users/<USER>Library/Application Support/Titanium/mobilesdk/osx/1.7.3.v20111012103817/iphone/builder.py"""""""", line 1305, in main execute_xcode(""""""""iphoneos%s"""""""" % iphone_version,args,False) File """"""""/Users/<USER>Library/Application Support/Titanium/mobilesdk/osx/1.7.3.v20111012103817/iphone/builder.py"""""""", line 1066, in execute_xcode output = run.run(args,False,False,o) File """"""""/Users/<USER>Library/Application Support/Titanium/mobilesdk/osx/1.7.3.v20111012103817/iphone/run.py"""""""", line 39, in run sys.exit(rc) SystemExit: 65 Steps to reproduce: 1) Install SDK 1.7.3.v20111012103817 2) Attempt to build kitchensink to run on device Results: Undeclared Identifier as seen in above paste from console. Expected: No build errors """"",title+description
