TIMOB-5304,12,"""Handle NSURL in ConvertIdTiValue""","""""""It appears that sometimes properties can be set to object types which are not handled by ConvertIdTiValue() correctly. In particular, TiUIImageViewProxy's 'image' property can be set to an NSURL (and in fact, almost always is; see the -[TiProxy sanitizeURL:] function).    Test is in customer code.""""""",Bug,"Title: Handle NSURL in ConvertIdTiValue
Description: """"It appears that sometimes properties can be set to object types which are not handled by ConvertIdTiValue() correctly. In particular, TiUIImageViewProxy's 'image' property can be set to an NSURL (and in fact, almost always is; see the -[TiProxy sanitizeURL:] function). Test is in customer code.""""",title+description
