TIMOB-5274,12,"""Android: copy folder with contents ""","""""""In iOS you can copy a folder and all of its contents with the example below.   Android throws a null pointer exception.    Requesting the ability to copy a folder and all its contents for parity with iOS.    Step 1: create a folder named """"""""data"""""""" in your resources directory and make some files in it.  Step 2: run the code below  Step 3: click the """"""""Copy Folder button  Step 4: notice the null pointer exception  (This should copy the folder with contents and print the contents of the folder to the log)    {code:title=app.js}  var win = Ti.UI.createWindow({    backgroundColor: '#fff',   layout: 'vertical'  });    var testButton = Ti.UI.createButton({   title: """"""""Copy Folder"""""""",   top: 20,   height: 50,   width: 250,  });  testButton.addEventListener('click', function(e){   // this will copy the data folder and its contents   var srcDataDir = Ti.Filesystem.getFile(Ti.Filesystem.resourcesDirectory, """"""""data"""""""");     var destDataDir = Ti.Filesystem.getFile(Ti.Filesystem.applicationDataDirectory, """"""""data"""""""");     destDataDir.write(srcDataDir.read());     Ti.API.info(""""""""listing: """""""" + destDataDir.getDirectoryListing());  });    win.add(testButton);  win.open();  {code}    h4. Associated Helpdesk Ticket  http://appc.me/c/APP-728922""""""",New Feature,"Title: Android: copy folder with contents
Description: """"In iOS you can copy a folder and all of its contents with the example below. Android throws a null pointer exception. Requesting the ability to copy a folder and all its contents for parity with iOS. Step 1: create a folder named """"""""data"""""""" in your resources directory and make some files in it. Step 2: run the code below Step 3: click the """"""""Copy Folder button Step 4: notice the null pointer exception (This should copy the folder with contents and print the contents of the folder to the log) {code:title=app.js} var win = Ti.UI.createWindow({ backgroundColor: '#fff', layout: 'vertical' }); var testButton = Ti.UI.createButton({ title: """"""""Copy Folder"""""""", top: 20, height: 50, width: 250, }); testButton.addEventListener('click', function(e){ // this will copy the data folder and its contents var srcDataDir = Ti.Filesystem.getFile(Ti.Filesystem.resourcesDirectory, """"""""data""""""""); var destDataDir = Ti.Filesystem.getFile(Ti.Filesystem.applicationDataDirectory, """"""""data""""""""); destDataDir.write(srcDataDir.read()); Ti.API.info(""""""""listing: """""""" + destDataDir.getDirectoryListing()); }); win.add(testButton); win.open(); {code} h4. Associated Helpdesk Ticket http://appc.me/c/APP-728922""""",title+description
