TIMOB-5251,12,"""Kitchensink: Base UI>Views>Table Views>Row data from sections, table header scrolls off screen at row 4""","""""""Description:  While testing KitchenSink, Base UI>Views>Table Views>Row data from sections, I scrolled the tableview up and the header row moved off the screen at row 4.    Steps to reproduce:  1) Install KS 1.8.0 on device  2) Navigate to Base UI>Views>Table Views>Row data from sections  3) Scroll down    Result:  Header leaves the screen at with row 4    Expected:  Header remains on screen unless another header displaces it    Notes:  Also occurs  in 1.7.2""""""",Bug,"Title: Kitchensink: Base UI>Views>Table Views>Row data from sections, table header scrolls off screen at row 4
Description: """"Description: While testing KitchenSink, Base UI>Views>Table Views>Row data from sections, I scrolled the tableview up and the header row moved off the screen at row 4. Steps to reproduce: 1) Install KS 1.8.0 on device 2) Navigate to Base UI>Views>Table Views>Row data from sections 3) Scroll down Result: Header leaves the screen at with row 4 Expected: Header remains on screen unless another header displaces it Notes: Also occurs in 1.7.2""""",title+description
