Description: """"1. base ui > views > scrollable view 2. reload it a few times (back and forth to test list) results: either a red screen with Sep 8 10:52:40 unknown KitchenSink[1085] <Error>: -[__NSArrayM context]: unrecognized selector sent to instance 0x5f20a0 Sep 8 10:52:40 unknown UIKitApplication:com.<USER>ks180[0xfad3][1085] <Notice>: [ERROR] Script Error = -[__NSArrayM context]: unrecognized selector sent to instance 0x5f20a0 at scroll_views_scrollable.js (line 5). or it crashes Sep 8 10:47:44 unknown com.apple.launchd[1] <Warning>: (UIKitApplication:com.<USER>ks180[0xf0d]) Job appears to have crashed: Segmentation fault: 11 Sep 8 10:47:44 unknown SpringBoard[15] <Warning>: Application 'KitchenSink' exited abnormally with signal 11: Segmentation fault: 11 """"",title+description
