Description: """"Steps to Reproduce: 1. Create a Titanium mobile project for iOS 2. Copy the following code in app.js 3. Build and launch the application with iOS 5 simulator or iOS 5 device. Expected Result: NavBar Image should be displayed as with iOS 4 devices and simulator Actual Result: No NavBarImage is displayed""""",title+description
