Description: """"When building a window based app, opening a window (with no properties) in iOS results is a black BG window, where in Android it results in a window with a """"""""spashscreen background"""""""" (see attached images, the label is simply added to see the effect, but not needed to reproduce the """"""""issue"""""""") """"",title+description
