Description: """"With the current production release of Titanium Studio (build 1.0.4.201108101535), project creation fails for a project trying to use the mobile web preview linked to from here: http://support.<USER>com/kb/81/tickets This prevents customers from previewing the mobile web SDK. To duplicate, try installing the mobile web SDK and generate a new project from within Studio using this SDK version.""""",title+description
TIMOB-5188,12,"""Android: TouchEnabled property does not work on TableView""","""""""h3.Problem  TouchEnabled property does not work on TableView. We are not able to block the rows from firing the """"""""click"""""""" event.    h3.Reproducible Steps  1. Execute attached code  2. Click on any row  3. The """"""""click"""""""" event was executed however tableView has set a """"""""touchEnabled: false"""""""" property    h3.Sample Code        h3.Associated HelpDesk ticket  http://appc.me/a/APP-787515""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: TouchEnabled property does not work on TableView
