Description: """"h3.Problem The Horizontal layout does not work correctly, it adds extra padding on the top. On iOS works correctly. Please take a look at the screenshots I posted within this issue. h3.Regression Please run the code below(I attached project with example image). After running you would show a blue space which is the views background color. The images should start filling the view from the top-left (like in iOS). h3.Sample Code """"",title+description
