TIMOB-5054,12,"""Fastdev fills up logcat when ti.android.debug set to true in tiapp.xml""","""""""To recreate, make sure you have         in your tiapp.xml, and then also that fastdev is running (which it will do automatically if you launch from Titanium Studio.)  Then when you're app is running, check `adb logcat` and you'll see the tons of messages streaming by.    As we discussion, probably a new ti.android.log_level would be useful as part of the solution.""""""",Bug,"Title: Fastdev fills up logcat when ti.android.debug set to true in tiapp.xml
Description: """"To recreate, make sure you have in your tiapp.xml, and then also that fastdev is running (which it will do automatically if you launch from Titanium Studio.) Then when you're app is running, check `adb logcat` and you'll see the tons of messages streaming by. As we discussion, probably a new ti.android.log_level would be useful as part of the solution.""""",title+description
