Description: """"Master is broken. Apps run in simulator may exit with NSException or simply quit. Apps run on device fail with red screen and """"""""Could not find the file app.js"""""""". Master was working as of build: 8/16/11 9:55 Hash: 1033139 Failed on: 8/16/11 13:54 Hash: 4cc4275 """"",title+description
