Description: """"Whenever the test results for an iOS test suite exceed 8K, they are being cut off because the default max buffer size for HTTPServerRequest.read() is 8K. To reproduce this, run the {{xml}} test suite for iPhone: This is the command I use in Lion (your mileage may vary): Currently the test closes in the iPhone simulator, but Drillbit never seems to register that the test has finished.""""",title+description
