Description: """"setting android:screenOrientation for an activity in AndroidManifest.xml does not work with 1.7.2 but it does with 1.6.2 Step 1: run the code below Step 2: use a custom AndroidManifest.xml (documented in the wiki) Step 3: add android:screenOrientation=""""""""portrait"""""""" to the TiTabActivity in the AndroidManifest.xml {code:title=""""""""AndroidManifest.xml""""""""} <activity android:name=""""""""ti.modules.titanium.ui.TiTabActivity"""""""" android:screenOrientation=""""""""portrait"""""""" android:configChanges=""""""""keyboardHidden|orientation"""""""" /> h4. Workaround Use the orientationModes property of window h4. Associated Helpdesk Ticket http://appc.me/c/APP-688371""""",title+description
