TIMOB-4844,12,"""Enable property for setBuiltInZoomControls in WebViews on Android""","""""""Request that <USER>expose the {{setBuiltInZoomControls}} property on WebViews within Android so that zooming functionality can be _disabled_ in the application. Perhaps a property name like {{disableZoom}} might be more appropriate.    Android documentation: http://developer.android.com/reference/android/webkit/WebSettings.html#setBuiltInZoomControls(boolean)""""""",New Feature,"Title: Enable property for setBuiltInZoomControls in WebViews on Android
