TIMOB-4770,12,"""Android:  apiXmlNodeRemoveChild comparison between Ti.XML.Element and Ti.XML.Node fails""","""""""drillbit test for apiXmlNodeRemoveChild fails when comparing T.XML.Node to Ti.XML.Element.  These should compare correctly as element is still a node.""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: apiXmlNodeRemoveChild comparison between Ti.XML.Element and Ti.XML.Node fails
Description: """"drillbit test for apiXmlNodeRemoveChild fails when comparing T.XML.Node to Ti.XML.Element. These should compare correctly as element is still a node.""""",title+description
TIMOB-4769,12,"""Android:  XML.Node drillbit tests fails when comparing Ti.Element to Ti.Element""","""""""XML.Node drill tests:  apiXmlNodeAppendChild  apiXmlNodeInsertBefore  apiXmlNodeRemoveChild  apiXmlNodeReplaceChild    fails when comparing Ti.Element to Ti.Element.  Objects in question should not have been copied so should be equal to one another from memory address standpoint.""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: XML.Node drillbit tests fails when comparing Ti.Element to Ti.Element
Description: """"XML.Node drill tests: apiXmlNodeAppendChild apiXmlNodeInsertBefore apiXmlNodeRemoveChild apiXmlNodeReplaceChild fails when comparing Ti.Element to Ti.Element. Objects in question should not have been copied so should be equal to one another from memory address standpoint.""""",title+description
