TIMOB-4711,12,"""Tooling: Mobile sdk contains '.svn' dir of csscompiler project ""","""""""Its not nice do not remove '.svn' folder from production code since inside it migth be [security sensible information|http://www.techcrunch.com/2009/09/23/basic-flaw-reveals-source-code-to-3300-popular-websites/] """"""",Bug,"Title: Tooling: Mobile sdk contains '.svn' dir of csscompiler project
