TIMOB-4704,12,"""Android: XML Element.setAttributeNode(attr) causes NPE""","""""""Sample failing drillbit code:    {code:file=""""""""xml.js""""""""}  var doc = Ti.XML.parseString(this.testSource[""""""""nodes.xml""""""""]);  var node = doc.getElementsByTagName(""""""""node"""""""").item(0);  var attr = doc.createAttribute(""""""""newattr"""""""");  node.setAttributeNode(attr); // NPE  {code}    """"""",Bug,"Title: Android: XML Element.setAttributeNode(attr) causes NPE
Description: """"Sample failing drillbit code: {code:file=""""""""xml.js""""""""} var doc = Ti.XML.parseString(this.testSource[""""""""nodes.xml""""""""]); var node = doc.getElementsByTagName(""""""""node"""""""").item(0); var attr = doc.createAttribute(""""""""newattr""""""""); node.setAttributeNode(attr); // NPE {code} """"",title+description
TIMOB-4703,12,"""Android: Comparison of proxies for nodes that should be the same sometimes do not work.""","""""""This could potentially be a drillbit problem (specifically {{shouldBe}}), but I'm assuming it's actually Android.    Drillbit code from xml.js test shows that a node's attribute's ownerElement is not considered the same as the node (which it should be):     {code:title=xml.js}  var doc = Ti.XML.parseString(this.testSource[""""""""nodes.xml""""""""]);  var node = doc.getElementsByTagName(""""""""node"""""""").item(0);  var attr = node.attributes.item(0);  valueOf(attr.ownerElement).shouldBe(node); // FAILS  {code}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Comparison of proxies for nodes that should be the same sometimes do not work.
Description: """"This could potentially be a drillbit problem (specifically {{shouldBe}}), but I'm assuming it's actually Android. Drillbit code from xml.js test shows that a node's attribute's ownerElement is not considered the same as the node (which it should be): {code:title=xml.js} var doc = Ti.XML.parseString(this.testSource[""""""""nodes.xml""""""""]); var node = doc.getElementsByTagName(""""""""node"""""""").item(0); var attr = node.attributes.item(0); valueOf(attr.ownerElement).shouldBe(node); // FAILS {code}""""",title+description
