TIMOB-4658,12,"""iOS: Table row event listeners get lost from appendRows""","""""""Already figured this one out: During some codepaths with appendRow, we aren't doing the sectionProxy rememberProxy of the rowProxy. So the rows JS gets garbagecollected.  """"""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Table row event listeners get lost from appendRows
Description: """"Already figured this one out: During some codepaths with appendRow, we aren't doing the sectionProxy rememberProxy of the rowProxy. So the rows JS gets garbagecollected. """"",title+description
