TIMOB-4653,12,"""iOS: Write unit tests for Ti.UI.3DMatrix""","""""""iOS needs unit tests for 3DMatrix, to ensure that setting properties functions as it should and that applying transforms adjusts the dynamic view width/height properties appropriately.""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Write unit tests for Ti.UI.3DMatrix
