TIMOB-4624,12,"""Drillbit: Emulator Is Always Launching on Startup""","""""""Every time drillbit is launched now it fires up an emulator. It's also loading an API level 4 emulator by default, the default should now be API level 7.    Please correct drillbit to not launch an emulator until run is pressed and then have it be a level 7 emulator if one isn't already running.""""""",Bug,"Title: Drillbit: Emulator Is Always Launching on Startup
Description: """"Every time drillbit is launched now it fires up an emulator. It's also loading an API level 4 emulator by default, the default should now be API level 7. Please correct drillbit to not launch an emulator until run is pressed and then have it be a level 7 emulator if one isn't already running.""""",title+description
