TIMOB-4547,12,"""transport.py losing language files and default image files""","""""""After running the transport.py script, the language files are being lost (the app shows the key ref. for the locale text) & the resources folder has all the default <USER>Titanium appicon.png, default.png etc. files instead of app-specific files.""""""",Bug,"Title: transport.py losing language files and default image files
Description: """"After running the transport.py script, the language files are being lost (the app shows the key ref. for the locale text) & the resources folder has all the default <USER>Titanium appicon.png, default.png etc. files instead of app-specific files.""""",title+description
