TIMOB-4534,12,"""KitchenSink: Crash returning from Platform>Sockets>Listening socket""","""""""Description:  While testing KS, Platform>Sockets>Listening socket, I attempted to return to the """"""""Sockets"""""""" test table after completing the test and KS crashed.     See log and screenshot for more details.    Steps to reproduce:  1) Build KS with 1.7.2  2) Install KS on Android device  3) Navigate to Platform>Sockets>Listening socket  4) Click """"""""socket state""""""""  5) CLick """"""""Listen on 40404""""""""  6) Telnet to the Android with command """"""""telnet <Android's IP> 40404"""""""" from system on same network  7) Click """"""""write paradise lost""""""""  8) Click """"""""close""""""""   9) Click """"""""socket state""""""""  10) Tap """"""""back"""""""" button to leave test    Result:  KS crashes    Expected:  Normal resumption of tests    Notes:  Also occurs with KS built with 1.7.0    """"""",Bug,"Title: KitchenSink: Crash returning from Platform>Sockets>Listening socket
