TIMOB-4447,12,"""Android: JSS picks up jss file from the iphone folder""","""""""h3. The Problem  If you place the .jss files in their respective """"""""/resources/iphone/"""""""" and """"""""/resources/android/"""""""" folders and run the app.js file you'll find that on android it loads the """"""""/resources/iphone/app.jss"""""""" file instead of the one for """"""""/resources/android/app.jss"""""""" file.   If you then remove the .jss file from the /iphone/ folder it correctly finds the android .jss file  h3. To reproduce:  Follow instructions and use the code in the gist.  https://gist.github.com/2d9511792698cf93dd41  h3. Helpdesk Ticket:  APP-934675""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: JSS picks up jss file from the iphone folder
Description: """"h3. The Problem If you place the .jss files in their respective """"""""/resources/iphone/"""""""" and """"""""/resources/android/"""""""" folders and run the app.js file you'll find that on android it loads the """"""""/resources/iphone/app.jss"""""""" file instead of the one for """"""""/resources/android/app.jss"""""""" file. If you then remove the .jss file from the /iphone/ folder it correctly finds the android .jss file h3. To reproduce: Follow instructions and use the code in the gist. https://gist.github.com/2d9511792698cf93dd41 h3. Helpdesk Ticket: APP-934675""""",title+description
TIMOB-4446,12,"""iOS 5- Video Recording crashes on 1.7""","""""""Testing on 1.7.0 RC crashes the app.    h3. The Problem  Start recording a video with the iPhone and then press stop. App crashes    h3. To Reproduce  - Open the KS in the device, make sure it's running at least the 1.7.0 RC.  - Phone --> Record Video  - Start recording and then stop  - App crashes    h3. Source code:  https://github.com/<USER>KitchenSink/blob/master/Resources/examples/record_video.js    h3. Tested on:  - iPhone 4 with iOS 5  - iPad 2 with iOS 5    h3. Helpdesk Ticket:  APP-949988""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS 5- Video Recording crashes on 1.7
Description: """"Testing on 1.7.0 RC crashes the app. h3. The Problem Start recording a video with the iPhone and then press stop. App crashes h3. To Reproduce - Open the KS in the device, make sure it's running at least the 1.7.0 RC. - Phone --> Record Video - Start recording and then stop - App crashes h3. Source code: https://github.com/<USER>KitchenSink/blob/master/Resources/examples/record_video.js h3. Tested on: - iPhone 4 with iOS 5 - iPad 2 with iOS 5 h3. Helpdesk Ticket: APP-949988""""",title+description
TIMOB-4445,12,"""Module build.py Always Warns About Default License""","""""""h1. Problem  The module.py in the module template always warns that the default license text is being used:      h1. Fix  Line 102 of support/module/iphone/templates/build.py is wrong:  {code:title=existing.build.py}   if c.find(module_license_default)!=1:  {code}  !=1 should be !=-1""""""",Bug,"Title: Module build.py Always Warns About Default License
Description: """"h1. Problem The module.py in the module template always warns that the default license text is being used: h1. Fix Line 102 of support/module/iphone/templates/build.py is wrong: {code:title=existing.build.py} if c.find(module_license_default)!=1: {code} !=1 should be !=-1""""",title+description
