TIMOB-4443,12,"""Android: Programatic Access to Preference Titles and Summaries""","""""""h1. Feature  Expose programatic access to preferences' titles and summaries on Android so that developers can customize what is shown by Ti.UI.Android.openPreferences().    h2. Possible Usage  {code:title=app.js}  Titanium.App.Properties.setTitle('propKey', 'This Is A Title!');  Titanium.App.Properties.setSummary('propKey', 'And this is a summary...');  {code}    h2. Documentation  http://developer.android.com/reference/android/preference/Preference.html#setSummary(java.lang.CharSequence)    h3. Associated Helpdesk Ticket  http://appc.me/c/APP-589371""""""",New Feature,"Title: Android: Programatic Access to Preference Titles and Summaries
Description: """"h1. Feature Expose programatic access to preferences' titles and summaries on Android so that developers can customize what is shown by Ti.UI.Android.openPreferences(). h2. Possible Usage {code:title=app.js} Titanium.App.Properties.setTitle('propKey', 'This Is A Title!'); Titanium.App.Properties.setSummary('propKey', 'And this is a summary...'); {code} h2. Documentation http://developer.android.com/reference/android/preference/Preference.html#setSummary(java.lang.CharSequence) h3. Associated Helpdesk Ticket http://appc.me/c/APP-589371""""",title+description
TIMOB-4441,12,"""Application and Simulator crashes sequentially when launched from xCode 4.2""","""""""1) Install xCode 4.2 beta  2) Launch Studio in the noted environment  3) Have or create a simple mobile project  4) Use run configuration to target a 4.3 simulator  5) Launch simulator    Results:  App crashes on launch.  A few seconds later, the simulator crashes.    Notes:  Does not occur when using the same configuration on Lion.  On 10.6.7 targetting the iOS 5.0 simulator works as expected.""""""",Bug,"Title: Application and Simulator crashes sequentially when launched from xCode 4.2
Description: """"1) Install xCode 4.2 beta 2) Launch Studio in the noted environment 3) Have or create a simple mobile project 4) Use run configuration to target a 4.3 simulator 5) Launch simulator Results: App crashes on launch. A few seconds later, the simulator crashes. Notes: Does not occur when using the same configuration on Lion. On 10.6.7 targetting the iOS 5.0 simulator works as expected.""""",title+description
