TIMOB-4259,12,"""iOS: TiVerify is not done on device and device never gets the unlicensed message""","""""""Steps to Reproduce 1. Create a new project with unlicense user 2. Add modules to the project 3. Compile and run on device  Actual Result: Do not get an unlicensed error   Expected Result: To get an unlicensed error  Workaround: Test with simulator to see the error message""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: TiVerify is not done on device and device never gets the unlicensed message
Description: """"Steps to Reproduce 1. Create a new project with unlicense user 2. Add modules to the project 3. Compile and run on device Actual Result: Do not get an unlicensed error Expected Result: To get an unlicensed error Workaround: Test with simulator to see the error message""""",title+description
