Description: """"Reimplement tableviews and tableviewcells using the latest APIs from Apple. The old tableview implementation was based on 3.2 APIs and has grown crufty. Additionally, implement a minimal dynamic data source API to feed the table. Use Apple apis for search.""""",title+description
TIMOB-4250,12,"""Single deployment-target set in tiapp.xml create multiple targets in Xcode""","""""""If you set your deployment-targets to iPhone or iPad only, there are still 3 targets created in Xcode (iPhone, iPad, Universal).  tiapp.xml file: http://screencast.com/t/iLYcqMBVeCQ  xcode result: http://screencast.com/t/u4akpy1g  Users need to be able to set a single deployment device.  Set this in any tiapp.xml file, and do a clean build for testing: """"""",Bug,"Title: Single deployment-target set in tiapp.xml create multiple targets in Xcode
Description: """"If you set your deployment-targets to iPhone or iPad only, there are still 3 targets created in Xcode (iPhone, iPad, Universal). tiapp.xml file: http://screencast.com/t/iLYcqMBVeCQ xcode result: http://screencast.com/t/u4akpy1g Users need to be able to set a single deployment device. Set this in any tiapp.xml file, and do a clean build for testing: """"",title+description
TIMOB-4249,12,"""Request for archive file (zip) processing functions""","""""""A number of users have requested zip file processing functions for Android. This ticket has been raised to track the request.    The following resources may or may not be useful:    * Android Developers [java.util.zip|http://developer.android.com/reference/java/util/zip/package-summary.html]  * [user-provided Q&A solution|http://developer.<USER>com/question/116956/zip-and-unzip-file-with-nandroid#206052]  * [androzip|https://github.com/websiteburo/androzip]  """"""",New Feature,"Title: Request for archive file (zip) processing functions
