TIMOB-4225,12,"""KitchenSink: Platform > XHR > File download, repeatedly pressing """"Large File Download"""" results in multiple downloads starting and eventual crash""","""""""Description: While testing KitchenSink, Platform>XHR>File download, I repeatedly pressed the """"""""Large File Download"""""""" button. The progress bar alternates displaying the progress of the various streams. If you initiate enough downloads, the app may crash.   Steps to reproduce: 1) Install KS 1.7.0 on a mobile device 2) Navigate to KitchenSink, Platform>XHR>File download 3) Repeatedly press the """"""""Large File Download"""""""" button  Result: Multiple downloads begin, the progress bar alternates showing status for each. Possible crash.  Expected Result: Single download, no crash  Notes:""""""",Bug,"Title: KitchenSink: Platform > XHR > File download, repeatedly pressing """"Large File Download"""" results in multiple downloads starting and eventual crash
Description: """"Description: While testing KitchenSink, Platform>XHR>File download, I repeatedly pressed the """"""""Large File Download"""""""" button. The progress bar alternates displaying the progress of the various streams. If you initiate enough downloads, the app may crash. Steps to reproduce: 1) Install KS 1.7.0 on a mobile device 2) Navigate to KitchenSink, Platform>XHR>File download 3) Repeatedly press the """"""""Large File Download"""""""" button Result: Multiple downloads begin, the progress bar alternates showing status for each. Possible crash. Expected Result: Single download, no crash Notes:""""",title+description
TIMOB-4224,12,"""Android: KitchenSink Base UI>Views>Options Dialog: It's possible to generate empty dialog""","""""""Description: While testing KitchenSink, Base UI>Views>Options Dialog, I pressed """"""""modify and show dialog"""""""" (the bottom one) prior to """"""""Show Dialog 1"""""""" and was presented with an empty dialog. See attached image  Steps to reproduce: 1) Install KS 1.7 on Android device 2) Navigate to Base UI>Views>Options Dialog 3) Press """"""""modify and show dialog"""""""" (the bottom one) 4) Dismiss the dialog by pressing """"""""ok"""""""" 5) Press """"""""Show Dialog 1""""""""  Result: Empty dialog shown  Expected Result: No empty dialog  Notes: Occurs in KS 1.6.2""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: KitchenSink Base UI>Views>Options Dialog: It's possible to generate empty dialog
Description: """"Description: While testing KitchenSink, Base UI>Views>Options Dialog, I pressed """"""""modify and show dialog"""""""" (the bottom one) prior to """"""""Show Dialog 1"""""""" and was presented with an empty dialog. See attached image Steps to reproduce: 1) Install KS 1.7 on Android device 2) Navigate to Base UI>Views>Options Dialog 3) Press """"""""modify and show dialog"""""""" (the bottom one) 4) Dismiss the dialog by pressing """"""""ok"""""""" 5) Press """"""""Show Dialog 1"""""""" Result: Empty dialog shown Expected Result: No empty dialog Notes: Occurs in KS 1.6.2""""",title+description
