TIMOB-4199,12,"""iOS: Debugger fails to connect when running certain projects, the debugger.plist is not being created""","""""""Steps to Reproduce: 1. Get the project from barcelona: 10.0.1.40/<USER>Thomas/forNatalie/KitchenSinkThomas 2. Add a breakpoint on line 21 in the app.js file 3. Run project in debug  Actual Result: Debugger progress waits for debugger to connect and stuck at 57% and application just launches  Expected Result: To stop at the breakpoint  Note: Same project works fine with Android""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Debugger fails to connect when running certain projects, the debugger.plist is not being created
