TIMOB-4192,12,"""XCode 4.0.2 breaks log messages in Ti Dev and Ti Studio against iOS 4.3""","""""""h1. Problem Ti.API.log (including info, warn, error) messages don't show up in a very particular scenario. If you use the latest version of XCode (4.0.2) and target iOS 4.3 from Titanium Developer, the messages don't show up. Point at iOS 4.2, and the messages will show up.  h2. Sample Code   h2. How To Reproduce # Open up Ti Dev or Ti Studio # Make sure XCode 4.0.2 installed # Target iOS 4.3 with the sample code # Run it, and you won't see the """"""""PASS:"""""""" message. # Target iOS 4.2 # Run it, and you will see the """"""""PASS:"""""""" message.  h2. Tested On BROKEN with XCode 4.0.2 targeting iOS 4.3 WORKS with XCode 4.0.2 targeting iOS 4.2 WORKS with XCode 4.0 targeting iOS 4.3 WORKS with XCode 4.0 targeting iOS 4.2 REPRODUCED IN: Ti Studio, Ti Developer 1.2.1, Ti Developer 1.2.2  h2. Run in XCode As a side note... if you run the Titanium mobile project directly from XCode, you will see the log messages you expect. Even though they don't show up in Ti Stud or Ti Dev, they will show up in XCode's console.  h3. Associated Helpdesk Ticket http://appc.me/c/APP-476989""""""",Bug,"Title: XCode 4.0.2 breaks log messages in Ti Dev and Ti Studio against iOS 4.3
Description: """"h1. Problem Ti.API.log (including info, warn, error) messages don't show up in a very particular scenario. If you use the latest version of XCode (4.0.2) and target iOS 4.3 from Titanium Developer, the messages don't show up. Point at iOS 4.2, and the messages will show up. h2. Sample Code h2. How To Reproduce # Open up Ti Dev or Ti Studio # Make sure XCode 4.0.2 installed # Target iOS 4.3 with the sample code # Run it, and you won't see the """"""""PASS:"""""""" message. # Target iOS 4.2 # Run it, and you will see the """"""""PASS:"""""""" message. h2. Tested On BROKEN with XCode 4.0.2 targeting iOS 4.3 WORKS with XCode 4.0.2 targeting iOS 4.2 WORKS with XCode 4.0 targeting iOS 4.3 WORKS with XCode 4.0 targeting iOS 4.2 REPRODUCED IN: Ti Studio, Ti Developer 1.2.1, Ti Developer 1.2.2 h2. Run in XCode As a side note... if you run the Titanium mobile project directly from XCode, you will see the log messages you expect. Even though they don't show up in Ti Stud or Ti Dev, they will show up in XCode's console. h3. Associated Helpdesk Ticket http://appc.me/c/APP-476989""""",title+description
TIMOB-4191,12,"""Locale.getString() produces exception when underscore is used in key arg AND hint arg is used AND key does not exist in strings.xml""",""""""" [Ti.Locale.getString()|http://developer.<USER>com/apidoc/mobile/latest/Titanium.Locale.getString-method.html] produces an exception when ALL of the following conditions are present:  * a underscores (or no-doubt other non-alphanumeric characters) are used in the key parameter, in the first argument of Ti.Locale.getString() * the hint argument of Ti.Locale.getString() is used * key does not exist in strings.xml  The following code demonstrates this:  {code:lang=javascript|title=app.js} var win1 = Ti.UI.createWindow({  backgroundColor:""""""""red"""""""",  exitOnClose:true,  navBarHidden:false,  title:""""""""Main Window"""""""" });  win1.open();  Ti.API.info(L(""""""""info0"""""""",""""""""No translation available for info0"""""""")); // translation exists - produces correct translation Ti.API.info(L(""""""""info_0"""""""",""""""""No translation available for info_0"""""""")); // translation exists - produces correct translation Ti.API.info(L(""""""""info1"""""""",""""""""No translation available for info1"""""""")); // translation does not exist - produces hint message Ti.API.info(L(""""""""info_1"""""""",""""""""No translation available for info_1"""""""")); // translation does not exist - produces exception followed by hint message   This results in the following output:  {code:lang=none|title=logcat output} 2364                  TiAPI  I  (kroll$1: app://app.js) [198,597] Hello0   2364                  TiAPI  I  (kroll$1: app://app.js) [2,599] Hello_0   2364                  TiAPI  I  (kroll$1: app://app.js) [12,611] No translation available for info1   2364           ResourceType  W  Failure getting entry for 0x7f040002 (t=3 e=2) in package 0 (error -75)   2364         TitaniumModule  E  (kroll$1: app://app.js) [9,620] Exception trying to localize string 'info_1':    2364         TitaniumModule  E  androi