ssage(KrollContext.java:217)   2364         TitaniumModule  E   at org.<USER>titanium.TiMessageQueue.handleMessage(TiMessageQueue.java:223)   2364         TitaniumModule  E   at android.os.Handler.dispatchMessage(Handler.java:95)   2364         TitaniumModule  E   at android.os.Looper.loop(Looper.java:123)   2364         TitaniumModule  E   at org.<USER>titanium.kroll.KrollHandlerThread.run(KrollHandlerThread.java:86)   2364                  TiAPI  I  (kroll$1: app://app.js) [24,644] No translation available for info_1 {code}""""""",Bug,"Title: Locale.getString() produces exception when underscore is used in key arg AND hint arg is used AND key does not exist in strings.xml
