TIMOB-4145,12,"""Android: KitchenSink Base UI > Window (Standalone) """"Traditional modal"""" and """"nav bar covered"""" windows do not cover nav bar on Droid""","""""""Description: While testing KS 1.7.0, Base UI > Window (Standalone), I opened """"""""traditional modal"""""""" window and a """"""""nav bar covered"""""""" window. Neither covered the Nav bar. In the case of the modal window, there is a """"""""vibrate"""""""" button that is partially obscured by the nav bar.  This does not occur on the Nexus S or the Galaxy tab.  Steps to reproduce: 1) Install KS 1.7.0 on the Droid 2) Navigate to Base UI > Window (Standalone)  3) Click either """"""""traditional modal"""""""" or """"""""nav bar covered""""""""  Result: Nav bar not covered  Expected Result: Nav bar covered  Notes: Also occurs on 1.6.2 on the droid 1.""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: KitchenSink Base UI > Window (Standalone) """"Traditional modal"""" and """"nav bar covered"""" windows do not cover nav bar on Droid
Description: """"Description: While testing KS 1.7.0, Base UI > Window (Standalone), I opened """"""""traditional modal"""""""" window and a """"""""nav bar covered"""""""" window. Neither covered the Nav bar. In the case of the modal window, there is a """"""""vibrate"""""""" button that is partially obscured by the nav bar. This does not occur on the Nexus S or the Galaxy tab. Steps to reproduce: 1) Install KS 1.7.0 on the Droid 2) Navigate to Base UI > Window (Standalone) 3) Click either """"""""traditional modal"""""""" or """"""""nav bar covered"""""""" Result: Nav bar not covered Expected Result: Nav bar covered Notes: Also occurs on 1.6.2 on the droid 1.""""",title+description
TIMOB-4144,12,"""Android: Text area - focus highlight issues after certain keyboard actions""","""""""1.Text Area > Basic 2.invoke keyboard 3.toggle editable 4.enter some chars, tap back button 2X (once to dismiss the keyboard, once to go back a level) 5.see the table cells results: unexpected highlight/focus on tableView row  not seen using 1.6.2""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Text area - focus highlight issues after certain keyboard actions
