TIMOB-4133,12,"""Android tooling: """"Device Not Found"""" and """"Waiting for SDCard"""" messages appear when packaging for distribution""","""""""Reproduce:  * Open mobile project (with android selected as a target) in Titanium Studio.  * Choose the Distribute - Android option from the Deploy menu item on the toolbar inside the App Explorer.  * Watch the output -- you'll see the message referred to.  Expected:  No messages concerning SDCards or inability to find devices, since we're packaging.""""""",Bug,"Title: Android tooling: """"Device Not Found"""" and """"Waiting for SDCard"""" messages appear when packaging for distribution
Description: """"Reproduce: * Open mobile project (with android selected as a target) in Titanium Studio. * Choose the Distribute - Android option from the Deploy menu item on the toolbar inside the App Explorer. * Watch the output -- you'll see the message referred to. Expected: No messages concerning SDCards or inability to find devices, since we're packaging.""""",title+description
TIMOB-4132,12,"""Unusable properties backgroundDisabledColor and backgroundDisabledImage. ""","""""""I found backgroundDisabledColor and backgroundDisabledImage properties of the Label object in the Titanium Mobile API docs (http://developer.<USER>com/apidoc/mobile/latest/Titanium.UI.Label-object). But I can't find property Enabled for Label object(property Enabled is present in Button). In which condition the background Color(Image) of the Label will change to DisabledColor(DisabledImage)? Or it is bug in the documentation and there is no such properties? The same thing is with View and ScrollView objects (maybe other). Please comment this issue.""""""",Story,"Title: Unusable properties backgroundDisabledColor and backgroundDisabledImage.
Description: """"I found backgroundDisabledColor and backgroundDisabledImage properties of the Label object in the Titanium Mobile API docs (http://developer.<USER>com/apidoc/mobile/latest/Titanium.UI.Label-object). But I can't find property Enabled for Label object(property Enabled is present in Button). In which condition the background Color(Image) of the Label will change to DisabledColor(DisabledImage)? Or it is bug in the documentation and there is no such properties? The same thing is with View and ScrollView objects (maybe other). Please comment this issue.""""",title+description
TIMOB-4128,12,"""scrollableView addView() first view does not to display until scrolled forward and back""","""""""See [this video|http://dl.dropbox.com/u/14392713/scrollableView-addView-issue.ogv] that shows the code below in action.  The issue is that the first view is not displayed until the user scrolls forward and back one view. This behavior is *not* exhibited if the views are assigned to an array and then to the scrollableView via the {{views}} property.  """"""",Bug,"Title: scrollableView addView() first view does not to display until scrolled forward and back
Description: """"See [this video|http://dl.dropbox.com/u/14392713/scrollableView-addView-issue.ogv] that shows the code below in action. The issue is that the first view is not displayed until the user scrolls forward and back one view. This behavior is *not* exhibited if the views are assigned to an array and then to the scrollableView via the {{views}} property. """"",title+description
