TIMOB-4125,12,"""Android: String/Text Properties on Proxies Initial Value Should be ''. The Empty String""","""""""A community member brought up the discussion that Android text proxies, specifically SearchBar.value, was returning '' for iOS and undefined for Android. Group API discussion ensued and we are stating that the initial values should be '' (the empty string) for Label.text, TextField.value, TextArea.value, and Button.title. Other fields may get added to this list over time.""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: String/Text Properties on Proxies Initial Value Should be ''. The Empty String
Description: """"A community member brought up the discussion that Android text proxies, specifically SearchBar.value, was returning '' for iOS and undefined for Android. Group API discussion ensued and we are stating that the initial values should be '' (the empty string) for Label.text, TextField.value, TextArea.value, and Button.title. Other fields may get added to this list over time.""""",title+description
