TIMOB-4078,12,"""Android: Fastdev: Cannot kill a running application, it just restarts the application""","""""""Steps to Reproduce:  1. Launch the application in emulator from TiStudio (Make sure server is running)  2. From the terminal in the current project type """"""""titanium fastdev kill-app""""""""     Actual Result:  Application Restarts    Expected Result:  Application should be killed""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Fastdev: Cannot kill a running application, it just restarts the application
Description: """"Steps to Reproduce: 1. Launch the application in emulator from TiStudio (Make sure server is running) 2. From the terminal in the current project type """"""""titanium fastdev kill-app"""""""" Actual Result: Application Restarts Expected Result: Application should be killed""""",title+description
TIMOB-4076,12,"""iOS: KitchenSink map view with route: route disappears when zoomed in""","""""""Description: While using KS, Base UI>Views>Map View with Routing, zooming in past a certain level will cause the route line to disappear. Zooming back out will restore the route line.  Steps to reproduce: 1) Install KS 2) Navigate to Base UI>Views>Map View with Routing 3) zoom in  Result: The route line will disappear  Expected result: Route line remains regardless of zoom level  Notes: Also occurs on 1.6.2""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: KitchenSink map view with route: route disappears when zoomed in
Description: """"Description: While using KS, Base UI>Views>Map View with Routing, zooming in past a certain level will cause the route line to disappear. Zooming back out will restore the route line. Steps to reproduce: 1) Install KS 2) Navigate to Base UI>Views>Map View with Routing 3) zoom in Result: The route line will disappear Expected result: Route line remains regardless of zoom level Notes: Also occurs on 1.6.2""""",title+description
