TIMOB-3886,12,"""Ti.Stream needs close() operation""","""""""Need to add close() to stream spec.  close() is:  1. Blocking 2. Throws exception on error 3. Return type 'void'  ... Check with Opie to see if we need isOpen(), other type of status, etc.""""""",New Feature,"Title: Ti.Stream needs close() operation
Description: """"Need to add close() to stream spec. close() is: 1. Blocking 2. Throws exception on error 3. Return type 'void' ... Check with Opie to see if we need isOpen(), other type of status, etc.""""",title+description
