TIMOB-3836,12,"""Android 3.0 xoom: Force close and relaunch causes the application to fail to display alerts""","""""""Steps to Reproduce:  1. Run TIMOB-3819 to get the crash  2. Press force close  3. Kitchen Sink relaunches itself   4. Run Base UI > Views > Table Views > Basic  5. Tap on each row    Actual Result:  The alert is not displayed    Expected Result:  Should display the alert  """"""",Bug,"Title: Android 3.0 xoom: Force close and relaunch causes the application to fail to display alerts
Description: """"Steps to Reproduce: 1. Run TIMOB-3819 to get the crash 2. Press force close 3. Kitchen Sink relaunches itself 4. Run Base UI > Views > Table Views > Basic 5. Tap on each row Actual Result: The alert is not displayed Expected Result: Should display the alert """"",title+description
TIMOB-3835,12,"""Android 3.0 xoom: The radio selection button looks pixelated""","""""""Steps to Reproduce:  1. Launch Kitchen Sink  2. Run Controls > Picker  > Basic Picker  3. Select Picker to see the radio button options    Actual Result:  The radio button looks pixelated    Expected Result:  The button should be more sharp""""""",Bug,"Title: Android 3.0 xoom: The radio selection button looks pixelated
Description: """"Steps to Reproduce: 1. Launch Kitchen Sink 2. Run Controls > Picker > Basic Picker 3. Select Picker to see the radio button options Actual Result: The radio button looks pixelated Expected Result: The button should be more sharp""""",title+description
