TIMOB-3831,12,"""Android 3.0 Xoom: Text field - blur does not dismiss keyboard""","""""""1. controls > search bar results: keyboard is invoked by default (not seen in 2.3)  2. tap blur results: keyboard starts going down then pops back up.  3. dismiss keyboard 4.tap blur  results: keyboard is invoked unexpectedly""""""",Bug,"Title: Android 3.0 Xoom: Text field - blur does not dismiss keyboard
Description: """"1. controls > search bar results: keyboard is invoked by default (not seen in 2.3) 2. tap blur results: keyboard starts going down then pops back up. 3. dismiss keyboard 4.tap blur results: keyboard is invoked unexpectedly""""",title+description
