TIMOB-3817,12,"""Android: Support Titanium.Media.VideoPlayer.thumbnailImageAtTime""","""""""h1. Feature On iOS, we have the Titanium.Media.VideoPlayer.thumbnailImageAtTime function which takes a time and an options array, and returns a blob thumbnail. Android doesn't have this function implemented.  So we can either add it to Android, or update the documentation saying it is not available for Android.  h2. Documentation http://developer.<USER>com/apidoc/mobile/latest/Titanium.Media.VideoPlayer.thumbnailImageAtTime-method.html  h2. Associated Helpdesk Ticket http://appc.me/c/APP-565369""""""",New Feature,"Title: Android: Support Titanium.Media.VideoPlayer.thumbnailImageAtTime
Description: """"h1. Feature On iOS, we have the Titanium.Media.VideoPlayer.thumbnailImageAtTime function which takes a time and an options array, and returns a blob thumbnail. Android doesn't have this function implemented. So we can either add it to Android, or update the documentation saying it is not available for Android. h2. Documentation http://developer.<USER>com/apidoc/mobile/latest/Titanium.Media.VideoPlayer.thumbnailImageAtTime-method.html h2. Associated Helpdesk Ticket http://appc.me/c/APP-565369""""",title+description
