TIMOB-3792,12,"""iOS: Listening socket terminates Kitchen Sink after telnet session""","""""""Steps to Reproduce: 1. Launch Kitchen Sink 2. Run Platform > Sockets > Listening socket 3. Click on Listen on 40404 4. Open a telnet session and 'telnet <address> 40404>  Actual Result: Kitchen Sink exits <USER>mbp:Desktop <USER> telnet 10.0.1.96 40404 Trying 10.0.1.96... Connected to 10.0.1.96. Escape character is '^]'. Connection closed by foreign host.  Expected Result: Open the connection  Note: Last working on INFO Titanium SDK version: 1.7.0 (04/19/11 07:22 ad264c9...)""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Listening socket terminates Kitchen Sink after telnet session
