TIMOB-3650,12,"""Fix TODOs in code added for 1.7.0""","""""""We've got a lot of TODOs peppered throughout the new code that I wrote for this release, implementing Ti.Buffer, Ti.Codec, Ti.Stream, and Ti.Network.Socket.TCP.  This is an umbrella ticket for handling these, divided up into subtasks.    Each subtask should be considered:    1. Review code for obvious (and otherwise) mistakes  2. Fix TODOs if you can!""""""",Bug,"Title: Fix TODOs in code added for 1.7.0
Description: """"We've got a lot of TODOs peppered throughout the new code that I wrote for this release, implementing Ti.Buffer, Ti.Codec, Ti.Stream, and Ti.Network.Socket.TCP. This is an umbrella ticket for handling these, divided up into subtasks. Each subtask should be considered: 1. Review code for obvious (and otherwise) mistakes 2. Fix TODOs if you can!""""",title+description
