TIMOB-3636,12,"""iOS: After animation completes the image flickers before being set""","""""""Steps to Reproduce:  1. Launch Kitchen Sink  2. Run Base UI > Animation  > Controls  3. Click on Animate me    Actual Result:  After animation completes it flickers before setting on its position    Expected Result:  Not to flicker after animation""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: After animation completes the image flickers before being set
