TIMOB-3634,12,"""iOS: Clicking all of the options causes the anchor point to lose its position""","""""""Steps to Reproduce:  1. Launch Kitchen Sink  2. Run Base UI > Animation > Anchor Point  3. Click on all the buttons 1 right after another    Actual:  The blocks loses its position    Expected:  For all the blocks to go back to the original position after rotating on the point""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Clicking all of the options causes the anchor point to lose its position
