TIMOB-3633,12,"""iOS: Run Query/Display properties on Facebook crashes with """"Terminating app due to uncaught exception 'NSInvalidArgumentException""""""","""""""Steps to Reproduce: 1. Launch Kitchen Sink 2. Run Mashups > Facebook > Query 3. Login and then click on Run Query  Actual Result: Crashed with exception (See attached logs)  Expected Result: To display the query results  Note same failure when running Display Properties""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Run Query/Display properties on Facebook crashes with """"Terminating app due to uncaught exception 'NSInvalidArgumentException""""
