TIMOB-3632,12,"""Android - AudioPlayer doesnt work on 2.1""","""""""As described on ticket: TIU-17828-443 ( http://support.<USER>com/tickets/TIU-17828-443/homepage ) The Audio Player for android works on SDK 2.2 but not on SDK 2.1    Sample Code: http://pastie.org/private/au5whnxxvdhqzlqnn31mvq    Tested on Android Emulator APIs 2.2 and 2.1  Ti SDK 1.6.3 (Apr 18 2011 16:23 rb8672b44)""""""",Bug,"Title: Android - AudioPlayer doesnt work on 2.1
