TIMOB-3612,12,"""Android: orientationModes does not work""","""""""Setting the orientationModes property on a window does not have any effect. If the window is heavyweight then the window will not rotate. If the window is lightweight, the window will rotate in any direction. Both behaviors happen irrelevant of what is set for orientationModes.    Step 1: run the code below  Step 2: if fullscreen is not set, notice that the window rotates to any orientation no matter what is set for win.orientationModes  Step 3: if fullscreen is true, notice that the window will only be portrait no matter what is set for win.orientationModes        h2. Tested On  Android 2.2 Emulator, TiSDK 1.6.1  Galaxy Tab 2.2.1, TiSDK 1.6.1    h2. Associated Helpdesk Ticket  http://support-admin.<USER>com/display/ZYS-62136-677""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: orientationModes does not work
Description: """"Setting the orientationModes property on a window does not have any effect. If the window is heavyweight then the window will not rotate. If the window is lightweight, the window will rotate in any direction. Both behaviors happen irrelevant of what is set for orientationModes. Step 1: run the code below Step 2: if fullscreen is not set, notice that the window rotates to any orientation no matter what is set for win.orientationModes Step 3: if fullscreen is true, notice that the window will only be portrait no matter what is set for win.orientationModes h2. Tested On Android 2.2 Emulator, TiSDK 1.6.1 Galaxy Tab 2.2.1, TiSDK 1.6.1 h2. Associated Helpdesk Ticket http://support-admin.<USER>com/display/ZYS-62136-677""""",title+description
