TIMOB-3578,12,"""iOS: facebook - canceling log in and returning app results in BaseUI Tab loading blank window""","""""""{html}<div><p>3g iphone 3.1.3, ipod 4gt 4.3, Apr 11 2011 17:20 rcb9c6dc4. New to 1.7.0</p> <ol> <li>Log in/log out test case<br></li> <li>force dialog: false<br></li> <li>tap log in button<br></li> <li>hit cancel on resulting dialog<br></li> <li>Tap Base UI</li> </ol> <p>results: contents of base UI are now blank</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: facebook - canceling log in and returning app results in BaseUI Tab loading blank window
