TIMOB-3574,12,"""iOS: intermittent error (callback exception) seen on append row test case and Events test case""","""""""{html}<div><p>Apr 11 2011 17:20 rcb9c6dc4, 3g iphone 3.1.3, ipod 4gt 4.3. New to 1.7.0</p> <p>1.Base UI &gt; Views &gt; Table Views &gt; Append Row<br> 2.Tap append row with header<br> 3.tap revealed row<br> 4.try a few more times if error not seen (quite intermittent)</p> <p>AND/OR</p> <p>1.Base UI &gt; Views &gt; Table Views &gt; Events<br> 2.tap the various objects</p> <p>results: following exceptions were seen. Tough to reliably reproduce.</p> <p>for append row:<br> Tue Apr 12 12:38:09 unknown UIKitApplication:com.<USER>titanium[0x35a7][365] : <a href= """"""""/projects/32238/changesets/WARN"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [WARN]"""""""">[WARN]</a> Exception in event callback. {<br> Tue Apr 12 12:38:09 unknown UIKitApplication:com.<USER>titanium[0x35a7][365] : expressionBeginOffset = 379;<br> Tue Apr 12 12:38:09 unknown UIKitApplication:com.<USER>titanium[0x35a7][365] : expressionCaretOffset = 382;<br> Tue Apr 12 12:38:09 unknown UIKitApplication:com.<USER>titanium[0x35a7][365] : expressionEndOffset = 393;<br> Tue Apr 12 12:38:09 unknown UIKitApplication:com.<USER>titanium[0x35a7][365] : line = 2;<br> Tue Apr 12 12:38:09 unknown UIKitApplication:com.<USER>titanium[0x35a7][365] : message = """"""""Result of expression 'row' <a href= """"""""/projects/32238/changesets/undefined"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [undefined]"""""""">[undefined]</a> is not an object."""""""";<br> Tue Apr 12 12:38:09 unknown UIKitApplication:com.<USER>titanium[0x35a7][365] : name = TypeError;<br> Tue Apr 12 12:38:09 unknown UIKitApplication:com.<USER>titanium[0x35a7][365] : sourceId = 86925864;<br> Tue Apr 12 12:38:09 unknown UIKitApplication:com.<USER>titanium[0x35a7][365] : sourceURL = """"""""file://localhost/var/mobile/Applications/595E31B9-8408-4DB6-BDC7-CD158E2AA8C9/KitchenSink.app/examples/table_view_row_append.js"""""""";<br> Tue Apr 12 12:38:09 unknown UIK