TIMOB-3551,12,"""CDATA not parsed in strings.xml""","""""""{html}<div><p>A CDATA section in strings.xml is not parsed by Titanium. This could be necessary if HTML entities are needed.</p> <pre> <code>&lt;?xml version=""""""""1.0"""""""" encoding=""""""""UTF-8""""""""?&gt; &lt;resources&gt;   &lt;string name=""""""""test""""""""&gt;&lt;![CDATA[&lt;h1&gt;Headline&lt;/h1&gt;]]&gt;&lt;/string&gt; &lt;/resources&gt;</code> </pre> <p>L('test') returns only an empty string.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: CDATA not parsed in strings.xml
Description: """"{html}<div><p>A CDATA section in strings.xml is not parsed by Titanium. This could be necessary if HTML entities are needed.</p> <pre> <code>&lt;?xml version=""""""""1.0"""""""" encoding=""""""""UTF-8""""""""?&gt; &lt;resources&gt; &lt;string name=""""""""test""""""""&gt;&lt;![CDATA[&lt;h1&gt;Headline&lt;/h1&gt;]]&gt;&lt;/string&gt; &lt;/resources&gt;</code> </pre> <p>L('test') returns only an empty string.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
