Description: """"{html}{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-3537,12,"""iPad - OptionDialog crash if modal window""","""""""{html}<div><p>On iPad only, when an options dialog is showed, if the window is  a modal window the app will crash.</p>  <p>Sample code:</p>  <pre>  <code>var win = Titanium.UI.createWindow({      backgroundColor:'#f5dcd2'  });    var btn = Ti.UI.createButton({      height:50,      width:200,      title:'chick here'  });    var dialog = Titanium.UI.createOptionDialog({      options:['Save to Gallery', 'Email Photo', 'Share on Facebook', 'Cancel'],      destructive:3,      cancel:3,      title:'Share This Photo'  });    btn.addEventListener('click', function(){      dialog.show();  });    win.add(btn);    win.open({modal:true});</code>  </pre>  <p>A helpdesk ticket (XJH-91382-789) encountered this problem.</p>  <p>Tested on 1.6.1, 1.6.2, and 1.7.0<br>  iPad Simulator 4.3</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iPad - OptionDialog crash if modal window
Description: """"{html}<div><p>On iPad only, when an options dialog is showed, if the window is a modal window the app will crash.</p> <p>Sample code:</p> <pre> <code>var win = Titanium.UI.createWindow({ backgroundColor:'#f5dcd2' }); var btn = Ti.UI.createButton({ height:50, width:200, title:'chick here' }); var dialog = Titanium.UI.createOptionDialog({ options:['Save to Gallery', 'Email Photo', 'Share on Facebook', 'Cancel'], destructive:3, cancel:3, title:'Share This Photo' }); btn.addEventListener('click', function(){ dialog.show(); }); win.add(btn); win.open({modal:true});</code> </pre> <p>A helpdesk ticket (XJH-91382-789) encountered this problem.</p> <p>Tested on 1.6.1, 1.6.2, and 1.7.0<br> iPad Simulator 4.3</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-3535,12,"""XML RSS - windows invoked cannot be closed by way of close button ""","""""""{html}<div><p>Titanium SDK version: 1.7.0 (04/05/11 15:55 8319743) ipad 1 (3.2) and ipod 4gt 4.1</p> <ol> <li>Platform &gt; XML RSS<br></li> <li>Tap on an item (should be opened in its own window)<br></li> <li>try to close the spawned window by way of the close button</li> </ol> <p>results: the spawned window does not close by way of close button (if it does close, try again - repeat till failure)</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: XML RSS - windows invoked cannot be closed by way of close button
Description: """"{html}<div><p>Titanium SDK version: 1.7.0 (04/05/11 15:55 8319743) ipad 1 (3.2) and ipod 4gt 4.1</p> <ol> <li>Platform &gt; XML RSS<br></li> <li>Tap on an item (should be opened in its own window)<br></li> <li>try to close the spawned window by way of the close button</li> </ol> <p>results: the spawned window does not close by way of close button (if it does close, try again - repeat till failure)</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
