TIMOB-3531,12,"""ios_proxy_registration - sounds test cases, closing window with sound looping does not kill sound""","""""""{html}<div><p>Titanium SDK version: 1.7.0 (04/05/11 15:55 8319743) ipad 1 (3.2) and ipod 4gt 4.1</p> <p>not seen in master</p> <p>1.Phone &gt; sound &gt; local<br> 2.tap looping, then tap play<br> 3.nav back a level and listen</p> <p>results: the sounds never gets killed</p> <p>ALSO</p> <p>1.Mashups &gt; RSS<br> 2.tap on an item and let the audio load and start playing<br> 3.nav back a few times</p> <p>results: the audio is not killed</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: ios_proxy_registration - sounds test cases, closing window with sound looping does not kill sound
Description: """"{html}<div><p>Titanium SDK version: 1.7.0 (04/05/11 15:55 8319743) ipad 1 (3.2) and ipod 4gt 4.1</p> <p>not seen in master</p> <p>1.Phone &gt; sound &gt; local<br> 2.tap looping, then tap play<br> 3.nav back a level and listen</p> <p>results: the sounds never gets killed</p> <p>ALSO</p> <p>1.Mashups &gt; RSS<br> 2.tap on an item and let the audio load and start playing<br> 3.nav back a few times</p> <p>results: the audio is not killed</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
