TIMOB-3503,12,"""iOS - ios_proxy_registration branch: crash on second open of window with animation""","""""""{html}<div><p>TiMob - 1.7.0.f7b28ae</p> <p>1.BaseUI &gt; Window standalone<br> 2.Tap """"""""open tab w/o animation""""""""<br> 3.close, reopen</p> <p>results: crash. may have to try once or twice more if you don;t the crash right away. repro'd on 3g iphone (3.1.3) and 4gt ipod touch (4.2.1)</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS - ios_proxy_registration branch: crash on second open of window with animation
