TIMOB-3461,12,"""iPhone: Activity Indicator does not display message""","""""""{html}<div><p>Problem occurs on first invocation of an instance. Can be demonstrated in KS:</p> <ol> <li> <p>Navigate to Activity Indicator test</p> </li> <li> <p>Tap Show Indicator (Message).</p> </li> </ol></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iPhone: Activity Indicator does not display message
