TIMOB-3416,12,"""iOS: Cannot compile with 1.6SDK after updating to xcode 4.0""","""""""{html}<div><ol> <li>Create a new project in Titanium Developer<br></li> <li>Set the SDK version to 1.6.0<br></li> <li>Save project<br></li> <li>Build to run on device</li> </ol> <p>Actual Result:<br> Install Error</p> <p><a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/BEROR"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [BEROR]"""""""">[BEROR]</a>CodeSign error: The entitlements file '/Users/<USER>TiProjects/Computer/build/iphone/ Resources/Entitlements.plist' is missing <a href= """"""""/projects/32238/changesets/ERROR"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [ERROR]"""""""">[ERROR]</a> [ERROR] Error: Traceback (most recent call last): File """"""""/Library/Application Support/Titanium/mobilesdk/osx/1.6.0/iphone/builder.py"""""""", line 1150, in main</p> <pre> <code>execute_xcode(""""""""iphoneos%s"""""""" % iphone_version,args,False)</code> </pre> <p>File """"""""/Library/Application Support/Titanium/mobilesdk/osx/1.6.0/iphone/builder.py"""""""", line 924, in execute_xcode</p> <pre> <code>output = run.run(args,False,False,o)</code> </pre> <p>File """"""""/Library/Application Support/Titanium/mobilesdk/osx/1.6.0/iphone/run.py"""""""", line 39, in run</p> <pre> <code>sys.exit(rc)</code> </pre> <p>SystemExit: 65</p> <p>Expected Result:<br> To compile without errors and allow user to install to device</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Cannot compile with 1.6SDK after updating to xcode 4.0
Description: """"{html}<div><ol> <li>Create a new project in Titanium Developer<br></li> <li>Set the SDK version to 1.6.0<br></li> <li>Save project<br></li> <li>Build to run on device</li> </ol> <p>Actual Result:<br> Install Error</p> <p><a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/BEROR"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [BEROR]"""""""">[BEROR]</a>CodeSign error: The entitlements file '/Users/<USER>TiProjects/Computer/build/iphone/ Resources/Entitlements.plist' is missing <a href= """"""""/projects/32238/changesets/ERROR"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [ERROR]"""""""">[ERROR]</a> [ERROR] Error: Traceback (most recent call last): File """"""""/Library/Application Support/Titanium/mobilesdk/osx/1.6.0/iphone/builder.py"""""""", line 1150, in main</p> <pre> <code>execute_xcode(""""""""iphoneos%s"""""""" % iphone_version,args,False)</code> </pre> <p>File """"""""/Library/Application Support/Titanium/mobilesdk/osx/1.6.0/iphone/builder.py"""""""", line 924, in execute_xcode</p> <pre> <code>output = run.run(args,False,False,o)</code> </pre> <p>File """"""""/Library/Application Support/Titanium/mobilesdk/osx/1.6.0/iphone/run.py"""""""", line 39, in run</p> <pre> <code>sys.exit(rc)</code> </pre> <p>SystemExit: 65</p> <p>Expected Result:<br> To compile without errors and allow user to install to device</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
