Changeset [INFO]"""""""">[INFO]</a> Performing full rebuild. This will take a little bit. Hold tight...</p> <p>Otherwise I get this error:<br> <a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/ERROR"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [ERROR]"""""""">[ERROR]</a> Script Error = Couldn't find module: ti.paint.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
