TIMOB-3401,12,"""Android: facebook log in test, log in button fails to invoke log in screen""","""""""{html}<div><p>Nexus S (2.3.2), galaxy tab (2.2.2) Titanium SDK version: 1.7.0 (03/21/11 08:55 3f9239e)</p> <p>1.Mashups &gt; Facebook &gt; log in/log out<br> 2.tap log in button (toggling """"""""force dialog"""""""" button does not change results)</p> <p>results: no dialog invoked. Same devices running same KS published in 1.6.1 works as expected</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: facebook log in test, log in button fails to invoke log in screen
