TIMOB-3400,12,"""Android: Galaxy tab Base UI > Views > Web Views > Local URL crashes on load""","""""""{html}<div><p>Galaxy Tab (2.2.2) Titanium SDK version: 1.7.0 (03/21/11 08:55 3f9239e)<br> not seeing on nexus s (2.3.2) or droid 1 (2.2.1), same device not occurring with 1.6.1</p> <p>1.Base UI &gt; Views &gt; Web Views &gt; Local URL<br> 2.let it load</p> <p>results: crash</p> <p>pastie: <a href= """"""""http://pastie.org/1696761"""""""">http://pastie.org/1696761</a></p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Galaxy tab Base UI > Views > Web Views > Local URL crashes on load
