TIMOB-3399,12,"""Android: Third view box of """"FOO"""" is very small and not legible ""","""""""{html}<div><p>Steps to Reproduce:<br> 1. Compile KitchenSink with Titanium SDK version: 1.7.0 (03/21/11 08:55 3f9239e)<br> 2. Run on Android Device Nexus S<br> 3. Base UI &gt; Views &gt; Remove Views</p> <p>Actual Result:<br> """"""""FOO"""""""" in the third box is very tiny</p> <p>Expected Result:<br> Should be easily legible (see attached image)</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Third view box of """"FOO"""" is very small and not legible
