TIMOB-3398,12,"""Android: Galaxy Tab only - alerts fail to be invoked""","""""""{html}<div><p>Galaxy Tab (2.2.2) - <a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/INFO"""""""" title=""""""""Changeset [INFO]"""""""">[INFO]</a> Titanium SDK version: 1.7.0 (03/21/11 08:55 3f9239e)</p> <p>There are a few places where this behavior is seen.</p> <ol> <li>Base UI &gt; Views &gt; Image Views &gt; Image File (tap image)<br> 1b. Base UI &gt; Views &gt; Alert Dialog (top 3 alerts)</li> </ol> <p>2.tap the image<br> 2b. tap the top 3 buttons</p> <p>results: nothing occurs.<br> seeing W/TiUIDialog( 3528): (main) [253,124974] Window must have gone away."""""""" in adb<br></p> <p>Works as expected in 1.6.1</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Galaxy Tab only - alerts fail to be invoked
Description: """"{html}<div><p>Galaxy Tab (2.2.2) - <a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/INFO"""""""" title=""""""""Changeset [INFO]"""""""">[INFO]</a> Titanium SDK version: 1.7.0 (03/21/11 08:55 3f9239e)</p> <p>There are a few places where this behavior is seen.</p> <ol> <li>Base UI &gt; Views &gt; Image Views &gt; Image File (tap image)<br> 1b. Base UI &gt; Views &gt; Alert Dialog (top 3 alerts)</li> </ol> <p>2.tap the image<br> 2b. tap the top 3 buttons</p> <p>results: nothing occurs.<br> seeing W/TiUIDialog( 3528): (main) [253,124974] Window must have gone away."""""""" in adb<br></p> <p>Works as expected in 1.6.1</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-3397,12,"""iOS: AudioRecorder duration""","""""""{html}<div><p>Help Desk ticket with additional background can be found here:  <a href=  """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/76590"""""""">http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/76590</a></p>  <p>It would be useful to have access to a """"""""duration"""""""" property on a  Ti.Media.AudioRecorder object; this should return the current  length of the recorded audio when requested.</p></div>{html}""""""",New Feature,"Title: iOS: AudioRecorder duration
Description: """"{html}<div><p>Help Desk ticket with additional background can be found here: <a href= """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/76590"""""""">http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/76590</a></p> <p>It would be useful to have access to a """"""""duration"""""""" property on a Ti.Media.AudioRecorder object; this should return the current length of the recorded audio when requested.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-3396,12,"""Label drawing issue""","""""""{html}<div><p>Labels no longer appear to query their properties correctly on a redraw. Behavior is visible in KitchenSink:</p> <ol> <li>Controls-&gt;Button:<br></li> <li>Click Button w/label overlay multiple times</li> <li>Label flashes green briefly before redrawing in red</li> </ol></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Label drawing issue
