TIMOB-3387,12,"""iPad: modalStyle attribute doesn't work""","""""""{html}<div><p>Using iOS 4.3, Ti 1.6.1</p> <p>It doesn't matter what modalStyle or modalTransitionStyle I set, I always get a fullscreen modal.<br> If I set a width, the background is black.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iPad: modalStyle attribute doesn't work
