TIMOB-3283,12,"""Drillbit: Error in Test Requires Restart of Drillbit""","""""""{html}<div><p>Modify a test to include a """"""""compile"""""""" error. Like add an extra paren to a valueOf test. Run. Drillbit will error and report that a problem occurred and not re-enable <code>run-tests</code>.</p> <p>Also, the error msg is very cryptic.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Drillbit: Error in Test Requires Restart of Drillbit
Description: """"{html}<div><p>Modify a test to include a """"""""compile"""""""" error. Like add an extra paren to a valueOf test. Run. Drillbit will error and report that a problem occurred and not re-enable <code>run-tests</code>.</p> <p>Also, the error msg is very cryptic.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
