TIMOB-3182,12,"""iOS Support multitouch event on a UI.View""","""""""{html}<div><p>A helpdesk ticket is asking for multitouch event support on a  native UIView<br>  Please, refer to<br>  <a href=  """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/74371"""""""">http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/74371</a></p>  <p>This is a feature request</p></div>{html}""""""",New Feature,"Title: iOS Support multitouch event on a UI.View
