TIMOB-3170,12,"""Android Bug: JSS ignored if file has an include""","""""""{html}<div><p>If you have an app.js with an app.jss everything works fine. If you add any Ti.include into the file the app.jss is ignored.</p> <p>Ticket reference: <a href= """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/73861"""""""">http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/73861</a></p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android Bug: JSS ignored if file has an include
