TIMOB-3154,12,"""iOS, iPad - fixed orientation is ignored when launching in portrait""","""""""{html}<div><p><a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/INFO"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [INFO]"""""""">[INFO]</a> Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (02/15/11 12:42 b9a4f2c...) 3.2 ipad and 4.2 ipad</p> <ol> <li>Ks-iPad ion portrait<br></li> <li>Tap """"""""fixed orientation""""""""</li> </ol> <p>results: app is in portrait</p> <p>3.rotate and then rotate again</p> <p>results: orientation lock is now active.</p> <p>regression from 1.5.1</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS, iPad - fixed orientation is ignored when launching in portrait
Description: """"{html}<div><p><a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/INFO"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [INFO]"""""""">[INFO]</a> Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (02/15/11 12:42 b9a4f2c...) 3.2 ipad and 4.2 ipad</p> <ol> <li>Ks-iPad ion portrait<br></li> <li>Tap """"""""fixed orientation""""""""</li> </ol> <p>results: app is in portrait</p> <p>3.rotate and then rotate again</p> <p>results: orientation lock is now active.</p> <p>regression from 1.5.1</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-3153,12,"""Android: AlertDialog only shows three buttons in Android (mobile)""","""""""{html}<div><p>Hi all,</p>  <p>I'm currently using Titanium 1.6</p>  <p>I created an AlertDialog with 6 buttons, but only three buttons  are shown.</p>  <p>Example<br>  var itsAlert = Titanium.UI.createAlertDialog({<br>  title: """"""""Title""""""""});</p>  <p>itsAlert.buttonNames = ['A', 'B', 'C', 'D' ,'E', 'Cancel'];</p>  <p>itsAlert.message = """"""""A. Werkt als een zonnetje\nB. Werk niet zo  goed\nC. Werkt slecht\nD. Werkt niet helemaal volgens de  gebruikers<br>  richtlijnen van paragraaf 2.3.1 in Docno BC1233030303-30303-Q\nE.  Geen mening"""""""";</p>  <p>itsAlert.show();</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: AlertDialog only shows three buttons in Android (mobile)
Description: """"{html}<div><p>Hi all,</p> <p>I'm currently using Titanium 1.6</p> <p>I created an AlertDialog with 6 buttons, but only three buttons are shown.</p> <p>Example<br> var itsAlert = Titanium.UI.createAlertDialog({<br> title: """"""""Title""""""""});</p> <p>itsAlert.buttonNames = ['A', 'B', 'C', 'D' ,'E', 'Cancel'];</p> <p>itsAlert.message = """"""""A. Werkt als een zonnetje\nB. Werk niet zo goed\nC. Werkt slecht\nD. Werkt niet helemaal volgens de gebruikers<br> richtlijnen van paragraaf 2.3.1 in Docno BC1233030303-30303-Q\nE. Geen mening"""""""";</p> <p>itsAlert.show();</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-3152,12,"""Ti.UI.ImageView.toBlob() does not provide proper sizing information""","""""""{html}<div><p>Behavior can be witnessed in Bugtests <a href= """"""""/projects/32238/tickets/1265"""""""" title=""""""""Ticket #1265"""""""">#1265</a>:</p> <p>-&gt; Open the test: No image is displayed -&gt; Change orientation: You will see the '1x' image flash.</p> <p>NOTE: There's a second special bug here - the flash of the image in rotation. That needs to be taken care of as well.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Ti.UI.ImageView.toBlob() does not provide proper sizing information
Description: """"{html}<div><p>Behavior can be witnessed in Bugtests <a href= """"""""/projects/32238/tickets/1265"""""""" title=""""""""Ticket #1265"""""""">#1265</a>:</p> <p>-&gt; Open the test: No image is displayed -&gt; Change orientation: You will see the '1x' image flash.</p> <p>NOTE: There's a second special bug here - the flash of the image in rotation. That needs to be taken care of as well.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
