TIMOB-3117,12,"""iOS: UI Module graphics need updating to retina display""","""""""{html}<div><p>A better naming of <a href=""""""""/projects/32238/tickets/1497"""""""" title=  """"""""Ticket #1497"""""""">#1497</a>, the badge.png, closeButton.png, and  photoDefault should get updating to be closer to the Apple  versions, including having @2x versions</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: UI Module graphics need updating to retina display
