TIMOB-3098,12,"""App crashes when you set webview visible = false in beforeload event""","""""""{html}<div><p>Testing with iPhone simulator.</p> <pre> <code class=""""""""javascript""""""""> webview1.addEventListener('beforeload',function(e){      // This doesn't seem to do anything at all.  Bug?     webview1.hide();              // This causes the app to crash.  Arghh!     webview1.visible = false; });</code> </pre></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: App crashes when you set webview visible = false in beforeload event
