TIMOB-3067,12,"""Orientation stops working one orientation is manually set""","""""""{html}<div><p>KS Phone - Orientation. Allow Landscape -&gt; Set Portrait -&gt; rotate to landscape and it never goes back to landscape. Orientation will no longer change once the orientation is explicitly set. Side effect of lifecycle refactor.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Orientation stops working one orientation is manually set
