TIMOB-3066,12,"""Android: Orientation change on paused video causes video to play""","""""""{html}<div><p>While checking in with another issue I noticed that a paused  video in a video player will resume / play on an orientation  change. It should probably stay paused unless the user indicates  otherwise.</p>  <p>Code sample:</p>  <pre>  <code class=""""""""javascript"""""""">var win = Ti.UI.currentWindow;     win.orientationModes =   [      Ti.UI.PORTRAIT,      Ti.UI.UPSIDE_PORTRAIT,       Ti.UI.LANDSCAPE_LEFT,      Ti.UI.LANDSCAPE_RIGHT  ];     var activeMovie = Titanium.Media.createVideoPlayer({      url: 'http://195.238.27.196/VOD/android/0006676NLP00.3gp'  });  activeMovie.play();     Ti.Gesture.addEventListener('orientationchange', function(e) {             Ti.API.info('Orientation changed: ' + e.orientation);  });</code>  </pre></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Orientation change on paused video causes video to play
Description: """"{html}<div><p>While checking in with another issue I noticed that a paused video in a video player will resume / play on an orientation change. It should probably stay paused unless the user indicates otherwise.</p> <p>Code sample:</p> <pre> <code class=""""""""javascript"""""""">var win = Ti.UI.currentWindow; win.orientationModes = [ Ti.UI.PORTRAIT, Ti.UI.UPSIDE_PORTRAIT, Ti.UI.LANDSCAPE_LEFT, Ti.UI.LANDSCAPE_RIGHT ]; var activeMovie = Titanium.Media.createVideoPlayer({ url: 'http://195.238.27.196/VOD/android/0006676NLP00.3gp' }); activeMovie.play(); Ti.Gesture.addEventListener('orientationchange', function(e) { Ti.API.info('Orientation changed: ' + e.orientation); });</code> </pre></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-3065,12,"""Android: Orientation events not firing with an open video player""","""""""{html}<div><p>Problem reported here: <a href=  """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/70751"""""""">http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/70751</a></p>  <p>Orientation events aren't getting picked up when a video player  is playing.<br></p>  <p>Code to reproduce:</p>  <pre>  <code class=""""""""javascript"""""""">var win = Ti.UI.currentWindow;     win.orientationModes =   [      Ti.UI.PORTRAIT,      Ti.UI.UPSIDE_PORTRAIT,       Ti.UI.LANDSCAPE_LEFT,      Ti.UI.LANDSCAPE_RIGHT  ];     var activeMovie = Titanium.Media.createVideoPlayer({      url: 'http://195.238.27.196/VOD/android/0006676NLP00.3gp'  });  activeMovie.play();     Ti.Gesture.addEventListener('orientationchange', function(e) {             Ti.API.info('Orientation changed: ' + e.orientation);  });</code>  </pre></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Orientation events not firing with an open video player
Description: """"{html}<div><p>Problem reported here: <a href= """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/70751"""""""">http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/70751</a></p> <p>Orientation events aren't getting picked up when a video player is playing.<br></p> <p>Code to reproduce:</p> <pre> <code class=""""""""javascript"""""""">var win = Ti.UI.currentWindow; win.orientationModes = [ Ti.UI.PORTRAIT, Ti.UI.UPSIDE_PORTRAIT, Ti.UI.LANDSCAPE_LEFT, Ti.UI.LANDSCAPE_RIGHT ]; var activeMovie = Titanium.Media.createVideoPlayer({ url: 'http://195.238.27.196/VOD/android/0006676NLP00.3gp' }); activeMovie.play(); Ti.Gesture.addEventListener('orientationchange', function(e) { Ti.API.info('Orientation changed: ' + e.orientation); });</code> </pre></div>{html}""""",title+description
