TIMOB-3031,12,"""iOS: Textfield suppressReturn Documentation or Semantic Adjustments""","""""""{html}<div><p>I'm not sure if this is to be filed as a bug, feature request,  or just incomplete documentation. From using iOS I'd say hitting  'return' almost always blurs a textfield if suppressReturn is true  but there could be cases where this is not desirable.</p>  <p>HD Ticket: <a href=  """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/69651"""""""">http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/69651</a></p></div>{html}""""""",New Feature,"Title: iOS: Textfield suppressReturn Documentation or Semantic Adjustments
