TIMOB-2987,12,"""iOS: Quickly starting and stopping video recording hangs app and generates """"deny iokit-open RootDomainUserClient"""" errors ""","""""""{html}<div><p>ipod touch 4gt 4.2.1, <a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/INFO"""""""" title=""""""""Changeset [INFO]"""""""">[INFO]</a> Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/24/11 08:14 e1cb22a) similar bug in 1.5.1, no regression tag</p> <p>1.Phone &gt; camera &gt; video record<br> 2.Tap """"""""start video"""""""" then immediately tap """"""""stop video""""""""</p> <p>results: camera animates shutter close, then stays on that screen (shutter closed). Backgrounding the app, then relaunching will recover the app, but with some redraw issues.</p> <p>also seeing: Thu Jan 27 11:17:01 unknown KitchenSink[1881] : <a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/Warning"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [Warning]"""""""">[Warning]</a> IORegisterForSystemPower failed</p> <p>1.5.1 also fails but with a different error - deny iokit-open RootDomainUserClient</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Quickly starting and stopping video recording hangs app and generates """"deny iokit-open RootDomainUserClient"""" errors
Description: """"{html}<div><p>ipod touch 4gt 4.2.1, <a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/INFO"""""""" title=""""""""Changeset [INFO]"""""""">[INFO]</a> Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/24/11 08:14 e1cb22a) similar bug in 1.5.1, no regression tag</p> <p>1.Phone &gt; camera &gt; video record<br> 2.Tap """"""""start video"""""""" then immediately tap """"""""stop video""""""""</p> <p>results: camera animates shutter close, then stays on that screen (shutter closed). Backgrounding the app, then relaunching will recover the app, but with some redraw issues.</p> <p>also seeing: Thu Jan 27 11:17:01 unknown KitchenSink[1881] : <a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/Warning"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [Warning]"""""""">[Warning]</a> IORegisterForSystemPower failed</p> <p>1.5.1 also fails but with a different error - deny iokit-open RootDomainUserClient</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
