TIMOB-2983,12,"""iOS: when setting app badge """"IMLocalObject died"""" seen in console ""","""""""{html}<div><p>seen on ipod touch 4.0.1 - 4.2.1 <a href= """"""""/projects/32238/changesets/INFO"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [INFO]"""""""">[INFO]</a> Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/24/11 08:14 e1cb22a)</p> <p>when setting app badge """"""""IMLocalObject died"""""""" seen in console<br> 1.Phone &gt; app badge<br> 2.Tap """"""""set app badge"""""""" then backgroudn the app and check for the badge<br> 3.back to app, tap reset and check for badge, also check console.</p> <p>results:<br> Thu Jan 27 11:25:08 unknown sandboxd[1903] : KitchenSink(1891) deny iokit-open RootDomainUserClient<br> Thu Jan 27 11:25:08 unknown KitchenSink[1891] : <a href= """"""""/projects/32238/changesets/Warning"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [Warning]"""""""">[Warning]</a> IMLocalObject died: <a href= """"""""/projects/32238/changesets/IMLocalObject"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [IMLocalObject]"""""""">[IMLocalObject]</a> Port Name: com.<USER>pushtest-listener</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: when setting app badge """"IMLocalObject died"""" seen in console
