TIMOB-2981,12,"""iOS: Console sandbox errors (deny read write) when using contacts picker tests ""","""""""{html}<div><p>INFO] Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/24/11 08:14 e1cb22a). ipod touch 4gt 4.2.1, iphone 3g 3.1.3</p> <p>1.Phone &gt; contacts &gt; contact images<br> 2.Tap set image via picker</p> <p>check console after setting an image for a contact:</p> <p>Thu Jan 27 11:08:16 unknown sandboxd[1866] : KitchenSink(1854) deny file-write <em>/private/var/mobile/Applications/07DF14FD-D4BE-4822-B08C-FBE5A253CB6D/Library/Preferences/com.apple.PeoplePicker.plist<br> Thu Jan 27 11:08:34 unknown sandboxd[1866] : KitchenSink(1854) deny file-write</em> /private/var/mobile/Applications/07DF14FD-D4BE-4822-B08C-FBE5A253CB6D/Library/Preferences/com.apple.PeoplePicker.plist<br> Thu Jan 27 11:08:58 unknown UIKitApplication:com.<USER>pushtest[0x12f4][1854] : <a href= """"""""/projects/32238/changesets/ERROR"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [ERROR]"""""""">[ERROR]</a> invalid image type. expected either TiBlob or TiFile, was: NSNull in -<a>TiUIImageView setImage_:</a><br> Thu Jan 27 11:09:49 unknown sandboxd[1869] : KitchenSink(1854) deny file-write* /private/var/mobile/Applications/07DF14FD-D4BE-4822-B08C-FBE5A253CB6D/Library/Preferences/com.apple.PeoplePicker.plist</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Console sandbox errors (deny read write) when using contacts picker tests
Description: """"{html}<div><p>INFO] Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/24/11 08:14 e1cb22a). ipod touch 4gt 4.2.1, iphone 3g 3.1.3</p> <p>1.Phone &gt; contacts &gt; contact images<br> 2.Tap set image via picker</p> <p>check console after setting an image for a contact:</p> <p>Thu Jan 27 11:08:16 unknown sandboxd[1866] : KitchenSink(1854) deny file-write <em>/private/var/mobile/Applications/07DF14FD-D4BE-4822-B08C-FBE5A253CB6D/Library/Preferences/com.apple.PeoplePicker.plist<br> Thu Jan 27 11:08:34 unknown sandboxd[1866] : KitchenSink(1854) deny file-write</em> /private/var/mobile/Applications/07DF14FD-D4BE-4822-B08C-FBE5A253CB6D/Library/Preferences/com.apple.PeoplePicker.plist<br> Thu Jan 27 11:08:58 unknown UIKitApplication:com.<USER>pushtest[0x12f4][1854] : <a href= """"""""/projects/32238/changesets/ERROR"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [ERROR]"""""""">[ERROR]</a> invalid image type. expected either TiBlob or TiFile, was: NSNull in -<a>TiUIImageView setImage_:</a><br> Thu Jan 27 11:09:49 unknown sandboxd[1869] : KitchenSink(1854) deny file-write* /private/var/mobile/Applications/07DF14FD-D4BE-4822-B08C-FBE5A253CB6D/Library/Preferences/com.apple.PeoplePicker.plist</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
