TIMOB-2979,12,"""iOS: 3.1.2 Crash on app close ""","""""""{html}<div><p><a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/INFO"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [INFO]"""""""">[INFO]</a> Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/24/11 08:14 e1cb22a) only seen on an iphone3 running 3.1.3.</p> <p>New to 1.6.0</p> <ol> <li>KS on 3.1.2<br></li> <li>hit home button and check console</li> </ol> <p>Wed Jan 26 10:51:40 unknown UIKitApplication:com.<USER>pushtest[0xd2e7][562] : <a href= """"""""/projects/32238/changesets/INFO"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [INFO]"""""""">[INFO]</a> The application is being shutdown<br> Wed Jan 26 10:51:46 unknown SpringBoard[24] : com.<USER>pushtest failed to terminate in time<br> elapsed total CPU time (seconds): 0.370 (user 0.220, system 0.150), 6% CPU<br> elapsed application CPU time (seconds): 0.090, 1% CPU<br> Wed Jan 26 10:51:46 unknown SpringBoard[24] : Forcing crash report of com.<USER>pushtest...<br> Wed Jan 26 10:51:48 unknown SpringBoard[24] : Finished crash reporting.<br> Wed Jan 26 10:51:48 unknown com.apple.launchd[1] : (UIKitApplication:com.<USER>pushtest[0xd2e7]) Exited: Killed<br> Wed Jan 26 10:51:48 unknown SpringBoard[24] : Application 'KitchenSink' exited abnormally with signal 9: Killed<br> Wed Jan 26 10:51:48 unknown ReportCrash[564] : Saved crashreport to /var/mobile/Library/Logs/CrashReporter/KitchenSink_2011-01-26-105146_Jeff-Haynies-iPhone.plist using uid: 0 gid: 0, synthetic_euid: 501 egid: 0</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: 3.1.2 Crash on app close
Description: """"{html}<div><p><a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/INFO"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [INFO]"""""""">[INFO]</a> Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/24/11 08:14 e1cb22a) only seen on an iphone3 running 3.1.3.</p> <p>New to 1.6.0</p> <ol> <li>KS on 3.1.2<br></li> <li>hit home button and check console</li> </ol> <p>Wed Jan 26 10:51:40 unknown UIKitApplication:com.<USER>pushtest[0xd2e7][562] : <a href= """"""""/projects/32238/changesets/INFO"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [INFO]"""""""">[INFO]</a> The application is being shutdown<br> Wed Jan 26 10:51:46 unknown SpringBoard[24] : com.<USER>pushtest failed to terminate in time<br> elapsed total CPU time (seconds): 0.370 (user 0.220, system 0.150), 6% CPU<br> elapsed application CPU time (seconds): 0.090, 1% CPU<br> Wed Jan 26 10:51:46 unknown SpringBoard[24] : Forcing crash report of com.<USER>pushtest...<br> Wed Jan 26 10:51:48 unknown SpringBoard[24] : Finished crash reporting.<br> Wed Jan 26 10:51:48 unknown com.apple.launchd[1] : (UIKitApplication:com.<USER>pushtest[0xd2e7]) Exited: Killed<br> Wed Jan 26 10:51:48 unknown SpringBoard[24] : Application 'KitchenSink' exited abnormally with signal 9: Killed<br> Wed Jan 26 10:51:48 unknown ReportCrash[564] : Saved crashreport to /var/mobile/Library/Logs/CrashReporter/KitchenSink_2011-01-26-105146_Jeff-Haynies-iPhone.plist using uid: 0 gid: 0, synthetic_euid: 501 egid: 0</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2978,12,"""Android Feature Request: DatePickerDialog min/max Date Support""","""""""{html}<div><p>Ticket Reference: <a href=  """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/68671"""""""">http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/68671</a></p>  <p>User would like minDate and maxDate support added to  DatePickerDialog.</p></div>{html}""""""",New Feature,"Title: Android Feature Request: DatePickerDialog min/max Date Support
