Description: """"{html}<div><p>JSON response sometimes gets converted (certain types?) In this case a bool is getting converted to a string.</p> <p>Enterprise issue reported here: <a href= """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/68741"""""""">http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/68741</a></p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2954,12,"""iOS: Programmatically change the url property of Ti.Media.createSound ""","""""""{html}<div><p>Currently it's not possible to programmatically set the url  property of Ti.Media.createSound.<br></p>  <p>HD Ticket: <a href=  """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/63241"""""""">http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/63241</a></p>  <p>Tested on 1.5.1</p></div>{html}""""""",New Feature,"Title: iOS: Programmatically change the url property of Ti.Media.createSound
