TIMOB-2940,12,"""Android: Galaxy Tab; Videos in landscape do not appear as expected. ""","""""""{html}<div><p><a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/INFO"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [INFO]"""""""">[INFO]</a> Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/24/11 08:14 e1cb22) Galaxy tab 2.2.2 only</p> <p>2 scenarios.<br> heres the first:<br> 1.start in portrait at Phone &gt; Play Movie<br> 2.while the movie is playing, rotate to landscape</p> <p>results: video does not update after the intial orientation change (though audio plays) and stays on same frame</p> <p>second:<br> 1.start in landscape at Phone &gt; Play Movie<br> results: Blue screen that never shows the video</p> <p>FWIW, I transfered the movie onto the sd card and played it via the media player on the tab. It would only play in landscape, but did so without issue.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Galaxy Tab; Videos in landscape do not appear as expected.
Description: """"{html}<div><p><a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/INFO"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [INFO]"""""""">[INFO]</a> Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/24/11 08:14 e1cb22) Galaxy tab 2.2.2 only</p> <p>2 scenarios.<br> heres the first:<br> 1.start in portrait at Phone &gt; Play Movie<br> 2.while the movie is playing, rotate to landscape</p> <p>results: video does not update after the intial orientation change (though audio plays) and stays on same frame</p> <p>second:<br> 1.start in landscape at Phone &gt; Play Movie<br> results: Blue screen that never shows the video</p> <p>FWIW, I transfered the movie onto the sd card and played it via the media player on the tab. It would only play in landscape, but did so without issue.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2939,12,"""Android: 2.3 only; Run time error when aborting large download (offset out of bounds)  ""","""""""{html}<div><p><a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/INFO"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [INFO]"""""""">[INFO]</a> Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/24/11 08:14 e1cb22a) Nexus S (2.3.1) specific</p> <p>1.Platform &gt; XHR &gt; File download<br> 2.Tap Loarge file download, and once it downloading, tap abort</p> <p>results:<br> E/KrollMethod( 615): (kroll$217) [5091,11941974] Exception calling kroll method abort, invocation: null ]<br> E/KrollMethod( 615): java.lang.ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException: Offset out of bounds: -1448</p> <p>2.3 only - pastie: <a href= """"""""http://pastie.org/1494175"""""""">http://pastie.org/1494175</a></p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: 2.3 only; Run time error when aborting large download (offset out of bounds)
Description: """"{html}<div><p><a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/INFO"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [INFO]"""""""">[INFO]</a> Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/24/11 08:14 e1cb22a) Nexus S (2.3.1) specific</p> <p>1.Platform &gt; XHR &gt; File download<br> 2.Tap Loarge file download, and once it downloading, tap abort</p> <p>results:<br> E/KrollMethod( 615): (kroll$217) [5091,11941974] Exception calling kroll method abort, invocation: null ]<br> E/KrollMethod( 615): java.lang.ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException: Offset out of bounds: -1448</p> <p>2.3 only - pastie: <a href= """"""""http://pastie.org/1494175"""""""">http://pastie.org/1494175</a></p></div>{html}""""",title+description
