TIMOB-2892,12,"""Android: unable to toggle off password mask (reports back undefined when set to true) ""","""""""{html}<div><p><a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/INFO"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [INFO]"""""""">[INFO]</a> Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/19/11 08:23 aa8c451) occur in 1.5.1 as well. user error maybe?</p> <p>1.Controls &gt; Text Field &gt; the Rest<br> 2.tap password mask, then enter some text (note its masked)<br> 3.toggle mask, type again</p> <p>results: mask is peristant, output shows:</p> <p>I/TiAPI ( 3409): (kroll$15) [4810,927691] passwordMask undefined<br> I/TiAPI ( 3409): (kroll$15) [6674,934365] passwordMask true]</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: unable to toggle off password mask (reports back undefined when set to true)
Description: """"{html}<div><p><a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/INFO"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [INFO]"""""""">[INFO]</a> Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/19/11 08:23 aa8c451) occur in 1.5.1 as well. user error maybe?</p> <p>1.Controls &gt; Text Field &gt; the Rest<br> 2.tap password mask, then enter some text (note its masked)<br> 3.toggle mask, type again</p> <p>results: mask is peristant, output shows:</p> <p>I/TiAPI ( 3409): (kroll$15) [4810,927691] passwordMask undefined<br> I/TiAPI ( 3409): (kroll$15) [6674,934365] passwordMask true]</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2891,12,"""Android: instances of """"Can't open keycharmap file"""" seen in output""","""""""{html}<div><p><a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/INFO"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [INFO]"""""""">[INFO]</a> Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/19/11 08:23 aa8c451) sim or device, exists in 1.5.1. noting behavior.</p> <p>one way to see it:<br> 1.Controls &gt; checkbox &gt; switch<br> 2. tap swicth ro checkbox, then back out a level and check output</p> <p>W/KeyCharacterMap( 1663): Can't open keycharmap file<br> W/KeyCharacterMap( 1663): Error loading keycharmap file '/system/usr/keychars/qtouch-touchscreen.kcm.bin'. hw.keyboards.65538.devname='qtouch-touchscreen'<br> W/KeyCharacterMap( 1663): Using default keymap: /system/usr/keychars/qwerty.kcm.bin</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: instances of """"Can't open keycharmap file"""" seen in output
Description: """"{html}<div><p><a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/INFO"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [INFO]"""""""">[INFO]</a> Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/19/11 08:23 aa8c451) sim or device, exists in 1.5.1. noting behavior.</p> <p>one way to see it:<br> 1.Controls &gt; checkbox &gt; switch<br> 2. tap swicth ro checkbox, then back out a level and check output</p> <p>W/KeyCharacterMap( 1663): Can't open keycharmap file<br> W/KeyCharacterMap( 1663): Error loading keycharmap file '/system/usr/keychars/qtouch-touchscreen.kcm.bin'. hw.keyboards.65538.devname='qtouch-touchscreen'<br> W/KeyCharacterMap( 1663): Using default keymap: /system/usr/keychars/qwerty.kcm.bin</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2890,12,"""Android: Decimal pad keyboard crashes app ""","""""""{html}<div><p><a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/INFO"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [INFO]"""""""">[INFO]</a> Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/19/11 08:23 aa8c451) device and sim.</p> <p>1.controls &gt; text field &gt; keyboard<br> 2.Tap decimal pad</p> <p>pastie - <a href= """"""""http://pastie.org/1478751"""""""">http://pastie.org/1478751</a></p> <p>repos in droid 1 (2.2.1) sim 2.1</p> <p>not really a regression as this part of the test is new, crashes in 1.5.1 as well.</p></div>{html}""""""",New Feature,"Title: Android: Decimal pad keyboard crashes app
