TIMOB-2889,12,"""Android: local URL - tap url, no browser gets launched""","""""""{html}<div><p><a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/INFO"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [INFO]"""""""">[INFO]</a> Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/19/11 08:23 aa8c451), all android platforms</p> <p>1.Base UI &gt; Views &gt; web views &gt; local URL<br> 2.Tap on google text string</p> <p>results: nothing</p> <p>on iOS it launches the browser, never has done so on android. noting behavior.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: local URL - tap url, no browser gets launched
