TIMOB-2888,12,"""Android: sound files fail to play""","""""""{html}<div><p><a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/INFO"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [INFO]"""""""">[INFO]</a> Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/19/11 08:23 aa8c451), device and sim. Works as expected on 1.5.1</p> <p>1.Platform &gt; sound &gt; any of the tests</p> <p>results, no sound - errors</p> <p><a href= """"""""http://pastie.org/1478938"""""""">http://pastie.org/1478938</a></p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: sound files fail to play
