t), and then that we tapped on the text field (to type):<br></p> <pre> <code>[TRACE] E/TiUIView( 321): (main) [5722,11848] TAP, TAP, TAP on [Ti.UI.ScrollView] [TRACE] E/TiUIView( 321): (main) [1401,13249] TAP, TAP, TAP on [Ti.UI.TextField]</code> </pre> <h2>Associated Helpdesk Ticket</h2> <p><a href= """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/64991"""""""">http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/64991</a></p></div>{html}""""",title+description
