TIMOB-2878,12,"""iPad """"flash popover"""" is failing silently after tapping in landscape, then tapping in portrait ""","""""""{html}<div><p><a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/INFO"""""""" title=  """"""""Changeset [INFO]"""""""">[INFO]</a> Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/17/11  08:08 5d1f301). wifi ipad 3.2</p>  <p>1.KS-iPad &gt; split view w/ nav group<br>  2.hold in landscape<br>  3.tap Flash pop-over (will do nothing)<br>  4.rotate to portrait and tap """"""""flash popover again""""""""</p>  <p>results: fails</p>  <p>not a regression as this test has always behaved this way.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iPad """"flash popover"""" is failing silently after tapping in landscape, then tapping in portrait
Description: """"{html}<div><p><a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/INFO"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [INFO]"""""""">[INFO]</a> Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/17/11 08:08 5d1f301). wifi ipad 3.2</p> <p>1.KS-iPad &gt; split view w/ nav group<br> 2.hold in landscape<br> 3.tap Flash pop-over (will do nothing)<br> 4.rotate to portrait and tap """"""""flash popover again""""""""</p> <p>results: fails</p> <p>not a regression as this test has always behaved this way.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2877,12,"""iOS: Modal window shows up behind the phones status bar""","""""""{html}<div><p>When opening a modal window, if the windows navBarHidden  property is set to true, opening it the first time is fine. After  closing it and reopening it, the modal window shows up behind the  phones status bar at the top.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Modal window shows up behind the phones status bar
Description: """"{html}<div><p>When opening a modal window, if the windows navBarHidden property is set to true, opening it the first time is fine. After closing it and reopening it, the modal window shows up behind the phones status bar at the top.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
