otActivity.onCreate(TiRootActivity.java:118) E/TiUncaughtHandler(31008): at android.app.Instrumentation.callActivityOnCreate(Instrumentation.java:1047) E/TiUncaughtHandler(31008): at android.app.ActivityThread.performLaunchActivity(ActivityThread.java:2627) E/TiUncaughtHandler(31008): ... 11 more</code> </pre></div>{html}""""",title+description
