oard[28] : Application 'KitchenSink' exited abnormally with signal 9: Killed<br> Mon Jan 17 13:52:17 Apple- ReportCrash[1805] : Saved crashreport to /var/mobile/Library/Logs/CrashReporter/KitchenSink_2011-01-17-135216_Apple-.plist using uid: 0 gid: 0, synthetic_euid: 501 egid: 0</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2868,12,"""iOS: iOS - YQL + Flickr fails to load with exception, spinner won't dismiss ""","""""""{html}<div><p><a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/INFO"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [INFO]"""""""">[INFO]</a> Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/17/11 08:08 5d1f301) 3gt ipod touch 4.0.2</p> <p>1.Mashups &gt; YQL &gt;YQL + Flickr<br> 2.check console output<br> 3.Nav back a few levels and note the activity indicator</p> <p>results, endless spinner and console says:</p> <p>Mon Jan 17 15:20:23 Apple- UIKitApplication:com.<USER>pushtest[0xb66b][1945] : <a href= """"""""/projects/32238/changesets/WARN"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [WARN]"""""""">[WARN]</a> Exception in event callback. {<br> Mon Jan 17 15:20:23 Apple- UIKitApplication:com.<USER>pushtest[0xb66b][1945] : expressionBeginOffset = 660;<br> Mon Jan 17 15:20:23 Apple- UIKitApplication:com.<USER>pushtest[0xb66b][1945] : expressionCaretOffset = 664;<br> Mon Jan 17 15:20:23 Apple- UIKitApplication:com.<USER>pushtest[0xb66b][1945] : expressionEndOffset = 670;<br> Mon Jan 17 15:20:23 Apple- UIKitApplication:com.<USER>pushtest[0xb66b][1945] : line = 4;<br> Mon Jan 17 15:20:23 Apple- UIKitApplication:com.<USER>pushtest[0xb66b][1945] : message = """"""""Result of expression 'data' <a href= """"""""/projects/32238/changesets/null"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [null]"""""""">[null]</a> is not an object."""""""";<br> Mon Jan 17 15:20:23 Apple- UIKitApplication:com.<USER>pushtest[0xb66b][1945] : name = TypeError;<br> Mon Jan 17 15:20:23 Apple- UIKitApplication:com.<USER>pushtest[0xb66b][1945] : sourceId = 111555496;<br> Mon Jan 17 15:20:23 Apple- UIKitApplication:com.<USER>pushtest[0xb66b][1945] : sourceURL = """"""""file://localhost/var/mobile/Applications/C05FEA44-8995-4A9F-A0AB-30FE733C45E1/KitchenSink.app/examples/yql_flickr.js"""""""";<br> Mon Jan 17 15:20:23 Apple- UIKitApplication:com.<USER>pushtest[0xb66b][1945] : }</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: iOS - YQL + Flickr fails to load with exception, spinner won't dismiss
Description: """"{html}<div><p><a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/INFO"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [INFO]"""""""">[INFO]</a> Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/17/11 08:08 5d1f301) 3gt ipod touch 4.0.2</p> <p>1.Mashups &gt; YQL &gt;YQL + Flickr<br> 2.check console output<br> 3.Nav back a few levels and note the activity indicator</p> <p>results, endless spinner and console says:</p> <p>Mon Jan 17 15:20:23 Apple- UIKitApplication:com.<USER>pushtest[0xb66b][1945] : <a href= """"""""/projects/32238/changesets/WARN"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [WARN]"""""""">[WARN]</a> Exception in event callback. {<br> Mon Jan 17 15:20:23 Apple- UIKitApplication:com.<USER>pushtest[0xb66b][1945] : expressionBeginOffset = 660;<br> Mon Jan 17 15:20:23 Apple- UIKitApplication:com.<USER>pushtest[0xb66b][1945] : expressionCaretOffset = 664;<br> Mon Jan 17 15:20:23 Apple- UIKitApplication:com.<USER>pushtest[0xb66b][1945] : expressionEndOffset = 670;<br> Mon Jan 17 15:20:23 Apple- UIKitApplication:com.<USER>pushtest[0xb66b][1945] : line = 4;<br> Mon Jan 17 15:20:23 Apple- UIKitApplication:com.<USER>pushtest[0xb66b][1945] : message = """"""""Result of expression 'data' <a href= """"""""/projects/32238/changesets/null"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [null]"""""""">[null]</a> is not an object."""""""";<br> Mon Jan 17 15:20:23 Apple- UIKitApplication:com.<USER>pushtest[0xb66b][1945] : name = TypeError;<br> Mon Jan 17 15:20:23 Apple- UIKitApplication:com.<USER>pushtest[0xb66b][1945] : sourceId = 111555496;<br> Mon Jan 17 15:20:23 Apple- UIKitApplication:com.<USER>pushtest[0xb66b][1945] : sourceURL = """"""""file://localhost/var/mobile/Applications/C05FEA44-8995-4A9F-A0AB-30FE733C45E1/KitchenSink.app/examples/yql_flickr.js"""""""";<br> Mon Jan 17 15:20:23 Apple- UIKitApplication:com.<USER>pushtest[0xb66b][1945] : }</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2867,12,"""iOS: analytics send errors""","""""""{html}<div><p>while testing Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/17/11 08:08 5d1f301) 3gt ipod touch 4.0.2. I wam seeing a lot of:</p> <p>Mon Jan 17 14:11:51 Apple- UIKitApplication:com.<USER>pushtest[0x2d86][1841] : <a href= """"""""/projects/32238/changesets/ERROR"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [ERROR]"""""""">[ERROR]</a> Analytics error sending request: The request timed out<br> Mon Jan 17 14:11:51 Apple- UIKitApplication:com.<USER>pushtest[0x2d86][1841] : <a href= """"""""/projects/32238/changesets/ERROR"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [ERROR]"""""""">[ERROR]</a> Will re-queue analytics<br> Mon Jan 17 14:11:51 Apple- UIKitApplication:com.<USER>pushtest[0x2d86][1841] : <a href= """"""""/projects/32238/changesets/DEBUG"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [DEBUG]"""""""">[DEBUG]</a> attempt to send analytics event but no network. will try again in 15 seconds</p> <p>that I am not seeing when using 1.5.1. no specific repro steps, launch the app and do a few tests while looking at the console.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: analytics send errors
Description: """"{html}<div><p>while testing Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/17/11 08:08 5d1f301) 3gt ipod touch 4.0.2. I wam seeing a lot of:</p> <p>Mon Jan 17 14:11:51 Apple- UIKitApplication:com.<USER>pushtest[0x2d86][1841] : <a href= """"""""/projects/32238/changesets/ERROR"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [ERROR]"""""""">[ERROR]</a> Analytics error sending request: The request timed out<br> Mon Jan 17 14:11:51 Apple- UIKitApplication:com.<USER>pushtest[0x2d86][1841] : <a href= """"""""/projects/32238/changesets/ERROR"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [ERROR]"""""""">[ERROR]</a> Will re-queue analytics<br> Mon Jan 17 14:11:51 Apple- UIKitApplication:com.<USER>pushtest[0x2d86][1841] : <a href= """"""""/projects/32238/changesets/DEBUG"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [DEBUG]"""""""">[DEBUG]</a> attempt to send analytics event but no network. will try again in 15 seconds</p> <p>that I am not seeing when using 1.5.1. no specific repro steps, launch the app and do a few tests while looking at the console.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2866,12,"""iOS: textfield in a scroll view, stutter while drawing text field when partially obscured by keyboard""","""""""{html}<div><p><a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/INFO"""""""" title=  """"""""Changeset [INFO]"""""""">[INFO]</a> Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/17/11  08:08 5d1f301) 3gt ipod touch 4.0.2</p>  <p>1.Controls &gt; Text Field &gt; Textfield in scrollview<br>  2.tap the top field ot invoke the keyboard<br>  3.scroll (with keyboard up) till the next textfield is revealed,  place it so the text (""""""""middle"""""""") is just above the keyboard (so the  field is partially obscured obscured)<br>  4.tap the text field to give it focus</p>  <p>results: it draws up, then back down to the keyboard</p>  <p>expected: as in 1.5.1, to smoothly animate so the text field is  shown and bottom aligned with the keyboard</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: textfield in a scroll view, stutter while drawing text field when partially obscured by keyboard
Description: """"{html}<div><p><a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/INFO"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [INFO]"""""""">[INFO]</a> Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/17/11 08:08 5d1f301) 3gt ipod touch 4.0.2</p> <p>1.Controls &gt; Text Field &gt; Textfield in scrollview<br> 2.tap the top field ot invoke the keyboard<br> 3.scroll (with keyboard up) till the next textfield is revealed, place it so the text (""""""""middle"""""""") is just above the keyboard (so the field is partially obscured obscured)<br> 4.tap the text field to give it focus</p> <p>results: it draws up, then back down to the keyboard</p> <p>expected: as in 1.5.1, to smoothly animate so the text field is shown and bottom aligned with the keyboard</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2865,12,"""iOS: nav group - closing then reopening nav group results in blank misaligned view ""","""""""{html}<div><p><a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/INFO"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [INFO]"""""""">[INFO]</a> Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/17/11 08:08 5d1f301) 3gt ipod touch 4.0.2</p> <p>1.Base UI &gt; Nav group<br> 2.tap """"""""tweetdeck is cool"""""""" in resulting screen<br> 3.tap """"""""Close Nav""""""""<br> 4tap """"""""open nav group""""""""</p> <p>results: a blank misaligned window</p> <p>regression, affects all platforms. missed in 1.5.1, works as expected in 1.4.2</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: nav group - closing then reopening nav group results in blank misaligned view
Description: """"{html}<div><p><a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/INFO"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [INFO]"""""""">[INFO]</a> Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/17/11 08:08 5d1f301) 3gt ipod touch 4.0.2</p> <p>1.Base UI &gt; Nav group<br> 2.tap """"""""tweetdeck is cool"""""""" in resulting screen<br> 3.tap """"""""Close Nav""""""""<br> 4tap """"""""open nav group""""""""</p> <p>results: a blank misaligned window</p> <p>regression, affects all platforms. missed in 1.5.1, works as expected in 1.4.2</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2864,12,"""3.1.3 only - button changed appearance since 1.4.2, bottom borders are truncated/obscured ""","""""""{html}<div><p><a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/INFO"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [INFO]"""""""">[INFO]</a> Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/17/11 08:08 5d1f301) iphone3 running 3.1.3</p> <ol> <li>Base UI &gt; Animation &gt; animation point<br> 2.compare to 1.4.2</li> </ol> <p>results: the bottom of the button is cut off. rotate the device and see the button redraw and look correct.</p> <p>screen shot attached</p> <p>missed in 1.5.1</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: 3.1.3 only - button changed appearance since 1.4.2, bottom borders are truncated/obscured
Description: """"{html}<div><p><a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/INFO"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [INFO]"""""""">[INFO]</a> Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/17/11 08:08 5d1f301) iphone3 running 3.1.3</p> <ol> <li>Base UI &gt; Animation &gt; animation point<br> 2.compare to 1.4.2</li> </ol> <p>results: the bottom of the button is cut off. rotate the device and see the button redraw and look correct.</p> <p>screen shot attached</p> <p>missed in 1.5.1</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2863,12,"""iOS: Animation points test case - clicking stop after the animation is already stopped results in unexpected animation ""","""""""{html}<div><p>01.17.2011 - <a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/INFO"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [INFO]"""""""">[INFO]</a> Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/17/11 08:08 5d1f301) 3gt ipod touch 4.0.2</p> <p>1.Base UI &gt; Animation &gt; animation point<br> 2.click the button to start the animation, the stop it while the circle is still on screen<br> 3.click stop animation again and watch the circle</p> <p>results: the image draws fomr the bottom right and animated to its stopped position. In 1.4.2, step 3 would not generate the bad behavior.</p> <p>missed in 1.5.1</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Animation points test case - clicking stop after the animation is already stopped results in unexpected animation
Description: """"{html}<div><p>01.17.2011 - <a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/INFO"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [INFO]"""""""">[INFO]</a> Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/17/11 08:08 5d1f301) 3gt ipod touch 4.0.2</p> <p>1.Base UI &gt; Animation &gt; animation point<br> 2.click the button to start the animation, the stop it while the circle is still on screen<br> 3.click stop animation again and watch the circle</p> <p>results: the image draws fomr the bottom right and animated to its stopped position. In 1.4.2, step 3 would not generate the bad behavior.</p> <p>missed in 1.5.1</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2862,12,"""OS: basic animation test case has changed behavior""","""""""{html}<div><p>seen on 3gt touch only (not repro on a 4G retina screen)  <a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/INFO"""""""" title=  """"""""Changeset [INFO]"""""""">[INFO]</a> Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/17/11  08:08 5d1f301) 3gt ipod touch 4.0.2</p>  <p>1.Base UI &gt; Views &gt; Animation &gt; basic<br>  2.tap the circle and let the animation complete<br>  3.tap the cirlce again, and let the color animation fincish<br>  4.place your finger on the cirlce and drag it around</p>  <p>results: on the 3GT touch, the circle won't track with fionger  (flies off and is jerky). Does wotk as expected on the 4gt  touch.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: OS: basic animation test case has changed behavior
Description: """"{html}<div><p>seen on 3gt touch only (not repro on a 4G retina screen) <a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/INFO"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [INFO]"""""""">[INFO]</a> Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/17/11 08:08 5d1f301) 3gt ipod touch 4.0.2</p> <p>1.Base UI &gt; Views &gt; Animation &gt; basic<br> 2.tap the circle and let the animation complete<br> 3.tap the cirlce again, and let the color animation fincish<br> 4.place your finger on the cirlce and drag it around</p> <p>results: on the 3GT touch, the circle won't track with fionger (flies off and is jerky). Does wotk as expected on the 4gt touch.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2861,12,"""iOS: objects appear in the wrong place after being cached and reloaded in a table View ""","""""""{html}<div><p>01.17.2011 - <a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/INFO"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [INFO]"""""""">[INFO]</a> Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/17/11 08:08 5d1f301) 3gt ipod touch 4.0.2</p> <p>1.BaseUI &gt; Views &gt; TableView (layout 5)<br> 2.let them all load in<br> 3.back out a level<br> 4.tap into test and watch the images</p> <p>results: they briefly appear on the right side of screen before drawing in the correct position</p> <p>does not appear in 1.4.2 does appear in 1.5.1</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: objects appear in the wrong place after being cached and reloaded in a table View
Description: """"{html}<div><p>01.17.2011 - <a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/INFO"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [INFO]"""""""">[INFO]</a> Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/17/11 08:08 5d1f301) 3gt ipod touch 4.0.2</p> <p>1.BaseUI &gt; Views &gt; TableView (layout 5)<br> 2.let them all load in<br> 3.back out a level<br> 4.tap into test and watch the images</p> <p>results: they briefly appear on the right side of screen before drawing in the correct position</p> <p>does not appear in 1.4.2 does appear in 1.5.1</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
