Description: """"{html}<div><p>Community report, verified by me:</p> <p>I noticed that in the API docs, the link to the TableViewStyle page in the TableView page is broken:</p> <p><a href= """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/apidoc/mobile/latest/Titanium.UI.TableView-object.html""""""""> http://developer.<USER>com/apidoc/mobile/latest/Titanium.UI....</a></p> <p>(Under the style attribute) Goes here:</p> <p><a href= """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/apidoc/mobile/latest/Titanium.UI.iPhone.TableViewStyle""""""""> http://developer.<USER>com/apidoc/mobile/latest/Titanium.UI....</a></p> <p>But should go here:</p> <p><a href= """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/apidoc/mobile/latest/Titanium.UI.iPhone.TableViewStyle-object""""""""> http://developer.<USER>com/apidoc/mobile/latest/Titanium.UI....</a></p></div>{html}""""",title+description
