TIMOB-2858,12,"""Android: Ti.UI.PICKER_TYPE_TIME not checking timezone""","""""""{html}<div><p>Ticket Reference: <a href= """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/66871"""""""">http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/66871</a></p> <p>Using the Picker widget with the useSpinner flag set to true, the system ignores the users timezone and displays GMT.</p> <pre> <code>var d = new Date(); Ti.API.error(""""""""The date is: """""""" + d);   //[ERROR] [942,1315] The date is: Mon Jan 17 2011 15:09:31 GMT-0800 (PST)   var timePicker = Ti.UI.createPicker({     type: Ti.UI.PICKER_TYPE_TIME,     useSpinner:true,     value:d }); win.add(timePicker); win.open();</code> </pre></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Ti.UI.PICKER_TYPE_TIME not checking timezone
Description: """"{html}<div><p>Ticket Reference: <a href= """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/66871"""""""">http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/66871</a></p> <p>Using the Picker widget with the useSpinner flag set to true, the system ignores the users timezone and displays GMT.</p> <pre> <code>var d = new Date(); Ti.API.error(""""""""The date is: """""""" + d); //[ERROR] [942,1315] The date is: Mon Jan 17 2011 15:09:31 GMT-0800 (PST) var timePicker = Ti.UI.createPicker({ type: Ti.UI.PICKER_TYPE_TIME, useSpinner:true, value:d }); win.add(timePicker); win.open();</code> </pre></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2857,12,"""iOS: Regression, can no longer build using 3.1""","""""""{html}<div><p>Starting at least in 1.4.1.1 (also tested in 1.5.1) you can no longer build using 3.1 of the iOS SDK. Most people should be updating to 3.2, but we still support 3.1 (or at least that was the intention, however, this is now a regression).</p> <p>Here's the build errors:</p> <pre> <code>CompileC build/sjcs.build/Debug-iphonesimulator/sjcs.build/Objects-normal/i386/TiMapView.o /Users/<USER>Desktop/ginny/sjcs/build/iphone/Classes/TiMapView.m normal i386 objective-c com.apple.compilers.gcc.4_0     cd /Users/<USER>Desktop/ginny/sjcs/build/iphone     setenv PATH """"""""/Developer/Platforms/iPhoneSimulator.platform/Developer/usr/bin:/Developer/usr/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin""""""""     /Developer/Platforms/iPhoneSimulator.platform/Developer/usr/bin/gcc-4.0 -x objective-c -arch i386 -fmessage-length=0 -pipe -std=c99 -Wno-trigraphs -fpascal-strings -fasm-blocks -O0 -Wunused-function -D__LOG__ID__=eac4af05-c380-4871-8f61-03f08e7ba4ed -DDEPLOYTYPE=development -DTI_DEVELOPMENT=1 -DDEBUG=1 -DTI_VERSION=1.4.1.1 -D__IPHONE_OS_VERSION_MIN_REQUIRED=30000 -isysroot /Developer/Platforms/iPhoneSimulator.platform/Developer/SDKs/iPhoneSimulator3.1.sdk -fvisibility=hidden -mmacosx-version-min=10.5 -gdwarf-2 -iquote /Users/<USER>Desktop/ginny/sjcs/build/iphone/build/sjcs.build/Debug-iphonesimulator/sjcs.build/sjcs-generated-files.hmap -I/Users/<USER>Desktop/ginny/sjcs/build/iphone/build/sjcs.build/Debug-iphonesimulator/sjcs.build/sjcs-own-target-headers.hmap -I/Users/<USER>Desktop/ginny/sjcs/build/iphone/build/sjcs.build/Debug-iphonesimulator/sjcs.build/sjcs-all-target-headers.hmap -iquote /Users/<USER>Desktop/ginny/sjcs/build/iphone/build/sjcs.build/Debug-iphonesimulator/sjcs.build/sjcs-project-headers.hmap -F/Users/<USER>Desktop/ginny/sjcs/build/iphone/build/Debug-iphonesimulator -I/Users/<USER>Desktop/ginny/sjcs/build/iphone/build/Debug-iphonesimulator/include -I/Developer/Platforms/iPhoneSimulator.platform/Developer/SDKs/iPhoneSimulator3.1.sdk/usr/include/libxml2 -Iheaders -I/Users/<USER>Desktop/ginny/sjcs/build/iphone/build/sjcs.build/Debug-iphonesimulator/sjcs.build/DerivedSources/i386 -I/Users/<USER>Desktop/ginny/sjcs/build/iphone/build/sjcs.build/Debug-iphonesimulator/sjcs.build/DerivedSources -DDEBUG -DTI_POST_1_2 -include /var/folders/-Q/-QOOtL79HkO32grwQemDn++++TI/-Caches-/com.apple.Xcode.501/SharedPrecompiledHeaders/sjcs_Prefix-eummnwrxorruitbkkyatymbdpgqv/sjcs_Prefix.pch -c /Users/<USER>Desktop/ginny/sjcs/build/iphone/Classes/TiMapView.m -o /Users/<USER>Desktop/ginny/sjcs/build/iphone/build/sjcs.build/Debug-iphonesimulator/sjcs.build/Objects-normal/i386/TiMapView.o /Users/<USER>Desktop/ginny/sjcs/build/iphone/Classes/TiMapView.m: In function '-[TiMapView removeAnnotation:]': /Users/<USER>Desktop/ginny/sjcs/build/iphone/Classes/TiMapView.m:156: error: request for member 'title' in something not a structure or union /Users/<USER>Desktop/ginny/sjcs/build/iphone/Classes/TiMapView.m: In function '-[TiMapView selectAnnotation:]': /Users/<USER>Desktop/ginny/sjcs/build/iphone/Classes/TiMapView.m:235: error: request for member 'title' in something not a structure or union /Users/<USER>Desktop/ginny/sjcs/build/iphone/Classes/TiMapView.m: In function '-[TiMapView deselectAnnotation:]': /Users/<USER>Desktop/ginny/sjcs/build/iphone/Classes/TiMapView.m:260: error: request for member 'title' in something not a structure or union</code> </pre> <p>thomas, we need to also make sure we test for 3.1 and 3.2 (or at least until we drop support for 3.1).</p> <p>ralf, please schedule into the appropriate 1.6 milestone. this should be an easy fix.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Regression, can no longer build using 3.1
Description: """"{html}<div><p>Starting at least in 1.4.1.1 (also tested in 1.5.1) you can no longer build using 3.1 of the iOS SDK. Most people should be updating to 3.2, but we still support 3.1 (or at least that was the intention, however, this is now a regression).</p> <p>Here's the build errors:</p> <pre> <code>CompileC build/sjcs.build/Debug-iphonesimulator/sjcs.build/Objects-normal/i386/TiMapView.o /Users/<USER>Desktop/ginny/sjcs/build/iphone/Classes/TiMapView.m normal i386 objective-c com.apple.compilers.gcc.4_0 cd /Users/<USER>Desktop/ginny/sjcs/build/iphone setenv PATH """"""""/Developer/Platforms/iPhoneSimulator.platform/Developer/usr/bin:/Developer/usr/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin"""""""" /Developer/Platforms/iPhoneSimulator.platform/Developer/usr/bin/gcc-4.0 -x objective-c -arch i386 -fmessage-length=0 -pipe -std=c99 -Wno-trigraphs -fpascal-strings -fasm-blocks -O0 -Wunused-function -D__LOG__ID__=eac4af05-c380-4871-8f61-03f08e7ba4ed -DDEPLOYTYPE=development -DTI_DEVELOPMENT=1 -DDEBUG=1 -DTI_VERSION=1.4.1.1 -D__IPHONE_OS_VERSION_MIN_REQUIRED=30000 -isysroot /Developer/Platforms/iPhoneSimulator.platform/Developer/SDKs/iPhoneSimulator3.1.sdk -fvisibility=hidden -mmacosx-version-min=10.5 -gdwarf-2 -iquote /Users/<USER>Desktop/ginny/sjcs/build/iphone/build/sjcs.build/Debug-iphonesimulator/sjcs.build/sjcs-generated-files.hmap -I/Users/<USER>Desktop/ginny/sjcs/build/iphone/build/sjcs.build/Debug-iphonesimulator/sjcs.build/sjcs-own-target-headers.hmap -I/Users/<USER>Desktop/ginny/sjcs/build/iphone/build/sjcs.build/Debug-iphonesimulator/sjcs.build/sjcs-all-target-headers.hmap -iquote /Users/<USER>Desktop/ginny/sjcs/build/iphone/build/sjcs.build/Debug-iphonesimulator/sjcs.build/sjcs-project-headers.hmap -F/Users/<USER>Desktop/ginny/sjcs/build/iphone/build/Debug-iphonesimulator -I/Users/<USER>Desktop/ginny/sjcs/build/iphone/build/Debug-iphonesimulator/include -I/Developer/Platforms/iPhoneSimulator.platform/Developer/SDKs/iPhoneSimulator3.1.sdk/usr/include/libxml2 -Iheaders -I/Users/<USER>Desktop/ginny/sjcs/build/iphone/build/sjcs.build/Debug-iphonesimulator/sjcs.build/DerivedSources/i386 -I/Users/<USER>Desktop/ginny/sjcs/build/iphone/build/sjcs.build/Debug-iphonesimulator/sjcs.build/DerivedSources -DDEBUG -DTI_POST_1_2 -include /var/folders/-Q/-QOOtL79HkO32grwQemDn++++TI/-Caches-/com.apple.Xcode.501/SharedPrecompiledHeaders/sjcs_Prefix-eummnwrxorruitbkkyatymbdpgqv/sjcs_Prefix.pch -c /Users/<USER>Desktop/ginny/sjcs/build/iphone/Classes/TiMapView.m -o /Users/<USER>Desktop/ginny/sjcs/build/iphone/build/sjcs.build/Debug-iphonesimulator/sjcs.build/Objects-normal/i386/TiMapView.o /Users/<USER>Desktop/ginny/sjcs/build/iphone/Classes/TiMapView.m: In function '-[TiMapView removeAnnotation:]': /Users/<USER>Desktop/ginny/sjcs/build/iphone/Classes/TiMapView.m:156: error: request for member 'title' in something not a structure or union /Users/<USER>Desktop/ginny/sjcs/build/iphone/Classes/TiMapView.m: In function '-[TiMapView selectAnnotation:]': /Users/<USER>Desktop/ginny/sjcs/build/iphone/Classes/TiMapView.m:235: error: request for member 'title' in something not a structure or union /Users/<USER>Desktop/ginny/sjcs/build/iphone/Classes/TiMapView.m: In function '-[TiMapView deselectAnnotation:]': /Users/<USER>Desktop/ginny/sjcs/build/iphone/Classes/TiMapView.m:260: error: request for member 'title' in something not a structure or union</code> </pre> <p>thomas, we need to also make sure we test for 3.1 and 3.2 (or at least until we drop support for 3.1).</p> <p>ralf, please schedule into the appropriate 1.6 milestone. this should be an easy fix.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2856,12,"""Android: Touchend Events are broken""","""""""{html}<div><p>Touchend events seem to be broken on buttons and views on Android.</p> <p>Bug possibly located in TiUIView.java. User has debugged and created a patch.</p> <p>Ticket Reference: <a href= """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/66211"""""""">http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/66211</a></p> <p>GitHub Patch created by user:<a href= """"""""https://github.com/appseleration/titanium_mobile/commit/ad24c453be4bd3c354621dbe3ea9e7db28fa0cdb"""""""">https://github.com/appseleration/titanium_mobile/commit/ad24c453be4...</a></p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Touchend Events are broken
