Description: """"{html}<div><p>As per ticket: <a href= """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/66331"""""""">http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/66331</a></p> <p>This simple sample demonstrates the problem with either grouped or plain table views<br> <a href= """"""""http://pastie.org/private/rn6zmxhapmhv60xlhzcl7a"""""""">http://pastie.org/private/rn6zmxhapmhv60xlhzcl7a</a></p> <p>Tested on 1.5.1 and 1.6.0 (Jan 14 2011 15:03 r6a69e427)</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2836,12,"""Android: Feature request Date Time Picker""","""""""{html}<div><p>Android feature similar to iOS  Ti.UI.PICKER_TYPE_DATE_AND_TIME</p>  <p>User would like to be able to a Date/Time Picker combination on  android.</p>  <p>Reference: <a href=  """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/66381"""""""">http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/66381</a></p></div>{html}""""""",New Feature,"Title: Android: Feature request Date Time Picker
