Description: """"{html}<div><p>Ever since I upgrade to v1.5 the ImageView is not firing the load event. Not sure if this is a bug or permanent thing. If permanent, then it should be removed from docs.</p> <p>Other people are having this problem: <a href= """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/question/90961/webview-load-eventlistener-broken""""""""> http://developer.<USER>com/question/90961/webview-load-event...</a></p></div>{html}""""",title+description
