TIMOB-2779,12,"""Android: kitchen sink doesnt work !""","""""""{html}<div><p>same as 400+ other people see</p>  <p><a href=  """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/questions/search/kitchen%20sink%20doesnt%20work"""""""">  http://developer.<USER>com/questions/search/kitchen%20sink%2...</a></p>  <p>same as 400+ other people see</p>  <p><a href=  """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/questions/search/kitchen%20sink%20doesnt%20work"""""""">  http://developer.<USER>com/questions/search/kitchen%20sink%2...</a></p>  <p>i got a bit of help during todays webcast but i have now  installed """"""""1.6"""""""" and """"""""apis 1.6"""""""" and it still doesnt work</p>  <p><a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/TRACE"""""""" title=  """"""""Changeset [TRACE]"""""""">[TRACE]</a> E/PackageManager( 60): Package  com.<USER>kitchensink requires unavailable shared library  com.google.android.maps; failing! <a href=  """"""""/projects/32238/changesets/TRACE"""""""" title=  """"""""Changeset [TRACE]"""""""">[TRACE]</a> W/PackageManager( 60): Package  couldn't be installed in  /data/app/com.<USER>kitchensink-1.apk <a href=  """"""""/projects/32238/changesets/TRACE"""""""" title=  """"""""Changeset [TRACE]"""""""">[TRACE]</a> D/dalvikvm( 60): GC_EXPLICIT freed  6035 objects / 275648 bytes in 167ms <a href=  """"""""/projects/32238/changesets/TRACE"""""""" title=  """"""""Changeset [TRACE]"""""""">[TRACE]</a> D/AndroidRuntime( 308): Shutting  down VM <a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/TRACE"""""""" title=  """"""""Changeset [TRACE]"""""""">[TRACE]</a> D/jdwp ( 308): adbd disconnected  <a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/TRACE"""""""" title=  """"""""Changeset [TRACE]"""""""">[TRACE]</a> I/AndroidRuntime( 308): NOTE:  attach of thread 'Binder Thread <a href=""""""""/projects/32238/tickets/3""""""""  title=""""""""Ticket #3"""""""">#3</a>' failed <a href=  """"""""/projects/32238/changesets/ERROR"""""""" title=  """"""""Changeset [ERROR]"""""""">[ERROR]</a> Failed installing  com.<USER>kitchensink: pkg: /data/local/tmp/app.apk <a href=  """"""""/projects/32238/changesets/TRACE"""""""" title=  """"""""Changeset [TRACE]"""""""">[TRACE]</a> Failure  [INSTALL_FAILED_MISSING_SHARED_LIBRARY]</p>  <p>i was then told</p>  <p>Audience Question<br>  Q: i've install 1.6 and apis 1.6 so where do i get the apis 1.6  with maps included ?<br>  A: """"""""APIs 1.6"""""""" in Developer</p>  <p>all i can see/install are """"""""1.6"""""""" and """"""""apis 1.6""""""""</p>  <p><a href=  """"""""http://www.flickr.com/photos/osde-info/5333234095/"""""""">http://www.flickr.com/photos/osde-info/5333234095/</a></p>  <p>so where should i get """"""""APIs 1.6"""""""" in Developer from ?</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: kitchen sink doesnt work !
