TIMOB-2743,12,"""iOS: remote streaming 2 - no spinner is invoked on load ""","""""""{html}<div><p>iOS 4.1 4GT iPod touch. Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/04/11 08:01 e49700d)</p> <p>worked in 1.5.0, seems a little intermittant.<br> 1.Phone &gt; Play movie &gt; Remote streaming<br> 2.look for spinner when the test loads</p> <p>results: white screen, no spinner, then vidoe loads</p> <p>expected: black screen with spinner, then video starts</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: remote streaming 2 - no spinner is invoked on load
Description: """"{html}<div><p>iOS 4.1 4GT iPod touch. Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/04/11 08:01 e49700d)</p> <p>worked in 1.5.0, seems a little intermittant.<br> 1.Phone &gt; Play movie &gt; Remote streaming<br> 2.look for spinner when the test loads</p> <p>results: white screen, no spinner, then vidoe loads</p> <p>expected: black screen with spinner, then video starts</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2742,12,"""iOS: embedded video briefly plays in the incorrect place after playing local movie ""","""""""{html}<div><p>iOS 4.1 4GT iPod touch. Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/04/11 08:01 e49700d)</p> <p>1.Phone &gt; Play movie &gt; embedded Video<br> 2.play local all the way through<br> 3.tap into embedded video and watch the placement of the objects on stage</p> <p>results: the movie is briefly drawn off screen. Does not occur unless you play local first.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: embedded video briefly plays in the incorrect place after playing local movie
Description: """"{html}<div><p>iOS 4.1 4GT iPod touch. Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/04/11 08:01 e49700d)</p> <p>1.Phone &gt; Play movie &gt; embedded Video<br> 2.play local all the way through<br> 3.tap into embedded video and watch the placement of the objects on stage</p> <p>results: the movie is briefly drawn off screen. Does not occur unless you play local first.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2741,12,"""iOS: hide/show misplaces objects on screen""","""""""{html}<div><p>iOS 4.1 4GT iPod touch. Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/04/11 08:01 e49700d)</p> <p>first instance:<br> 1.Controls &gt; Button<br> 2.tap the button until it shows the label """"""""white text"""""""" and has been resized to be smaller than the button originally presented<br> 3.tap hide/show 2X to hide then reveal it</p> <p>results: the button has been been drawn to the left side of the screen (see screen shot)</p> <p>second instance:<br> 1.Base UI &gt; Label &gt;basic<br> 2.tap hide/show 2X</p> <p>results: label is drawn mostly offscreen</p> <p>third instance<br> 1.controls &gt; search bar<br> 2.hide show 2X</p> <p>results: search bar drawn off screen</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: hide/show misplaces objects on screen
Description: """"{html}<div><p>iOS 4.1 4GT iPod touch. Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/04/11 08:01 e49700d)</p> <p>first instance:<br> 1.Controls &gt; Button<br> 2.tap the button until it shows the label """"""""white text"""""""" and has been resized to be smaller than the button originally presented<br> 3.tap hide/show 2X to hide then reveal it</p> <p>results: the button has been been drawn to the left side of the screen (see screen shot)</p> <p>second instance:<br> 1.Base UI &gt; Label &gt;basic<br> 2.tap hide/show 2X</p> <p>results: label is drawn mostly offscreen</p> <p>third instance<br> 1.controls &gt; search bar<br> 2.hide show 2X</p> <p>results: search bar drawn off screen</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2740,12,"""iOS: scrollable view with clipping, list items do not appear (in 1.5.1, can't find bug)""","""""""{html}<div><p>OS 4.1 4GT iPod touch. Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/04/11 08:01 e49700d)</p> <p>1.Base UI &gt; Views&gt; scroll View &gt;scrollable view w/ clipping<br> 2.look at at the pobvjects on stage<br> 3.tap the item</p> <p>results: the contents of the list (""""""""hello world"""""""") do not appear until they are tapped on. Regression during 1.5.0, can't find the orginal bug.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: scrollable view with clipping, list items do not appear (in 1.5.1, can't find bug)
Description: """"{html}<div><p>OS 4.1 4GT iPod touch. Titanium SDK version: 1.6.0 (01/04/11 08:01 e49700d)</p> <p>1.Base UI &gt; Views&gt; scroll View &gt;scrollable view w/ clipping<br> 2.look at at the pobvjects on stage<br> 3.tap the item</p> <p>results: the contents of the list (""""""""hello world"""""""") do not appear until they are tapped on. Regression during 1.5.0, can't find the orginal bug.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
