TIMOB-2729,12,"""Android: runtime errors and intermittent crash when removing values from picker""","""""""{html}<div><p>goes back to 1.5.1. found in 1.6.0 (01/03/11 08:14 11dd2b6),  droid 1 (2.2.1)</p>  <p>1.Controls&gt; Picker &gt; Android """"""""useSpinner"""""""" - text<br>  2. Tap """"""""remove"""""""" 8 times</p>  <p>results: run time error</p>  <p>location:<br>  76,0 app://examples/picker_android_spnner_text.js#76</p>  <p>message:Wrapped java.lang.ClassCastException:  org.<USER>kroll.KrollProxy$1  (app:/examples/picker_android_spinner_text.js <a href=  """"""""/projects/32238/tickets/76"""""""" title=""""""""Ticket #76"""""""">#76</a></p>  <p>This crashed on the droid1 log here: <a href=  """"""""http://pastie.org/1426843"""""""">http://pastie.org/1426843</a></p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: runtime errors and intermittent crash when removing values from picker
