TIMOB-2728,12,"""Android: disabled text fields allow software keyboard text entry (not physical keyboard) ""","""""""{html}<div><p>exists in 1.5.0.<br> found in 1.6.0 (01/03/11 08:14 11dd2b6), droid 1 (2.2.1)</p> <p>1.Controls &gt; text Field &gt; the rest<br> 2.tap enabled, then tap into the text field</p> <p>resultds: field takes appearance of disabled text field, but keyboard invokes</p> <p>3.enter text by way of software keyboard, then try on a device with a hard keyboard</p> <p>results: physical keyboard not active, but soft keyboard allows text entry into a disabled text field.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: disabled text fields allow software keyboard text entry (not physical keyboard)
