Description: """"{html}{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2650,12,"""iPad - difference in image loading behavior between device and emulator""","""""""{html}<div><p>User provided content, found attached to ticket <a href= """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/61891"""""""">http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/61891</a></p> <p>1.build project and install onto an ipad<br> 2.run in simulator and compare</p> <p>results: on device a number of images are left with default placeholders,</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iPad - difference in image loading behavior between device and emulator
