TIMOB-2639,12,"""""""change"""" event listener for Ti.Media.createAudioPlayer() not working in 1.5""","""""""{html}<div><p>My streaming audio player stopped working. Upon further investigation it appears as though it is not working in the kitchensink either.</p> <p>I am running iphone simulator 4.2 on the 1.5.1 mobile sdk on TD 1.2.2</p> <p>To see the problem in action pull up sound_remote.js in the kitchensink and you will see that the stream state never gets updated. Looking at the logs I can see the event listener never fires.</p> <p>Cant submit my app until this is fixed :(</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: """"change"""" event listener for Ti.Media.createAudioPlayer() not working in 1.5
Description: """"{html}<div><p>My streaming audio player stopped working. Upon further investigation it appears as though it is not working in the kitchensink either.</p> <p>I am running iphone simulator 4.2 on the 1.5.1 mobile sdk on TD 1.2.2</p> <p>To see the problem in action pull up sound_remote.js in the kitchensink and you will see that the stream state never gets updated. Looking at the logs I can see the event listener never fires.</p> <p>Cant submit my app until this is fixed :(</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2638,12,"""Android: Space in """"Galaxy Tab"""" skin name (available in android sdk tools r8) causes problem at build""","""""""{html}<div><p>If you install android sdk tools r8 and then install the Samsung options therein, you'll see the Galaxy Tab as a an option for the """"""""skin"""""""" when launching your app from Titanium Developer. The space in """"""""Galaxy Tab"""""""" breaks the build, however -- it's the first time we've been confronted with a space in a skin name.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Space in """"Galaxy Tab"""" skin name (available in android sdk tools r8) causes problem at build
Description: """"{html}<div><p>If you install android sdk tools r8 and then install the Samsung options therein, you'll see the Galaxy Tab as a an option for the """"""""skin"""""""" when launching your app from Titanium Developer. The space in """"""""Galaxy Tab"""""""" breaks the build, however -- it's the first time we've been confronted with a space in a skin name.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2637,12,"""Documentation: Titanium.Database.ResultSet missing next() method.""","""""""{html}<div><p><a href= """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/apidoc/mobile/latest/Titanium.Database.ResultSet-object""""""""> Titanium.Database.ResultSet</a> documentation missing next() method.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Documentation: Titanium.Database.ResultSet missing next() method.
