TIMOB-2532,12,"""iOS:  coverflow remote images - image 14 fails to load, no errors seen ""","""""""{html}<div><p>TiMobile sdk version 1.5.0.8f4eea3 ipod touch 4GT (4.2.1), ipod 3gt (4.0.1), iphone 3 (3.1.3) sim 4.2</p> <p>1.Base UI &gt; views &gt; coverflow &gt;coverflow remote<br> 2.let the images load (wait till network activity indicator is gone), then cycle through</p> <p>results: image 14 does not load, no errors are seen.</p> <p>not marked as a regression as coverflow got overhauled for 1.5.0 and this is a new test</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: coverflow remote images - image 14 fails to load, no errors seen
Description: """"{html}<div><p>TiMobile sdk version 1.5.0.8f4eea3 ipod touch 4GT (4.2.1), ipod 3gt (4.0.1), iphone 3 (3.1.3) sim 4.2</p> <p>1.Base UI &gt; views &gt; coverflow &gt;coverflow remote<br> 2.let the images load (wait till network activity indicator is gone), then cycle through</p> <p>results: image 14 does not load, no errors are seen.</p> <p>not marked as a regression as coverflow got overhauled for 1.5.0 and this is a new test</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2531,12,"""iOS:  iPod touch, audio line type is returned as """"unknown"""" when using the mic to record ""","""""""{html}<div><p>TiMobile sdk version 1.5.0.8f4eea3 ipod touch 4GT (4.2.1)</p> <p>worked in 1.4.2, not sure the break build for 1.5.0</p> <p>1.Phone &gt; Sound &gt; Record<br> 2.check the value for audio line type</p> <p>results: """"""""unknown"""""""" should be """"""""mic"""""""" though in 1.4.2 it said """"""""speaker"""""""" which seems wrong as well&#8230; so maybe this never reported back the correct value?</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: iPod touch, audio line type is returned as """"unknown"""" when using the mic to record
Description: """"{html}<div><p>TiMobile sdk version 1.5.0.8f4eea3 ipod touch 4GT (4.2.1)</p> <p>worked in 1.4.2, not sure the break build for 1.5.0</p> <p>1.Phone &gt; Sound &gt; Record<br> 2.check the value for audio line type</p> <p>results: """"""""unknown"""""""" should be """"""""mic"""""""" though in 1.4.2 it said """"""""speaker"""""""" which seems wrong as well&#8230; so maybe this never reported back the correct value?</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
