TIMOB-2529,12,"""mapView - tapping """"SV"""" - annotations do not appear - 4.0.1/4.2 (3.1. works as expected) ""","""""""{html}<div><p>TiMObile sdk version 1.5.0.8f4eea3 ipod touch 4GT (4.2.1), ipod 3gt (4.0.1), iphone 3 (3.1.3)</p> <p>1.Base UI &gt; Views &gt; Map View<br> 2.Tap the """"""""SV"""""""" button, check for the annotation when the map loads in the new location</p> <p>results: 4.0.1 + 4.2.1, the pin appears, but not the custom annotation. 3.1.3 works as expected</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: mapView - tapping """"SV"""" - annotations do not appear - 4.0.1/4.2 (3.1. works as expected)
Description: """"{html}<div><p>TiMObile sdk version 1.5.0.8f4eea3 ipod touch 4GT (4.2.1), ipod 3gt (4.0.1), iphone 3 (3.1.3)</p> <p>1.Base UI &gt; Views &gt; Map View<br> 2.Tap the """"""""SV"""""""" button, check for the annotation when the map loads in the new location</p> <p>results: 4.0.1 + 4.2.1, the pin appears, but not the custom annotation. 3.1.3 works as expected</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
