Context(10952):  at java.lang.ClassLoader.loadClass(ClassLoader.java:573) E/KrollContext(10952):  at java.lang.ClassLoader.loadClass(ClassLoader.java:532) E/KrollContext(10952):  ... 10 more</code> </pre></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Apps created with 'Distribute' under 1.5. do not work
