TIMOB-2521,12,"""Android, G2 -  images set by facebook not appearing in contacts test case ""","""""""{html}<div><p>Titanium SDK version: 1.5.0 (12/06/10 08:42 4d92d40)</p> <p>1.Log in to facebook using the built in app (came preinstalled)<br> 2.create a contact associated with a fb friend<br> 3.note it uses the image from friends FB account.<br> 4.Phone&gt;contacts&gt;contacts images<br> 5.tap """"""""get image from picker"""""""" nav to the friend with the fb image</p> <p>results: """"""""no image"""""""". It seems to only be images set by way of FB that do this.</p> <p>Not new.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android, G2 - images set by facebook not appearing in contacts test case
Description: """"{html}<div><p>Titanium SDK version: 1.5.0 (12/06/10 08:42 4d92d40)</p> <p>1.Log in to facebook using the built in app (came preinstalled)<br> 2.create a contact associated with a fb friend<br> 3.note it uses the image from friends FB account.<br> 4.Phone&gt;contacts&gt;contacts images<br> 5.tap """"""""get image from picker"""""""" nav to the friend with the fb image</p> <p>results: """"""""no image"""""""". It seems to only be images set by way of FB that do this.</p> <p>Not new.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2520,12,"""Android: focus not released on SOFT_INPUT_ADJUST_UNSPECIFIED , causes input issues""","""""""{html}<div><p>Titanium SDK version: 1.5.0 (12/06/10 08:42 4d92d40), G2, not seen in sim. specific steps to repro:</p> <p>1.Base UI &gt; Window Soft Input<br> 2.select then launch SOFT_INPUT_ADJUST_UNSPECIFIED<br> 3.by way of trackball, click focus to the bottom most field<br> 4.trackball move up one field and click<br> 5.move up to the top most (trackball)</p> <p>view results: see screenshot</p> <p>6.type in the field</p> <p>results: the second field still appears to have focus, if you enter text it will not appear until the keyboard is dismissed. You must use trackball, use touch focus and this is resolved.</p> <p>Not new.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: focus not released on SOFT_INPUT_ADJUST_UNSPECIFIED , causes input issues
Description: """"{html}<div><p>Titanium SDK version: 1.5.0 (12/06/10 08:42 4d92d40), G2, not seen in sim. specific steps to repro:</p> <p>1.Base UI &gt; Window Soft Input<br> 2.select then launch SOFT_INPUT_ADJUST_UNSPECIFIED<br> 3.by way of trackball, click focus to the bottom most field<br> 4.trackball move up one field and click<br> 5.move up to the top most (trackball)</p> <p>view results: see screenshot</p> <p>6.type in the field</p> <p>results: the second field still appears to have focus, if you enter text it will not appear until the keyboard is dismissed. You must use trackball, use touch focus and this is resolved.</p> <p>Not new.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2519,12,"""Android: mapview, some annotations do not appear until map is tapped on ""","""""""{html}<div><p>Titanium SDK version: 1.5.0 (12/06/10 08:42 4d92d40) sim and device</p> <p>1.Base UI &gt; Views &gt; Map Views<br> 2.note the appearance fo the screen, then tap it</p> <p>results, pin but no custom annotations. they appear after the tap.</p> <p>test note - be sure """"""""remove all"""""""" removes these items when bug is fixed (currently they are not)</p> <p>regression, worked in 1.4.2, finding the break build in 1.5.0 is turning into a bit of a time hole.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: mapview, some annotations do not appear until map is tapped on
Description: """"{html}<div><p>Titanium SDK version: 1.5.0 (12/06/10 08:42 4d92d40) sim and device</p> <p>1.Base UI &gt; Views &gt; Map Views<br> 2.note the appearance fo the screen, then tap it</p> <p>results, pin but no custom annotations. they appear after the tap.</p> <p>test note - be sure """"""""remove all"""""""" removes these items when bug is fixed (currently they are not)</p> <p>regression, worked in 1.4.2, finding the break build in 1.5.0 is turning into a bit of a time hole.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2518,12,"""Android: scroll views > basic, """"scroll to top"""" eats first press ""","""""""{html}<div><p>new since last week. Titanium SDK version: 1.5.0 (12/06/10 08:42 4d92d40). reproduces on G2 and the nexus 1, <em>not</em> seen using g1 or the emulator running 2.2.</p> <p>1.BaseUI &gt; Views &gt; scroll Views<br> 2.scroll to bottom, and using trackball or finger tap """"""""scroll to top""""""""</p> <p>results: nothing occurs</p> <p>3.do it again</p> <p>results: works now. not repro in last weeks 1.5.0.faa27c7 pull</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: scroll views > basic, """"scroll to top"""" eats first press
Description: """"{html}<div><p>new since last week. Titanium SDK version: 1.5.0 (12/06/10 08:42 4d92d40). reproduces on G2 and the nexus 1, <em>not</em> seen using g1 or the emulator running 2.2.</p> <p>1.BaseUI &gt; Views &gt; scroll Views<br> 2.scroll to bottom, and using trackball or finger tap """"""""scroll to top""""""""</p> <p>results: nothing occurs</p> <p>3.do it again</p> <p>results: works now. not repro in last weeks 1.5.0.faa27c7 pull</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2517,12,"""Label doesn't redraw in correct position""","""""""{html}<div><p>-Controls-&gt;Button -Click the 'click me' button until it resizes ('White text')</p> <p>Note that the custom label is no longer drawn on top of the button. Seems to be a regression since at least 3 weeks ago (appeared somewhere between week 3 and week 4).</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Label doesn't redraw in correct position
Description: """"{html}<div><p>-Controls-&gt;Button -Click the 'click me' button until it resizes ('White text')</p> <p>Note that the custom label is no longer drawn on top of the button. Seems to be a regression since at least 3 weeks ago (appeared somewhere between week 3 and week 4).</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2516,12,"""Android: common .js bad module errors (at least 2 weeks old, not seen in 1.4.2) ""","""""""{html}<div><p>Titanium SDK version: 1.5.0 (12/06/10 08:42 4d92d40), device and sim</p> <p>1.Platform &gt; common js with logcat going</p> <p>results:<br> D/TitaniumModule( 5647): (kroll$118) [34,1335484] Attempting to include native module: echo<br> D/TitaniumModule( 5647): (kroll$118) [26,1335510] Attempting to include native module: echo<br> D/TitaniumModule( 5647): (kroll$118) [22,1335532] Attempting to include native module: <strong>bad_module</strong><br> E/TitaniumModule( 5647): (kroll$118) [0,1335532] Error loading module named: <strong>bad_module</strong></p> <p>full pastie: <a href= """"""""http://pastie.org/1353874"""""""">http://pastie.org/1353874</a></p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: common .js bad module errors (at least 2 weeks old, not seen in 1.4.2)
