TIMOB-2515,12,"""Android : yql + flickr multple instances of activity indicators invoked on load""","""""""{html}<div><p>Titanium SDK version: 1.5.0 (12/06/10 08:42 4d92d40)</p> <p>1.Mashups &gt; YQL + Flickr<br> 2.watch the test as it loads in</p> <p>results: 2 instances of activity indicators are invoked - test runs okay.</p> <p>very obvious on the G2, less so on the g1 and nexus 1, seen on sim as well.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android : yql + flickr multple instances of activity indicators invoked on load
