TIMOB-2425,12,"""Drillbit: Test With No Lines Fails""","""""""{html}<div><p>Test name Passed? Line number Message<br>  android results<br>  testLH1489BackGroundImageOOM false 3 Cannot read property  """"""""lineNumber"""""""" from null</p>  <pre>  <code>describe(""""""""UI Imageview tests"""""""", {            // https://<USER>lighthouseapp.com/projects/32238/tickets/1489-android-setting-background-image-can-cause-out-of-memory      testLH1489BackGroundImageOOM : function() {                }  })</code>  </pre></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Drillbit: Test With No Lines Fails
