TIMOB-2424,12,"""Push notifications not passing full payload to app""","""""""{html}<div><p>Extra data passed in a Push Notification is stripped before it get's to the app.<br> e.g. acme1 &amp; acme2 are not readable:</p> <p>{</p> <pre> <code>""""""""aps"""""""" : {     """"""""alert"""""""" : """"""""You got your emails."""""""",     """"""""badge"""""""" : 9,     """"""""sound"""""""" : """"""""bingbong.aiff"""""""" }, """"""""acme1"""""""" : """"""""bar"""""""", """"""""acme2"""""""" : 42</code> </pre> <p>}</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Push notifications not passing full payload to app
Description: """"{html}<div><p>Extra data passed in a Push Notification is stripped before it get's to the app.<br> e.g. acme1 &amp; acme2 are not readable:</p> <p>{</p> <pre> <code>""""""""aps"""""""" : { """"""""alert"""""""" : """"""""You got your emails."""""""", """"""""badge"""""""" : 9, """"""""sound"""""""" : """"""""bingbong.aiff"""""""" }, """"""""acme1"""""""" : """"""""bar"""""""", """"""""acme2"""""""" : 42</code> </pre> <p>}</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2423,12,"""Label not showing on buttons with background images""","""""""{html}<div><p>When adding a label to a button that has a background image the label is not shown. Removing the background image on the button shows the label.<br> zIndex issue?</p> <p>Issue in the current 1.5.0 build.</p> <p>iPhone.</p> <p>example code:</p> <p>var button = Ti.UI.createButton({<br></p> <pre> <code>width: 215, height: 47, color: '#fff', backgroundImage: '../../images/big-button.png', top: 215</code> </pre> <p>}); var buttonLabel = Ti.UI.createLabel({<br></p> <pre> <code>text: 'Add a new search', width: 215, height: 25, zIndex: 10, textAlign: 'center', color: '#fff', shadowColor: '#333', shadowOffset: {x:1, y:1}, font: {     fontSize: 20,     fontWeight: 'bold' }, touchEnabled: false</code> </pre> <p>}); button.add(buttonLabel);</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Label not showing on buttons with background images
Description: """"{html}<div><p>When adding a label to a button that has a background image the label is not shown. Removing the background image on the button shows the label.<br> zIndex issue?</p> <p>Issue in the current 1.5.0 build.</p> <p>iPhone.</p> <p>example code:</p> <p>var button = Ti.UI.createButton({<br></p> <pre> <code>width: 215, height: 47, color: '#fff', backgroundImage: '../../images/big-button.png', top: 215</code> </pre> <p>}); var buttonLabel = Ti.UI.createLabel({<br></p> <pre> <code>text: 'Add a new search', width: 215, height: 25, zIndex: 10, textAlign: 'center', color: '#fff', shadowColor: '#333', shadowOffset: {x:1, y:1}, font: { fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold' }, touchEnabled: false</code> </pre> <p>}); button.add(buttonLabel);</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2422,12,"""Add scrollEnd event to scroll views on Android""","""""""{html}<div><p>  Environment:  - Android checked on device (os 2.3.6 nexus one) and emulator (OS 2.2)    Create a scrollable region of content with Ti.UI.createScrollView.  The expected behavior is to be able to trigger and event when the whole portion of area is scrolled.  'scrollEnd' event works fine on iOS but on Android no event is triggered.  'scroll' event correctly works.    Sample code:  http://pastie.org/2690123  </p></div>{html}""""""",New Feature,"Title: Add scrollEnd event to scroll views on Android
Description: """"{html}<div><p> Environment: - Android checked on device (os 2.3.6 nexus one) and emulator (OS 2.2) Create a scrollable region of content with Ti.UI.createScrollView. The expected behavior is to be able to trigger and event when the whole portion of area is scrolled. 'scrollEnd' event works fine on iOS but on Android no event is triggered. 'scroll' event correctly works. Sample code: http://pastie.org/2690123 </p></div>{html}""""",title+description
