TIMOB-2417,12,"""Android: Facebook - publish stream - long lag on button press""","""""""{html}<div><p>1.5.0.91838a G2 (2.2), Droid1 (2.2) sim 2.1</p> <p>1.Facebook &gt; log in<br> 2.Facebook &gt; publish stream &gt; tap publish stream button</p> <p>Results: the button takes the press, but no action occurs for 3 seconds or so, looking like the app is dead. the behavior at this point is intermittant, it did work most of the time, but occasionally locked up on the droid1</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Facebook - publish stream - long lag on button press
