TIMOB-2407,12,"""iOS: facebook Query - close button missing""","""""""{html}<div><p>4th gen iPod (4.2), 3.1.3 iphone, some sim with mobile sdk build 1.5.0.3ee6a97</p> <p>1.Mashups &gt; facebook, log in and then run facebook query test<br> results: no Close button on resulting window, seems like</p> <p>win.setRightNavButton(close);</p> <p>is being ignored</p> <p>regression</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: facebook Query - close button missing
Description: """"{html}<div><p>4th gen iPod (4.2), 3.1.3 iphone, some sim with mobile sdk build 1.5.0.3ee6a97</p> <p>1.Mashups &gt; facebook, log in and then run facebook query test<br> results: no Close button on resulting window, seems like</p> <p>win.setRightNavButton(close);</p> <p>is being ignored</p> <p>regression</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2406,12,"""iOS, 4.2.1 - local/embedded video - brief bit of audio plays as completion alert shows (during completion event?)  ""","""""""{html}<div><p>4th gen ipod touch, mobile sdk build 1.5.0.3ee6a97 seen on 4.2.1 only</p> <p>local/embedded video - brief bit of audio plays as completion alert shows (during completion event?)<br> 1.Phone &gt; play Movie<br> 2.Local or embedded<br> 3.let it play to end<br> results: movie plays till end, then windows closes and while the movie completion alert shows a brifef bit of audio plays.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS, 4.2.1 - local/embedded video - brief bit of audio plays as completion alert shows (during completion event?)
Description: """"{html}<div><p>4th gen ipod touch, mobile sdk build 1.5.0.3ee6a97 seen on 4.2.1 only</p> <p>local/embedded video - brief bit of audio plays as completion alert shows (during completion event?)<br> 1.Phone &gt; play Movie<br> 2.Local or embedded<br> 3.let it play to end<br> results: movie plays till end, then windows closes and while the movie completion alert shows a brifef bit of audio plays.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2405,12,"""iOS: Nav group opens below status bar""","""""""{html}<div><p>mostly 4.2.1, some 4.1 some 3.1.3. mobile sdk 1.5.0.3ee6a97</p> <p>1.Base UI &gt; Nav Group<br> 2.tap done<br> 3.tap """"""""open nav group""""""""<br> 4.note appearance of window</p> <p>results: (screen shot), position of window is off</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Nav group opens below status bar
Description: """"{html}<div><p>mostly 4.2.1, some 4.1 some 3.1.3. mobile sdk 1.5.0.3ee6a97</p> <p>1.Base UI &gt; Nav Group<br> 2.tap done<br> 3.tap """"""""open nav group""""""""<br> 4.note appearance of window</p> <p>results: (screen shot), position of window is off</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2404,12,"""iOS:  tabbedBar draw in problems""","""""""{html}<div><p>1.Controls &gt; Tabbed bar<br> 2.watch the nav bar as the cortls draw in<br> results: the """"""""one two"""""""" buttons briefly draw over the back button before landing in the correct final location</p> <p>regression, but the result of a fix that made layout wayyyyyyyy better</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: tabbedBar draw in problems
Description: """"{html}<div><p>1.Controls &gt; Tabbed bar<br> 2.watch the nav bar as the cortls draw in<br> results: the """"""""one two"""""""" buttons briefly draw over the back button before landing in the correct final location</p> <p>regression, but the result of a fix that made layout wayyyyyyyy better</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2403,12,"""iOS: Intermittent - Table Row eats first tap but loads view anyway (stays in list view) - results in unexpected behavior ""","""""""{html}<div><p>This seems new as of 4.2.1 and the noted build of TiMobile (1.5.0.3ee6a97). During the pass I encountered a number of bugs that I believe are related to this.</p> <p>Hard to repro, but when it occurs, this is what it looks like:<br> 1.tapping on list view will shows the highlight, but will not seem to load the targetted js file (however, traces show the code is being executed)<br> 2.tap a second time<br> results: test loads<br> 3.tap back button<br> results: one view is replced by a second<br> 4.tap back again</p> <p>results: finally back to tableView list</p> <p>Only seen on 4.2.1 so far.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Intermittent - Table Row eats first tap but loads view anyway (stays in list view) - results in unexpected behavior
Description: """"{html}<div><p>This seems new as of 4.2.1 and the noted build of TiMobile (1.5.0.3ee6a97). During the pass I encountered a number of bugs that I believe are related to this.</p> <p>Hard to repro, but when it occurs, this is what it looks like:<br> 1.tapping on list view will shows the highlight, but will not seem to load the targetted js file (however, traces show the code is being executed)<br> 2.tap a second time<br> results: test loads<br> 3.tap back button<br> results: one view is replced by a second<br> 4.tap back again</p> <p>results: finally back to tableView list</p> <p>Only seen on 4.2.1 so far.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
