TIMOB-2393,12,"""Drillbit regression: xml.js (Wrong node attribute)""","""""""{html}<div><p>Test fails xmlNodes:98:</p> <pre> <code>var doc = Ti.XML.parseString(this.testSource[""""""""nodes.xml""""""""]); var nodesList = doc.getElementsByTagName(""""""""nodes""""""""); var nodes = nodesList.item(0); var node = nodes.getElementsByTagName(""""""""node"""""""").item(0); var subnodes = node.getElementsByTagName(""""""""node""""""""); valueOf(subnodes.item(1).getAttribute(""""""""id"""""""")).shouldBe(""""""""node 2"""""""");</code> </pre> <p>Could also be invalid on Android. Going to test and see.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Drillbit regression: xml.js (Wrong node attribute)
Description: """"{html}<div><p>Test fails xmlNodes:98:</p> <pre> <code>var doc = Ti.XML.parseString(this.testSource[""""""""nodes.xml""""""""]); var nodesList = doc.getElementsByTagName(""""""""nodes""""""""); var nodes = nodesList.item(0); var node = nodes.getElementsByTagName(""""""""node"""""""").item(0); var subnodes = node.getElementsByTagName(""""""""node""""""""); valueOf(subnodes.item(1).getAttribute(""""""""id"""""""")).shouldBe(""""""""node 2"""""""");</code> </pre> <p>Could also be invalid on Android. Going to test and see.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2392,12,"""iOS: Drillbit regression: kroll.js""","""""""Test fails customObjects:53        Note that view.customObj = { test:""""""""hello"""""""" } passes. Probably has to do with objects being presented as raw NSDictionary, and not translating property accessors as [setValue:forKey:].""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Drillbit regression: kroll.js
Description: """"Test fails customObjects:53 Note that view.customObj = { test:""""""""hello"""""""" } passes. Probably has to do with objects being presented as raw NSDictionary, and not translating property accessors as [setValue:forKey:].""""",title+description
TIMOB-2391,12,"""Android: Smoketest Map View test crashes on load with IllegalArgumentException""","""""""{html}<div><pre> <code>E/KrollContext(22529): (kroll$15) [6,237392] Error evaluating source: Wrapped java.lang.IllegalArgumentException: Expected 1 arguments for createMenu, got 0 (app://examples/map_view.js#6) E/KrollContext(22529): org.mozilla.javascript.WrappedException: Wrapped java.lang.IllegalArgumentException: Expected 1 arguments for createMenu, got 0 (app://examples/map_view.js#6)</code> </pre></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Smoketest Map View test crashes on load with IllegalArgumentException
