TIMOB-2380,12,"""Android: Unexpected output on YQL + Flickr (""""could not open stream to bitmap""""), test seems to work as expected though ""","""""""{html}<div><p>1.5.0.fb4b340. G2 (2.2) 2.1 emulator</p> <p>1.Mashups &gt; YQL &gt; YQL + Flickr<br> 2.adb logcat</p> <p>results: all the images load, but I see the following output:</p> <p>W/TiUIImageView(28718): (main) [181,39373] The url property of ImageView is deprecated, use image instead.<br> W/TiDrawableReference(28718): (main) [5,39378] Could not open stream for drawable, therefore bounds checking could not be completed<br> W/TiDrawableReference(28718): (main) [0,39378] Bitmap bounds could not be determined. If bitmap is loaded, it won't be scaled.<br> W/TiDrawableReference(28718): (main) [3,39381] Could not open stream to get bitmap</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Unexpected output on YQL + Flickr (""""could not open stream to bitmap""""), test seems to work as expected though
Description: """"{html}<div><p>1.5.0.fb4b340. G2 (2.2) 2.1 emulator</p> <p>1.Mashups &gt; YQL &gt; YQL + Flickr<br> 2.adb logcat</p> <p>results: all the images load, but I see the following output:</p> <p>W/TiUIImageView(28718): (main) [181,39373] The url property of ImageView is deprecated, use image instead.<br> W/TiDrawableReference(28718): (main) [5,39378] Could not open stream for drawable, therefore bounds checking could not be completed<br> W/TiDrawableReference(28718): (main) [0,39378] Bitmap bounds could not be determined. If bitmap is loaded, it won't be scaled.<br> W/TiDrawableReference(28718): (main) [3,39381] Could not open stream to get bitmap</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2379,12,"""Android: Map View crash when tapping/scrolling map after removing label (label does not remove) ""","""""""{html}<div><p>1.5.0.fb4b340. G2 (2.2) 2.1 emulator, 1.6 G1</p> <p>1.Base UI &gt; Views &gt; Map View<br> 2.Menu&gt;more&gt;remove all<br> 3.tap the label, scroll around a little</p> <p>results: crash <a href= """"""""http://pastie.org/1306950"""""""">http://pastie.org/1306950</a></p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Map View crash when tapping/scrolling map after removing label (label does not remove)
