TIMOB-2378,12,"""Android: alert dialog - basic alert - returns unexpected values when dismissing ""","""""""{html}<div><p>1.5.0.fb4b340. G2 (2.2) 2.1 emulator. g1 (1.6)</p>  <p>1.Base UI &gt; Alert<br>  2.Tap Basic Alert button<br>  3.tap back button<br>  4.read values shown</p>  <p>results: -268435457. if you then test a nother one of the  alerts, then try this one again, you'll get a value of """"""""1""""""""</p>  <p>previously (1.4.2) no value was returned here.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: alert dialog - basic alert - returns unexpected values when dismissing
Description: """"{html}<div><p>1.5.0.fb4b340. G2 (2.2) 2.1 emulator. g1 (1.6)</p> <p>1.Base UI &gt; Alert<br> 2.Tap Basic Alert button<br> 3.tap back button<br> 4.read values shown</p> <p>results: -268435457. if you then test a nother one of the alerts, then try this one again, you'll get a value of """"""""1""""""""</p> <p>previously (1.4.2) no value was returned here.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2377,12,"""Android: Redraw issues after 3 row presses on TableView (Layout 2)  ""","""""""{html}<div><p>1.5.0.fb4b340. G2 (2.2) 2.1 emulator,1.6 G1</p> <p>1.Sim, or device, any supported android sdk version<br> 2.Base UI &gt; Views &gt; Table Views &gt; Table View (Layout 2)<br> 3.Tap an object on the row (img, calender, date etc)<br> 4.repeat 3 or more times</p> <p>results: the labels that report what values were tapped appeared garbled (see screen shot), and the line number associated with the user (Fred Smith X) has redraw issues as well.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Redraw issues after 3 row presses on TableView (Layout 2)
Description: """"{html}<div><p>1.5.0.fb4b340. G2 (2.2) 2.1 emulator,1.6 G1</p> <p>1.Sim, or device, any supported android sdk version<br> 2.Base UI &gt; Views &gt; Table Views &gt; Table View (Layout 2)<br> 3.Tap an object on the row (img, calender, date etc)<br> 4.repeat 3 or more times</p> <p>results: the labels that report what values were tapped appeared garbled (see screen shot), and the line number associated with the user (Fred Smith X) has redraw issues as well.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2376,12,"""Android: tabs are drawn partially off screen on load before drawing in the correct location ""","""""""{html}<div><p>1.5.0.fb4b340. G2 (2.2) 2.1 emulator, 1.6 g1</p>  <p>1.seen on sim (2.1), G1 (1.6), G2 (2.2) and droid 1 (2.2)<br>  2.build and install KS on sim or emulator<br>  3.launch while looking at the tabs</p>  <p>results: the tabs are initiall drawn partially off screen before  being redrawn to the correct area.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: tabs are drawn partially off screen on load before drawing in the correct location
Description: """"{html}<div><p>1.5.0.fb4b340. G2 (2.2) 2.1 emulator, 1.6 g1</p> <p>1.seen on sim (2.1), G1 (1.6), G2 (2.2) and droid 1 (2.2)<br> 2.build and install KS on sim or emulator<br> 3.launch while looking at the tabs</p> <p>results: the tabs are initiall drawn partially off screen before being redrawn to the correct area.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
