TIMOB-2355,12,"""iOS: steps to have the Tab UI apppear in landscape while phone is portrait ""","""""""{html}<div><p>ipod 4gt (4.2) mobile sdk build 1.5.0.fb4b340</p> <p>1.Phone &gt; Orientation<br> 2.hold phone in portrait<br> 3.tap """"""""allow landscape only""""""""<br> 4.screen rotates to landscape, hold in portrait still<br> 5.tap controls tab</p> <p>results: app is portrait, tabs are landscape (see screen shot)</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: steps to have the Tab UI apppear in landscape while phone is portrait
