TIMOB-2351,12,"""iOS: Dashboard View - swiping through views creates issues ""","""""""{html}<div><p>ipod 4gt mobile sdk build 1.5.0.fb4b340</p> <p>1.Base UI &gt; Views &gt; Dashboard View<br> 2.on the second scroll view (swipe ot get there) hold down an icon to get to edit mode, then create a 3rd screen by holding it gainst the edge.<br> 3.tap done<br> 4.swipe thorugh the screen a few times, note the indictaor on the bottom</p> <p>results: the indicator does not keep up with the screen shown - then all of a sudden edit mode is invoked again.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Dashboard View - swiping through views creates issues
