TIMOB-2350,12,"""iOS: Coverflow - navigating away then back to a coverflow that has been stepped through till the end results in redraw and sorting issues ""","""""""{html}<div><p>ipod 4gt mobile sdk build 1.5.0.fb4b340</p> <p>1.base ui &gt; views&gt; coverflow view&gt; either coverflow local or replace images<br> 2.tap the right arrow until you reach the end of the images<br> 3.tap another tab, wait a second or two<br> 4.tap the base UI tab and check out the screen</p> <p>results: (screen shot) images are not shown as expected, seems the order is off as well.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Coverflow - navigating away then back to a coverflow that has been stepped through till the end results in redraw and sorting issues
