TIMOB-2346,12,"""iOS: Vertical Layout Table Views flash/redraw a few times as they render ""","""""""{html}<div><p>ipod 4gt mobile sdk build 1.5.0.fb4b340, emulator 4.2</p> <p>1.Base UI &gt; Vertical Layout<br> 2.select either for the tests and watch them draw as they load</p> <p>results: the initial layout is wrgon, then it redraws the correct layout.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Vertical Layout Table Views flash/redraw a few times as they render
