TIMOB-2261,12,"""Android: Network change events not fired with app in background ""","""""""{html}<div><p>G2 (2.2) some G1 (1.6) some 2.1 simulator mobile sdk 1.5.0.4f5838</p> <p>goes back to 1.4.1.1 at least</p> <p>1.start with cell or wifi<br> 2.nav to Platform&gt;Network (bug already inf ro event havign been fired with no change)<br> 3.background the app and change to another connection type<br> 4.bring back app check values.</p> <p>results: unchanged values. Not new.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Network change events not fired with app in background
Description: """"{html}<div><p>G2 (2.2) some G1 (1.6) some 2.1 simulator mobile sdk 1.5.0.4f5838</p> <p>goes back to 1.4.1.1 at least</p> <p>1.start with cell or wifi<br> 2.nav to Platform&gt;Network (bug already inf ro event havign been fired with no change)<br> 3.background the app and change to another connection type<br> 4.bring back app check values.</p> <p>results: unchanged values. Not new.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
