TIMOB-2245,12,"""iOS: Analytics error on shutdown 3.2 or earlier ""","""""""{html}<div><p>found on 3g iphone (3.1.2) 4th gen ipod (4.1) mobile sdk build 1.5.0.8846d87</p> <p>1.3.2 or earlier, launch KS, connect to debug<br> 2.hit the home button to close the app, view output</p> <p>results:<br> Mon Nov 1 12:00:43 unknown UIKitApplication:com.<USER>KitchenSink[0xa2f6][819] : <a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/DEBUG"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [DEBUG]"""""""">[DEBUG]</a> attempt to send analytics event but no network. will try again in 15 seconds</p> <p>regression (not seen on 1.4.1.1), not seen on 4.0+ devices when quitting the running app (home, double click home button, quit the app)</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Analytics error on shutdown 3.2 or earlier
Description: """"{html}<div><p>found on 3g iphone (3.1.2) 4th gen ipod (4.1) mobile sdk build 1.5.0.8846d87</p> <p>1.3.2 or earlier, launch KS, connect to debug<br> 2.hit the home button to close the app, view output</p> <p>results:<br> Mon Nov 1 12:00:43 unknown UIKitApplication:com.<USER>KitchenSink[0xa2f6][819] : <a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/DEBUG"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [DEBUG]"""""""">[DEBUG]</a> attempt to send analytics event but no network. will try again in 15 seconds</p> <p>regression (not seen on 1.4.1.1), not seen on 4.0+ devices when quitting the running app (home, double click home button, quit the app)</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2244,12,"""iOS: 3.1.2 contacts picker - several load/back out/load results in silent fail on tableView item press ""","""""""{html}<div><p>found on 3g iphone (3.1.2) 4th gen ipod (4.1) mobile sdk build 1.5.0.8846d87</p> <p>1.I have a very long long list of contacts (100's)<br> 2.Phone&gt;Contacts&gt;display people<br> 3.as soon as it loads, nackout and tap it again<br> 4.repeat 2-3 times</p> <p>results: soon enough the tableview Item will fail to load anything, it will dissapear on touch and nothing will occur.<br> happen on 1.4.1.1, not seen on the 4.02 or 4.1 device</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: 3.1.2 contacts picker - several load/back out/load results in silent fail on tableView item press
Description: """"{html}<div><p>found on 3g iphone (3.1.2) 4th gen ipod (4.1) mobile sdk build 1.5.0.8846d87</p> <p>1.I have a very long long list of contacts (100's)<br> 2.Phone&gt;Contacts&gt;display people<br> 3.as soon as it loads, nackout and tap it again<br> 4.repeat 2-3 times</p> <p>results: soon enough the tableview Item will fail to load anything, it will dissapear on touch and nothing will occur.<br> happen on 1.4.1.1, not seen on the 4.02 or 4.1 device</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2243,12,"""iOS: 3.2 and lower, animated image view - missing buttons on load ""","""""""{html}<div><p>found on 3g iphone (3.1.2) 4th gen ipod (4.1) mobile sdk build 1.5.0.8846d87</p> <p>1.BaseUI &gt; Views &gt; Image Views &gt; Animated<br> 2.wait for it to load and check the screen</p> <p>buttons missing after load, same device running ks 1.4.1.1 does not show the same behavior, regression</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: 3.2 and lower, animated image view - missing buttons on load
Description: """"{html}<div><p>found on 3g iphone (3.1.2) 4th gen ipod (4.1) mobile sdk build 1.5.0.8846d87</p> <p>1.BaseUI &gt; Views &gt; Image Views &gt; Animated<br> 2.wait for it to load and check the screen</p> <p>buttons missing after load, same device running ks 1.4.1.1 does not show the same behavior, regression</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2242,12,"""iOS: Error (could not send unregistered request) on geolocation test case ""","""""""{html}<div><p>found on 3g iphone (3.1.2) 4th gen ipod (4.1) mobile sdk build 1.5.0.8846d87</p> <p>1.Phone&gt;geolocation<br> 2.okay alert<br> 3.view output (may have to back out to see output on 3.1.2, but 4.1 should show it on load)</p> <p>Mon Nov 1 10:47:16 unknown UIKitApplication:com.<USER>KitchenSink[0xfa53][423] : ERROR,Time,310326436.063,Function,""""""""void CLClientInvalidate(<strong>CLClient*)"""""""",could not send unregistration request to daemon<br> Mon Nov 1 10:47:16 unknown UIKitApplication:com.<USER>KitchenSink[0xfa53][423] : ERROR,Time,310326436.084,Function,""""""""void CLClientInvalidate(</strong>CLClient<em>)"""""""",could not send unregistration request to daemon<br> Mon Nov 1 10:47:22 unknown UIKitApplication:com.<USER>KitchenSink[0xfa53][423] : ERROR,Time,310326442.589,Function,""""""""void CLClientInvalidate(__CLClient</em>)"""""""",could not send unregistration request to daemon</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Error (could not send unregistered request) on geolocation test case
Description: """"{html}<div><p>found on 3g iphone (3.1.2) 4th gen ipod (4.1) mobile sdk build 1.5.0.8846d87</p> <p>1.Phone&gt;geolocation<br> 2.okay alert<br> 3.view output (may have to back out to see output on 3.1.2, but 4.1 should show it on load)</p> <p>Mon Nov 1 10:47:16 unknown UIKitApplication:com.<USER>KitchenSink[0xfa53][423] : ERROR,Time,310326436.063,Function,""""""""void CLClientInvalidate(<strong>CLClient*)"""""""",could not send unregistration request to daemon<br> Mon Nov 1 10:47:16 unknown UIKitApplication:com.<USER>KitchenSink[0xfa53][423] : ERROR,Time,310326436.084,Function,""""""""void CLClientInvalidate(</strong>CLClient<em>)"""""""",could not send unregistration request to daemon<br> Mon Nov 1 10:47:22 unknown UIKitApplication:com.<USER>KitchenSink[0xfa53][423] : ERROR,Time,310326442.589,Function,""""""""void CLClientInvalidate(__CLClient</em>)"""""""",could not send unregistration request to daemon</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2241,12,"""iOS: Platform data crashes app with segmentation warning""","""""""{html}<div><p>found on 3g iphone (3.1.2) 4th gen ipod (4.1) mobile sdk build 1.5.0.8846d87</p> <p>1.Platform&gt;Platform Data</p> <p>results: crash Mon Nov 1 15:51:52 eWorld com.apple.launchd<a>1</a> : (UIKitApplication:com.<USER>KitchenSink[0x330e]) Job appears to have crashed: Segmentation fault</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Platform data crashes app with segmentation warning
