TIMOB-2229,12,"""iOS: animate does not change the property value""","""""""{html}<div><p>If I animate an property of an ui element, the property does not  change the value after animation.</p>  <p>Example:<br></p>  <pre>  <code class=""""""""javascript"""""""">var search = Titanium.UI.createSearchBar({    height: 43,    top: -43  });  win.add(search);  search.animate({top:0});  Ti.API.info(search.top);</code>  </pre>  <p>Output: -43<br>  Expected result: 0</p>  <p>The search bar is animated but the top property has not changed  the value.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: animate does not change the property value
Description: """"{html}<div><p>If I animate an property of an ui element, the property does not change the value after animation.</p> <p>Example:<br></p> <pre> <code class=""""""""javascript"""""""">var search = Titanium.UI.createSearchBar({ height: 43, top: -43 }); win.add(search); search.animate({top:0}); Ti.API.info(search.top);</code> </pre> <p>Output: -43<br> Expected result: 0</p> <p>The search bar is animated but the top property has not changed the value.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
