TIMOB-2214,12,"""Android: email and url keyboard do not work with swype keyboard""","""""""{html}<div><p>G2 (2.2) TiMobile SDK 1.5.0.add5e1</p> <p>1.Settings&gt;Language and Keyboard. Turn off android keyboard, turn on swype<br> 2.Controls&gt; text field&gt; keyboard<br> 3.URL keyboard look for the .com button<br> 4.email keyboard, look for @ button</p> <p>results: chars do not appear, keyboard seems unchanged</p></div>{html}""""""",New Feature,"Title: Android: email and url keyboard do not work with swype keyboard
