TIMOB-2213,12,"""Android: View should scroll, contents of textArea are obscured by keyboard ""","""""""{html}<div><p>G2 (2.2) G1 (1.6) TiMobile SDK 1.5.0.add5e1</p> <p>1.BaseUI&gt;Views&gt;Scroll Views&gt;scroll views text area<br> 2.tap into the lowest field, type a few lines of text.</p> <p>results: the field is obscured by both the keyboard and the predictive text field.</p> <p>expected: push field up to reveal text being typed/reveal text</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: View should scroll, contents of textArea are obscured by keyboard
Description: """"{html}<div><p>G2 (2.2) G1 (1.6) TiMobile SDK 1.5.0.add5e1</p> <p>1.BaseUI&gt;Views&gt;Scroll Views&gt;scroll views text area<br> 2.tap into the lowest field, type a few lines of text.</p> <p>results: the field is obscured by both the keyboard and the predictive text field.</p> <p>expected: push field up to reveal text being typed/reveal text</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2212,12,"""Android: button fails on first press when mixing touch and trackball ""","""""""{html}<div><p>G2 (2.2) G1 (1.6) simulator (2.1) TiMobile SDK 1.5.0.add5e1</p> <p>Android, button fails when mixing touch and trackball<br> 1.BaseUI&gt;Views&gt;Scroll Views&gt;Basic<br> 2.Use the trackball to give ficus and press """"""""add to scroll view"""""""" button<br> 3.use your finger to scroll all the way down<br> 4.Use the trackball to give focus and press """"""""scroll to top""""""""</p> <p>results: fails for the first press. Not seen when using only trackball or only touch.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: button fails on first press when mixing touch and trackball
Description: """"{html}<div><p>G2 (2.2) G1 (1.6) simulator (2.1) TiMobile SDK 1.5.0.add5e1</p> <p>Android, button fails when mixing touch and trackball<br> 1.BaseUI&gt;Views&gt;Scroll Views&gt;Basic<br> 2.Use the trackball to give ficus and press """"""""add to scroll view"""""""" button<br> 3.use your finger to scroll all the way down<br> 4.Use the trackball to give focus and press """"""""scroll to top""""""""</p> <p>results: fails for the first press. Not seen when using only trackball or only touch.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
