TIMOB-2184,12,"""Kitchensink 1.4 does not compile on windows x64""","""""""{html}<div><p>Compilation ends with</p> <p><a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/ERROR"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [ERROR]"""""""">[ERROR]</a> C:\android-sdk\tools\zipalign.exe Unable to open 'C:\KitchenSink\build\android\bin\app.apk' as zip archive</p> <p>This was a fresh install with java for 64 bits, I have not seen this with the 32-bit java version on another win7 x64 machine.</p> <p>Kitchensink 1.3 does compile fine and runs nicely in the simulator. Titanium SDK is 1.4.0</p> <p>Here is the same error reported -<br> <a href= """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/question/63001/kitchensink-win64-wont-emulate""""""""> http://developer.<USER>com/question/63001/kitchensink-win64-...</a><br> <a href= """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/question/66931/error-building-kitchensink""""""""> http://developer.<USER>com/question/66931/error-building-kit...</a><br> <a href= """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/question/46891/i-cant-even-run-kitchensink-sample-code""""""""> http://developer.<USER>com/question/46891/i-cant-even-run-ki...</a></p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Kitchensink 1.4 does not compile on windows x64
Description: """"{html}<div><p>Compilation ends with</p> <p><a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/ERROR"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [ERROR]"""""""">[ERROR]</a> C:\android-sdk\tools\zipalign.exe Unable to open 'C:\KitchenSink\build\android\bin\app.apk' as zip archive</p> <p>This was a fresh install with java for 64 bits, I have not seen this with the 32-bit java version on another win7 x64 machine.</p> <p>Kitchensink 1.3 does compile fine and runs nicely in the simulator. Titanium SDK is 1.4.0</p> <p>Here is the same error reported -<br> <a href= """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/question/63001/kitchensink-win64-wont-emulate""""""""> http://developer.<USER>com/question/63001/kitchensink-win64-...</a><br> <a href= """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/question/66931/error-building-kitchensink""""""""> http://developer.<USER>com/question/66931/error-building-kit...</a><br> <a href= """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/question/46891/i-cant-even-run-kitchensink-sample-code""""""""> http://developer.<USER>com/question/46891/i-cant-even-run-ki...</a></p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2183,12,"""iOS: zindex not working correctly""","""""""{html}<div><p>Running on master as of 10/24, zIndex seems broken.</p> <p>Here's the test case. Pink should be on top.</p> <pre> <code class=""""""""javascript"""""""">var window = Ti.UI.createWindow(); var view1 = Ti.UI.createView({     backgroundColor:'pink',     zIndex:20,     width:200,     height:30,     top:10,     left:10 });  var view2 = Ti.UI.createView({     backgroundColor:'blue',     zIndex:11,     width:200,     height:30,     top:15,     left:15 });  var view3 = Ti.UI.createView({     backgroundColor:'red',     zIndex:12,     width:200,     height:30,     top:20,     left:20 });  window.add(view1); window.add(view2); window.add(view3); window.open();</code> </pre></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: zindex not working correctly
Description: """"{html}<div><p>Running on master as of 10/24, zIndex seems broken.</p> <p>Here's the test case. Pink should be on top.</p> <pre> <code class=""""""""javascript"""""""">var window = Ti.UI.createWindow(); var view1 = Ti.UI.createView({ backgroundColor:'pink', zIndex:20, width:200, height:30, top:10, left:10 }); var view2 = Ti.UI.createView({ backgroundColor:'blue', zIndex:11, width:200, height:30, top:15, left:15 }); var view3 = Ti.UI.createView({ backgroundColor:'red', zIndex:12, width:200, height:30, top:20, left:20 }); window.add(view1); window.add(view2); window.add(view3); window.open();</code> </pre></div>{html}""""",title+description
