TIMOB-2165,12,"""Android: mailDialog.addAttachment is failing""","""""""{html}<div><p>1.5.0.70ce98 g2 running 2.2, G1 running 1.6, sim 2.2.</p> <p>1.BaseUI&gt;Views&gt;Email dialog<br> 2.select an image when prompted, add a valid email you can check and send<br> 3.check sent email</p> <p>results: text and image are sent, cricket.wav file was not sent.</p> <p>not sure this ever worked</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: mailDialog.addAttachment is failing
