TIMOB-2164,12,"""Android: Options dialog - dismissing dialog by way of back button reports itself as a dialog selection""","""""""{html}<div><p>1.5.0.70ce98 g2 running 2.2, G1 running 1.6</p> <p>1.BaseUI&gt;Views&gt;Options dialog<br> 2.tap show dialog, then use the hardware back button to dismiss it. read reported value</p> <p>results:""""""""you selected 1"""""""" which is the same value reoprted when selecting the second item in the dialog. This seems odd.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Options dialog - dismissing dialog by way of back button reports itself as a dialog selection
