TIMOB-2163,12,"""Android: Scrolling large tables results in a stuttered scroll as the scroll slows down""","""""""{html}<div><p>1.5.0.70ce98 g2 running 2.2</p>  <p>1.BaseUI&gt;TableView&gt;Performance<br>  2.after the tableview loads, scroll it down a ways then scroll back  up, pay attention to when the scroll starts to slow</p>  <p>results: scrolling is stuttered and chunky, fluid would be  nicerer</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Scrolling large tables results in a stuttered scroll as the scroll slows down
