TIMOB-2119,12,"""Remote images broken in Cover Flow iphone""","""""""{html}<div><p>On the iphone (probably iPad as well) the Cover Flow will not load any remote images.</p> <p>This is happening using 4.1 and 1.5.</p> <p>Help Desk ticket:<br> <a href= """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/49291"""""""">http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/49291</a></p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Remote images broken in Cover Flow iphone
Description: """"{html}<div><p>On the iphone (probably iPad as well) the Cover Flow will not load any remote images.</p> <p>This is happening using 4.1 and 1.5.</p> <p>Help Desk ticket:<br> <a href= """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/49291"""""""">http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/49291</a></p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2118,12,"""Android revision 7""","""""""{html}<div><p>Titanium apps don't distribute with android SDK Tools revision 7 (the full updated sdk) becouse the apkbuilder stopped working under apple.<br> An another method of building is needed, one without the apkbuilder.</p> <p>See the following links for other people with this problem:<br> <a href= """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/question/66741/apkbuilder-is-deprecated-titanium-developer-121-sdk-1411-mac-osx""""""""> http://developer.<USER>com/question/66741/apkbuilder-is-depr...</a><br> <a href= """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/question/67641/apkbuilderbat-deprecated--see---help""""""""> http://developer.<USER>com/question/67641/apkbuilderbat-depr...</a></p> <p>How to reproduce?<br> run """"""""android"""""""" in the """"""""tools"""""""" directory, go to """"""""Available packages"""""""", check everything in the list and install it.<br> Now try to distribute the application from titanium, this doesn't work. Also running in emulator gives errors.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android revision 7
Description: """"{html}<div><p>Titanium apps don't distribute with android SDK Tools revision 7 (the full updated sdk) becouse the apkbuilder stopped working under apple.<br> An another method of building is needed, one without the apkbuilder.</p> <p>See the following links for other people with this problem:<br> <a href= """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/question/66741/apkbuilder-is-deprecated-titanium-developer-121-sdk-1411-mac-osx""""""""> http://developer.<USER>com/question/66741/apkbuilder-is-depr...</a><br> <a href= """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/question/67641/apkbuilderbat-deprecated--see---help""""""""> http://developer.<USER>com/question/67641/apkbuilderbat-depr...</a></p> <p>How to reproduce?<br> run """"""""android"""""""" in the """"""""tools"""""""" directory, go to """"""""Available packages"""""""", check everything in the list and install it.<br> Now try to distribute the application from titanium, this doesn't work. Also running in emulator gives errors.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2117,12,"""Move itens to a blank Header in TableView on Edit crash App. ""","""""""{html}<div><p>When you move an item to an empty category in Tableview crashes  the application.</p>  <p>See sample code above:</p>  <pre>  <code>var win = Ti.UI.createWindow();    var Data = [      {header:'A',title:""""""""test 1""""""""},      {title:""""""""test 2""""""""},      {header:'B',title:""""""""test 3""""""""},      {header:'C',title:""""""""test 4""""""""},      {title:""""""""test 5""""""""}  ];    var Table = Ti.UI.createTableView({      style: Ti.UI.iPhone.TableViewStyle.PLAIN,      editable:true,      moveable:true,      data:Data  });    Table.editing = true;    win.add(Table);  win.open();</code>  </pre>  <p>Now run this code, Drag the """"""""test 3"""""""" to outsite of """"""""B"""""""" and then  drag ANY item to inside """"""""B"""""""". The App will CRASH.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Move itens to a blank Header in TableView on Edit crash App.
Description: """"{html}<div><p>When you move an item to an empty category in Tableview crashes the application.</p> <p>See sample code above:</p> <pre> <code>var win = Ti.UI.createWindow(); var Data = [ {header:'A',title:""""""""test 1""""""""}, {title:""""""""test 2""""""""}, {header:'B',title:""""""""test 3""""""""}, {header:'C',title:""""""""test 4""""""""}, {title:""""""""test 5""""""""} ]; var Table = Ti.UI.createTableView({ style: Ti.UI.iPhone.TableViewStyle.PLAIN, editable:true, moveable:true, data:Data }); Table.editing = true; win.add(Table); win.open();</code> </pre> <p>Now run this code, Drag the """"""""test 3"""""""" to outsite of """"""""B"""""""" and then drag ANY item to inside """"""""B"""""""". The App will CRASH.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
