TIMOB-2113,12,""" iOS keyboard, unable to turn off Autocorrect""","""""""{html}<div><p>iPod 4th gen (4.1), 3rd gen 4.0.2 with mobile sdk build 1.5.0.62c1cae</p> <p>1.BaseUI&gt;TextField&gt;The rest<br> 2.toggle auto correct, then type some text that would invoke autocorrect.<br> 3.toogle again and try</p> <p>results: unable to turn it off, auto correct kicks in for second word - first word is not auto corrected.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS keyboard, unable to turn off Autocorrect
