TIMOB-2112,12,"""iOS, Facebook module intermittently crashing on network ops""","""""""{html}<div><p>iPod 4th gen (4.1), 3rd gen 4.0.2 with mobile sdk build 1.5.0.62c1cae</p> <p>1.Mashups&gt;FaceBook<br> 2.log in<br> 3.publish stream test</p> <p>or just run the tests sequentially starting at the top of the list</p> <p>results: crashes while running tests. Intermittent, do not always occur at the same time.</p> <p>regression. Crash logs provided. seen on 2 diff devices</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS, Facebook module intermittently crashing on network ops
Description: """"{html}<div><p>iPod 4th gen (4.1), 3rd gen 4.0.2 with mobile sdk build 1.5.0.62c1cae</p> <p>1.Mashups&gt;FaceBook<br> 2.log in<br> 3.publish stream test</p> <p>or just run the tests sequentially starting at the top of the list</p> <p>results: crashes while running tests. Intermittent, do not always occur at the same time.</p> <p>regression. Crash logs provided. seen on 2 diff devices</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
