TIMOB-2047,12,"""iOS: map view with routing - route dissapears when map is being scrolled ""","""""""{html}<div><p>10.11.2010 -3gen iPod touch (4.1) with mobile sdk build  1.5.0.d5d8dbe</p>  <p>1.BaseUI&gt;Views&gt;Map View with Router<br>  2.note thre route indicator<br>  3.scroll the map around by way of your finger</p>  <p>results: route dissapears during scroll<br>  occurs in 1.4.1.1</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: map view with routing - route dissapears when map is being scrolled
Description: """"{html}<div><p>10.11.2010 -3gen iPod touch (4.1) with mobile sdk build 1.5.0.d5d8dbe</p> <p>1.BaseUI&gt;Views&gt;Map View with Router<br> 2.note thre route indicator<br> 3.scroll the map around by way of your finger</p> <p>results: route dissapears during scroll<br> occurs in 1.4.1.1</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2046,12,"""iOS: removeAllAnnotations(); temporarily removes users location indicator""","""""""{html}<div><p>1.BaseUI&gt;Views&gt;Mapviews (3g gen ipod touch)<br>  2.note your indicator for your current location (maybe zoom out to  show this)<br>  3.tap remove all button (this calls removeAllAnnotations();)<br>  4.watch your location</p>  <p>results: after being cleared, the users location icon appears  again (you may need to tap the zoom buttons or scroll the map a bit  to get it to appear, or it may happen by itself)</p>  <p>expected: leave it or remove it :)</p>  <p>occurs in 1.4.1.1</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: removeAllAnnotations(); temporarily removes users location indicator
Description: """"{html}<div><p>1.BaseUI&gt;Views&gt;Mapviews (3g gen ipod touch)<br> 2.note your indicator for your current location (maybe zoom out to show this)<br> 3.tap remove all button (this calls removeAllAnnotations();)<br> 4.watch your location</p> <p>results: after being cleared, the users location icon appears again (you may need to tap the zoom buttons or scroll the map a bit to get it to appear, or it may happen by itself)</p> <p>expected: leave it or remove it :)</p> <p>occurs in 1.4.1.1</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2045,12,"""iOS - zIndex test crashes app""","""""""{html}<div><p>1.BaseUI&gt;Views&gt;zIndex</p> <p>results: crash. Log attached, console output below</p> <p>Mon Oct 11 11:04:44 Apple- UIKitApplication:com.<USER>KitchenSink[0x8e82][992] : <a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/INFO"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [INFO]"""""""">[INFO]</a> window was closed</p> <p>Mon Oct 11 11:05:47 Apple- ReportCrash[1244] : Formulating crash report for <USER>KitchenSink[992]</p> <p>Mon Oct 11 11:05:48 Apple- com.apple.launchd<a>1</a> : (UIKitApplication:com.<USER>KitchenSink[0x8e82]) Job appears to have crashed: Segmentation fault</p> <p>Mon Oct 11 11:05:48 Apple- SpringBoard[28] : Application 'KitchenSink' exited abnormally with signal 11: Segmentation fault</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS - zIndex test crashes app
