TIMOB-2044,12,"""iOS:scrollview image appears on stage when zoom values are negative ""","""""""{html}<div><p>1.BaseUI&gt;Views&gt;ScrollViews&gt;scrolling zoom and pinch<br> 2.hit the minus button until the values are negative, view object on screen<br> results: once the zoom scale is 1.0 or less, the obvject on scale stays the same size</p> <p>expected:should the object still apear when zoom values are less than 0?</p> <p>same in 1.4.1.1, not new</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS:scrollview image appears on stage when zoom values are negative
