TIMOB-2043,12,"""iOS: Image View Encoding - image now scales to window widths""","""""""{html}<div><p>1.BaseUI&gt;Views&gt;Image Views&gt;IMage View Encoding<br> 2.note appearance of image</p> <p>results: image scales to screen size. New behavior (would be much smaller), not sure if its intentional.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Image View Encoding - image now scales to window widths
