TIMOB-2019,12,"""Android: Media Callbacks Fail Inside a TabGroup""","""""""{html}<div><p>showCamera, openPhotoGallery, and previewImage fail to pass the result back from the Activity started for result. Results are only returned to Activities that don't have a parent. See <a href= """"""""http://stackoverflow.com/questions/2497205/how-to-return-a-result-startactivityforresult-from-a-tabhost-activity""""""""> http://stackoverflow.com/questions/2497205/how-to-return-a-result-startactivityforresult-from-a-tabhost-activity</a>.</p> <p>This has been duplicated on 1.4.X and 1.5.X. This ticket is specifically for 1.5.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Media Callbacks Fail Inside a TabGroup
Description: """"{html}<div><p>showCamera, openPhotoGallery, and previewImage fail to pass the result back from the Activity started for result. Results are only returned to Activities that don't have a parent. See <a href= """"""""http://stackoverflow.com/questions/2497205/how-to-return-a-result-startactivityforresult-from-a-tabhost-activity""""""""> http://stackoverflow.com/questions/2497205/how-to-return-a-result-startactivityforresult-from-a-tabhost-activity</a>.</p> <p>This has been duplicated on 1.4.X and 1.5.X. This ticket is specifically for 1.5.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2018,12,"""Android: Implement Synthetic Events on Proxies""","""""""{html}<div><p>See <a href=""""""""/projects/32238/tickets/581"""""""" title= """"""""Ticket #581"""""""">#581</a></p> <p>Basically I should be able to add an event listener to a proxy and fire it. Ticket <a href=""""""""/projects/32238/tickets/581"""""""" title= """"""""Ticket #581"""""""">#581</a> is specifically about Window(Views) but this should be a TiProxy capability, not just TiViewProxy.</p></div>{html}""""""",New Feature,"Title: Android: Implement Synthetic Events on Proxies
Description: """"{html}<div><p>See <a href=""""""""/projects/32238/tickets/581"""""""" title= """"""""Ticket #581"""""""">#581</a></p> <p>Basically I should be able to add an event listener to a proxy and fire it. Ticket <a href=""""""""/projects/32238/tickets/581"""""""" title= """"""""Ticket #581"""""""">#581</a> is specifically about Window(Views) but this should be a TiProxy capability, not just TiViewProxy.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
