TIMOB-2010,12,"""Android: backgrounding and relaunching app - animation stays paused (iOS auto resume.)""","""""""{html}<div><p>1.4.2.4ce7ff G1 running 1.6, 2.2 simulator</p> <p>1.BaseUI&gt;Views&gt;image views&gt;animated<br> 2.start the animation, then hit the home button<br> 3.start the app again</p> <p>results:animation stays paused, should auto resume?</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: backgrounding and relaunching app - animation stays paused (iOS auto resume.)
Description: """"{html}<div><p>1.4.2.4ce7ff G1 running 1.6, 2.2 simulator</p> <p>1.BaseUI&gt;Views&gt;image views&gt;animated<br> 2.start the animation, then hit the home button<br> 3.start the app again</p> <p>results:animation stays paused, should auto resume?</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-2009,12,"""Android: crash when setting keyboard focus on text area ""","""""""{html}<div><p>1.4.2.4ce7ff G1 running 1.6, 2.2 simulator</p> <p>1.use this code:</p> <p>Titanium.UI.setBackgroundColor('#000');</p> <p>var w = Ti.UI.createWindow({<br></p> <pre> <code>fullscreen: true, title: 'test'</code> </pre> <p>});</p> <p>var ta = Titanium.UI.createTextArea({<br></p> <pre> <code>value: """"""""Now is the time for all good men to come to the aid of their country."""""""", height:100, width:300, top: 0, left: 0, keyboardType:Titanium.UI.KEYBOARD_DEFAULT</code> </pre> <p>}); w.add(ta);<br> w.open();</p> <p>2.open on a device or sim<br> results: crash pastie here: <a href= """"""""http://pastie.org/1201676"""""""">http://pastie.org/1201676</a></p> <p>notes: keyboard type does not seem to matter</p> <p>regression, this worked as of <a href= """"""""/projects/32238/tickets/1537"""""""" title=""""""""Ticket #1537"""""""">#1537</a> (sept 1) Removing keyboard line does not affect behavior.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: crash when setting keyboard focus on text area
Description: """"{html}<div><p>1.4.2.4ce7ff G1 running 1.6, 2.2 simulator</p> <p>1.use this code:</p> <p>Titanium.UI.setBackgroundColor('#000');</p> <p>var w = Ti.UI.createWindow({<br></p> <pre> <code>fullscreen: true, title: 'test'</code> </pre> <p>});</p> <p>var ta = Titanium.UI.createTextArea({<br></p> <pre> <code>value: """"""""Now is the time for all good men to come to the aid of their country."""""""", height:100, width:300, top: 0, left: 0, keyboardType:Titanium.UI.KEYBOARD_DEFAULT</code> </pre> <p>}); w.add(ta);<br> w.open();</p> <p>2.open on a device or sim<br> results: crash pastie here: <a href= """"""""http://pastie.org/1201676"""""""">http://pastie.org/1201676</a></p> <p>notes: keyboard type does not seem to matter</p> <p>regression, this worked as of <a href= """"""""/projects/32238/tickets/1537"""""""" title=""""""""Ticket #1537"""""""">#1537</a> (sept 1) Removing keyboard line does not affect behavior.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
