TIMOB-1964,12,"""Android: kitchensink opens on a blank window after being backgrounded and device sleeps.""","""""""{html}<div><p>pastie of logcat:<br>  <a href=  """"""""http://pastie.org/1192004"""""""">http://pastie.org/1192004</a></p>  <p>I've sen this a few times recently.<br>  1.Launch KS (seen on a G1 running 1.6).<br>  2.background it, let the device fall asleep for some time (more  than a few minutes anyway)<br>  3.wake device, launch app from app drawer</p>  <p>results: blank window with """"""""kitchen sink"""""""" header. Pressing the  back button quits the app (next launch will show the app  splash)</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: kitchensink opens on a blank window after being backgrounded and device sleeps.
Description: """"{html}<div><p>pastie of logcat:<br> <a href= """"""""http://pastie.org/1192004"""""""">http://pastie.org/1192004</a></p> <p>I've sen this a few times recently.<br> 1.Launch KS (seen on a G1 running 1.6).<br> 2.background it, let the device fall asleep for some time (more than a few minutes anyway)<br> 3.wake device, launch app from app drawer</p> <p>results: blank window with """"""""kitchen sink"""""""" header. Pressing the back button quits the app (next launch will show the app splash)</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-1963,12,"""iPad - Blur with two open nav groups causes erroneous 'blur'""","""""""{html}<div><p>In KS-iPad:</p> <ul> <li>Split view w/nav</li> <li>Landscape mode</li> <li>Master: 'open window'</li> <li>Detail: 'open window'</li> </ul> <p>You will get a 'blurred master window' message.</p> <ul> <li>Go back in detail nav</li> </ul> <p>You will get two messages: 'blurred detail window', 'blurred master window'</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iPad - Blur with two open nav groups causes erroneous 'blur'
Description: """"{html}<div><p>In KS-iPad:</p> <ul> <li>Split view w/nav</li> <li>Landscape mode</li> <li>Master: 'open window'</li> <li>Detail: 'open window'</li> </ul> <p>You will get a 'blurred master window' message.</p> <ul> <li>Go back in detail nav</li> </ul> <p>You will get two messages: 'blurred detail window', 'blurred master window'</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
