TIMOB-1940,12,"""Android: """"connect with facebook"""" button fails silently""","""""""{html}<div><p>1.4.2.5935b3 G1 running 1.6</p> <p>1.Mashups&gt;facebook&gt;login/Logout<br> 2.tap or use trackball to click """"""""connect with Facebook""""""""</p> <p>resultds: button has down state, nothing else occurs</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: """"connect with facebook"""" button fails silently
