TIMOB-1939,12,"""Android: switch does not respond to touch or trackball presses""","""""""{html}<div><p>1.4.2.5935b3 G1 running 1.6</p> <ol> <li>Controls&gt;Switch<br> 2.use the trackball to give focus ot the swicth, the press down<br> 3.tap the swicth with your finger</li> </ol> <p>results: switch does not change states/respond to inpout. (using the test buttons to change it's state works as expected).</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: switch does not respond to touch or trackball presses
