TIMOB-1924,12,"""iOS: unexpected output in video test case when toggling to front view camera""","""""""{html}<div><p>iPod (4.1) with mobile sdk build 1.4.2.e6bd67</p>  <p>1.Phone&gt;camera&gt;Video Record<br>  2.toggle to front camera and view output in console<br>  results:</p>  <p>Mon Sep 27 11:46:58 unknown KitchenSink[84] : MP  _playbackInterruptionDidEndNotification :: NSConcreteNotification  0x7eea650 {name =  AVController_PlaybackInterruptionDidEndNotification; object =  &lt;AVController: 0xd124850&gt;; userInfo = {<br></p>  <pre>  <code>    """"""""AVController_InterruptionStatusNotificationParameter"""""""" = """"""""non-resumable.PlayAndRecord"""""""";      """"""""AVController_InterruptorNameNotificationParameter"""""""" = RecorderServer;  }}, _state = 0</code>  </pre>  <p>same in 1.4.0</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: unexpected output in video test case when toggling to front view camera
