TIMOB-1920,12,"""iOS: After pause and reversing animation, animation plays one frame forward before reversing""","""""""{html}<div><p>1.Base UI&gt; Views&gt; Image Views&gt; Animated<br>  2.Tap pause, tap reverse, tap play.<br>  3.watch frame count</p>  <p>result: the frame count goes up by one before reversing. (issue  exists in 1.4.0)</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: After pause and reversing animation, animation plays one frame forward before reversing
