TIMOB-1903,12,"""Android: some alt chars are not working""","""""""{html}<div><p>1.KS&gt;controls&gt;text field&gt;keyboard&gt;numbers/Punc<br>  2.Tap the alt key and try the diff chars</p>  <p>fails:&pound;, &yen;, &cent;, &#8364;, degrees symbol, &reg;,  copywrite, elipses, lower """""""""""""""" chars</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: some alt chars are not working
