TIMOB-1887,12,"""iOS: while modal is being invoked, split view briefly draws in the incorrect orientation/misplaced on iPad""","""""""{html}<div><p>iPad (3.2.2) with mobile sdk build 1.4.2.dc7b90</p>  <p>1.Start in landscape<br>  2.KS-iPad&gt;Split View - Plain<br>  3.Tap show modal and watch the window behind the modal as it  draws</p>  <p>results: the split view changes orientation and is squashed</p>  <p>notes:only happens on first encounter, do it a second time and  no repro.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: while modal is being invoked, split view briefly draws in the incorrect orientation/misplaced on iPad
Description: """"{html}<div><p>iPad (3.2.2) with mobile sdk build 1.4.2.dc7b90</p> <p>1.Start in landscape<br> 2.KS-iPad&gt;Split View - Plain<br> 3.Tap show modal and watch the window behind the modal as it draws</p> <p>results: the split view changes orientation and is squashed</p> <p>notes:only happens on first encounter, do it a second time and no repro.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-1886,12,"""iOS - sound: unexpected value after lowering volume to mute, then turning it up a tap  ""","""""""{html}<div><p>4th gen iPod touch (4.1) with mobile sdk build 1.4.2.dc7b90</p> <p>1.Phone&gt;Sound&gt;local with file<br> 2.tap play and tap looping<br> 3.tap the """"""""Volume--"""""""" button until the value reads (0)<br> 4.Tap the """"""""Volume++"""""""" button once (will now read 0.1)<br> 5.Tap """"""""Volume--"""""""" button<br> 6.read its value</p> <p>results: 1.4<br> expected: 0.1</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS - sound: unexpected value after lowering volume to mute, then turning it up a tap
Description: """"{html}<div><p>4th gen iPod touch (4.1) with mobile sdk build 1.4.2.dc7b90</p> <p>1.Phone&gt;Sound&gt;local with file<br> 2.tap play and tap looping<br> 3.tap the """"""""Volume--"""""""" button until the value reads (0)<br> 4.Tap the """"""""Volume++"""""""" button once (will now read 0.1)<br> 5.Tap """"""""Volume--"""""""" button<br> 6.read its value</p> <p>results: 1.4<br> expected: 0.1</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-1885,12,"""iOS - crash when toggling airplane mode with KS in background (found on an ipod touch) ""","""""""{html}<div><p>4th gen iPod touch (4.1) with mobile sdk build 1.4.2.dc7b90</p> <p>1.launch KS with wifi on<br> 2.click the home button, open settings and turn on airplane mode<br> 3.open KS<br> 4.hit the ohm button again and turn airplane mode off<br> 5.tap ks icon</p> <p>results: crash (you may need to wait a while before it crashes)</p> <p>logs attached</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS - crash when toggling airplane mode with KS in background (found on an ipod touch)
Description: """"{html}<div><p>4th gen iPod touch (4.1) with mobile sdk build 1.4.2.dc7b90</p> <p>1.launch KS with wifi on<br> 2.click the home button, open settings and turn on airplane mode<br> 3.open KS<br> 4.hit the ohm button again and turn airplane mode off<br> 5.tap ks icon</p> <p>results: crash (you may need to wait a while before it crashes)</p> <p>logs attached</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-1884,12,"""iOS - backgrounding, then reopening app creates unexpected output""","""""""{html}<div><p>4th gen iPod touch (4.1) with mobile sdk build 1.4.2.dc7b90</p> <p>1.launch KS (be plugged in and viewing console)<br> 2.press the home button<br> 3.tap the icon to open the app and check output</p> <p>Wed Sep 22 11:58:45 unknown /var/mobile/Applications/08DA1C8D-CAF1-4FAC-9F9D-C1B2D2DF4F65/KitchenSink.app/KitchenSink[1698] : dnssd_clientstub write_all(10) DEFUNCT<br> Wed Sep 22 11:58:46 unknown /var/mobile/Applications/08DA1C8D-CAF1-4FAC-9F9D-C1B2D2DF4F65/KitchenSink.app/KitchenSink[1698] : dnssd_clientstub deliver_request ERROR: write_all(10, 62 bytes) failed<br> Wed Sep 22 11:58:46 unknown /var/mobile/Applications/08DA1C8D-CAF1-4FAC-9F9D-C1B2D2DF4F65/KitchenSink.app/KitchenSink[1698] : dnssd_clientstub write_all(10) DEFUNCT</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS - backgrounding, then reopening app creates unexpected output
Description: """"{html}<div><p>4th gen iPod touch (4.1) with mobile sdk build 1.4.2.dc7b90</p> <p>1.launch KS (be plugged in and viewing console)<br> 2.press the home button<br> 3.tap the icon to open the app and check output</p> <p>Wed Sep 22 11:58:45 unknown /var/mobile/Applications/08DA1C8D-CAF1-4FAC-9F9D-C1B2D2DF4F65/KitchenSink.app/KitchenSink[1698] : dnssd_clientstub write_all(10) DEFUNCT<br> Wed Sep 22 11:58:46 unknown /var/mobile/Applications/08DA1C8D-CAF1-4FAC-9F9D-C1B2D2DF4F65/KitchenSink.app/KitchenSink[1698] : dnssd_clientstub deliver_request ERROR: write_all(10, 62 bytes) failed<br> Wed Sep 22 11:58:46 unknown /var/mobile/Applications/08DA1C8D-CAF1-4FAC-9F9D-C1B2D2DF4F65/KitchenSink.app/KitchenSink[1698] : dnssd_clientstub write_all(10) DEFUNCT</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
