TIMOB-1880,12,"""iOS - Tabbed bar is misplaced on screen""","""""""{html}<div><p>4th gen iPod touch (4.1) with mobile sdk build 1.4.2.dc7b90</p> <p>1.Controls&gt;Tabbed Bar<br> 2.check the appearance of the """"""""toggle style"""""""" """"""""toggle enabled"""""""" tabbed bar</p> <p>results: its not centered, should be.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS - Tabbed bar is misplaced on screen
