TIMOB-1879,12,"""iOS - sliders ignore min values with negatives (treats them as positives) ""","""""""{html}<div><p>4th gen iPod touch (4.1) with mobile sdk build 1.4.2.dc7b90</p> <p>1.Controls&gt;Slider&gt;change Min/Max<br> 2.tap the """"""""-5/75/105"""""""" button<br> 3.slide the slider all the way to the left and check its value</p> <p>results:5<br> expected (as on android): -5</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS - sliders ignore min values with negatives (treats them as positives)
