TIMOB-1866,12,"""Android: camera basic test case - unexpected output (type undefined and bitmap not found) ""","""""""{html}<div><p>Seen on g1 running 1.6. TiMobileSDK 1.4.2.dc7b90</p> <p>1.Phone&gt;camera&gt;basic<br> 2.connect device to machine and adb logcat<br> 3.take a pic and view output</p> <p>results:<br> W/TiMedia ( 6756): (main) [12431,2869573] bitmap not found: content://media/external/images/media/448<br> D/TiAPI ( 6756): (kroll$36) [35,2869608] Our type was: undefined</p></div>{html}""""""",New Feature,"Title: Android: camera basic test case - unexpected output (type undefined and bitmap not found)
