TIMOB-1865,12,"""Android: error message not shown on failed SOAP test case (when the service is unavailable) ""","""""""{html}<div><p>Seen on g1 running 1.6. TiMobileSDK 1.4.2.dc7b90</p> <p>1.Mashups&gt;SOAP<br> 2.view screen and tap locate output</p> <p>results: the screen shows """"""""contacting currency web service"""""""" but console shows the service is unavailable, in which case the error condition should be invoked and the onscreen message updated.</p> <p>output:<br> I/TiHttpClient( 382): (TiHttpClient-14) [13,895598] Sending error Service Unavailable</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: error message not shown on failed SOAP test case (when the service is unavailable)
