TIMOB-1864,12,"""Android: change event not fired when turning off wifi""","""""""{html}<div><p>Seen on g1 running 1.6. TiMobileSDK 1.4.2.dc7b90</p>  <p>1.Platform&gt;network<br>  2.look at the values (use wifi, no sim card)<br>  3.turn on airplane mode<br>  4.look to see if the change event was fired</p>  <p>was not.</p>  <p>expected: event to fire  (Titanium.Network.addEventListener('change', function(e) )</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: change event not fired when turning off wifi
