TIMOB-1862,12,"""Android: Remote Streaming test case, """"invalid percentage value"""" output""","""""""{html}<div><p>Seen on g1 running 1.6. TiMobileSDK 1.4.2.dc7b90</p> <p>1.Phone&gt;Sound&gt;Remote streaming<br> 2.connect the device and check output by way of adb logcat<br> 3.tap the button to start streaming and check the output</p> <p>""""""""E/PlayerDriver( 51): Invalid percentage value 86995"""""""" (writes until the test is closed)</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Remote Streaming test case, """"invalid percentage value"""" output
