TIMOB-1861,12,"""Android: unexpected value when tapping the""""volume--"""" button and the sound value is < 0.1 ""","""""""{html}<div><p>Seen on g1 running 1.6. TiMobileSDK 1.4.2.dc7b90</p> <p>1.Phone&gt;Sound&gt;Local<br> 2.tap play<br> 3.tap the """"""""volume --"""""""" button while reading it's value (on button), repeat until the sound is muted</p> <p>results:0.5, 0.4 etc until after 0.1 you'll see """"""""2.7"""""""" reported</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: unexpected value when tapping the""""volume--"""" button and the sound value is < 0.1
