TIMOB-1860,12,"""Android: Empty contacts on Droid 2""","""""""{html}<div><p>Kevin getting no contacts when we're using 1.6 contacts api, but all his contacts when using the newer contacts api (via a custom native app). He's on a Droid 2 which runs 2.2. This makes me completely distrust the deprecated contacts api.</p> <p>Recommend using reflection / class loaders to get at the newer api when it's on a phone that has it.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Empty contacts on Droid 2
Description: """"{html}<div><p>Kevin getting no contacts when we're using 1.6 contacts api, but all his contacts when using the newer contacts api (via a custom native app). He's on a Droid 2 which runs 2.2. This makes me completely distrust the deprecated contacts api.</p> <p>Recommend using reflection / class loaders to get at the newer api when it's on a phone that has it.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
