TIMOB-1837,12,"""iOS: System buttons inherit barColor""","""""""{html}<div><p>When using a buttonbar with a set barColor (black in this case),  any buttons with styles set to a system style (done, plain,  bordered) render using the parents barColor.</p>  <p>Removing the barColor from the bar renders the buttons as thier  normal blue/grey/etc.</p>  <p>This leaves me to use image assets to 'recreate' native looking  elements when using any specified barColor.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: System buttons inherit barColor
Description: """"{html}<div><p>When using a buttonbar with a set barColor (black in this case), any buttons with styles set to a system style (done, plain, bordered) render using the parents barColor.</p> <p>Removing the barColor from the bar renders the buttons as thier normal blue/grey/etc.</p> <p>This leaves me to use image assets to 'recreate' native looking elements when using any specified barColor.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
