TIMOB-1835,12,"""_OBJC_CLASS_$_SBJSON"""". referenced from: Objc-class-ref-to-SBJSON in libtiverify.a (TiVerify.o)  Symbol(s) not found""","""""""{html}<div><p>On Developer 1.2.1, OSX SDK 1.4.1 with Apple Xcode 3.2.4, iOS SDK 4.1 compilation stops without warning and the application never loads. Running Xcode and compiling manually I see a build failed error</p> <pre> <code>_OBJC_CLASS_$_SBJSON"""""""". referenced from: Objc-class-ref-to-SBJSON in libtiverify.a (TiVerify.o)  Symbol(s) not found</code> </pre> <p>libtiverify.a looks to have last been modified by <USER>on 2010-09-10. reversing out those changes resolves the issue.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: _OBJC_CLASS_$_SBJSON"""". referenced from: Objc-class-ref-to-SBJSON in libtiverify.a (TiVerify.o) Symbol(s) not found
Description: """"{html}<div><p>On Developer 1.2.1, OSX SDK 1.4.1 with Apple Xcode 3.2.4, iOS SDK 4.1 compilation stops without warning and the application never loads. Running Xcode and compiling manually I see a build failed error</p> <pre> <code>_OBJC_CLASS_$_SBJSON"""""""". referenced from: Objc-class-ref-to-SBJSON in libtiverify.a (TiVerify.o) Symbol(s) not found</code> </pre> <p>libtiverify.a looks to have last been modified by <USER>on 2010-09-10. reversing out those changes resolves the issue.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
