TIMOB-1833,12,"""Default splash screen image jumps the amount of the status bar, ipad, iphone""","""""""{html}<div><p>On both the iPhone and iPad, right before the apps initial window is shown, the splash screen image jumps up the height of the status bar. I found a work around to increase the size of the image to the full size of the device screens and the jump goes away. The KS shows this on both.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Default splash screen image jumps the amount of the status bar, ipad, iphone
