TIMOB-1821,12,"""Android: TableView scroll performance issue""","""""""{html}<div><p>g1 running 1.6 and sim with 2.2, 1.4.1.ec5d6d</p> <p>1.BaseUI&gt;Vertical Layout&gt;Table View<br> 2.scroll up and down</p> <p>results: stuttering, not smooth scrolling</p> <p>believe this is a regression</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: TableView scroll performance issue
Description: """"{html}<div><p>g1 running 1.6 and sim with 2.2, 1.4.1.ec5d6d</p> <p>1.BaseUI&gt;Vertical Layout&gt;Table View<br> 2.scroll up and down</p> <p>results: stuttering, not smooth scrolling</p> <p>believe this is a regression</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-1820,12,""" Android: tab group events are not triggered by way of trackball""","""""""{html}<div><p>1.KS, tap on the tabs and see the windows generated by doing so<br> 2.use the trackball to nav between the tabs and look for the alerts</p> <p>results: the alerts are not generated when the trackball is used to navigate between the tabs</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: tab group events are not triggered by way of trackball
