TIMOB-1819,12,"""Mixing views test case, taping into webview fails""","""""""{html}<div><p>1.BaseUI&gt;Views&gt;Mixing views<br> 2.Tap the """"""""I am a web view, click me"""""""" view</p> <p>results: nothing occurs.</p> <p>It used to be it would take a few seconds until the """"""""click me"""""""" object would respond top the tap, now nothing occurs on tap.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Mixing views test case, taping into webview fails
Description: """"{html}<div><p>1.BaseUI&gt;Views&gt;Mixing views<br> 2.Tap the """"""""I am a web view, click me"""""""" view</p> <p>results: nothing occurs.</p> <p>It used to be it would take a few seconds until the """"""""click me"""""""" object would respond top the tap, now nothing occurs on tap.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-1818,12,"""iOS: TableView (Layout 4) loading and scroll performance issues ""","""""""{html}<div><p>1.BaseUI&gt;View&gt;Table Views&gt; Table View (layout 4)<br> 2.scroll to the bottom and top</p> <p>results: the test is slow to load, then on scroll is stuttered and slow</p> <p>also seen on Table with controls</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: TableView (Layout 4) loading and scroll performance issues
