TIMOB-1817,12,"""iOS: Grouped TableView - all row items (except the top most) fail to draw to the delineator""","""""""{html}<div><p>1.BaseUI&gt;Views&gt;Table Views<br>  2.hold down your finger on the top most """"""""basic"""""""" row, note the  highlight draws over the entire cell<br>  3.hold your finger down on """"""""performance""""""""</p>  <p>results: the focus rect fails to draw to the top of the table  row, a few pixels missing. The top most row does draw  correctly.</p>  <p>not a new issue</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Grouped TableView - all row items (except the top most) fail to draw to the delineator
Description: """"{html}<div><p>1.BaseUI&gt;Views&gt;Table Views<br> 2.hold down your finger on the top most """"""""basic"""""""" row, note the highlight draws over the entire cell<br> 3.hold your finger down on """"""""performance""""""""</p> <p>results: the focus rect fails to draw to the top of the table row, a few pixels missing. The top most row does draw correctly.</p> <p>not a new issue</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-1816,12,"""iOS: Phone > Record Video, edit/trimming is not shown in playback""","""""""Found using 1.4.1.ec5d6d and a 4th gen ipod touch running 4.1    # Phone > Record Video  # Take 10 seconds of video  # When presented with the option to do so, trim the video down  # Tap """"""""done"""""""" play it back    h3. results  10 second video    h3. Expected  Reflect trimmed/edited movie""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Phone > Record Video, edit/trimming is not shown in playback
Description: """"Found using 1.4.1.ec5d6d and a 4th gen ipod touch running 4.1 # Phone > Record Video # Take 10 seconds of video # When presented with the option to do so, trim the video down # Tap """"""""done"""""""" play it back h3. results 10 second video h3. Expected Reflect trimmed/edited movie""""",title+description
TIMOB-1815,12,"""iOS: unexpected output (""""unknown sandbox"""") on Phone>Camera Basic""","""""""{html}<div><p>1.4.1.ec5d6d 4.1 and 3.1.2</p>  <p>1.Phone&gt;Camera Basic&gt;take an image, tap """"""""use"""""""" and check  the output</p>  <p>results: Mon Sep 13 10:21:51 unknown sandboxd[628] :  KitchenSink(623) deny file-write-data  /private/var/mobile/Media/PhotoData</p>  <p>think this is a regression, but not 100%</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: unexpected output (""""unknown sandbox"""") on Phone>Camera Basic
Description: """"{html}<div><p>1.4.1.ec5d6d 4.1 and 3.1.2</p> <p>1.Phone&gt;Camera Basic&gt;take an image, tap """"""""use"""""""" and check the output</p> <p>results: Mon Sep 13 10:21:51 unknown sandboxd[628] : KitchenSink(623) deny file-write-data /private/var/mobile/Media/PhotoData</p> <p>think this is a regression, but not 100%</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-1814,12,"""BaseUI>Animation>Animation Points, unexpected output""","""""""{html}<div><p>1.BaseUI&gt;Animation&gt;Animation Points<br> 2.tap the animations to have them play<br> 3.check the output</p> <p>output:Mon Sep 13 08:53:52 eWorld UIKitApplication:com.<USER>KitchenSink[0x9d5c][532] : <a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/ERROR"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [ERROR]"""""""">[ERROR]</a> While executing Timer, received script error. 'Result of expression 'circle.animatedCenter' <a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/null"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [null]"""""""">[null]</a> is not an object. at animation_points.js (line 4)'</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: BaseUI>Animation>Animation Points, unexpected output
Description: """"{html}<div><p>1.BaseUI&gt;Animation&gt;Animation Points<br> 2.tap the animations to have them play<br> 3.check the output</p> <p>output:Mon Sep 13 08:53:52 eWorld UIKitApplication:com.<USER>KitchenSink[0x9d5c][532] : <a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/ERROR"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [ERROR]"""""""">[ERROR]</a> While executing Timer, received script error. 'Result of expression 'circle.animatedCenter' <a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/null"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [null]"""""""">[null]</a> is not an object. at animation_points.js (line 4)'</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-1813,12,"""iOS: youtube video - done button does not dismiss movie or take user back a level on iPad""","""""""{html}<div><p>1.BaseUI&gt;Views&gt;WebViews&gt;youtube video<br>  2.start playback, then atop the video to invoke the overlay  controls<br>  3.tap done</p>  <p>results: nothing occurs, done fails silently.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: youtube video - done button does not dismiss movie or take user back a level on iPad
