TIMOB-1812,12,"""iOS: html5 Video fails to play (no controls appear) on iPad""","""""""{html}<div><p>1.BaseUI&gt;Views&gt;WebView&gt;html5 video<br>  2.tap to play/tap to invoke controls<br>  results: nothing occurs, controls do not appear, video does not  play</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: html5 Video fails to play (no controls appear) on iPad
