TIMOB-1780,12,"""Android: Support app-widgets""","""""""{html}<div><p>It would be nice to have android widget support:<br>  <a href=  """"""""http://developer.android.com/guide/topics/appwidgets/index.html"""""""">http://developer.android.com/guide/topics/appwidgets/index.html</a></p></div>{html}""""""",New Feature,"Title: Android: Support app-widgets
