TIMOB-1771,12,"""App crashes when opened/closed quickly repeatedly ios4""","""""""{html}<div><p>On iOS 4, if internet connectivity is disabled and the app is opened and closed repeatedly quickly, the app becomes unresponsive. KS was used as the test app, Titanium SDK 1.4.0 and 1.4.1 builds.</p> <p>As a note: I was able to do this same thing with non titanium apps as well so it <em>could be</em> an iOS issue.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: App crashes when opened/closed quickly repeatedly ios4
Description: """"{html}<div><p>On iOS 4, if internet connectivity is disabled and the app is opened and closed repeatedly quickly, the app becomes unresponsive. KS was used as the test app, Titanium SDK 1.4.0 and 1.4.1 builds.</p> <p>As a note: I was able to do this same thing with non titanium apps as well so it <em>could be</em> an iOS issue.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
