TIMOB-1768,12,"""Android: KS alerts are not respecting opacity.""","""""""{html}<div><p>1.launch KS on device or simulator<br> 2.note the pop ups that show the sdk version and tab info (change tabs to generate more)</p> <p>results: the windows are not opaque, as per the script they should reflect:</p> <p>opacity:0.7,</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: KS alerts are not respecting opacity.
