TIMOB-1740,12,"""local imageView does not scale down in 1.4.1""","""""""{html}<div><p>If you try to set the width/height of a local stored image, it does not work.</p> <p>Let's say the image has 200x200px<br></p> <pre> <code class=""""""""javascript"""""""">Ti.UI.createImageView({ image:'some_image.jpg', width:100, height:100 })</code> </pre> will load the image at a 200x200 size.</div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: local imageView does not scale down in 1.4.1
Description: """"{html}<div><p>If you try to set the width/height of a local stored image, it does not work.</p> <p>Let's say the image has 200x200px<br></p> <pre> <code class=""""""""javascript"""""""">Ti.UI.createImageView({ image:'some_image.jpg', width:100, height:100 })</code> </pre> will load the image at a 200x200 size.</div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-1739,12,"""Label background disappears in tableRow on selection""","""""""{html}<div><p>The issue mentioned at<br> <a href= """"""""https://developer.<USER>com/question/40701/label-background-disappears-in-tablerow-on-selection""""""""> https://developer.<USER>com/question/40701/label-background-...</a></p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Label background disappears in tableRow on selection
