TIMOB-1732,12,"""Android: Kroll refactor""","""""""{html}<div><p>This ticket is a placeholder for commits towards the new Android Kroll refactor. This refactor includes:</p> <ul> <li>Annotation based API w/ source code generation (minimal use of reflection)</li> <li>Better contextual awareness throughout the API</li> <li>Static binding (vs Dynamic)</li> </ul></div>{html}""""""",New Feature,"Title: Android: Kroll refactor
Description: """"{html}<div><p>This ticket is a placeholder for commits towards the new Android Kroll refactor. This refactor includes:</p> <ul> <li>Annotation based API w/ source code generation (minimal use of reflection)</li> <li>Better contextual awareness throughout the API</li> <li>Static binding (vs Dynamic)</li> </ul></div>{html}""""",title+description
