TIMOB-1708,12,"""VideoPlayer audio session not honoring application audio session""","""""""{html}<div><p>The VideoPlayer doesn't honor the application's audio session mode.</p> <p>This can be tested with the KitchenSink app by setting the defaultAudioSessionMode to AUDIO_SESSION_MODE_AMBIENT on one of the movie examples (I just copied the line from the sound/local example). Once the movie starts playing the iPod audio fades out.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: VideoPlayer audio session not honoring application audio session
Description: """"{html}<div><p>The VideoPlayer doesn't honor the application's audio session mode.</p> <p>This can be tested with the KitchenSink app by setting the defaultAudioSessionMode to AUDIO_SESSION_MODE_AMBIENT on one of the movie examples (I just copied the line from the sound/local example). Once the movie starts playing the iPod audio fades out.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-1707,12,"""Date Picker off by a year on iOS 4 sdk 1.4 & 1.4.1""","""""""{html}<div><p>Using the KS as the example, whenever you move the Date Picker from Jan 1 to Jan 2 (by moving the day-of-month up 1) for any year, the 'change' event handler's e.value.getFullYear() [and e.value.getUTCFullYear() for that matter] is off by one year.</p> <p><a href= """"""""http://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/blob/master/demos/KitchenSink/Resources/examples/picker_date1.js""""""""> http://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/blob/master/demos/Ki...</a></p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Date Picker off by a year on iOS 4 sdk 1.4 & 1.4.1
Description: """"{html}<div><p>Using the KS as the example, whenever you move the Date Picker from Jan 1 to Jan 2 (by moving the day-of-month up 1) for any year, the 'change' event handler's e.value.getFullYear() [and e.value.getUTCFullYear() for that matter] is off by one year.</p> <p><a href= """"""""http://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/blob/master/demos/KitchenSink/Resources/examples/picker_date1.js""""""""> http://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/blob/master/demos/Ki...</a></p></div>{html}""""",title+description
