TIMOB-1696,12,"""iPad modal windows do not open small when url to JS file is used""","""""""{html}<div><p>This helpdesk ticket has the code:<br> <a href= """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/39701"""""""">http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/39701</a></p> <p>If a modal window is opened on the iPad without a url it opens small like expected, if a URL is used it opens full screen.</p> <p>Titanium SDK used 1.4, 1.4.1</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iPad modal windows do not open small when url to JS file is used
