TIMOB-1632,12,"""iOS - 3.1.2/3G crash after running all the camera tests""","""""""{html}<div><p>1.I tried to get this down to one or two steps, but the only way I can reliably repro it is to:<br> 2.Phone&gt;camera<br> 3.run each test sequentially</p> <p>results: I crashed 3X on the last test case """"""""save to file"""""""" after the file was saved.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS - 3.1.2/3G crash after running all the camera tests
