TIMOB-1628,12,"""scrollable view - """"ghost views"""" appear after adding a few views""","""""""{html}<div><p>this was seen on 4.0.2, not on seen on 3.1.2</p> <p>1.Base UI&gt;views&gt;scroll views&gt;scrollable view<br> 2.tap add and swipe through to the end</p> <p>results: a white view with no text will briefly appear the be replaced by the expected view. I crashed a few times (not repro) while doing this. If you don't see the issue by adding a single view, add whole bunch before swiping through the views.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: scrollable view - """"ghost views"""" appear after adding a few views
Description: """"{html}<div><p>this was seen on 4.0.2, not on seen on 3.1.2</p> <p>1.Base UI&gt;views&gt;scroll views&gt;scrollable view<br> 2.tap add and swipe through to the end</p> <p>results: a white view with no text will briefly appear the be replaced by the expected view. I crashed a few times (not repro) while doing this. If you don't see the issue by adding a single view, add whole bunch before swiping through the views.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-1627,12,"""iOS: modal transitions - """"flip horizontal"""" modal windows draw the new window on both sides of the flip""","""""""{html}<div><p>1.base UI&gt;modal windows<br>  2.select flip horizontal<br>  3.select any of the right column options<br>  4.tap show modal while looking at the screen</p>  <p>results:the purple window is loaded on top of the spawning  window<br>  expected, it should only be on the """"""""new"""""""" side (look at the other  modal window transitions and note how the end state window is only  on half of the transitions)</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: modal transitions - """"flip horizontal"""" modal windows draw the new window on both sides of the flip
Description: """"{html}<div><p>1.base UI&gt;modal windows<br> 2.select flip horizontal<br> 3.select any of the right column options<br> 4.tap show modal while looking at the screen</p> <p>results:the purple window is loaded on top of the spawning window<br> expected, it should only be on the """"""""new"""""""" side (look at the other modal window transitions and note how the end state window is only on half of the transitions)</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
