TIMOB-1618,12,"""Android: Expose Ti.UI.Label.minimumFontSize for Parity""","""""""{html}<div><p><a href= """"""""https://developer.<USER>com/apidoc/mobile/latest/Titanium.UI.Label-object""""""""> https://developer.<USER>com/apidoc/mobile/latest/Titanium.UI...</a> lists in properties:</p> <pre> <code>minimumFontSize     int  the minimum size of the font when the font is sized based on the contents. Enables font scaling to fit and forces the label content to be limited to a single line</code> </pre> <p>This is extremely useful, however it appears to only be implemented on iOS; the property is never even checked in the Android code.</p></div>{html}""""""",Improvement,"Title: Android: Expose Ti.UI.Label.minimumFontSize for Parity
Description: """"{html}<div><p><a href= """"""""https://developer.<USER>com/apidoc/mobile/latest/Titanium.UI.Label-object""""""""> https://developer.<USER>com/apidoc/mobile/latest/Titanium.UI...</a> lists in properties:</p> <pre> <code>minimumFontSize int the minimum size of the font when the font is sized based on the contents. Enables font scaling to fit and forces the label content to be limited to a single line</code> </pre> <p>This is extremely useful, however it appears to only be implemented on iOS; the property is never even checked in the Android code.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-1617,12,"""Android: TableView filterAttribute Not Defaulting To title""","""""""{html}<div><p>On iPhone the filterAttribute defaults to title. Use this default on Android.</p> <p>Reported in <a href= """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/37441#c167471"""""""">Helpdesk 37441</a></p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: TableView filterAttribute Not Defaulting To title
Description: """"{html}<div><p>On iPhone the filterAttribute defaults to title. Use this default on Android.</p> <p>Reported in <a href= """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/37441#c167471"""""""">Helpdesk 37441</a></p></div>{html}""""",title+description
