TIMOB-1567,12,"""Swipe event only works in portrait mode on iPad""","""""""{html}<div><p>Just discovered swipe event does not work on any orientations other than portrait/right side up on iPad. The event is not fired at all when in landscape mode, and incorrectly reports the direction when upside down. I pulled the events example from the Kitchen Sink out into an independent app.js to illustrate:</p> <p><a href= """"""""http://gist.github.com/527209"""""""">http://gist.github.com/527209</a></p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Swipe event only works in portrait mode on iPad
Description: """"{html}<div><p>Just discovered swipe event does not work on any orientations other than portrait/right side up on iPad. The event is not fired at all when in landscape mode, and incorrectly reports the direction when upside down. I pulled the events example from the Kitchen Sink out into an independent app.js to illustrate:</p> <p><a href= """"""""http://gist.github.com/527209"""""""">http://gist.github.com/527209</a></p></div>{html}""""",title+description
