Description: """"{html}<div><p>in 1.4, when you create a progress bar, you have to declare visible = true.</p> <p>This means that the example in the documentation doesn't work.<br> <a href= """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/apidoc/mobile/latest/Titanium.UI.ProgressBar-object""""""""> http://developer.<USER>com/apidoc/mobile/latest/Titanium.UI....</a></p></div>{html}""""",title+description
