TIMOB-1530,12,"""Android: deleting nonexistent row generates runtime error""","""""""{html}<div><p>found on 1.4.1 f88b9e</p> <p>1.kitchenSink&gt;baseUI&gt;Views&gt;Table Views&gt; Delete Row<br> 2.delete until there are no more rows, delete again</p> <p>results: runtime error</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: deleting nonexistent row generates runtime error
