TIMOB-1526,12,"""new Issue: iPad - Orientation issues when rotating with video in fullscreen""","""""""{html}<div><p>1.Ks-iPad &gt;main tests &gt; embedded video in portrait<br> 2.tap fullscreen (or do the pinch out gesture)<br> 3.rotate to landscape<br> 4.toggle fullscreen<br> 5.note the ipad UI, tap to invoke menu</p> <p>results: the menu and ipad UI is in landscape, but the app is in portrait</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: new Issue: iPad - Orientation issues when rotating with video in fullscreen
