TIMOB-1518,12,"""iOS - events Propagation test case change in behavior for OS 3.1.2 - """"D"""" intermittently fails to load.""","""""""{html}<div><p>1.this seems to happen only on the first time the test case is run, and is very intermittent. Not seen on 4.0. Tapping the screen will always make the object show, and all the events tests work wether or not the object is visible.<br> 2.BaseUI&gt;Views&gt;Event Propagation<br> 3.look at the screen</p> <p>results: the """"""""D"""""""" is not shown in the lower box.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS - events Propagation test case change in behavior for OS 3.1.2 - """"D"""" intermittently fails to load.
