TIMOB-1515,12,"""iOS -  label is truncated by default, hiding and showing will have it draw correctly""","""""""{html}<div><p>1.Controls&gt;label<br> 2.note appearance of """"""""<USER>label"""""""", specifically the r on the end<br> 3.tap to hide, then tap to show</p> <p>results:by default the label is being truncated (fwiw, it is set to """"""""auto""""""""), hiding and reshowing the label will show it correctly. I think this was a result of the fix for original bug 1308.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS - label is truncated by default, hiding and showing will have it draw correctly
