TIMOB-1487,12,"""Create Sound causes a crash""","""""""{html}<div><p>This one is hard to explain. I am attaching the code that represents this issue because that explains it best.</p> <p>This project uses sound quite heavily and when navigating through windows and starting/stopping sounds, a crash happens. Its quite repeatable. See this helpdesk ticket for reference:</p> <p><a href= """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/33151"""""""">http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/33151</a></p> <p>Another issue here is that preloading does not seem to work either.</p> <p>iphone, sdk 4, Ti SDK 1.4 &amp; 1.4.1</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Create Sound causes a crash
