TIMOB-1334,12,"""Web view - selection highight for google is smaller than actual field.""","""""""{html}<div><p>See it in KS:</p> <p>1.open KitchenSink on iPhone (not seen on android, no """"""""highlight"""""""" appears when tapping into the field), nav to baseUI&gt;Views&gt;webViews&gt;External URL<br> 2.tap into the main search field (below googles logo) and watch the size of the focus rect when tapping in.</p> <p>results: the focus rect is smaller than the actual field. Not seen in the simulator, found on a 3g running 3.1.2</p> <p>unable to take a screen shot, as the rect does not appear in the capture?</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Web view - selection highight for google is smaller than actual field.
