TIMOB-1329,12,"""Able to programmatically override set orientation/lock hardware switch""","""""""{html}<div><p>You can see this using KitchenSink (the regular, non iPad version)</p> <p>1.Start in portrait orientation, and lock the screen orientation by way of the hardware switch on the ipad<br> 2.KS&gt;Phone Tab&gt; Orientation<br> 3.Tap """"""""set landscape""""""""</p> <p>results: the ipad UI and the apps UI changes to landscape</p> <p>expected: should we not respect the lock?</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Able to programmatically override set orientation/lock hardware switch
Description: """"{html}<div><p>You can see this using KitchenSink (the regular, non iPad version)</p> <p>1.Start in portrait orientation, and lock the screen orientation by way of the hardware switch on the ipad<br> 2.KS&gt;Phone Tab&gt; Orientation<br> 3.Tap """"""""set landscape""""""""</p> <p>results: the ipad UI and the apps UI changes to landscape</p> <p>expected: should we not respect the lock?</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-1328,12,"""iPad: redraw issues and intermittent failure to load video""","""""""{html}<div><p>Using KitchenSink-iPad (2 parts)</p> <p>part 1<br> 1.Open Main Tests&gt; Show lists&gt;Test list&gt;Embedded Video in landscape orientation, start video playback<br> 2.tap """"""""embedded video"""""""" in the test list to kick off the animation</p> <p>results: screen flashes and redraw occurs around the video.</p> <p>part 2</p> <p>video intermittently fails to load.<br> 1.Open Main Tests&gt; Show lists&gt;Test list&gt;Embedded Video<br> 2.repeat several times</p> <p>results, video fails to load intermittently.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iPad: redraw issues and intermittent failure to load video
Description: """"{html}<div><p>Using KitchenSink-iPad (2 parts)</p> <p>part 1<br> 1.Open Main Tests&gt; Show lists&gt;Test list&gt;Embedded Video in landscape orientation, start video playback<br> 2.tap """"""""embedded video"""""""" in the test list to kick off the animation</p> <p>results: screen flashes and redraw occurs around the video.</p> <p>part 2</p> <p>video intermittently fails to load.<br> 1.Open Main Tests&gt; Show lists&gt;Test list&gt;Embedded Video<br> 2.repeat several times</p> <p>results, video fails to load intermittently.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-1327,12,"""setRequestHeader -> """"If-Modified-Since""""""","""""""{html}<div><p>I cant use setRequestHeader with """"""""If-Modified-Since"""""""" to get back at 304 Status.<br> I want to use this for storing images and xml files on the device.<br> And everytime the xml or the image is requested by the application it should check<br> if a newer version is found on the server.<br> Im sending the date """"""""Mon, 19 Jul 2010 11:20:22 GMT""""""""<br> And im receiving the date """"""""Mon, 19 Jul 2010 10:20:17 GMT"""""""" from the server.<br> Usually it should work and return a 304 status.</p> <pre> <code> if (Titanium.Network.online) {       var c = Titanium.Network.createHTTPClient();       if (c.status == 304)       {         // XML File not necessary - Clientlog File is newer         console.log('Use Client XML File - is newer than the server XML');         fn_end(file_obj);         return;       }       // ...here will follow some code to store the files on the device        c.open('GET', url);       c.setRequestHeader(""""""""If-Modified-Since"""""""", """"""""Mon, 19 Jul 2010 11:20:22 GMT"""""""");       c.send(); }</code> </pre></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: setRequestHeader -> """"If-Modified-Since""""
Description: """"{html}<div><p>I cant use setRequestHeader with """"""""If-Modified-Since"""""""" to get back at 304 Status.<br> I want to use this for storing images and xml files on the device.<br> And everytime the xml or the image is requested by the application it should check<br> if a newer version is found on the server.<br> Im sending the date """"""""Mon, 19 Jul 2010 11:20:22 GMT""""""""<br> And im receiving the date """"""""Mon, 19 Jul 2010 10:20:17 GMT"""""""" from the server.<br> Usually it should work and return a 304 status.</p> <pre> <code> if (Titanium.Network.online) { var c = Titanium.Network.createHTTPClient(); if (c.status == 304) { // XML File not necessary - Clientlog File is newer console.log('Use Client XML File - is newer than the server XML'); fn_end(file_obj); return; } // ...here will follow some code to store the files on the device c.open('GET', url); c.setRequestHeader(""""""""If-Modified-Since"""""""", """"""""Mon, 19 Jul 2010 11:20:22 GMT""""""""); c.send(); }</code> </pre></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-1326,12,"""textArea.enable triggers focus of text area""","""""""{html}<div><p>only happens on 3.1.x.</p> <p>from customer ticket:</p> <p><a href= """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/29721"""""""">http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/29721</a></p> <p>code:<br> var win = Ti.UI.createWindow();<br> var notesText = Titanium.UI.createTextArea({<br></p> <pre> <code>value: """"""""location_notes_go_here"""""""", textAlign:'left', enabled:false, font: {fontSize: 12, fontWeight:'bold'},  color:'#000', top:10, bottom:5, left:10, width:300, height:100, keyboardType:Titanium.UI.KEYBOARD_DEFAULT, returnKeyType:Titanium.UI.RETURNKEY_DONE</code> </pre> <p>}); win.add(notesText);<br> var b = Ti.UI.createButton({text:'enable',height:30,width:200});<br> win.add(b);</p> <p>b.addEventListener('click', function()<br> {</p> <pre> <code>notesText.enabled = (notesText.enabled)?false:true;</code> </pre> <p>});</p> <p>win.open();</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: textArea.enable triggers focus of text area
Description: """"{html}<div><p>only happens on 3.1.x.</p> <p>from customer ticket:</p> <p><a href= """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/29721"""""""">http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/29721</a></p> <p>code:<br> var win = Ti.UI.createWindow();<br> var notesText = Titanium.UI.createTextArea({<br></p> <pre> <code>value: """"""""location_notes_go_here"""""""", textAlign:'left', enabled:false, font: {fontSize: 12, fontWeight:'bold'}, color:'#000', top:10, bottom:5, left:10, width:300, height:100, keyboardType:Titanium.UI.KEYBOARD_DEFAULT, returnKeyType:Titanium.UI.RETURNKEY_DONE</code> </pre> <p>}); win.add(notesText);<br> var b = Ti.UI.createButton({text:'enable',height:30,width:200});<br> win.add(b);</p> <p>b.addEventListener('click', function()<br> {</p> <pre> <code>notesText.enabled = (notesText.enabled)?false:true;</code> </pre> <p>});</p> <p>win.open();</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
