Description: """"{html}<div><p>As per <a href= """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/26521"""""""">http://developer.<USER>com/helpdesk/view/26521</a></p> <p>KS -&gt; 'Phone' -&gt; 'Photo Gallery' in 1.3.2 you get to edit (zoom/crop) the image, in 1.3.3 you can't.</p> <ul> <li>This was a key feature in my app :(</li> </ul> <p>Tested against:<br> 439b396548f9cd1db11f697832c0c5b48f740dff (Thu 8 Jul 2010 07:27:31 BST)</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
