TIMOB-1212,12,"""Webview loses bindings to Ti/Titanium when navigation occurs""","""""""{html}<div><p>Simple test: create two html files in your Resources. test1.html should have a link to test2.html. Both files should attempt to write a Ti.API.info() messsage. Create a webview with url test1.html and load it. test1.html's call to Ti.API.info will succeed. Click link to test2.html &lt;-- it's call to Ti.API.info will fail. (If you surround with a try...catch, you'll see error that 'Ti' doesn't exist).</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Webview loses bindings to Ti/Titanium when navigation occurs
Description: """"{html}<div><p>Simple test: create two html files in your Resources. test1.html should have a link to test2.html. Both files should attempt to write a Ti.API.info() messsage. Create a webview with url test1.html and load it. test1.html's call to Ti.API.info will succeed. Click link to test2.html &lt;-- it's call to Ti.API.info will fail. (If you surround with a try...catch, you'll see error that 'Ti' doesn't exist).</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-1211,12,"""iOS: Slider and other crashes in modal windows. ""","""""""{html}<div><p>Spent the last four hours trying to figure out why my app was  crashing and it turns out you can't do pickers in modal windows. It  crashes right out without giving any errors.</p>  <p>I created a sample project and here's the resource folder:  <a href=  """"""""http://www.mediafire.com/?mjljhkytozi"""""""">http://www.mediafire.com/?mjljhkytozi</a></p>  <p>The code works fine with the 1.3.2 posted in on the blog but  fails on a build did from the head right now up to commit <a href=  """"""""http://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/commit/1abd30859ee18d3e976c2aa453127ecd74f09efe"""""""">  http://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/commit/1abd30859ee18...</a></p>  <p>Also have another app that's giving a crash on modal windows but  it has no pickers, I have yet to figure out what's causing it.</p>  <p>TiDev didn't give me any errors but I did get the following  expections in xCode:<a href=  """"""""http://www.pastie.org/1023566.txt"""""""">http://www.pastie.org/1023566.txt</a></p>  <p>The same happens on device. I'm using iPhone iOS4.0 and  iPhone4.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: Slider and other crashes in modal windows.
Description: """"{html}<div><p>Spent the last four hours trying to figure out why my app was crashing and it turns out you can't do pickers in modal windows. It crashes right out without giving any errors.</p> <p>I created a sample project and here's the resource folder: <a href= """"""""http://www.mediafire.com/?mjljhkytozi"""""""">http://www.mediafire.com/?mjljhkytozi</a></p> <p>The code works fine with the 1.3.2 posted in on the blog but fails on a build did from the head right now up to commit <a href= """"""""http://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/commit/1abd30859ee18d3e976c2aa453127ecd74f09efe""""""""> http://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/commit/1abd30859ee18...</a></p> <p>Also have another app that's giving a crash on modal windows but it has no pickers, I have yet to figure out what's causing it.</p> <p>TiDev didn't give me any errors but I did get the following expections in xCode:<a href= """"""""http://www.pastie.org/1023566.txt"""""""">http://www.pastie.org/1023566.txt</a></p> <p>The same happens on device. I'm using iPhone iOS4.0 and iPhone4.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-1210,12,"""App runs in simluator but frozen on iphone""","""""""{html}<div><p>Hey guys,</p> <p>i hope you can help me :), my Problem - My App runs perfect on the Simulator an the tabGroup opend via:</p> <p>tabGroup.setActiveTab(0);<br> tabGroup.open({<br></p> <pre> <code>transition:Ti.UI.iPhone.AnimationStyle.CURL_DOWN</code> </pre> <p>});</p> <p>but on the iphone - i have open the Xcode project and build and run it but there comes only the Default.png and no open of the tabGroup.</p> <p>I have also tried from Titanium Developer - my App is on iTunes and i can sync it, but wenn i clicked on it the app crash directly - in Xcode the welcome screen is viewed all the time.</p> <p>The console log of the iPhone is attached</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: App runs in simluator but frozen on iphone
Description: """"{html}<div><p>Hey guys,</p> <p>i hope you can help me :), my Problem - My App runs perfect on the Simulator an the tabGroup opend via:</p> <p>tabGroup.setActiveTab(0);<br> tabGroup.open({<br></p> <pre> <code>transition:Ti.UI.iPhone.AnimationStyle.CURL_DOWN</code> </pre> <p>});</p> <p>but on the iphone - i have open the Xcode project and build and run it but there comes only the Default.png and no open of the tabGroup.</p> <p>I have also tried from Titanium Developer - my App is on iTunes and i can sync it, but wenn i clicked on it the app crash directly - in Xcode the welcome screen is viewed all the time.</p> <p>The console log of the iPhone is attached</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
