TIMOB-1204,12,"""App properties not saving in iphone sdk 4""","""""""{html}<div><p>A customer reported that App.Properties were getting wiped out when a window was opened that was trying to read from them. Attaching files that show this.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: App properties not saving in iphone sdk 4
