ckr.com/4002/4659835939_337e82ddeb_m.jpg</a> <a href=""""""""/projects/32238/changesets/ERROR"""""""" title= """"""""Changeset [ERROR]"""""""">[ERROR]</a> Couldn't load coverflow image url: <a href= """"""""http://farm5.static.flickr.com/4061/4659835365_d454f887b7_m.jpg"""""""">http://farm5.static.flickr.com/4061/4659835365_d454f887b7_m.jpg</a></p> <p>The app works fine under 1.3.0 and is published to the app store as such, the relevant code for generating the coverflowview is as follows (Snipped):</p> <p>Titanium.Yahoo.yql('select * from flickr.photos.search('+flickrlimit+') where user_id=""""""""'+flickruser+'""""""""',function(e)<br></p> <pre> <code>{ var data = e.data; for (var c=0;c&lt;data.photo.length;c++) { var photo = data.photo[c]; // form the flickr url var url = 'http://farm' + photo.farm + '.static.flickr.com/' + photo.server + '/' + photo.id + '_' + photo.secret + '_m.jpg'; images[c] = url; } //create coverflow view with images var view = Titanium.UI.createCoverFlowView({ images:images, backgroundColor:'#000' });</code> </pre></div>{html}""""",title+description
