TIMOB-1151,12,"""iTunes gives error 0xe8008001 when installing application using custom module""","""""""{html}<div><p>Hello, here is my problem.<br> I wanted to make a titanium module that uses the <a href= """"""""http://www.pjsip.org/"""""""" title=""""""""Lighthouse"""""""">pjsip</a> libraries for voice over ip. If I use these libraries in a normal iPhone app written in XCode everything works fine, i can make calls. But when I link these libraries to the titanium module, and make an app using this module the following happens.</p> <ul> <li>Titanium doesn't ask me whether to code sign the app or not</li> <li>In iTunes it gives me error 0xe8008001 and doesn't sync my app.</li> </ul> <p>Any advice would be helpful. Thanks.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iTunes gives error 0xe8008001 when installing application using custom module
Description: """"{html}<div><p>Hello, here is my problem.<br> I wanted to make a titanium module that uses the <a href= """"""""http://www.pjsip.org/"""""""" title=""""""""Lighthouse"""""""">pjsip</a> libraries for voice over ip. If I use these libraries in a normal iPhone app written in XCode everything works fine, i can make calls. But when I link these libraries to the titanium module, and make an app using this module the following happens.</p> <ul> <li>Titanium doesn't ask me whether to code sign the app or not</li> <li>In iTunes it gives me error 0xe8008001 and doesn't sync my app.</li> </ul> <p>Any advice would be helpful. Thanks.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
