TIMOB-1148,12,"""TableView search bar option inconsistent""","""""""{html}<div><p>When create a table with a search bar, i.e.</p> <p>var retailerList = Titanium.UI.createTableView({<br> data: [], search: Titanium.UI.createSearchBar(), filterAttribute: 'title' });</p> <p>The search bar renders about 50% of the time. This only happens on iOS4 devices.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: TableView search bar option inconsistent
