Description: """"{html}<div><p>Ok, a premium customer reported that Ti. works in a webview but Titanium. does not. I am able to reproduce this.</p> <p>helpdesk ticket: <a href= """"""""http://helpdesk.<USER>net/tickets/3065"""""""">http://helpdesk.<USER>net/tickets/3065</a></p></div>{html}""""",title+description
