TIMOB-1117,12,"""Android: deprecate the ImageView url property""","""""""{html}<div><p>formally deprecate the property 'url' in favor of the single property 'image'</p> <p>for now, warn (via log) that url is no longer supported -- however, don't disable it (yet).</p> <p>we want to have singular properties for functions that do the same thing vs. different properties based on their type. in iphone, this calls problems, particular during tableview repainting</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: deprecate the ImageView url property
Description: """"{html}<div><p>formally deprecate the property 'url' in favor of the single property 'image'</p> <p>for now, warn (via log) that url is no longer supported -- however, don't disable it (yet).</p> <p>we want to have singular properties for functions that do the same thing vs. different properties based on their type. in iphone, this calls problems, particular during tableview repainting</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-1116,12,"""iphone: deprecate the ImageView url property""","""""""{html}<div><p>formally deprecate the property 'url' in favor of the single property 'image'</p> <p>for now, warn (via log) that url is no longer supported -- however, don't disable it (yet).</p> <p>we want to have singular properties for functions that do the same thing vs. different properties based on their type. in iphone, this calls problems, particular during tableview repainting</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iphone: deprecate the ImageView url property
Description: """"{html}<div><p>formally deprecate the property 'url' in favor of the single property 'image'</p> <p>for now, warn (via log) that url is no longer supported -- however, don't disable it (yet).</p> <p>we want to have singular properties for functions that do the same thing vs. different properties based on their type. in iphone, this calls problems, particular during tableview repainting</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-1115,12,"""SelectAnnotation causes a crash if no args are passed""","""""""{html}<div><p>We ensure UI thread before ensuring a single argument, so it throws an uncaught exception.</p> <p>Also, wouldn't selectAnnotation(null) be valid to deselect all annotations?</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: SelectAnnotation causes a crash if no args are passed
Description: """"{html}<div><p>We ensure UI thread before ensuring a single argument, so it throws an uncaught exception.</p> <p>Also, wouldn't selectAnnotation(null) be valid to deselect all annotations?</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-1114,12,"""Deleting an invalid row from a table causes crash""","""""""{html}<div><p>Specifically, because it does all its work in the UI thread, the exceptions that it raises which were meant for getting back to the JS are now uncaught exceptions that cause the app to crash.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Deleting an invalid row from a table causes crash
Description: """"{html}<div><p>Specifically, because it does all its work in the UI thread, the exceptions that it raises which were meant for getting back to the JS are now uncaught exceptions that cause the app to crash.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-1113,12,"""Android: Add DIALOG and TITLE constants for ActivityIndicator""","""""""{html}<div><p>The Android Activity Indicator supports use in the status area. Insert and document the constants to be used with the location attribute.</p> <p>0 - Title Area<br> 1 - Dialog</p> <p>The integers can be used with the <code>location</code> attribute as a workaround. The default is DIALOG.</p></div>{html}""""""",New Feature,"Title: Android: Add DIALOG and TITLE constants for ActivityIndicator
Description: """"{html}<div><p>The Android Activity Indicator supports use in the status area. Insert and document the constants to be used with the location attribute.</p> <p>0 - Title Area<br> 1 - Dialog</p> <p>The integers can be used with the <code>location</code> attribute as a workaround. The default is DIALOG.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
