TIMOB-1109,12,"""Android: JS Compilation Assumes Unlimited Command Line""","""""""{html}<div><p>The javascript Rhino compiler addition assumes that there is no command line limit and passes all files in one pass. Given a path like <code>C:\Documents and Settings\myuser\My Documents\Projects\Titanium\KitchenSink\build\android\bin\assets\Resources\examples\sound_local.js</code> it fails to compile.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: JS Compilation Assumes Unlimited Command Line
Description: """"{html}<div><p>The javascript Rhino compiler addition assumes that there is no command line limit and passes all files in one pass. Given a path like <code>C:\Documents and Settings\myuser\My Documents\Projects\Titanium\KitchenSink\build\android\bin\assets\Resources\examples\sound_local.js</code> it fails to compile.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-1108,12,"""Android: add allowCancel to ActivityIndicator""","""""""{html}<div><p>Since the Android activity is modal there is benefit in allowing  the user to cancel out of the operation if it's taking too  long.</p></div>{html}""""""",New Feature,"Title: Android: add allowCancel to ActivityIndicator
