Description: """"{html}<div><p><strong>Expected:</strong> iPhone apps built against SDK 3.2 will launch in iPad emulator centered at iPhone screen size.</p> <p><strong>Observed:</strong> iPad emulator launches with centered all black iPhone screen. Error <code>Failed to load NSMainNibFile MainWindow_ipad' appears in logs.</code></p> <p><strong>Steps to reproduce:</strong></p> <ol> <li>Click New Project<br></li> <li>Select type 'mobile'<br></li> <li>Complete form<br></li> <li>Click Test &amp; Package tab<br></li> <li>Select SDK 3.2 in iPhone tab</li> </ol> <p><strong>Resulting log:</strong></p> <pre> <code class=""""""""text"""""""">[INFO] Compiling JavaScript...one moment [INFO] No JavaScript errors detected. [INFO] One moment, building ... [INFO] Titanium SDK version: 1.3.0 [INFO] iPhone Device family: iphone [INFO] iPhone SDK version: 3.2 [INFO] Performing full rebuild. This will take a little bit. Hold tight... [INFO] Executing XCode build... [INFO] Executing XCode Compiler [toggle output] [DEBUG] executing command: xcodebuild -target iPhone on iPad -configuration Debug -sdk iphonesimulator3.2 GCC_PREPROCESSOR_DEFINITIONS=__LOG__ID__=4666dd69-40c6-46be-a427-d4baf552914f DEPLOYTYPE=development DEBUG=1 TI_VERSION=1.3.0 IPHONEOS_DEPLOYMENT_TARGET=3.1 TARGETED_DEVICE_FAMILY=1 Build settings from command line: GCC_PREPROCESSOR_DEFINITIONS = __LOG__ID__=4666dd69-40c6-46be-a427-d4baf552914f DEPLOYTYPE=development DEBUG=1 TI_VERSION=1.3.0 IPHONEOS_DEPLOYMENT_TARGET = 3.1 PLATFORM_NAME = iphonesimulator SDKROOT = /Developer/Platforms/iPhoneSimulator.platform/Developer/SDKs/iPhoneSimulator3.2.sdk TARGETED_DEVICE_FAMILY = 1 === BUILD NATIVE TARGET iPhone on iPad OF PROJECT iPhone on iPad WITH CONFIGURATION Debug === Check dependencies ProcessInfoPlistFile """"""""build/Debug-iphonesimulator/iPhone on iPad.app/Info.plist"""""""" Info.plist cd """"""""/Users/jschulz/Sites/Titanium/iPhone on iPad/build/iphone"""""""" setenv PATH """"""""/Developer/Platforms/iPhoneSimulator.pla