Description: """"{html}<div><p>in <a href= """"""""http://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/blob/master/iphone/Classes/GeolocationModule.m""""""""> http://github.com/<USER>titanium_mobile/blob/master/iphone/C...</a> line 129<br> event = [NSDictionary dictionaryWithObjectsAndKeys:NUMBOOL(NO),@""""""""success"""""""",""""""""error obtaining geolocation"""""""",@""""""""error"""""""",nil];</p> <p>should there be a @ before """"""""error obtaining geolocation""""""""?</p> <p>Thanks for all the hard work guys, keep up the good work!</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
