TIMOB-915,12,"""Custom proxy data doesn't survive in a Window's new context""","""""""{html}<div><p>If you create a window like so:</p> <pre> <code class= """"""""javascript"""""""">var myObject = { doSomething: function() { Ti.API.info(""""""""hello world""""""""); } } var window = Ti.UI.createWindow({   url: 'window.js',   myObject: myObject }); window.open();</code> </pre> <p>You can't access """"""""myObject"""""""" from within the Window's context, like so:<br></p> <pre> <code class=""""""""javascript"""""""">// window.js var win = Ti.UI.currentWindow; var myObject = win.myObject; myObject.doSomething();</code> </pre></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Custom proxy data doesn't survive in a Window's new context
Description: """"{html}<div><p>If you create a window like so:</p> <pre> <code class= """"""""javascript"""""""">var myObject = { doSomething: function() { Ti.API.info(""""""""hello world""""""""); } } var window = Ti.UI.createWindow({ url: 'window.js', myObject: myObject }); window.open();</code> </pre> <p>You can't access """"""""myObject"""""""" from within the Window's context, like so:<br></p> <pre> <code class=""""""""javascript"""""""">// window.js var win = Ti.UI.currentWindow; var myObject = win.myObject; myObject.doSomething();</code> </pre></div>{html}""""",title+description
