TIMOB-883,12,"""Showing an alert dialog from a parent context / activity gets sandwiched when another Activity is currently open""","""""""{html}<div><p>This problem is pretty simple to reproduce.. code:</p> <pre> <code class=""""""""javascript"""""""">var tabGroup = Ti.UI.createTabGroup(); var win = Ti.UI.createWindow(); var label = Ti.UI.createLabel({   bottom: 0, top: 0, right: 0, left: 0,   text: """"""""Click Me"""""""" }); label.addEventListener(""""""""click"""""""", function(e) {   Ti.UI.createAlertDialog({message: """"""""Clicked""""""""}).show(); }); win.add(label);  var tab = Ti.UI.createTab({ title: 'Tab', window: win }); tabGroup.addTab(tab); tabGroup.open();</code> </pre> <p>The alert dialog is created, but never shown</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Showing an alert dialog from a parent context / activity gets sandwiched when another Activity is currently open
Description: """"{html}<div><p>This problem is pretty simple to reproduce.. code:</p> <pre> <code class=""""""""javascript"""""""">var tabGroup = Ti.UI.createTabGroup(); var win = Ti.UI.createWindow(); var label = Ti.UI.createLabel({ bottom: 0, top: 0, right: 0, left: 0, text: """"""""Click Me"""""""" }); label.addEventListener(""""""""click"""""""", function(e) { Ti.UI.createAlertDialog({message: """"""""Clicked""""""""}).show(); }); win.add(label); var tab = Ti.UI.createTab({ title: 'Tab', window: win }); tabGroup.addTab(tab); tabGroup.open();</code> </pre> <p>The alert dialog is created, but never shown</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-882,12,"""Android: Passing Data Example Fails with TypeError""","""""""{html}<div><p>See <a href= """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/question/22431/bug-android---passing-data""""""""> Q&amp;A</a></p> <pre> <code>TypeError: Cannot call property testFn in object ti.modules.titanium.ui.WindowProxy@43e99d18. It is not a function, it is """"""""object"""""""".</code> </pre></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Passing Data Example Fails with TypeError
