TIMOB-869,12,"""Android: Missing separatorColor on TableView""","""""""{html}<div><p>See <a href= """"""""https://developer.<USER>com/apidoc/mobile/1.2/Titanium.UI.TableView-object.html""""""""> doc</a></p> <p>add support for separatorColor to TableView.</p> <p>At a minimum you'll probably need to do something like this. On the list view</p> <pre> <code>int dividerHeight = listView.getDividerHeight(); listView.setDivider(new ColorDrawable(TiColorHelper.parseColor(newValue))); listView.setDividerHeight(dividerHeight); // This may not be necessary, but copy the old height.</code> </pre></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Missing separatorColor on TableView
