TIMOB-837,12,"""Android: Allow multiple attachments to EmailDialog""","""""""{html}<div><p><a href=""""""""/projects/32238/tickets/821"""""""" title=  """"""""Ticket #821"""""""">#821</a> added support for EmailDialog and  addAttachment() but only one attachment can be handled. iPhone  supports multiple.</p>  <p>Starting point to investigate:<br>  <a href=  """"""""http://blog.blackmoonit.com/2010/02/filebrowser-send-receive-intents.html"""""""">  http://blog.blackmoonit.com/2010/02/filebrowser-send-receive-intent...</a></p></div>{html}""""""",New Feature,"Title: Android: Allow multiple attachments to EmailDialog
