TIMOB-833,12,"""Animation/Transition not working at orientation change on iPad""","""""""{html}<div><p>If you have two windows with an image background, one for portrait and one for landscape orientations, and attempt to add an animation to make the transition smoother using something like Ti.UI.ANIMATION_CURVE_EASE_IN_OUT during the orientation change, the animation does not take place.</p> <p>The screen changes orientation then the windows just change abruptly.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Animation/Transition not working at orientation change on iPad
Description: """"{html}<div><p>If you have two windows with an image background, one for portrait and one for landscape orientations, and attempt to add an animation to make the transition smoother using something like Ti.UI.ANIMATION_CURVE_EASE_IN_OUT during the orientation change, the animation does not take place.</p> <p>The screen changes orientation then the windows just change abruptly.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
