TIMOB-806,12,"""Titanium.UI.Slider 'touchend' event is not fired""","""""""{html}<div><p>Hello,</p> <p>I tried it several times and even the most basic example is not working:</p> <p>var slider = Titanium.UI.createSlider({<br></p> <pre> <code>min:0, max:10, value:5, width:100, height:'auto', top:30</code> </pre> <p>});</p> <p>slider.addEventListener('touchend', function(e){<br></p> <pre> <code>alert(""""""""touchend"""""""");</code> </pre> <p>});</p> <p>win.add(slider);</p> <p>Is it not yet implemented or just a bug?<br> I actually need this very urgently. Is there some kind of workaround for this?</p> <p>Many thanks,<br> Florian</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Titanium.UI.Slider 'touchend' event is not fired
Description: """"{html}<div><p>Hello,</p> <p>I tried it several times and even the most basic example is not working:</p> <p>var slider = Titanium.UI.createSlider({<br></p> <pre> <code>min:0, max:10, value:5, width:100, height:'auto', top:30</code> </pre> <p>});</p> <p>slider.addEventListener('touchend', function(e){<br></p> <pre> <code>alert(""""""""touchend"""""""");</code> </pre> <p>});</p> <p>win.add(slider);</p> <p>Is it not yet implemented or just a bug?<br> I actually need this very urgently. Is there some kind of workaround for this?</p> <p>Many thanks,<br> Florian</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
