Description: """"{html}{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-794,12,"""Android: AudioPlayer pauses on window change""","""""""{html}<div><p>Android: Implement AudioPlayer - <a href= """"""""/projects/32238/tickets/705"""""""" title=""""""""Ticket #705"""""""">#705</a></p> <p>Great to see this implemented! Seems to be working well for me on the lastest dev release! :) Cheers</p> <p>When changing windows however, it pauses the currently playing audio until you return to the window with the AudioPlayer in. Would it be possible to modify it so that it works in the same way as the iphone? (I.E when changing windows it continues to play)</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: AudioPlayer pauses on window change
Description: """"{html}<div><p>Android: Implement AudioPlayer - <a href= """"""""/projects/32238/tickets/705"""""""" title=""""""""Ticket #705"""""""">#705</a></p> <p>Great to see this implemented! Seems to be working well for me on the lastest dev release! :) Cheers</p> <p>When changing windows however, it pauses the currently playing audio until you return to the window with the AudioPlayer in. Would it be possible to modify it so that it works in the same way as the iphone? (I.E when changing windows it continues to play)</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
