TIMOB-723,12,"""Initial copy of project resources to /sdcard sometimes fails""","""""""{html}<div><p>ATM I've only seen this happen in linux..</p> <p>When a project is first deployed onto a new emulator, sometimes you get an error during the initial copy to /sdcard. If this error occurs, you will see a crash when the app boots up for the first time. (The trace will say that it can't find /sdcard/Ti.debug/$yourappid/app.js)</p> <p>A temporary workaround:</p> <ul> <li>Close the app</li> <li>Uninstall from the emulator (Home &gt; Menu &gt; Settings &gt; Applications &gt; Manage Applications &gt; &gt; Uninstall)</li> <li>Close the emulator</li> <li>Hit """"""""Launch"""""""" again from Developer</li> </ul></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Initial copy of project resources to /sdcard sometimes fails
Description: """"{html}<div><p>ATM I've only seen this happen in linux..</p> <p>When a project is first deployed onto a new emulator, sometimes you get an error during the initial copy to /sdcard. If this error occurs, you will see a crash when the app boots up for the first time. (The trace will say that it can't find /sdcard/Ti.debug/$yourappid/app.js)</p> <p>A temporary workaround:</p> <ul> <li>Close the app</li> <li>Uninstall from the emulator (Home &gt; Menu &gt; Settings &gt; Applications &gt; Manage Applications &gt; &gt; Uninstall)</li> <li>Close the emulator</li> <li>Hit """"""""Launch"""""""" again from Developer</li> </ul></div>{html}""""",title+description
