TIMOB-718,12,"""iOS: YQL Insert, Update and Delete queries are not supported on Titanium""","""""""{html}<div><p>YahooModule.m only supports SELECT queries and doesn't support  INSERT, UPDATE and DELETE queries.</p>  <p>When trying to use INSERT queries with YAhoo.yql method the  Application closes.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: iOS: YQL Insert, Update and Delete queries are not supported on Titanium
Description: """"{html}<div><p>YahooModule.m only supports SELECT queries and doesn't support INSERT, UPDATE and DELETE queries.</p> <p>When trying to use INSERT queries with YAhoo.yql method the Application closes.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-717,12,"""Bug: No escaping of special characters in project description""","""""""{html}<div><p>When creating a new Titanium Mobile project within Titanium, or change the project properties within titanium, ampersand characters (&amp;) in the """"""""application description"""""""" field do not get escaped properly (&amp;). Ampersands in the """"""""application name"""""""", for instance, get properly escaped. When building the project, the XML parser throws an exception (xml.parsers.expt.ExpatError: not well-formed (invalid token). Angle brackets also do not seem to get escaped in the project description field.</p> <p>[there are other problems with ampersand characters, but I will report them separately]</p> <p>Used Titanium Developer 1.0 with the latest Mobile SDK.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Bug: No escaping of special characters in project description
Description: """"{html}<div><p>When creating a new Titanium Mobile project within Titanium, or change the project properties within titanium, ampersand characters (&amp;) in the """"""""application description"""""""" field do not get escaped properly (&amp;). Ampersands in the """"""""application name"""""""", for instance, get properly escaped. When building the project, the XML parser throws an exception (xml.parsers.expt.ExpatError: not well-formed (invalid token). Angle brackets also do not seem to get escaped in the project description field.</p> <p>[there are other problems with ampersand characters, but I will report them separately]</p> <p>Used Titanium Developer 1.0 with the latest Mobile SDK.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-716,12,"""table view event issues""","""""""{html}<div><p>reported from:</p> <p><a href= """"""""http://helpdesk.<USER>net/tickets/1767"""""""">http://helpdesk.<USER>net/tickets/1767</a></p> <p>A few problems:</p> <p>1) a table level listener is not reporting the proper source of the event (via event.source). buttons seem to work but other elements always return table view row as their source</p> <p>2) row-level element click events do not fire at all</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: table view event issues
Description: """"{html}<div><p>reported from:</p> <p><a href= """"""""http://helpdesk.<USER>net/tickets/1767"""""""">http://helpdesk.<USER>net/tickets/1767</a></p> <p>A few problems:</p> <p>1) a table level listener is not reporting the proper source of the event (via event.source). buttons seem to work but other elements always return table view row as their source</p> <p>2) row-level element click events do not fire at all</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
