TIMOB-696,12,"""Android: Validate appid and Title as valid Java identifiers""","""""""{html}<div><p>See <a href= """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/question/10201/project-name-bug""""""""> Q&amp;A</a>.</p> <p>Part of this checking should be in Developer. Basically the app id must be<br> [a-z][a-zA-Z0-9<em>]*(.[a-z][a-zA-Z0-9</em>]<em>)</em></p> <p>AppTitle should be converted to conform to at project creation.<br> [A-Z][a-zA-Z0-9_]*</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Validate appid and Title as valid Java identifiers
