TIMOB-685,12,"""Android: Minimize APK""","""""""{html}<div><p>Several things to consider</p> <ul> <li>Make sure modules aren't linked in if not used.</li> <li>Create minimal js.jar</li> <li>Have dependency detection between modules (requires extending module project)</li> <li>Use js compiler where possible</li> </ul> <p>See this <a href= """"""""http://developer.<USER>com/question/8511/how-to-optimize-for-pacakge-size""""""""> Q&amp;A</a></p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Minimize APK
