TIMOB-646,12,"""Iphone SDK: Problem with non-ASCII characters in Development Certificate""","""""""{html}<div><p>I'm having essentially the same problem as <USER>br> <a href= """"""""http://support.<USER>net/discussions/titanium-mobile-discussion/656-problem-with-umlaut-special-german-character-in-development-certificate/""""""""> http://support.<USER>net/discussions/titanium-mobile-discuss...</a></p> <p>My name has a character with umlaut (&ouml;) which prevents prereq.py from doing what it should. Titanium only says """"""""Loading..."""""""" in the SDK version select box.</p> <p>The patch attached to the page, which changes json parser into simplejson, helps the python script to pass. I run it in console and get the expected output:</p> <p>'{""""""""wwdr"""""""": true,""""""""ipad"""""""": false,""""""""sdks"""""""": [""""""""3.1"""""""",""""""""3.1.2"""""""",""""""""3.1.3""""""""],""""""""iphone_dev_name"""""""": [""""""""Bj&ouml;rn S&ouml;derqvist (XXXXXXXXXX)""""""""],""""""""iphone_dist_message"""""""": """"""""Missing iPhone Distribution Certificate"""""""",""""""""wwdr_message"""""""": null,""""""""itunes_message"""""""": null,""""""""itunes"""""""": true,""""""""iphone_dev_message"""""""": null,""""""""iphone_dev"""""""": true,""""""""iphone_dist"""""""": false,""""""""itunes_version"""""""": """"""""9.0.3""""""""}'</p> <p>Titanium app still reads the output wrong though.</p> <p>It works if I copy-paste the console output of patched prereq.py like so:<br> (line 877 of packaging.js)</p> <p>var d = '{""""""""wwdr"""""""": true,""""""""ipad"""""""": false,""""""""sdks"""""""": [""""""""3.1"""""""",""""""""3.1.2"""""""",""""""""3.1.3""""""""],""""""""iphone_dev_name"""""""": [""""""""Bj&ouml;rn S&ouml;derqvist (XXXXXXXXXX)""""""""],""""""""iphone_dist_message"""""""": """"""""Missing iPhone Distribution Certificate"""""""",""""""""wwdr_message"""""""": null,""""""""itunes_message"""""""": null,""""""""itunes"""""""": true,""""""""iphone_dev_message"""""""": null,""""""""iphone_dev"""""""": true,""""""""iphone_dist"""""""": false,""""""""itunes_version"""""""": """"""""9.0.3""""""""}'</p> <p>Let me know if I should mail my certificate to you.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Iphone SDK: Problem with non-ASCII characters in Development Certificate
Description: """"{html}<div><p>I'm having essentially the same problem as <USER>br> <a href= """"""""http://support.<USER>net/discussions/titanium-mobile-discussion/656-problem-with-umlaut-special-german-character-in-development-certificate/""""""""> http://support.<USER>net/discussions/titanium-mobile-discuss...</a></p> <p>My name has a character with umlaut (&ouml;) which prevents prereq.py from doing what it should. Titanium only says """"""""Loading..."""""""" in the SDK version select box.</p> <p>The patch attached to the page, which changes json parser into simplejson, helps the python script to pass. I run it in console and get the expected output:</p> <p>'{""""""""wwdr"""""""": true,""""""""ipad"""""""": false,""""""""sdks"""""""": [""""""""3.1"""""""",""""""""3.1.2"""""""",""""""""3.1.3""""""""],""""""""iphone_dev_name"""""""": [""""""""Bj&ouml;rn S&ouml;derqvist (XXXXXXXXXX)""""""""],""""""""iphone_dist_message"""""""": """"""""Missing iPhone Distribution Certificate"""""""",""""""""wwdr_message"""""""": null,""""""""itunes_message"""""""": null,""""""""itunes"""""""": true,""""""""iphone_dev_message"""""""": null,""""""""iphone_dev"""""""": true,""""""""iphone_dist"""""""": false,""""""""itunes_version"""""""": """"""""9.0.3""""""""}'</p> <p>Titanium app still reads the output wrong though.</p> <p>It works if I copy-paste the console output of patched prereq.py like so:<br> (line 877 of packaging.js)</p> <p>var d = '{""""""""wwdr"""""""": true,""""""""ipad"""""""": false,""""""""sdks"""""""": [""""""""3.1"""""""",""""""""3.1.2"""""""",""""""""3.1.3""""""""],""""""""iphone_dev_name"""""""": [""""""""Bj&ouml;rn S&ouml;derqvist (XXXXXXXXXX)""""""""],""""""""iphone_dist_message"""""""": """"""""Missing iPhone Distribution Certificate"""""""",""""""""wwdr_message"""""""": null,""""""""itunes_message"""""""": null,""""""""itunes"""""""": true,""""""""iphone_dev_message"""""""": null,""""""""iphone_dev"""""""": true,""""""""iphone_dist"""""""": false,""""""""itunes_version"""""""": """"""""9.0.3""""""""}'</p> <p>Let me know if I should mail my certificate to you.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
