TIMOB-579,12,"""vertical layout + transition causes some positioning problems""","""""""{html}<div><p><a href= """"""""http://helpdesk.<USER>net/tickets/1495"""""""">http://helpdesk.<USER>net/tickets/1495</a></p> <p>we fixed this partially but when you change pages view transitions the content seems to be vertically centered</p> <p>this also has to do with auto height.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: vertical layout + transition causes some positioning problems
