TIMOB-537,12,"""ConcurrentModificationException in dispatchEvent""","""""""{html}<div><p>Original Tender issue here:<br> <a href= """"""""http://support.<USER>net/discussions/support/2220-concurrency-issue-in-window-standalone-ks-test-09x-for-android""""""""> http://support.<USER>net/discussions/support/2220-concurrenc...</a></p> <p>Stack trace:<br> <a href=""""""""http://pastie.org/861234"""""""">http://pastie.org/861234</a></p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: ConcurrentModificationException in dispatchEvent
