TIMOB-534,12,"""Javascript stops execution when using @var doc-comment""","""""""{html}<div><p>Hi there,</p> <p>while working with Titanium Mobile 0.8.2 (OSX 10.5.8, iPhone-SDK 3.1.2) i could use these doc-coments (@var/@return etc) without problems, but suddenly the execution of my code stopped without any message whatsoever. It turns out the problem was a doc-comment in a prototype. A snippet to illustrate:</p> <p>function XXX()<br> {</p> <p>/<em>* * @var date</em> / this.thing = null;</p> <p>}</p> <p>does fine, while</p> <p>function XXX()<br> {</p> <p>/<em>* * @var Date</em> / this.thing = null;</p> <p>}</p> <p>does not.</p> <p>I'm not sure if i'm using the """"""""correct"""""""" way to anotate my code, but since it's inside a comment-block i tend to say it's an error. Correct me if i'm wrong, otherwise i hope its helpful to you and others.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Javascript stops execution when using @var doc-comment
Description: """"{html}<div><p>Hi there,</p> <p>while working with Titanium Mobile 0.8.2 (OSX 10.5.8, iPhone-SDK 3.1.2) i could use these doc-coments (@var/@return etc) without problems, but suddenly the execution of my code stopped without any message whatsoever. It turns out the problem was a doc-comment in a prototype. A snippet to illustrate:</p> <p>function XXX()<br> {</p> <p>/<em>* * @var date</em> / this.thing = null;</p> <p>}</p> <p>does fine, while</p> <p>function XXX()<br> {</p> <p>/<em>* * @var Date</em> / this.thing = null;</p> <p>}</p> <p>does not.</p> <p>I'm not sure if i'm using the """"""""correct"""""""" way to anotate my code, but since it's inside a comment-block i tend to say it's an error. Correct me if i'm wrong, otherwise i hope its helpful to you and others.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-533,12,"""XML parsing not working (Kitchen Sink 0.9.3)""","""""""{html}<div><p>XML comes in fine but the individual fields cannot be extracted with the following code:</p> <pre> <code>Ti.API.info(""""""""user node = """"""""+this.responseXML.documentElement.getElementsByTagName(""""""""screen_name"""""""").item(0).nodeValue);</code> </pre> <p>You can see in the output below (very last line) that user node = null</p> <pre> <code>[INFO] twitter xml [object TiDOMDocument] text Thu Mar 23 00:03:19 +0000 2006 123 finished analyzing smam/ac success rates web false false 17 Tony Stubblebine tonystubblebine Mill Valley, CA Founder of CrowdVine. Interested in events, smallbiz, social software. http://a1.twimg.com/profile_images/609823904/tonystubblebine3_normal.png http://www.stubbleblog.com false 6555 0D7CDA 000000 0000ff 91FFE9 131411 218 Tue Mar 21 21:01:35 +0000 2006 24 ~28800 Pacific Time (US &amp; Canada) http://a1.twimg.com/profile_background_images/32/OTHER-Lista_1280x1024.jpg false false false 2072 en false [INFO] user node = null</code> </pre></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: XML parsing not working (Kitchen Sink 0.9.3)
Description: """"{html}<div><p>XML comes in fine but the individual fields cannot be extracted with the following code:</p> <pre> <code>Ti.API.info(""""""""user node = """"""""+this.responseXML.documentElement.getElementsByTagName(""""""""screen_name"""""""").item(0).nodeValue);</code> </pre> <p>You can see in the output below (very last line) that user node = null</p> <pre> <code>[INFO] twitter xml [object TiDOMDocument] text Thu Mar 23 00:03:19 +0000 2006 123 finished analyzing smam/ac success rates web false false 17 Tony Stubblebine tonystubblebine Mill Valley, CA Founder of CrowdVine. Interested in events, smallbiz, social software. http://a1.twimg.com/profile_images/609823904/tonystubblebine3_normal.png http://www.stubbleblog.com false 6555 0D7CDA 000000 0000ff 91FFE9 131411 218 Tue Mar 21 21:01:35 +0000 2006 24 ~28800 Pacific Time (US &amp; Canada) http://a1.twimg.com/profile_background_images/32/OTHER-Lista_1280x1024.jpg false false false 2072 en false [INFO] user node = null</code> </pre></div>{html}""""",title+description
