Description: """"{html}<div><p>You should be able to do both:</p> <p>1) in the tab constructor set active:true - and this will be the active tab on startup. If a tab defined after this tab also has active:true, then it will be the active tab</p> <p>2) tabGroup.setActiveTab(x) should also work before tabGroup.open is called</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
