TIMOB-437,12,"""height auto on row does not work with web view height auto""","""""""{html}<div><p>see test case:</p> <pre> <code class=""""""""javascript"""""""">var win= Ti.UI.createWindow(); var headerView = Ti.UI.createLabel({ &#8232;color:'white', &#8232;text:'Quick bits of info' &#8232;}); var row = Ti.UI.createTableViewRow({height:'auto'}); &#8232; var html= '&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;table &gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=""""""""font-weight:bold;color:#111"""""""" valign=""""""""top"""""""" width=""""""""100""""""""&gt;Label&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign=""""""""top""""""""&gt;I am a lot of text that may wrap or may not&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;';  &#8232;html+= '&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=""""""""font-weight:bold""""""""&gt;Label&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;I am a lot of text that may wrap or may not&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;'; var wv = Ti.UI.createWebView({top:10,bottom:10,html:html, height:'auto'}); row.add(wv); // create table view &#8232;var tableview = Titanium.UI.createTableView({ &#8232;data:[row], &#8232;style: Titanium.UI.iPhone.TableViewStyle.GROUPED &#8232;}); &#8232;win.add(tableview); win.open();</code> </pre></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: height auto on row does not work with web view height auto
