TIMOB-422,12,"""HBox and VBox components for mobile""","""""""{html}<div><p>Marshall and I were talking about this last week and I thought I would throw it in a ticket. Absolute positioning for an entire app may quickly grow a bit onerous as the complexity of the UI increases (or on larger screens, like iPad). It would make a lot of sense to have some kind of auto-aligning component to arrange views horizontally or vertically. Pseudocode for such a component would be:</p> <pre> <code>var vbox = Titanium.UI.createVerticalBox({width:'100%', height:'100%',align:'center'}); vbox.add(view1); vbox.add(view2); vbox.add(view3); //all three views are aligned vertically and centered within the vbox view Titanium.UI.currentWindow.add(vbox);</code> </pre></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: HBox and VBox components for mobile
Description: """"{html}<div><p>Marshall and I were talking about this last week and I thought I would throw it in a ticket. Absolute positioning for an entire app may quickly grow a bit onerous as the complexity of the UI increases (or on larger screens, like iPad). It would make a lot of sense to have some kind of auto-aligning component to arrange views horizontally or vertically. Pseudocode for such a component would be:</p> <pre> <code>var vbox = Titanium.UI.createVerticalBox({width:'100%', height:'100%',align:'center'}); vbox.add(view1); vbox.add(view2); vbox.add(view3); //all three views are aligned vertically and centered within the vbox view Titanium.UI.currentWindow.add(vbox);</code> </pre></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-421,12,"""Syntax error in main. File iphone/builder.py""","""""""{html}<div><p>I'm getting the following error when building my project on 0.9.1:</p> <p>Traceback (most recent call last):<br> File """"""""/Library/Application Support/Titanium/mobilesdk/osx/0.9.1/iphone/builder.py"""""""", line 500, in<br> main(sys.argv)<br> File """"""""/Library/Application Support/Titanium/mobilesdk/osx/0.9.1/iphone/builder.py"""""""", line 244, in main<br> shutil.copy(s,)<br> TypeError: copy() takes exactly 2 arguments (1 given)</p> <p>There seems to be a syntax error on line 244 in the mobilesdk source.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Syntax error in main. File iphone/builder.py
Description: """"{html}<div><p>I'm getting the following error when building my project on 0.9.1:</p> <p>Traceback (most recent call last):<br> File """"""""/Library/Application Support/Titanium/mobilesdk/osx/0.9.1/iphone/builder.py"""""""", line 500, in<br> main(sys.argv)<br> File """"""""/Library/Application Support/Titanium/mobilesdk/osx/0.9.1/iphone/builder.py"""""""", line 244, in main<br> shutil.copy(s,)<br> TypeError: copy() takes exactly 2 arguments (1 given)</p> <p>There seems to be a syntax error on line 244 in the mobilesdk source.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
