TIMOB-351,12,"""Status bar will not retain color on sub-windows""","""""""{html}<div><p>This point may be moot for 0.9, but in 0.8.x the status bar does not retain its color from a parent window - you have to reset it in the onload handler. Here's a community member to back up what I saw in the Razorfish app:</p> <p><a href= """"""""http://support.<USER>net/discussions/support/1075-status-bar-wont-retain-state-if-not-pre-loaded""""""""> http://support.<USER>net/discussions/support/1075-status-bar...</a></p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Status bar will not retain color on sub-windows
Description: """"{html}<div><p>This point may be moot for 0.9, but in 0.8.x the status bar does not retain its color from a parent window - you have to reset it in the onload handler. Here's a community member to back up what I saw in the Razorfish app:</p> <p><a href= """"""""http://support.<USER>net/discussions/support/1075-status-bar-wont-retain-state-if-not-pre-loaded""""""""> http://support.<USER>net/discussions/support/1075-status-bar...</a></p></div>{html}""""",title+description
