TIMOB-326,12,"""Android: PNG with transparent border incorrectly identified as nine-patch""","""""""{html}<div><p>The nine patch detection algorithm incorrectly detects a simple png with a transparent border as a nine patch.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: PNG with transparent border incorrectly identified as nine-patch
