TIMOB-315,12,"""Android: Build Doesn't Handle Version for AndroidManifest.xml""","""""""{html}<div><p>The AndroidManifest.xml generator doesn't use the version from tiapp.xml for the string version. There currently doesn't exist a way to specify the integer version required by Android for the market in tiapp.xml.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Build Doesn't Handle Version for AndroidManifest.xml
Description: """"{html}<div><p>The AndroidManifest.xml generator doesn't use the version from tiapp.xml for the string version. There currently doesn't exist a way to specify the integer version required by Android for the market in tiapp.xml.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-314,12,"""Need to support Facebook module level state changes that aren't tied to a button""","""""""{html}<div><p>The problem is if you login/logout programatically, you can't get state changes events w/o a hack.</p> <p>The workaround temporarily is:</p> <p><a href= """"""""http://gist.github.com/254685"""""""">http://gist.github.com/254685</a></p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Need to support Facebook module level state changes that aren't tied to a button
