TIMOB-301,12,"""Android: CAMERA_PERMISSION missing if only Media.showCamera API is used""","""""""{html}<div><p>The camera permission is only added if the video player API is used.</p> <p>Apply the attached patch or update .../android/builder.py to include the following line in the permissions section.</p> <pre> <code>'Media.showCamera' : CAMERA_PERMISSION,</code> </pre> <p>Should look similar to.</p> <pre> <code># MEDIA 'Media.vibrate' : VIBRATE_PERMISSION, 'Media.createVideoPlayer' : CAMERA_PERMISSION, 'Media.showCamera' : CAMERA_PERMISSION,  # CONTACTS</code> </pre></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: CAMERA_PERMISSION missing if only Media.showCamera API is used
Description: """"{html}<div><p>The camera permission is only added if the video player API is used.</p> <p>Apply the attached patch or update .../android/builder.py to include the following line in the permissions section.</p> <pre> <code>'Media.showCamera' : CAMERA_PERMISSION,</code> </pre> <p>Should look similar to.</p> <pre> <code># MEDIA 'Media.vibrate' : VIBRATE_PERMISSION, 'Media.createVideoPlayer' : CAMERA_PERMISSION, 'Media.showCamera' : CAMERA_PERMISSION, # CONTACTS</code> </pre></div>{html}""""",title+description
