TIMOB-273,12,"""Add support for video upload to Facebook""","""""""{html}<div><p>a small change to the URL portion needs to be added to support video upload to Facebook through FB Connect.</p> <p><a href= """"""""http://wiki.developers.facebook.com/index.php/Video.upload"""""""">http://wiki.developers.facebook.com/index.php/Video.upload</a></p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Add support for video upload to Facebook
Description: """"{html}<div><p>a small change to the URL portion needs to be added to support video upload to Facebook through FB Connect.</p> <p><a href= """"""""http://wiki.developers.facebook.com/index.php/Video.upload"""""""">http://wiki.developers.facebook.com/index.php/Video.upload</a></p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-272,12,"""Problem with Resources in subdirectories ""","""""""{html}<div><p>This is a regression problem introduced in Android for 0.8.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Problem with Resources in subdirectories
Description: """"{html}<div><p>This is a regression problem introduced in Android for 0.8.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-271,12,"""Using Filesystem files with Other APIs""","""""""{html}<div><p>We need to ensure that Filesystem API files can be used with any of our other relevant APIs:</p> <ul> <li>saveToPhotoGallery</li> <li>createImageView</li> <li>createVideoPlayer</li> <li>createSound</li> </ul> <p>so any file that we read in or write out (then read in again) should work with the above APIs assuming the file is the proper format.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Using Filesystem files with Other APIs
Description: """"{html}<div><p>We need to ensure that Filesystem API files can be used with any of our other relevant APIs:</p> <ul> <li>saveToPhotoGallery</li> <li>createImageView</li> <li>createVideoPlayer</li> <li>createSound</li> </ul> <p>so any file that we read in or write out (then read in again) should work with the above APIs assuming the file is the proper format.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-270,12,"""Android: Add support for preload and load event.""","""""""{html}<div><p>Add support for preload and load events on currentWindow, currentView. Event object is {url : url}</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Add support for preload and load event.
Description: """"{html}<div><p>Add support for preload and load events on currentWindow, currentView. Event object is {url : url}</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-269,12,"""Android: Race condition when modifying the table model""","""""""{html}<div><p>In testing for 0.8 we discovered a race condition in tableview. If operations occur too quickly the state of the model is indeterminate.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Race condition when modifying the table model
Description: """"{html}<div><p>In testing for 0.8 we discovered a race condition in tableview. If operations occur too quickly the state of the model is indeterminate.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-268,12,"""Orientation Change does not fire for views""","""""""{html}<div><p>When you are listening for orientation changes and you show a view, the orientation change does not fire. if you don't show a view, it does fire.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Orientation Change does not fire for views
Description: """"{html}<div><p>When you are listening for orientation changes and you show a view, the orientation change does not fire. if you don't show a view, it does fire.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
