TIMOB-243,12,"""Android: Removing android.permission.ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE causes crash""","""""""{html}<div><p>The android.permission.ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE is used to determine if the device is on a fast or slow network. If the permission is removed it causes a crash instead of failing silently.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android: Removing android.permission.ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE causes crash
Description: """"{html}<div><p>The android.permission.ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE is used to determine if the device is on a fast or slow network. If the permission is removed it causes a crash instead of failing silently.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
