TIMOB-227,12,"""iOS: Add support for ad-hoc icon""","""""""{html}<div><p>According to docs</p>  <p><a href=  """"""""http://developer.apple.com/iphone/library/DOCUMENTATION/iPhone/Conceptual/iPhoneOSProgrammingGuide/ApplicationEnvironment/ApplicationEnvironment.html"""""""">  http://developer.apple.com/iphone/library/DOCUMENTATION/iPhone/Conc...</a></p>  <p>iTunesArtwork is needed in root of package to specify the  artwork for ad-hoc installs. Need to update script to pick this  up.</p></div>{html}""""""",New Feature,"Title: iOS: Add support for ad-hoc icon
