TIMOB-196,12,"""HTML Table View performance""","""""""{html}<div><p>When using an HTML table view on the device (~20 rows with several linee of text), performance degrades when the app is actually running on the device. CSC has HTML table views that displays an RSS and twitter feeds - each gets a bit choppy when scrolling and flicking on the device. Any improvements to the performance of this component would help.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: HTML Table View performance
Description: """"{html}<div><p>When using an HTML table view on the device (~20 rows with several linee of text), performance degrades when the app is actually running on the device. CSC has HTML table views that displays an RSS and twitter feeds - each gets a bit choppy when scrolling and flicking on the device. Any improvements to the performance of this component would help.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-195,12,"""Orientation change wierdness (iPhone)""","""""""{html}<div><p>When you have a table view in one of your initial tab windows with orientation set to 'either', rotating the device (orientation change) works fine. In landscape mode, when you enter a sub-window, orientation change works. When entering a sub-window in portrait orientation, the child window will not shift its contents on orientation change - it is frozen in portrait mode.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Orientation change wierdness (iPhone)
Description: """"{html}<div><p>When you have a table view in one of your initial tab windows with orientation set to 'either', rotating the device (orientation change) works fine. In landscape mode, when you enter a sub-window, orientation change works. When entering a sub-window in portrait orientation, the child window will not shift its contents on orientation change - it is frozen in portrait mode.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-194,12,"""Tab switching feedback""","""""""{html}<div><p>There is a delay of several seconds when a tab is rendered in a tabbed application (when running on device). Need a way to show some feedback to the user while a tab's content is loading.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Tab switching feedback
Description: """"{html}<div><p>There is a delay of several seconds when a tab is rendered in a tabbed application (when running on device). Need a way to show some feedback to the user while a tab's content is loading.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-193,12,"""Adding CFNetwork to default titanium mobile installation template""","""""""{html}<div><p>Dear TM developers,</p> <p>could CFNetwork framework (from CoreServices) be added to default titanium mobile template, in next release(s) ?</p> <p>It's very useful to handle low level sockets; actually I had to recompile titanium mobile adding this framework in order to make my custom project module work :(</p> <p>Having it already added in next releases, will help me saving a lot work next time you will release a new TM version ;)</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Adding CFNetwork to default titanium mobile installation template
Description: """"{html}<div><p>Dear TM developers,</p> <p>could CFNetwork framework (from CoreServices) be added to default titanium mobile template, in next release(s) ?</p> <p>It's very useful to handle low level sockets; actually I had to recompile titanium mobile adding this framework in order to make my custom project module work :(</p> <p>Having it already added in next releases, will help me saving a lot work next time you will release a new TM version ;)</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
