TIMOB-189,12,"""Orientation Change gesture not working with SDK 3.1.2""","""""""{html}<div><p>I spent about two hours doing numerous tests and could not get it to work. I tried in the emulator and on my actual phone. Very frustrating.</p> <pre> <code>Titanium.Gesture.addEventListener('orientationchange',function(e)     {        if (Titanium.Gesture.isLandscape(e.to))        {          document.getElementById(""""""""status"""""""").innerHTML = 'Stop Shaking me';           }         else if (Titanium.Gesture.isPortrait(e.to))         {          document.getElementById(""""""""status"""""""").innerHTML = 'Stop Shaking me';           }     });</code> </pre></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Orientation Change gesture not working with SDK 3.1.2
Description: """"{html}<div><p>I spent about two hours doing numerous tests and could not get it to work. I tried in the emulator and on my actual phone. Very frustrating.</p> <pre> <code>Titanium.Gesture.addEventListener('orientationchange',function(e) { if (Titanium.Gesture.isLandscape(e.to)) { document.getElementById(""""""""status"""""""").innerHTML = 'Stop Shaking me'; } else if (Titanium.Gesture.isPortrait(e.to)) { document.getElementById(""""""""status"""""""").innerHTML = 'Stop Shaking me'; } });</code> </pre></div>{html}""""",title+description
