TIMOB-186,12,"""add support to make app shareware (through licensing/keys)""","""""""{html}<div><p>how would sell a desktop <USER>app? I'd like people to download trial/limited version of the app, and once they register, enter key they get fully functional product.</p> <p>I probably would like to be able to customize the <USER> I don't want to end up in a situation where if one <USER>app gets cracked, all <USER>apps can be cracked automatically because they all use the same, out of the box licensing scheme.</p> <p>I probably want to avoid activation, since it usually creates more problems than I want to handle, at least in a small app.</p> <p>any thoughts?</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: add support to make app shareware (through licensing/keys)
Description: """"{html}<div><p>how would sell a desktop <USER>app? I'd like people to download trial/limited version of the app, and once they register, enter key they get fully functional product.</p> <p>I probably would like to be able to customize the <USER> I don't want to end up in a situation where if one <USER>app gets cracked, all <USER>apps can be cracked automatically because they all use the same, out of the box licensing scheme.</p> <p>I probably want to avoid activation, since it usually creates more problems than I want to handle, at least in a small app.</p> <p>any thoughts?</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
