TIMOB-169,12,"""jQuery Ajax not working in 0.7 or 0.7.1""","""""""{html}<div><p>It seems that overriding the default XMLHttpRequest() function is not enough to satisfy jQuery - will check out the other libraries as well. This code will print the error message in the console:</p> <pre> <code> jQuery.ajax({   url: """"""""http://www.google.com"""""""",   method: """"""""GET"""""""",   dataType: """"""""html"""""""",   success: function(data) {     Titanium.API.info(""""""""jQuery FTW!!!!!!!!!"""""""");   },   error: function(xhr,error) {     Titanium.API.error(""""""""jQuery FAIL!!!!!!!!!"""""""");   } });</code> </pre> <p>Will get the debug version of jQuery to see if I can get a specific error...</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: jQuery Ajax not working in 0.7 or 0.7.1
Description: """"{html}<div><p>It seems that overriding the default XMLHttpRequest() function is not enough to satisfy jQuery - will check out the other libraries as well. This code will print the error message in the console:</p> <pre> <code> jQuery.ajax({ url: """"""""http://www.google.com"""""""", method: """"""""GET"""""""", dataType: """"""""html"""""""", success: function(data) { Titanium.API.info(""""""""jQuery FTW!!!!!!!!!""""""""); }, error: function(xhr,error) { Titanium.API.error(""""""""jQuery FAIL!!!!!!!!!""""""""); } });</code> </pre> <p>Will get the debug version of jQuery to see if I can get a specific error...</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
