TIMOB-155,12,"""Custom Events on current window""","""""""{html}<div><p>Enable custom events to be fired and subscribed to within the Titanium.UI.currentWindow context:</p> <pre> <code class=""""""""javascript""""""""> // fire an event // takes an event name and a JSON data object Titanium.UI.currentWindow.fireEvent('foo', {name:'<USER>});  // subscribe to an event Titanium.UI.currentWindow.addEventListener('foo', function(data) {          var name = data.name  };</code> </pre></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Custom Events on current window
Description: """"{html}<div><p>Enable custom events to be fired and subscribed to within the Titanium.UI.currentWindow context:</p> <pre> <code class=""""""""javascript""""""""> // fire an event // takes an event name and a JSON data object Titanium.UI.currentWindow.fireEvent('foo', {name:'<USER>}); // subscribe to an event Titanium.UI.currentWindow.addEventListener('foo', function(data) { var name = data.name };</code> </pre></div>{html}""""",title+description
