TIMOB-88,12,"""Support Stretchable Images in Buttons - Android""","""""""{html}<div><p>for example:</p> <pre> <code>var button1 = Titanium.UI.createButton({     id:'button1',     backgroundImage:'blue.png',     backgroundSelectedImage:'blue_pressed.png',     backgroundFocusedImage:'blue_focused.png',     title:'Hello',     color:'#ffffff',     height:47, });</code> </pre> <p>where each .png is a small blue image that is stretched based on the width of the button control</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Support Stretchable Images in Buttons - Android
