TIMOB-79,12,"""EmailDialog not handing content urls correctly. (Android)""","""""""{html}<div><p>Found in 0.6.0</p> <p>If the attachment argument in dlg.addAttachment is an image blob which contains a content url, the image fails to attach correctly because the mimeType was not found using a content resolver.</p> <p>Also due to a change before release of 0.6.0 the addAttachment method gets an undefined error because it was expecting an object of the form {file: } not just or string.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: EmailDialog not handing content urls correctly. (Android)
Description: """"{html}<div><p>Found in 0.6.0</p> <p>If the attachment argument in dlg.addAttachment is an image blob which contains a content url, the image fails to attach correctly because the mimeType was not found using a content resolver.</p> <p>Also due to a change before release of 0.6.0 the addAttachment method gets an undefined error because it was expecting an object of the form {file: } not just or string.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
