TIMOB-35,12,"""Add an option to preload tabs""","""""""{html}<div><p>In certain cases developers may need to pre-load application tabs, for example if they'd like to display a badge right away.</p> <p>Currently with the kitchen_sink demo, the badge on the """"""""UI"""""""" tab is only displayed after the user clicks on it, which is not the expected behavior.</p> <p>I propose supporting a new XMl element called within in tiapp.xml. If set to true, the window's html would be loaded as soon as the tab was created.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Add an option to preload tabs
Description: """"{html}<div><p>In certain cases developers may need to pre-load application tabs, for example if they'd like to display a badge right away.</p> <p>Currently with the kitchen_sink demo, the badge on the """"""""UI"""""""" tab is only displayed after the user clicks on it, which is not the expected behavior.</p> <p>I propose supporting a new XMl element called within in tiapp.xml. If set to true, the window's html would be loaded as soon as the tab was created.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-34,12,"""Can't add custom nav buttons to iPhone apps""","""""""{html}<div><p>The """"""""Navbar Buttons/Image"""""""" demo (navbar_buttons.html) in the kitchen_sink project (located in the beta branch of titanium_mobile) does not work correctly. An image is displayed, but the refresh/cancel buttons are not.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Can't add custom nav buttons to iPhone apps
Description: """"{html}<div><p>The """"""""Navbar Buttons/Image"""""""" demo (navbar_buttons.html) in the kitchen_sink project (located in the beta branch of titanium_mobile) does not work correctly. An image is displayed, but the refresh/cancel buttons are not.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
TIMOB-33,12,"""Via Tender: Unicode error with tiapp.xml""","""""""{html}<div><p>Assigned to <a href= """"""""http://support.<USER>net/discussions/support/60-unicode-error-with-tiappxml""""""""> Tender issue #60</a>. As reported in Tender:</p> <blockquote> <p>My app fails to build when I include a Unicode character in tiapp.xml.</p> <p>Here's a fragment of my XML:</p> <pre> <code>    &lt;window&gt;         &lt;id&gt;suite&lt;/id&gt;         &lt;icon&gt;suite_button.png&lt;/icon&gt;         &lt;title&gt;Have2&#8230;&lt;/title&gt;</code> </pre> <p>The word """"""""Have2"""""""" is followed by the Unicode ellipsis character. The build error is</p> <pre> <code>Traceback (most recent call last): File """"""""/Library/Application Support/Titanium/mobilesdk/osx/0.4.2/iphone/builder.py"""""""", line 309, in main(sys.argv) File """"""""/Library/Application Support/Titanium/mobilesdk/osx/0.4.2/iphone/builder.py"""""""", line 166, in main add_plist(os.path.join(iphone_dir,'Resources')) File """"""""/Library/Application Support/Titanium/mobilesdk/osx/0.4.2/iphone/builder.py"""""""", line 140, in add_plist ti = TiAppXML(tiapp_xml) File """"""""/Library/Application Support/Titanium/mobilesdk/osx/0.4.2/iphone/../tiapp.py"""""""", line 64, in __init__ wp = get_window_properties(window) File """"""""/Library/Application Support/Titanium/mobilesdk/osx/0.4.2/iphone/../tiapp.py"""""""", line 35, in get_window_properties wp[w.nodeName]=getText(w.childNodes) File """"""""/Library/Application Support/Titanium/mobilesdk/osx/0.4.2/iphone/../tiapp.py"""""""", line 13, in getText return str(rc) UnicodeEncodeError: 'ascii' codec can't encode character u'&#8230;' in position 5: ordinal not in range(128)</code> </pre> <p>The problem was worked around by changing the ellipsis to three periods.</p> </blockquote></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Via Tender: Unicode error with tiapp.xml
Description: """"{html}<div><p>Assigned to <a href= """"""""http://support.<USER>net/discussions/support/60-unicode-error-with-tiappxml""""""""> Tender issue #60</a>. As reported in Tender:</p> <blockquote> <p>My app fails to build when I include a Unicode character in tiapp.xml.</p> <p>Here's a fragment of my XML:</p> <pre> <code> &lt;window&gt; &lt;id&gt;suite&lt;/id&gt; &lt;icon&gt;suite_button.png&lt;/icon&gt; &lt;title&gt;Have2&#8230;&lt;/title&gt;</code> </pre> <p>The word """"""""Have2"""""""" is followed by the Unicode ellipsis character. The build error is</p> <pre> <code>Traceback (most recent call last): File """"""""/Library/Application Support/Titanium/mobilesdk/osx/0.4.2/iphone/builder.py"""""""", line 309, in main(sys.argv) File """"""""/Library/Application Support/Titanium/mobilesdk/osx/0.4.2/iphone/builder.py"""""""", line 166, in main add_plist(os.path.join(iphone_dir,'Resources')) File """"""""/Library/Application Support/Titanium/mobilesdk/osx/0.4.2/iphone/builder.py"""""""", line 140, in add_plist ti = TiAppXML(tiapp_xml) File """"""""/Library/Application Support/Titanium/mobilesdk/osx/0.4.2/iphone/../tiapp.py"""""""", line 64, in __init__ wp = get_window_properties(window) File """"""""/Library/Application Support/Titanium/mobilesdk/osx/0.4.2/iphone/../tiapp.py"""""""", line 35, in get_window_properties wp[w.nodeName]=getText(w.childNodes) File """"""""/Library/Application Support/Titanium/mobilesdk/osx/0.4.2/iphone/../tiapp.py"""""""", line 13, in getText return str(rc) UnicodeEncodeError: 'ascii' codec can't encode character u'&#8230;' in position 5: ordinal not in range(128)</code> </pre> <p>The problem was worked around by changing the ellipsis to three periods.</p> </blockquote></div>{html}""""",title+description
