TIMOB-6,12,"""Android Scons Generates R.java in wrong folder""","""""""{html}<div><p>When the SDK moved from 1.1 to 1.5 the default location for creating R.java has moved to /gen and that folder should be included in .gitignore. If the android project is then loaded into Eclipse, you get a build error with a duplicate R.java.</p></div>{html}""""""",Bug,"Title: Android Scons Generates R.java in wrong folder
Description: """"{html}<div><p>When the SDK moved from 1.1 to 1.5 the default location for creating R.java has moved to /gen and that folder should be included in .gitignore. If the android project is then loaded into Eclipse, you get a build error with a duplicate R.java.</p></div>{html}""""",title+description
